window.FWN_ALCHEMY_EMPEROR_HEAD_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_ALCHEMY_EMPEROR_HEAD_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1801,"title":"Chapter 1801: Battle Strength Increase","paragraphs":["Chapter 1801: Battle Strength Increase","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Every breakthrough was an all-round leap of life from the beginning to the","end. It was like how ants could easily lift things that were 400 times heavier than themselves, while humans could barely lift things that were the same weight as themselves. However, humans could stomp a group of ants to death.","The weakness of Chu Yunfan’s body limited his strength. Even if an ant could lift something that was a thousand times heavier than itself, it could not withstand a human’s stomp. Therefore, even if Chu Yunfan had the ability to challenge those who were above his level, it was still difficult for him to face Li Qianyuan. Even he had to admit that people had their limits. Unless he could break through to the same level as Li Qianyuan, he would not be able to compete with Li Qianyuan.","And now, Chu Yunfan had finally broken through this shackle. It was as if something was brewing in his body and finally broke out of the shell, turning into a brand new him and completing the transition of life level.","“I’m finally standing on the same starting line as Li Qianyuan!” Chu Yunfan grinned.","If others heard this, they would probably think that Chu Yunfan was being too arrogant. Li Qianyuan had already entered the Cosmos Stage for many years, and Chu Yunfan had just stepped into this field, but he thought that he was standing on the same starting line as Li Qianyuan. It was simply arrogant.","Chu Yunfan knew that in terms of real combat strength, he was still far from Li Qianyuan. He might even be several times or even more than ten times weaker. The difference between each level of the Cosmos Stage could not be calculated logically. Chu Yunfan’s breakthrough challenge had its limits.","However, that was only a theoretical difference in combat strength. There were many methods that surpassed cultivation levels. It was not the usual cross-level challenge like Chu Yunfan, but some methods that exceeded the limit could cause great damage to the body. Even a top genius like Li Qianyuan would not easily try this method, or rather, he would not use it at all.","To them, as long as they cultivated step by step, they would be able to reach the top sooner or later. However, if they rashly used such a method, hurt their foundation, and could not reach the top, it would be the greatest loss.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t care. After breaking through to the Cosmos Stage, his physical fitness had undergone earth-shaking changes. He relied on the two amazing physiques, the Imperial Physique and the Thunderclap Physique, to become ridiculously strong. Now, he had gained some parts of the Immemorial Dark Phoenix’s physique, so his recovery ability was ridiculously strong.","For ordinary people, this would be a permanent self-harming move, but for Chu Yunfan, he just needed some time to recover. For ordinary people, the most feared move of burning their lifespan was nothing to him. With a lifespan of thousands of years, he had become a rich man overnight. He could use some taboo methods without any fear.","Of course, if it was not necessary, he would not use such methods. After all, no one would complain about having a long life. Didn’t even the emperors of old break the heavens and lead to the end of an era for the possibility of immortality?","Chu Yunfan was very satisfied with his progress. When he met Li Qianyuan before, he used the Sword Light Talisman to plot against Li Qianyuan, but he could only escape and was almost killed. Now Chu Yunfan had a way to compete with Li Qianyuan, and all of this only took a few years. He was very satisfied with this development.","He had nothing to complain about. He did not know how much pressure his growth had brought to the entire Huntian Marquis residence. He had gone from an ant that could be easily trampled to an existence that was enough to threaten them. Though one was a child and the other was an adult in their eyes, they were still on the same level. They were not like ants and humans. Even the strongest ant would not be able to withstand a blow from the weakest child.","After breaking through to the Cosmos Stage, Chu Yunfan could easily defeat fifth-level Cosmics with his ordinary combat strength. If he took on the hou form, his physical fitness would be further enhanced, and he would not be inferior to sixth-level Cosmics.","After breaking through to the Cosmos Stage, Chu Yunfan’s physical fitness improved further. Coupled with the Immemorial Dark Phoenix’s characteristics, his body’s recovery ability had become even more abnormal.","Even the time he took to transform into a hou had increased by ten times. Although it was not very long, it was enough to end a battle. Once he used some taboo means, his combat strength could rise to another level. This was why Chu Yunfan and Li Qianyuan stood at the same starting line.","“Li Qianyuan, it won’t be long before we have a battle.” Chu Yunfan smiled faintly. “But for now, it’s time to get rid of Wang Yifan.”","The Cosmos Stage? Did that make Wang Yifan very strong? Who wasn’t in the Cosmos Stage?","Mist surrounded the place and purple energy filled the air. The Flying Celestials was like a paradise on earth. It was an ordinary day for most people in the Flying Celestials. However, it was different for many people.","On this day, Startling Cloud Peak was filled with joy. The master of this peak, the true disciple of the Flying Celestials, Wang Yifan, had just come out of seclusion and was hosting a tea party.","Although it was just a simple tea party, the participants were all Cosmic true disciples. This meant that Wang Yifan would be able to get rid of his awkward status as a new true disciple and receive the recognition of the older true disciples. Otherwise, these people would not have come to this gathering.","As for Wang Yifan’s followers, they would also obtain great benefits. With this tea party, Wang Yifan’s status in the sect would increase by a lot and he would get to know more people.","Everyone on Startling Cloud Peak was busy. No one dared to make a mistake and make Wang Yifan lose face. Otherwise, the consequences would be unimaginable.","This was also Wang Yifan’s first time hosting such a gathering. Apart from the tea party that only a few people could attend, there was also a banquet on Startling Cloud Peak, which attracted many inner disciples and elite disciples of the Flying Celestials. As for the fringe disciples, they were not qualified to participate in such a grand event.","In the banquet hall, a handsome young man dressed in a moon-white robe shuttled through the crowd. In a short while, he arrived in front of a group of young men who were about the same age.","These young men were about the same age as him, and there were both men and women. The leader was a woman who looked to be about 27 or 28 years old. She had a beautiful face and a tall figure. She was the focus of everyone present.","From the uniform she was wearing, one could tell that she was an elite disciple. Although she was not as good as a true disciple, an elite disciple could be considered a prominent figure in the Flying Celestials.."]},{"number":1802,"title":"Chapter 1802: A Guy Who Doesn’t Know the Immensity of Heaven and Earth","paragraphs":["Chapter 1802: A Guy Who Doesn’t Know the Immensity of Heaven and Earth","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","These young men and women surrounded the woman in the lead. When they saw the young man in the moon-white robe walking over, they hurriedly stretched out their hands.","“Jinghong! Why are you so late?”","A young man with a bright smile stepped forward and playfully punched the young man in the chest.","“Sorry, I’m late! “The young man named Jinghong scratched the back of his head in embarrassment. “Fortunately, the banquet hasn’t started yet. This is a rare opportunity. To celebrate his first tea party, Senior Wang will probably bring out a lot of good items,” the young man with a bright smile said with some longing.","Although they were all inner disciples, they were at the bottom among the disciples present. Moreover, their cultivation resources were limited, and they did not get to obtain good items on a regular basis. Only when such high-level big shots held a banquet would they be able to eat some really good things.","Even if it was just to give face, those big shots would not pass off inferior quality as good quality. According to their seniors, a meal at such a banquet was equivalent to a month of bitter cultivation. Otherwise, there would not be so many people coming to freeload. However, not everyone had the qualifications to do so. They were able to attend the banquet because of of their senior sister, Senior Liu.","“How imposing. As expected of a true disciple,” someone said in amazement.","To them, true disciples were really high and mighty figures. Even though they had just joined the sect, they had heard of the power of true disciples. Among the experts of Grand Xia, they were all important figures.","“That’s right. For people like us, it’s very difficult to become an elite disciple in this lifetime. It’s almost impossible. We can’t even dream about becoming a true disciple.”","Some people sighed regretfully. Their expression were gloomy. After all, in the outside world, they were known as geniuses, but in the Flying Celestials, they were only qualified to be at the bottom. It wasn’t that they didn’t work hard, but their opponents were monsters.","Geniuses were everywvhere. One brick throw would surely hit half a dozen monster-level geniuses. This was the true might of the Flying Celestials, one of the ten great sects of Grand Xia. It was not something that small sects could compare to.","“Senior Liu, we have to thank you for this. Otherwise, we’d never get the opportunity to attend such a banquet,” someone said.","Senior Liu only smiled. Then, she glanced at Jinghong and said, “I have a little pull around here. I managed to bring you guys here because our Senior Zhantai of Fairy Peak, was invited to the tea party.”","Senior Liu didn’t take credit for it, but when she mentioned Senior Zhantai, her face revealed a proud expression.","“Even Senior Zhantai is here. Before I joined the Flying Celestials, I’ve already heard of her. She’s a big shot among the true disciples, right? I didn’t expect her to attend this tea party. Senior Wang really has things going for him, ” someone exclaimed.","They clearly knew who Senior Zhantai was. She was considered a big shot among the true disciples of the Flying Celestials. Even Senior Liu, whom they looked up to, was a follower of Senior Zhantai. As for these people, they couldn’t even be considered followers. At most, they could only be considered a part of Senior Zhantai’s peripheral forces. However, as new inner disciples, it was not easy to rely on a backer so quickly.","“That’s right. Senior Wang helped Senior Zhantai once before. This time, it can be considered as returning his favor.” Senior Liu covered her mouth and laughed. “Let’s grab a seat!”","Senior Liu led the group to their seats, and the crowd jeered as they let Jinghong sit next to Senior Liu. Jinghong wasn’t shy and sat down beside Senior Liu. He looked quite calm.","“There are so many true disciples here today. Even the true disciples of the other ten great sects have come. The scale of this tea party pretty big.”","“That’s right. The larger the scale of the tea party, the greater the host’s reputation. Although Senior Wang was promoted to true disciple not too long ago—not even ten years—his strength has increased very quickly.” “After this tea party, he’ll be entrusted with an important task.”","Many people were discussing this tea party.","Among these people, Jinghong clenched his fists and asked, “Senior Liu, I heard that Senior Wang has a one year appointment with someone.”","“A year?” Senior Liu’s beautiful eyes revealed a puzzled expression as she frowned slightly.","“I heard of that. It seems like it was an elite disciple who doesn’t know the immensity of heaven and earth wants to challenge Senior Wang,” someone said.","This person had entered the sect a little earlier and knew something that others did not. The other disciples who had just joined the sect revealed puzzled expressions. To them, true disciples were no different from high and mighty gods. Who dared to challenge such a figure?","When the person who spoke saw everyone looking at him, he immediately said proudly, “A year ago, a disciple who had just entered the sect provoked Senior Wang and challenged him. They made a one-year agreement, but Senior Wang was magnanimous and didn’t argue with him. In just a year, he was able to challenge Senior Wang. Who does he think he is? The reincarnation of a mighty figure? It’s just someone in a clown suit.”","The man had a disdainful expression on his face, but there was also some surprise in his eyes. He remembered that more than a year ago, that person had caused a huge wave among the inner disciples. He had been a legendary figure. However, this one year agreement was quickly forgotten. After all, one of them was a true disciple, while the other was an inner disciple at that time. At most, he was an elite disciple now.","The two of them were not on the same level. No one thought that Chu Yunfan would dare to challenge Senior Wang a year later.","In this one year, that guy had disappeared without a trace. At least, that was the case for them. This confirmed their thoughts.","“Now that the one-year agreement is over, I haven’t seen him appear. He must have run away in fear.”","“Impossible, he’s not that kind of person,” Jinghong slammed said angrily as he slammed on the table.."]},{"number":1803,"title":"Chapter 1803: If You Can’t Offend Wang Yifan, Can You Offend Chu Yunfan?","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Everyone was shocked by Jinghong’s sudden outburst. No one had expected him to suddenly explode.","“Chu Jinghong, what is the meaning of this?” The young man who was mouthing off earlier was shocked.","As for the young man named Jinghong, he seemed to have realized what he had done. He hurriedly sat down and said, “I just don’t believe that he would run away without a fight. After all, don’t forget that when we were ridiculing him, he entered the Flying Celestials as one of the top ten inner disciples and became an elite disciple in the shortest time possible.” Chu Jinghong’s face revealed a mocking expression.","“Are you looking for trouble, Chu Jinghong?” the young man said unhappily, “What does that Chu Yunfan have to do with you? Why are you protecting him like this?”","“That’s not right. He’s from the Violet Thunder Prefecture, and you are too. Don’t tell me you’re related to him?” the young man sneered. ” If Chu Yunfan wasn’t a coward, he would have issued a challenge long ago. Why would he need you to defend him?”","“All right, cut it out. I’ve heard of Chu Yunfan. Even if he didn’t appear, he would still be a talent. After all, it’s not wise to go against a true disciple who is far stronger than him, ” Senior Liu said.","At this moment, Senior Liu finally remembered who Chu Yunfan was. A year ago, he had caused a huge commotion among the inner disciples, and even among the elite disciples. Even they had to admit that Chu Yunfan’s future was limitless, but all of this was under the premise that Chu Yunfan didn’t offend Wang Yifan.","How could Chu Yunfan survive in the Flying Celestials after offending a true disciple?","During this year, Chu Yunfan had gone into hiding and didn’t dare to come back. In the future, Wang Yifan would only become stronger and stronger, and the blows that Chu Yunfan would face would also become stronger and stronger. Basically, there would be no future for him.","All of this was under the circumstances of offending a true disciple. In the history of the Flying Celestials for so many years, there had never been an exception.","However, Senior Liu looked at Chu Jinghong thoughtfully. Everyone could see","Chu Jinghong’s excitement earlier. Moreover, they were both from the Violet Thunder Prefecture. The relationship between the two parties was probably not shallow.","“Senior Liu, Chu Yunfan doesn’t know the immensity of heaven and earth and offended Senior Wang. What future can he have in the Flying Celestials? He doesn’t dare to come back now. I advise some people not to go against the tide,” the male disciple said rudely.","“Zhang Chao, no matter what I do, you have no right to critize me,” Chu Jinghong said coldly.","“You’ve given yourself away. What’s your relationship with Chu Yunfan?” Zhang","Chao sneered.","Chu Jinghong paused, then gritted his teeth and said, “He’s my cousin.”","“What?” Many people cried out in surprise, especially the others who were in disbelief. Although Chu Yunfan was like a monkey in Zhang Chao’s mouth, he was someone who could advance to an elite disciple within a year. How could they afford to provoke him?","Although Chu Yunfan couldn’t afford to offend Wang Yifan, could they afford to offend Chu Yunfan?","“I see.” Senior Liu understood. Then, she bit her lower lip and said, “You shouldn’t mention this again in the future. Chu Yunfan has offended a lot of people. It might not be a good thing for you to get involved with him.”","“Senior Liu, I’ve already thought it through. I want to advance and retreat together with my cousin!” Chu Jinghong said, “Brother Fan saved me once before. I can’t let him be alone here.","“You just don’t understand. I can’t do anything for you. How about I go beg Senior Zhantai and ask her to take Chu Yunfan in. His talent is pretty good and he’s qualified to become Senior Zhantai’s follower. Even Senior Wang wouldn’t dare to do anything to him then,” Senior Liu offered after some thought.","In the end, she couldn’t harden her heart and say anything more.","“Senior Liu, this matter must be very difficult for you. I’ll take responsibility for what I did. I won’t implicate you,” Chu Jinghong said.","When Senior Liu heard this, she was shocked and angry. “What are you trying to do? Do you know how serious it is to offend a true disciple? For a new disciple like you who just joined this year, if Senior Wang wants to kill you, he only needs to give the word. I’m an elite disciple, so Senior Wang won’t dare to do anything to me.”","Chu Jinghong looked at Senior Liu and felt touched. He knew that she had to bear a lot of responsibility. He was not a fool. How could he not understand Senior Liu’s intentions? It was just that his identity was special and he did not dare to accept her good intentions.","The other disciples watched the two of them. The male disciples looked at Chu Jinghong with envy and hatred. Senior Liu was a great beauty, and she was strong. She was an elite disciple, not to mention that she had a big backer like Senior Zhantai. She was a good match that many disciples of the Flying Celestials could only dream of. However, ever since Chu Jinghong entered the sect, she had been looking at this kid without any background and treated him well wholeheartedly.","“Liu Wenjing, I wouldn’t be so sure if I were you. This person is related to Chu","Yunfan, so I’ll take him away. It’s useless even if you look for Senior Zhantai.” At this moment, a cold voice was heard. A middle-aged man in his thirties, dressed in a moon-white robe, appeared nearby. His expression was extremely cold. Only when he looked at Chu Jinghong did he reveal a smile.","“You snitched?” Liu Wenjing looked at Zhang Chao in shock and anger. The person in front of her had come so quickly. Who else could it be other than Zhang Chao?","“That’s right, Senior Liu. I advise you to be a wise person who understands the times. Chu Yunfan offended Senior Wang, so how can he have a good ending?”","Zhang Chao’s eyes were filled with madness. He looked at Liu Wenjing with a bit of admiration in his eyes. He couldn’t understand what was so good about this kid. Ever since he joined the sect, Liu Wenjing had treated him well as if she was possessed. She turned a blind eye to all his good intentions.","“Zhang Chao, I didn’t expect you to be such a villain!” Liu Wenjing was so angry that her shoulders trembled. “But Fu Heng, aren’t you thinking too simply to arrest someone in front of me?” she said as she turned to the middle-aged man.."]},{"number":1804,"title":"Chapter 1804: The One Who Should Run Isn’t Me, It’s Wang Yifan","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Liu Wenjing, I wanted to give Senior Zhantai some face, but this person is related to Chu Yunfan. This matter was personally instructed by Senior Wang, so I have no choice but to be ruthless,” Fu Heng said coldly, “I advise you not to try to rely on Senior Zhantai. If it were you, Senior Zhantai might interfere, but for such a new disciple, would Senior Zhantai fall out with Senior Wang?”","“Fu Heng, who do you think you are? Are there no laws in the Flying Celestials? Do you think can arrest people as you wish? You’re lawless!” Liu Wenjing’s pretty face turned red with anger.","“Law? Liu Wenjing, you can be considered an old disciple. Don’t you know that the laws of Grand Xia can’t affect the Flying Celestials? The words of a true disciple are the law!” Fu Heng sneered.","At this moment, the confrontation attracted the attention of the surrounding disciples who were attending the banquet. Not only were there elite disciples present, but there were also many inner disciples. Very soon, they understood what had happened. Although Chu Yunfan and Wang Yifan’s one-year promise was slowly forgotten as time passed, it was still a sensation back then.","The Flying Celestials had been established for so many years, but this was the first time that an inner disciple had challenged a true disciple. However, as time passed, things slowly became dull. There were countless geniuses in the Flying Celestials, and there were naturally many smart people. Back then, Chu Yunfan had only used words to capture Wang Yifan. It was impossible for an inner disciple to have the strength to challenge Wang Yifan in a year. It was already a miracle that he could protect himself from Wang Yifan.","Though Chu Yunfan later created another record and became the first disciple who had just entered the sect to be promoted to an elite disciple, even the elite disciples weren’t Wang Yifan’s match. Among the elite disciples, only one in a hundred could advance to a true disciple. Moreover, elite disciples themselves were geniuses that were one in a thousand. It could be seen how difficult it was to advance to this level.","Even if Chu Yunfan could become a true disciple in the future, it was unlikely that he could defeat Wang Yifan, who was older than him. Chu Yunfan was a","genius, but Wang Yifan was also a chosen one.","“Chu Yunfan hasn’t returned even once in a year. Does he really dare to come and fulfill the one-year promise?","“It’s already good enough that he can stabilize himself in the realm of elite disciples in a year’s time. What else can we expect?”","“Back then, Chu Yunfan only used this as a pretext to trap Wang Yifan so that Wang Yifan wouldn’t be able to kill him. He had some tricks up his sleeve, but in the end, he still has to rely on his true strength.”","Everyone was discussing animatedly, but without exception, no one was optimistic about Chu Yunfan. After all, he had disappeared for a whole year.","Even when he was promoted to External General, there was no celebration.","Other than You Chuyun and the others, no one knew.","Their impression of Chu Yunfan was still from a year ago, and Wang Yifan had improved again in the past year. He held this tea party with great fanfare and forcefully declared his existence. It was obvious who was stronger and who was weaker.","“The words of a true disciple are the law? How dare you. Even our sect master doesn’t dare to say such words. Who do you think you are?” A clear voice sounded from the crowd.","Everyone turned around and saw a young man in a moon-white robe with golden edges striding over.","“Chu Yunfan!”","When someone saw this person’s face, they exclaimed in suprise.","Everyone was stunned. No one had expected that Chu Yunfan would actually appear.","“Brother Fan!” Chu Jinghong shouted, looking a little surprised.","Liu Wenjing and the others looked at Chu Jinghong in surprise. He had said he knew Chu Yunfan, and it was true. It seemed that they had a deep relationship. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have taken such a risk for Chu Yunfan.","“Why didn’t you tell me you were coming?” Chu Yunfan said as he looked at Chu Hongcai who had matured a little.","That’s right, Chu Jinghong was actually Chu Hongcai, who had escaped from the Chu Clan. During this period, Chu Hongcai had concealed his identity and hid from place to place. Later, he found out about Chu Yunfan, so he changed his name and joined the Flying Celestials.","Chu Yunfan shook his head and laughed. During this period, he was almost never in the Flying Celestials. Not many people knew of his whereabouts, so it was normal for Chu Hongcai to not get any news of him.","“This is good. I wanted to use Chu Jinghong to lure you out, but now it seems that there’s no need.” Fu Heng looked at Chu Yunfan with a sinister smile.","His target was not Chu Jinghong in the first place. He only wanted to use Chu Jinghong as bait to attract Chu Yunfan. However, since Chu Yunfan had already appeared, Chu Jinghong was meaningless.","Fu Heng revealed a pleasantly surprised expression. Chu Yunfan was the person Wang Yifan had named. After a year, Wang Yifan had lost his last bit of patience. Even if he had to face the censure of some elders after this, he had to get rid of Chu Yunfan. And now, this opportunity had actually fallen into his hands. It was really a godsend.","“Are you going to surrender obediently? Or do you want me to break your limbs and bring you to Senior Wang?” Fu Heng laughed hideously. With a true disciple backing him up, he was full of confidence.","A mere Chu Yunfan had barely become an elite disciple a year ago. How could he compare to him?","“Chu Yunfan, leave now. You shouldn’t linger here,” Liu Wenjing said through gritted teeth, but her eyes were on Chu Hongcai.","Chu Yunfan looked at Chu Hongcai. Of course, he could tell that Liu Wenjing was involved in this mess because of Chu Hongcai.","He smiled and said, “You’ve grown up. There are girls who like you now. But I think you all have a misunderstanding about me. Run? Why should I run? The person who will be running today isn’t me, but it’s Wang Yifan!”","Everyone looked at Chu Yunfan with their mouths agape as if they were looking at a person who had lost his mind. How crazy was Chu Yunfan to say such arrogant words?","It was already good enough that Chu Yunfan could run from Wang Yifan, but now he wanted Wang Yifan to run?","At this moment, Fu Heng suddenly moved. He laughed. “Have you lost your mind? I don’t care about this. You refuse a toast only to drink a forfeit. Die!” Fu Heng’s figure was like a roc spreading its wings. With a monstrous aura, he pounced toward Chu Yunfan.."]},{"number":1805,"title":"Chapter 1805: Punched Into a Mummy","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Almost everyone in the surroundings immediately felt this terrifying aura, especially the many inner disciples. This terrifying aura was like a heavy hammer that smashed into their hearts. It wanted to destroy their aura.","Even the elite disciples present did not feel good.","Fu Heng’s strength was among the top among the many elite disciples. It was extraordinary.","Liu Wenjing wanted to stop him, but she couldn’t keep up with Fu Heng’s speed.","In an instant, Fu Heng rushed toward Chu Yunfan. He raised all the divine power in his body and formed a seal. In the blink of an eye, countless lightning bolts condensed in the sky. Countless lightning bolts flashed around his body, like thousands of birds chirping in unison. They turned into a seal and smashed down on Chu Yunfan.","“A lightning technique?” Chu Yunfan recognized it at a glance.","This was a widely circulated thunder seal in the Flying Celestials. It was called the Divine Lightning Seal. Once it was used, it could turn the power of thunder into one’s own power. It was extremely terrifying.","This lightning technique was very powerful. Unfortunately, Fu Heng met Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan opened his hand and collected the lightning. Then, he clenched his fist and punched out.","Boom!","With a loud boom, the punch pierced through the air, causing a terrifying collapse.","However, before Fu Heng could react, the punch landed on his chest. Bam!","Everyone heard a loud bang. Before they could react, they saw that Fu Heng, who was like a thunder god in the sky, had all the power of lightning absorbed by Chu Yunfan and was punched in the chest.","Fu Heng fell to the ground like a kite with a broken string.","“How is this possible?”","Some people couldn’t believe how Chu Yunfan could be so powerful.","Fu Heng’s strength had long reached the peak of the Abstract Interpretation Stage. Although he had been stuck at this threshold for many years and it was very difficult for him to advance further into the Cosmos Stage, among the Interpreter elite disciples, he was an existence that ranked at the top.","Now, he was defeated with just one punch. How strong was Chu Yunfan?","Chu Yunfan’s casual attack had not even used his full strength. This was completely beyond their imagination.","“He’s so strong. Oh my god, look at Fu Heng!” someone cried out in surprise.","Fu Heng, who was lying on the ground, did not move. What was even more terrifying was that this punch had turned Fu Heng into a mummy and he died immediately. It was as if all the blood in his body had been sucked dry and disappeared without a trace as if he had been hit by an evil spell.","However, everyone had seen Chu Yunfan’s attack just now. It was a fair and square move. It was definitely not some demonic technique. In other words, Fu Heng’s blood was evaporated by Chu Yunfan’s punch.","How terrifying was the fist force to be able to do this? It was ten times more difficult than shattering the body.","The inner disciples present had powerful cultivation bases. They were not ordinary people. Naturally, they could see how shocking everything was.","When they looked at Chu Yunfan again, their gazes had changed. They no longer felt that Chu Yunfan was overestimating himself. Chu Yunfan had just been promoted to an elite disciple a year ago. A year later, he could easily kill Fu Heng, who was ranked at the top of the elite disciples. This improvement had reached a shocking level. Given a few more years, it was not impossible for him to enter the Cosmos Stage. No wonder he was so confident. Many people now understood why Chu Yunfan dared to challenge Wang Yifan.","“That was boring. He’s so weak,” Chu Yunfan said with a wave.","After witnessing a battlefield where millions of people fought, even a Cosmic did not dare to say that he could protect himself. Looking back now, Fu Heng’s attack seemed powerful, but in fact, Chu Yunfan was not even interested in taking the initiative to attack.","“A-Aren’t you afraid of Senior Wang’s wrath by doing this?” someone said in a trembling voice as if he was frightened by Chu Yunfan’s ferocity.","“Wang Yifan? Let’s see if he survives past today.” Chu Yunfan shook his head and smiled coldly.","At this moment, everyone looked at Chu Yunfan with some doubt, but no one dared to say that he was overestimating his own strength. Just the strength that Chu Yunfan had displayed now, even if it was not as good as a true disciple, it was not something that they could compare with.","Perhaps he had some trump card?","Everyone could not help but think so.","“Chu Yunfan, you have to be careful. Wang Yifan’s strength is not as simple as you think.”","Suddenly, a figure emerged from the crowd, floating like an immortal.","Everyone took a look and saw that it was none other than Hua Xianyuan.","Many people were still curious. A year ago, Hua Xianyuan was defeated by Chu Yunfan. Could it be that the relationship between the two of them had reached a certain stage?","Only Chu Yunfan understood what Hua Xianyuan meant. Hua Xianyuan saw himself as an opponent. In this world, opponents were rare. He didn’t want Chu Yunfan to die just like that. That would be a pity.","This was the mutual appreciation between opponents.","“Wang Yifan has long entered the Cosmos Stage. He’s not someone that Fu Heng trash can compare to. If you can’t beat him, why don’t you take a step back? With your talent, Wang Yifan won’t be your match in a few years,” Hua Xianyuan sincerely offered his opinion.","He had lost to Chu Yunfan and failed to win the inner disciple competition. Although he had been promoted to an elite disciple in the end, he wanted to win back a match from Chu Yunfan and avenge his previous humiliation. But if Chu Yunfan died at Wang Yifan’s hands, he would never have the chance.","In Hua Xianyuan’s eyes, Wang Yifan was nothing. As long as he was given a few more years, surpassing Wang Yifan was just a matter of time. Even geniuses were divided into levels, and he was undoubtedly the top. In his eyes, Wang Yifan was just an ordinary person. The only person who could be compared to him, or even suppress him, was Chu Yunfan. He might not be able to meet such an opponent in many years. This was the reason why he spoke up to persuade Chu Yunfan.","“It’s fine. I’m here today to fulfill the one-year agreement. If you’re interested in seeing how Wang Yifan dies, you can come and watch.” Chu Yunfan shook his head.","In this one year, Hua Xianyuan’s improvement was indeed shocking. As expected of a king-level physique. He had reached the peak of the Abstract Interpretation Stage in a year. Breaking through to the Cosmos Stage was only a matter of time. If it was an ordinary person, they would have been scared to death.","However, Chu Yunfan’s progress was faster than Hua Xianyuan’s. Hua","Xianyuan’s advice was unnecessary.."]},{"number":1806,"title":"Chapter 1806: I Will Kill Wang Yifan Today","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The commotion soon reached the ears of Wang Yifan and the others who were having a tea party in the depths of the Startling Cloud Peak. There were not many people who could attend this tea party. There were only a few true disciples and a small number of elite disciples.","No one else was qualified, but for most people, even just eating a meal at the banquet was a considerable harvest. The first problem on the path of cultivation was eating. Those who did not know how to dine well were destined to not go far on the path of cultivation.","Wang Yifan received the news very quickly, and his expression darkened. Not only did Chu Yunfan appear, but he had killed Fu Heng. Fu Heng was his trusted subordinate. Among his many followers, he was also the one he valued the most. Now, Fu Heng was killed by Chu Yunfan.","“How dare you!” Wang Yifan said coldly.","The true disciples who were attending the meeting also quickly received the news. This news spread like wildfire. These true disciples either revealed anger on their faces or a playful smile. Not everyone welcomed Chu Yunfan’s arrival, but not everyone hated him either.","“Brother Wang, I hear that you’re in trouble. Do you need our help?” a young man in a loose white robe with a cynical expression asked.","“No need. He’s just a clown. I can handle him,” Wang Yifan said coldly.","Of course, Wang Yifan knew that this tea party was not simple. It represented the beginning of his integration into this circle. Cosmics had their own circles. There was no one who could be independent of these circles. People with such strength would naturally have people gather around them and form a social circle.","Wang Yifan didn’t have the strength to start his own circle, so he chose to join one. As a newcomer, he had to gain the recognition of others in order to join this circle. However, not everyone welcomed him. The distribution of benefits involved was a problem in itself.","“Interesting. An inner disciple challenging a true disciple? Tsk tsk, the Flying Celestials sure know how to play! ” The cynical young man smiled.","These words immediately attracted the dissatisfied gazes of the few Flying Celestial true disciples present. Among these people, there was a woman who was about 25 or 26 and wore a light yellow dress. She had a head of straight black hair, a tall figure, and a beautiful face. She was exquisite and picturesque.","She glanced at the cynical young man and said, “Ye Wuxie, you don’t have to gloat. ”","“Senior Zhantai, I’m not gloating. Actually, I think this Chu Yunfan of your sect is a genius. He sure is bold! Hahaha!” Ye Wuxie laughed.","Ye Wuxie clearly did not welcome Wang Yifan into this circle. Now that he had the chance to see Wang Yifan make a fool of himself, he would not let it go.","Wang Yifan’s expression became even uglier.","A middle-aged man with a square face and a medium build suddenly stood up. “Martial Nephew Wang, there’s no need for you to do anything. I will personally capture him and let him know the difference between a true disciple and an elite disciple.”","“All right, then I’ll have to trouble you, Martial Uncle Zhu,” Wang Yifan said. He sat steadily in the high hall and had no intention of personally attacking.","Everyone’s eyes were focused on this Martial Uncle Zhu. They secretly thought to themselves that it was obvious that he wanted to curry favor with Wang Yifan.","This senior of theirs was a generation older than them. Though they were of different ages, they were both in the Cosmos Stage. However, everyone was in their prime, and their cultivation could advance by leaps and bounds. Their current cultivation was only temporary. However, Senior Zhu was different. He was lucky enough to enter the Cosmos Stage. Moreover, he was old and had lost the potential to advance further.","At this moment, he naturally had to find a reliable backer to rely on. After all, although a Cosmic was an elder in the Flying Celestials, he was only a fringe elder. He couldn’t hold any real power or get good cultivation resources. Compared to Wang Yifan, he was far inferior.","“You will capture me?”","Suddenly, a clear voice came from afar and a figure appeared in the venue of the tea party.","“Chu Yunfan!” Wang Yifan gritted his teeth.","Compared to a year ago, Chu Yunfan looked even more arrogant. He dared to appear in front of him so casually. This was simply going to turn the sky upside down. An ant who could only hide behind Yi Yunyao to survive a year ago actually dared to look him in the eye.","Chu Yunfan swept his gaze across the garden. There were about 40 to 50 people. Among them, more than 20 were true disciples who had entered the Cosmos Stage, and the rest were elite disciples at the peak of the Abstract Interpretation Stage.","Such a lineup was not small. Among these true disciples, the Flying Celestials accounted for half, and the true disciples of the other sects accounted for half. Only the true disciples of the ten great sects could organize such a circle that spanned across the sects.","Chu Yunfan was fearless in the face of dozens of gazes. If it was an ordinary person, even an ordinary true disciple, he would not be so calm.","“You said you wanted to capture me? Are you planning to do it alone? And you that eager to jump out and be someone’s lapdog?” Chu Yunfan said without hesitation.","“You’re courting death!” Senior Zhu looked at Chu Yunfan with a fierce gaze. Although this was the truth, being exposed by Chu Yunfan in public made him furious. “Don’t even think about surviving today. I’m going to skin you alive!”","“Hmph, as an elder, you actually dare to interfere in a life-and-death battle between us disciples? I think you’re tired of living,” Chu Yunfan said bluntly.","In the Flying Celestials, the elders were also divided into ranks. Although there were elders who were extremely powerful, there were those who had barely entered the Cosmos Stage. These elders had no status in front of ordinary true disciples. They could put on airs in front of elite disciples, but in front of Chu Yunfan, it was ridiculous.","Then, Chu Yunfan glanced at everyone and said, “I’m here to fulfill the one-year agreement. Today, I will kill Wang Yifan. If any of you dare to interfere, don’t blame me for not giving you face either..”"]},{"number":1807,"title":"Chapter 1807 - 1808: Slapped Into Meat Paste","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Forget about the true disciples. Now even the elite disciples were so arrogant and completely disregarding them. They had finally found a reason to deal with Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan’s attack was indeed terrifying. He had turned a Cosmic into a mummy with one attack. What a terrifying technique.","However, among them, Martial Uncle Zhu was at the bottom. Even though he was not Chu Yunfan’s match, it did not mean that they were not Chu Yunfan’s match.","Chu Yunfan sneered. “Whoever wants to interfere, come at me together. I’ll send you all on your way. There’s no need to waste time.”","The elders of the Flying Celestials leaped out. They were a tall elder, a","medium-built elder, and an old man who looked to be in his seventies or eighties. These three people, along with Martial Uncle Zhu, were the forces that Wang Yifan had roped in.","Wang Yifan was considered a newcomer among the true disciples and was eager to establish his own faction. These elders also hoped to find a backer. It could be said that they hit it off.","The three of them formed a three-man formation and flew toward Chu Yunfan.","Their divine power surged, and their energy and blood gushed out like pillars. Every trace of divine power was tempered. Although these elders were stuck in their level and did not make much progress, they had a lot of time to temper their divine power. Their divine power was tempered and condensed. On this point, even those geniuses with extremely fast cultivation progress were often inferior.","The three of them joined hands and struck out an incomparably huge palm print. It was the ultimate technique of the Flying Celestials, the Flying Celestial Palm Strike.","The Flying Celestial Palm Strike was an extremely famous unique skill of the Flying Celestials. It could be used by one person or more than one person. The more people who used it, the more powerful it would be.","When the three of them saw Chu Yunfan’s astonishing strength, they were naturally prepared. The effect of the three of them working together was naturally far more than just one plus one.","“Even I have to take the Flying Celestial Palm Strike that the three of them use seriously. Chu Yunfan is dead.”","“That’s it. Chu Yunfan has some tricks up his sleeve, but it’s nothing in front of the three elders. The power of this is definitely more than three times.”","“It’s already rare for an elite disciple like him to be able to cultivate to this stage.”","Everyone present, whether it was Ye Wuxie or Senior Zhantai, stared at Chu Yunfan with burning eyes. Wang Yifan, who was on the high platform, stared at Chu Yunfan, wishing he could tear him into pieces.","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, did not move. In that instant, countless pieces of information were analyzed by him in the short period when the Flying Celestial Palm Strike slapped down.","He had never learned the Flying Celestial Palm Strike before, but he had heard of it. He had only joined the Flying Celestials for a short time, so his contribution points were not enough. Naturally, he was not qualified to learn such a supreme art, especially one that would become more and more powerful as the number of executors increased.","However, this did not prevent him from learning a lot in an instant. No one knew that Chu Yunfan’s eyes were constantly flashing with light. In an instant, he saw through the various mysteries of the Flying Celestial Palm Strike and turned it into his own.","Boom!","When the Flying Celestial Palm Strike came down, Chu Yunfan didn’t dodge or shield. Instead, he allowed the strike to land on him.","Everyone sucked in a breath of cold air. They clearly saw that Chu Yunfan had drilled a big hole in the Flying Celestial Palm Strike. He was not injured in the slightest, and the Flying Celestial Palm Strike actually collapsed.","“How is he so strong?!” someone exclaimed.","Senior Zhantai’s expression finally became serious. She too had a way of facing the Flying Celestial Palm Strike that the three elders executed together, but it was absolutely impossible for her to be like Chu Yunfan, who could easily withstand it with just his body. The toughness of Chu Yunfan’s physique was definitely not inferior to a hallowed weapon.","‘Is he a physique cultivator? But even for physique cultivators, it’s extremely difficult to refine one’s body to the point where it’s comparable to a hallowed weapon.’ Senior Zhantai’s eyes flashed with a thoughtful light.","She had met a few physique cultivators, and they were all monsters with extremely abnormal physiques. However, very few actually walked this path because it was very painful. In the process of tempering themselves, the pain would increase with the increase of their cultivation. Many people could not hold on and gave up halfway.","This was because the cultivator had to tear themselves apart and reconstruct themselves at each step of the training process. The more profound the cultivation was, the sturdier their body would be. The pain they had to experience when being torn apart was not something that ordinary people could endure. Thus, physique cultivators were like ascetics. They were different from other cultivators. In many people’s eyes, they were no different from a group of lunatics.","“How is this happening?”","The three elders were stunned. There was no doubt that Chu Yunfan’s move had shocked them. This was different from what they had expected. In their opinion, if the three of them joined forces, even if Chu Yunfan had already entered the Cosmos Stage, he would still be defeated. After all, Martial Uncle Zhu had barely entered the Cosmos Stage. As for the three of them, one of them was at a second-level Cosmic while the other two were at third-level Cosmics.","It was more than enough to deal with a junior who had just entered the Cosmos Stage. Who knew that they would discover that something was wrong as soon as they made their move?","“That’s all. The Flying Celestial Palm Strike is indeed exquisite, but it’s too wasteful in your hands. You can’t unleash its true power. Have a taste of my Flying Celestial Palm Strike!” Chu Yunfan shouted.","In the blink of an eye, Chu Yunfan made his move. With a backhand, he slapped down with a Flying Celestial Palm Strike. The spirit energy of the world seemed to be attracted by some force and condensed into a huge palm print in the air.","At the end of the palm print, there was a faint figure of a celestial from the sky.","This was the Flying Celestial Palm Strike that the Flying Celestials were so proud of.","In that short period, Chu Yunfan had learned it. If others knew, they would probably be scared to death. However, it was obvious that the others did not know this. They only thought that Chu Yunfan had learned the Flying Celestial Palm Strike from somewhere.","The giant palm grew larger and larger and firmly locked onto the three elders. They instantly felt as if the world was collapsing. Almost all the power in their bodies was locked down.","The three elders were shocked. They hurriedly blasted out all kinds of offensive divine abilities and Dao techniques in an attempt to block the incoming attack. However, it was completely useless. This giant palm print crushed all the enemies before it.","Bam!","The giant palm smashed down and turned the three elders into a pile of meat paste.."]},{"number":1808,"title":"Chapter 1808: Slapped Into Meat Paste","paragraphs":["Chapter 1808: Slapped Into Meat Paste","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Forget about the true disciples. Now even the elite disciples were so arrogant and completely disregarding them. They had finally found a reason to deal with Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan’s attack was indeed terrifying. He had turned a Cosmic into a mummy with one attack. What a terrifying technique.","However, among them, Martial Uncle Zhu was at the bottom. Even though he was not Chu Yunfan’s match, it did not mean that they were not Chu Yunfan’s match.","Chu Yunfan sneered. “Whoever wants to interfere, come at me together. I’ll send you all on your way. There’s no need to waste time.”","The elders of the Flying Celestials leaped out. They were a tall elder, a","medium-built elder, and an old man who looked to be in his seventies or eighties. These three people, along with Martial Uncle Zhu, were the forces that Wang Yifan had roped in.","Wang Yifan was considered a newcomer among the true disciples and was eager to establish his own faction. These elders also hoped to find a backer. It could be said that they hit it off.","The three of them formed a three-man formation and flew toward Chu Yunfan.","Their divine power surged, and their energy and blood gushed out like pillars. Every trace of divine power was tempered. Although these elders were stuck in their level and did not make much progress, they had a lot of time to temper their divine power. Their divine power was tempered and condensed. On this point, even those geniuses with extremely fast cultivation progress were often inferior.","The three of them joined hands and struck out an incomparably huge palm print. It was the ultimate technique of the Flying Celestials, the Flying Celestial Palm Strike.","The Flying Celestial Palm Strike was an extremely famous unique skill of the Flying Celestials. It could be used by one person or more than one person. The more people who used it, the more powerful it would be.","When the three of them saw Chu Yunfan’s astonishing strength, they were naturally prepared. The effect of the three of them working together was naturally far more than just one plus one.","“Even I have to take the Flying Celestial Palm Strike that the three of them use seriously. Chu Yunfan is dead.”","“That’s it. Chu Yunfan has some tricks up his sleeve, but it’s nothing in front of the three elders. The power of this is definitely more than three times.”","“It’s already rare for an elite disciple like him to be able to cultivate to this stage.”","Everyone present, whether it was Ye Wuxie or Senior Zhantai, stared at Chu Yunfan with burning eyes. Wang Yifan, who was on the high platform, stared at Chu Yunfan, wishing he could tear him into pieces.","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, did not move. In that instant, countless pieces of information were analyzed by him in the short period when the Flying Celestial Palm Strike slapped down.","He had never learned the Flying Celestial Palm Strike before, but he had heard of it. He had only joined the Flying Celestials for a short time, so his contribution points were not enough. Naturally, he was not qualified to learn such a supreme art, especially one that would become more and more powerful as the number of executors increased.","However, this did not prevent him from learning a lot in an instant. No one knew that Chu Yunfan’s eyes were constantly flashing with light. In an instant, he saw through the various mysteries of the Flying Celestial Palm Strike and turned it into his own.","Boom!","When the Flying Celestial Palm Strike came down, Chu Yunfan didn’t dodge or shield. Instead, he allowed the strike to land on him.","Everyone sucked in a breath of cold air. They clearly saw that Chu Yunfan had drilled a big hole in the Flying Celestial Palm Strike. He was not injured in the slightest, and the Flying Celestial Palm Strike actually collapsed.","“How is he so strong?!” someone exclaimed.","Senior Zhantai’s expression finally became serious. She too had a way of facing the Flying Celestial Palm Strike that the three elders executed together, but it was absolutely impossible for her to be like Chu Yunfan, who could easily withstand it with just his body. The toughness of Chu Yunfan’s physique was definitely not inferior to a hallowed weapon.","‘Is he a physique cultivator? But even for physique cultivators, it’s extremely difficult to refine one’s body to the point where it’s comparable to a hallowed weapon.’ Senior Zhantai’s eyes flashed with a thoughtful light.","She had met a few physique cultivators, and they were all monsters with extremely abnormal physiques. However, very few actually walked this path because it was very painful. In the process of tempering themselves, the pain would increase with the increase of their cultivation. Many people could not hold on and gave up halfway.","This was because the cultivator had to tear themselves apart and reconstruct themselves at each step of the training process. The more profound the cultivation was, the sturdier their body would be. The pain they had to experience when being torn apart was not something that ordinary people could endure. Thus, physique cultivators were like ascetics. They were different from other cultivators. In many people’s eyes, they were no different from a group of lunatics.","“How is this happening?”","The three elders were stunned. There was no doubt that Chu Yunfan’s move had shocked them. This was different from what they had expected. In their opinion, if the three of them joined forces, even if Chu Yunfan had already entered the Cosmos Stage, he would still be defeated. After all, Martial Uncle Zhu had barely entered the Cosmos Stage. As for the three of them, one of them was at a second-level Cosmic while the other two were at third-level Cosmics.","It was more than enough to deal with a junior who had just entered the Cosmos Stage. Who knew that they would discover that something was wrong as soon as they made their move?","“That’s all. The Flying Celestial Palm Strike is indeed exquisite, but it’s too wasteful in your hands. You can’t unleash its true power. Have a taste of my Flying Celestial Palm Strike!” Chu Yunfan shouted.","In the blink of an eye, Chu Yunfan made his move. With a backhand, he slapped down with a Flying Celestial Palm Strike. The spirit energy of the world seemed to be attracted by some force and condensed into a huge palm print in the air.","At the end of the palm print, there was a faint figure of a celestial from the sky.","This was the Flying Celestial Palm Strike that the Flying Celestials were so proud of.","In that short period, Chu Yunfan had learned it. If others knew, they would probably be scared to death. However, it was obvious that the others did not know this. They only thought that Chu Yunfan had learned the Flying Celestial Palm Strike from somewhere.","The giant palm grew larger and larger and firmly locked onto the three elders. They instantly felt as if the world was collapsing. Almost all the power in their bodies was locked down.","The three elders were shocked. They hurriedly blasted out all kinds of offensive divine abilities and Dao techniques in an attempt to block the incoming attack. However, it was completely useless. This giant palm print crushed all the enemies before it.","Bam!","The giant palm smashed down and turned the three elders into a pile of meat paste.."]},{"number":1809,"title":"Chapter 1809: A True Dragon Appearing From Shallow Waters","paragraphs":["Chapter 1809: A True Dragon Appearing From Shallow Waters","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The three elders were unable to fight back under Chu Yunfan’s Flying Celestial","Palm Strike. It could be said that they were crushed.","He had turned three Cosmic elders into minced meat with a single slap!","The scene was dead silent. When everyone saw this scene, they were dumbfounded. It was so silent that a pin drop could be heard. No one had expected Chu Yunfan to be so powerful.","Everyone no longer had any doubts about why Chu Yunfan had come to meet them. They thought that he must have lost his mind. Otherwise, why would he dare to come and pull the tiger’s whiskers?","But now that they saw it, they realized that it was still uncertain who the tiger was. They had thought that they were the strong side, but now it seemed that it might not be the case.","Senior Zhantai especially thought this way. Liu Wenjing had asked her to take care of Chu Yunfan so that he wouldn’t be beaten to death. Her red lips twitched slightly. Who was she supposed to protect? This Chu Yunfan was terrifyingly powerful.","He had killed four Cosmics without panting or sweating. Without a doubt, he had not used his full strength. These four elders in the Cosmos Stage were not enough to test Chu Yunfan’s strength.","Senior Zhantai couldn’t even see what kind of method Chu Yunfan used to temporarily increase his strength. If this was his original combat strength, it was absolutely shocking. Chu Yunfan had only just obtained the spot of an elite disciple a year ago, but now he could easily kill a true disciple.","In this one year, Chu Yunfan had not only achieved a complete transformation, but he had also undergone an earth-shattering change. When did such a peerless and vicious person appear in their Flying Celestials?","Only now did many people realize that they knew too little about Chu Yunfan. He had only joined the Flying Celestials for a short time. Even if he had a stunning performance, his level was too low. People like them would not pay attention to an inner sect disciple.","After Chu Yunfan entered the Flying Celestials, he spent two years traveling outside, so they knew even less. And now, just the tip of the iceberg had been revealed, and it was already so shocking.","Even the true disciples of the other sects were sitting upright, treating Chu","Yunfan as an expert who could be compared to them. They were not treating Chu Yunfan like a laughable monkey and treating everything as a monkey show. This was fundamentally different.","Ye Wuxie immediately restrained his cynical expression and looked at Chu Yunfan with a serious expression as if he finally recognized Chu Yunfan’s strength. ‘I didn’t expect the Flying Celestials to have such a character. This is truly rare!’","The corners of Ye Wuxie’s mouth curled up slightly. Although they were both in the ranks of the top ten great sects, the Flying Celestials had always been one of the bottom few among the top ten great sects. To outsiders, it was a colossus, but to the top ten great sects, there were differences in strength.","Among them, the three strongest sects were the Destiny Sect, the Virtuous Academy, and the Great Change Faith. The strength of these three sects might be much stronger than the other seven sects combined. Of course, the most outstanding disciples were often from the three great sects. Such ferocious and invincible newcomers were often from the three great sects.","And Ye Wuxie was from the Great Change Faith, one of the three great sects. He naturally felt that the Flying Celestials was not that impressive. In the entire","Flying Celestials, there were only a handful of people who could catch his eye.","He didn’t come here to give Wang Yifan face. Instead, he wanted to see Hua Xianyuan, who had recently become famous. However, he was very disappointed after seeing him. Hua Xianyuan’s talent was extraordinary, but he was still young and couldn’t compete for the world in the short term.","‘A true dragon appeared in shallow water?’ Ye Wuxie smiled.","At this moment, Wang Yifan leaped to his feet. He laughed out loud. It was a smile of extreme anger. “This is great. I didn’t kill you before because I didn’t expect to raise a tiger and invite trouble!”","He finally admitted that it was a mistake to let Chu Yunfan go. However, he had been forced by the situation and lost to Yi Yunyao, so he had no choice but to give up on killing Chu Yunfan back then. However, he had never taken Chu Yunfan seriously. Even though Chu Yunfan had ruined his plans several times, he was still nothing in his eyes.","He was a true disciple. Chu Yunfan was nothin—just an inner sect disciple. He was only using Chu Yunfan to deal a blow to Yi Yunyao. His true target had always been Yi Yunyao, who had repeatedly opposed him. Chu Yunfan was just a bystander.","Who would have thought that this ant that he had targeted in passing would bring him such great trouble?","With his temperament, how could Wang Yifan not see that Chu Yunfan had only used words to hold him back, making it inconvenient for him to directly attack? However, he had used all his previous methods, so naturally, he was not soft-hearted. The only thing he shouldn’t have done was not to do it himself.","“Do you think you were the one who let me go? No. I was the one who let you go. I could’ve killed you back then too,” Chu Yunfan said coldly, “It’s useless to talk about this now. You’re already lucky that I’ve let you live for another year.” “What big words. You won’t be as lucky as before,” Wang Yifan said coldly.","“Lucky? Do you think I relied on luck to get to where I am today?” Chu Yunfan sneered and stomped his foot.","In an instant, an unparalleled aura was released from his body. It was the first time that his vigorous divine power was displayed. Previously, he had killed four elders in a row with ease. He did not even use 10% of his strength. At this time, everyone finally saw his true strength.","Wang Yifan looked on coldly. His aura was finally released. Terrifying mana was released like tidal waves. In an instant, many defensive barriers on Startling Cloud Peak were activated. This was to prevent the mountain peak from collapsing. After all, any one of these true disciples had the strength to blast these mountains into pieces.","The entire mountain peak was trembling slightly, and the floating clouds were also trembling non-stop. At this moment, all of these unforeseen events finally shocked all of Startling Mountain Peak. The inner disciples and elite disciples who had come to partake in the banquet arrived at the tea party venue and witnessed a shocking battle.."]},{"number":1810,"title":"Chapter 1810: I Didn’t Even Use 10% Of My Power!","paragraphs":["Chapter 1810: I Didn’t Even Use 10% Of My Power!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The aura released by the two of them enveloped the entire Startling Cloud Peak. Other than the true disciples who could still sit in high positions, almost everyone else flew away and did not dare to approach.","The auras of both sides were too terrifying.","“Chu Yunfan, do you think you can compare with me just because your cultivation has improved greatly?” Wang Yifan looked at Chu Yunfan coldly, his face filled with shock and killing intent.","“Compared to you? Who do you think you are? If I were your age, crushing you would be as easy as crushing an ant,” Chu Yunfan said calmly.","“You arrogant brat!”","Wang Yifan immediately shouted. He swept out like a violent chariot and instantly rushed in front of Chu Yunfan. He turned into a shocking rainbow and slapped down with a Flying Celestial Palm Strike.","The power of this Flying Celestial Palm Strike was even more shocking than the one displayed by the three elders. This showed Wang Yifan’s astonishing talent. He really wasn’t someone that those elders who were on the sidelines could compare to.","A fourth-level Cosmic!","Wang Yifan had reached the fourth level of the Cosmos Stage!","Even in the Cosmos Stage, such a cultivation was considered average and not weak. However, none of the Cosmics present were surprised. They knew that if Wang Yifan didn’t have such strength, they wouldn’t be willing to come and take a look, let alone participate in the tea party.","Among the Cosmic true disciples, there were different grades. Some people could not cultivate to the fourth Level of the Cosmos Stage in their entire lives.","This was a cruel fact.","However, Chu Yunfan’s reaction was not slow. He threw a punch. He didn’t seem to have used any martial arts, but a simple punch had shattered the Flying Celestial Palm Strike. The terrifying fist force was like a heavenly river that surged toward Wang Yifan.","Boom!","This punch arrived in front of Wang Yifan, and Wang Yifan used the Flying Celestial Palm Strike to block it. His eyes flashed with a dumbfounded expression as he said, “I didn’t expect you to be able to withstand 30% of my strength. Not bad. not bad. Killing you will be worth it.”","“30%? I didn’t even use 10% of my power. If that’s all you have, I advise you to obediently find a rope and hang yourself.” Chu Yunfan crossed his arms and looked coldly at Wang Yifan.","“You’re too arrogant!” Wang Yifan shouted and attacked again. But this time, it was different from before. The mana in his body boiled and shook the surrounding space.","“Geng Metal Sword!”","A sword appeared in Wang Yifan’s hand. This sword gave off a golden light and was extremely sharp. Just one look at it gave the illusion that it could cut someone in half.","“That’s geng metal?”","Everyone, including Ye Wuxie, was stunned.","“Geng metal is the pinnacle of metal. If ordinary divine weapons are mixed with a little geng metal, their power will increase greatly. Not to mention, the entire sword is forged from geng metal. Anything that comes into contact with it, even by just a little bit, will probably be cut into two.”","“Where did Wang Yifan find so much geng metal? Even a little bit of geng metal is priceless. An entire sword made of geng metal is worth at least 20 million middle-grade spirit stones!”","Everyone was instantly stunned and discussed animatedly. Even those extremely powerful true disciples were stunned. Many people were no longer optimistic about Chu Yunfan’s odds. His physique had amazed many people earlier, and he had withstood a low-grade weapon with his bare hands. However, this sword was different.","Among metals, geng metal was one of the best. Its sharpness was unparalleled, and even a low-grade artifact would be cut in half with a single sword strike. Its value was on a completely different level.","“So what if you are the best among physique cultivators? You’ll die under my geng metal sword!” Wang Yifan sneered.","It was because of this trump card that he didn’t panic when Chu Yunfan displayed his shocking physique cultivation. Even a low-grade artifact couldn’t do anything to him.","There was a reason why physique cultivation wasn’t mainstream. The cultivation of the body was unparalleled in the world, but there were always methods to restrain them. For example, the geng metal sword was one of them. Even the most powerful physique cultivators would suffer at this sword.","“In the past, I raised a tiger and invited trouble. Today, I won’t be lenient. You won’t be able to escape death!” Wang Yifan shouted.","In an instant, a sword light slashed out. A golden sword light swept through the sky, and the light illuminated the entire sky and tore it apart. This sword light split into tens of millions of sword rain. Countless sword rain enveloped Chu Yunfan, forming a sword energy field.","All of this happened quickly. Everyone felt their vision blur before they saw that the sky was filled with golden sword lights.","“Ridiculous. Do you think you can deal with me just because you have a geng metal sword?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","If it was an ordinary physique cultivator, they would probably die if they touched this sword. Physique cultivators had unparalleled bodies, but they relied too much on their bodies. Once their physical defense failed, they would die.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. He was not an ordinary physique cultivator. With the addition of two terrifying physiques, his physical strength had reached a shocking level.","Chu Yunfan’s body was first covered in a layer of jade color, and then a layer of lightning power spread out. This lightning power formed a thin armor around his body, protecting him tightly.","In the next moment, he let out a long cry. His entire body was like a great roc spreading its wings. He rushed out and flew toward the sword rain that filled the sky.","Bam!","Just as the sword lights were about to hit Chu Yunfan, Chu Yunfan threw a punch. In an instant, the sword lights were scattered.","These golden sword lights were extremely fast. Other than a few people present, everyone’s eyes could not keep up. All they could see was Chu Yunfan being drowned by countless sword lights.","“It’s over. No matter how strong Chu Yunfan is, it’s useless. He’s dead!”","“One of these geng metal sword lights is enough to kill him, let alone so many at the same time. There’s no hope for him.”","“That’s right. What a pity. I thought that he would succeed. If that was the case, he would’ve created history. However, he turned into ashes in the end.”","Everyone’s first reaction was that Chu Yunfan was dead for sure. Nobody expected in the next moment that countless sword lights would be shattered and sprayed out in all directions, and a figure quickly rushed out from within.."]},{"number":1811,"title":"Chapter 1811: Stomping Wang Yifan to Death","paragraphs":["Chapter 1811: Stomping Wang Yifan to Death","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Everyone focused their eyes and saw that it was Chu Yunfan!","Everyone thought that he would not be able to escape after being completely enveloped by the sword lights. Who knew that he would shatter all of them?","His clothes weren’t even damaged, so he didn’t look like he was in a sorry state.","“Wow!”","Many people sucked in a breath of cold air. They could only think of one word—terrifying!","A person’s physical cultivation could actually be so tyrannical to this extent?","It could actually ignore the geng metal sword light!","Even Wang Yifan hadn’t expected this.","The geng metal sword light was extremely sharp, and its power would increase according to the cultivation of the person who used it. Even a low-grade hallowed weapon used by a Cosmic would be cut in half.","However, such a powerful energy could not do anything to Chu Yunfan.","How powerful was Chu Yunfan’s physique?","Wang Yifan’s eyes flickered with terrifying killing intent. It could be said that he had never wanted to kill someone so much. Chu Yunfan was already so difficult to deal with. If Chu Yunfan was allowed to advance to the Cosmos Stage, the consequences would be unimaginable. If Chu Yunfan continued to grow in the future, wouldn’t he be left far behind?","At this moment, Wang Yifan remembered that it had only been two years since Chu Yunfan had entered the sect until now. Two years ago, Chu Yunfan was nothing but an ant. He had never put him in his eyes.","However, two years later, everything had changed. Chu Yunfan could now fight him to this extent. Earlier, he was confident that he could kill Chu Yunfan, so he turned a blind eye to Chu Yunfan’s growth. But now, he truly felt that Chu Yunfan’s threat was imminent.","‘I can’t let him continue to grow. Otherwise, I will lose my place in the sect!’ he thought.","“I won’t tolerate you!” Wang Yifan brandished the long sword in his hand, and his eyes burst with shocking lights. He swept in Chu Yunfan’s direction.","The sword lights soared into the sky and tore through everything. When they tore through the sky, there was the sound of cloth being torn apart.","There was a clanging sound!","Countless sword lights swept out like a rain of swords that covered the sky and earth. They cut through air and reversed Yin and Yang. Every sword light swept out and condensed into a terrifying waterfall.","They instantly enveloped Chu Yunfan, making it impossible for him to escape or dodge.","“The geng metal sword light is powerful, but it’s not enough to hurt me.” Chu Yunfan sneered and leaped up. He stomped down like a roc spreading its wings. “First Stomp of the Nine Netherworld Stomps!”","When Chu Yunfan took this step, countless netherworld water spread out from nowhere. The water formed a torrential force and ruthlessly rushed toward the sword rain that was flying over.","Rumble!","A series of thunder-like sounds rang out as the sword rain and the netherworld water collided. The water drowned everything, while the sword rain tore everything apart. The two sides collided continuously. Wang Yifan’s cultivation was continuously injected into the geng metal sword, causing sword lights to continuously sweep out. These sword light could destroy an entire city. As the higher-ups of Grand Xia, the true disciples did have such strength.","“Break!” Wang Yifan roared, and more sword lights appeared, attacking Chu","Yunfan.","“Nine Nethworld Stomps,” Chu Yunfan said calmly, “Second Stomp.”","With this step, the endless netherworld water exploded and rolled back. It suppressed the geng metal sword lights. Even with the sharpness of the sword lights, it could not break through the water.","‘How is he so strong?!’ Wang Yifan roared, and all the divine power in his body burned as he tried to resist Chu Yunfan. However, Chu Yunfan stomped a third time.","Boom!","With a loud boom, everyone saw Chu Yunfan’s stomp shatter countless golden swordl lights. The sword lights were incomparably sharp and invincible. However, the netherworld water not ordinary water either. It was a terrifying water produced in the depths of the underworld.","When the third stomp landed, the entire world shook and the sword lights were compressed around Wang Yifan.","“What technique is this? How is it so powerful?” a true disciple then spoke up. His eyes were filled with shock. He was shocked by Chu Yunfan’s Nine Netherworld Stomps.","If Wang Yifan wasn’t a match for the Nince Netherworld Stomps, they would certainly far no better. It was not much better because this technique was absolutely terrifying.","Chu Yunfan had only used the first three stomps, the power was already so shocking. The power of each stomp was multiplied by several times. If he used all nine stomps, what kind of scene would it be? It was simply unimaginable.","In any case, it was definitely not a technique of the Flying Celestials, because the Flying Celestials did not have such a technique. They were all very clear about it. However, no one was surprised. All of them had all kinds of fortuitous encounters. It was just a high-grade technique. They all had all kinds of fortuitous encounters, but they were not as shocking. At this moment, Chu Yunfan’s fourth stomp erupted.","Boom!","This stomp landed directly on Wang Yifan, trampling him to the ground.","Bam!","A huge hole was created in the ground, and everyone found that the hole was less than a meter in diameter. Judging from the terrifying range of Chu Yunfan’s attack, it was only this big. It was not that the power had decreased, but on the contrary, Chu Yunfan’s control of divine power had reached a shocking level.","This was the most terrifying part!","However, everyone saw that Wang Yifan was lying on the ground, motionless. He had been trampled to death by Chu Yunfan.","To be more precise, Wang Yifan’s chest had been pierced by Chu Yunfan’s stomp. Blood spurted out from it, and his internal organs were completely turned into a pile of mud.","“Wang Yifan died just like that?” Ye Wuxie looked at Wang Yifan in shock. Wang Yifan couldn’t even withstand four stomps from Chu Yunfan.","Senior Zhantai was dumbstruck by what she saw and her beautiful eyes flashed with disbelief.."]},{"number":1812,"title":"Chapter 1812: Wang Yifan Transforms Into a Demon","paragraphs":["Chapter 1812: Wang Yifan Transforms Into a Demon","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Everyone was extremely shocked. Although Chu Yunfan had become stronger and stronger as time passed, and everyone had imagined that Wang Yifan might fail, they had never thought that Chu Yunfan would be able to kill Wang Yifan so easily.","This could only mean that Chu Yunfan was just playing around in the previous fights. He did not use his full strength at all. What Chu Yunfan said just now was that he used 10% of his strength. Now, that seemed highly likely.","Thinking of this, many people sucked in a breath of cold air. What exactly had Chu Yunfan experienced during this period of time? He had changed so much. Even if it was a fortuitous encounter, it was still too shocking. Those who were present, such as Senior Zhantai, Ye Wuxie, and the others, did not know what fortuitous encounter could allow one to advance to this level in such a short period of time. In the eyes of many people, ascending in the day and gaining enlightenment overnight was nothing more than this.","“So strong! Senior Wang is so weak! Too terrifying!”","I thought Chu Yunfan was the one who would be crushed. Who knew that","Senior Wang was the one who was easily beaten to death in the end.”","While everyone was discussing, Liu Wenjing was still in disbelief. Chu Yunfan entered the sect much later than her, but who knew that he would reach such a terrifying level in such a short time?","She originally thought that Chu Yunfan’s words were just big talk. After all, he had only become an elite disciple not long ago. How could he kill Wang Yifan? Who knew that Chu Yunfan actually did it. To her, it was also an incomparable shock.","Only Chu Hongcai’s expression did not change. He had seen Chu Yunfan create many miracles. Chu Yunfan’s invincible heart had already penetrated deep into his heart and had never wavered. In his opinion, it was normal for Chu Yunfan to make any kind of declaration. Even if Chu Yunfan said that he wanted to become the sect leader of the Flying Celestials, he wouldn’t be surprised.","In the crowd, Zhang Chao’s face suddenly turned pale. He had wanted to tell on Chu Hongcai and betray him, but now, seeing Chu Yunfan’s shocking strength, he was frightened. Chu Yunfan was so strong. Even if he couldn’t defeat Wang Yifan, he could easily kill him. Who would offend an elite disciple with a bright future for him?","It was even worse now. Even if he was stupid, he could see that Chu Yunfan would definitely become a true disciple after this battle. This was definitely something that was unavoidable.","If the true disciple was determined to kill him, it would only be a matter of a moment.","Chu Yunfan had been able to escape previously because another true disciple, Yi Yunyao, had protected him. Zhang Chao didn’t even know a few elite disciples, so how could a true disciple offend Chu Yunfan for an insignificant person like him?","Thinking of this, Zhang Chao felt powerless. He realized that his previous ridicule was like a clown. Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at him because he didn’t even have the right to have Chu Yunfan look at him. The mere thought of Chu Yunfan attacking him was enough to make his heart break.","Soon, everyone realized that after killing Wang Yifan, Chu Yunfan didn’t look happy. Instead, he stared at Wang Yifan’s corpse.","Suddenly, a violent power surged out of Wang Yifan’s body. An extremely terrifying dark power surged.","“Demonic energy!” someone exclaimed.","Many people present were familiar with demonic energy. Not to mention those otherworldly demons, there were many people who cultivated demonic techniques and cultivated demonic energy.","Demons were the greatest enemy of the world. If Grand Xia suppressed the demons to fight for living space, then the war with the demons was the true battle of life and death.","The demons were the same as the humans. They absorbed energy to cultivate. Where they differed was that the energy they absorbed for cultivation was demonic energy. Therefore, wherever the demons went, the world would be filled with demonic energy. Even human cultivators would feel extremely uncomfortable in places filled with demonic energy. It would even be difficult for them to move, let alone ordinary humans. It was a dead end.","Once the demons invaded the world, it would destroy their foundation and exterminate the entire human race. Even if there were a few experts who were not afraid of demonic energy, the foundation of the entire race would be broken. The collapse of the human race would be in front of them. It was precisely because of this that humans were very sensitive to demonic energy. This was why evil was hated by everyone.","Wang Yifan was a true disciple of the Flying Celestials, but now he was emitting demonic energy. This shocked many people. This matter wasn’t no longer just a private matter between Chu Yunfan and Wang Yifan. It was going to shake the upper echelons of the Flying Celestials.","A true disciple of the Flying Celestials had turned into a demon. This was simply shocking. If it was blown up a little more, it might even attract the attention of the Imperial Court.","Chu Yunfan’s eyes flashed with a sharp light. He heard Wang Yifan’s heartbeat. The internal organs that he had stomped into meat paste were growing back at an astonishing speed. However, they were different from before. Black muscles had grown out, and dense scales had grown on the black muscles.","This was the symbol of demons.","Demonic energy quickly covered Wang Yifan’s entire body, and his corpse turned into a demonic body. Wang Yifan then jumped up and looked at Chu Yunfan with a ferocious expression. He no longer had a human form. His entire body was covered in scales, and he had wings on his ribs. He had a green face and fangs, and he looked like a demon.","Ye Wuxie, Senior Zhantai, and the others who were watching the show could not sit idly by. Slaying demons was where righteousness lay.","Everyone’s mana were raised and their minds tensed up, ready to attack at any moment. Even the inner sect disciples and elite disciples were no exception. They all pointed at Wang Yifan.","But at this moment, Wang Yifan turned a deaf ear to them. He only stared at Chu Yunfan, his blood-red eyes revealing a bone-deep killing intent.","“Chu Yunfan, you’ve forced me to this extent. Even if I die today, I’ll drag you down with me!” Wang Yifan grinned. However, his handsome face was now filled with a sinister look that made people feel nauseous.","The demonic energy in Wang Yifan’s body continued to increase, becoming more and more intense. It formed a hurricane that was several times more terrifying than before.."]},{"number":1813,"title":"Chapter 1813: If I Can Kill Him Once, I Can Kill Him Twice","paragraphs":["Chapter 1813: If I Can Kill Him Once, I Can Kill Him Twice","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After becoming a demon, Wang Yifan’s strength had clearly increased by a lot. If he was originally only at the fourth level of the Cosmos Stage, he had entered the fifth level of the Cosmos Stage after becoming a demon, and he was rapidly approaching the sixth level. This crazy increase in strength made Ye Wuxie and the others’ expressions turn grave.","This was the advantage of becoming a demon. Demons were much stronger than humans in the first place. It was because of this that many people chose to submit to the demons to improve their strength. Because many people were already old or had exhausted their potential. For them, other than this plan, there was no way to advance further.","“This must be a Demon Seed,” Chu Yunfan said.","He knew that this was a Demon Seed. Many people wanted to enter the demonic path but could not do so. The human body was completely different from demons, and rashly absorbing demonic energy or cultivating the demons’ demonic skills was tantamount to courting death. It was precisely because of this situation that the Demon Seed was born. A Demon Seed was injected into a person’s body, and the seed was used day and night to infuse the person’s body into a demon physique.","This was the fastest way for humans to enter the demonic path. Later on, there were people with great talent in the demonic path who modified their demonic techniques to adapt to the human body, and finally created the demonic path. In turn, these demonic martial arts developed a large number of demonic cultivators, thus breaking free from the control of the otherworldly demons and forming their own lineage.","However, there were still many people who took the risk and chose to plant the Demon Seed to obtain greater strength and a longer life.","“That’s right. This is a Demon Seed, and it’s a Demon Seed of a high-level demon!” Wang Yifan smiled sinisterly. “I didn’t expect you to know. I need this","Demon Seed. Now that you’ve caused me to fall into the bottomless abyss, even if I die, I’ll drag you down with me!”","As Wang Yifan spoke, his expression became even more ferocious. Relying on the power of the Demon Seed to revive, his strength had also increased to a higher level. He was approaching the power of a sixth-level Cosmic. This strength was close to the small group of people at the top of the Cosmos Stage.","It was a realm that he had dreamed of reaching, but now he had to use such a","method to reach it. To him, this was undoubtedly a form of mockery. Most importantly, he knew that he had nowhere to run today. It was impossible for him to escape. If he was in any other place, he could still run for his life. However, it was different here. This was the headquarters of the Flying Celestials.","Although Wang Yifan could be considered an expert, it was precisely because","he was a true disciple of the Flying Celestials that he knew best how many terrifying old monsters were lurking in the Flying Celestials. It would be a huge joke if he could escape.","Although it had been just a short period, the news had probably already spread, and the experts of the Flying Celestials were probably already gathering. Therefore, he did not have much time left. There was now only one word in his heart—revenge.","It was Chu Yunfan who had forced him to this point. Even if he died, he would not let Chu Yunfan off.","“Wang Yifan, you sided with the demons and planted a Demon Seed in yourself!” a true disciple of the Flying Celestials roared and activated his divine power.","In the current circumstances, he no longer cared about supporting Wang Yifan. What kind of joke was this? It was confirmed that Wang Yifan was colluding with the demons. After all, the demons’ Demon Seed couldn’t be nurtured under ordinary circumstances. Nurturing a Demon Seed was a huge burden for the demons. In addition to the fact that Grand Xia had sealed it for many years, there were very few Demon Seeds. It was very difficult to obtain them, let alone a high-level Demon Seed.","Those who came to support Wang Yifan couldn’t escape responsibility. They would all be seen as Wang Yifan’s allies. Although their relationship with him wasn’t close, it would take a long time to clear their names. Since it would be difficult to clear their names, they had no choice but to make a statement. Otherwise, it would be troublesome.","“Everyone, attack together. We can’t let him escape!” the true disciple shouted. He gathered all his mana and was about to attack Wang Yifan. However, before he could finish speaking, a demonic claw tore through the void and appeared in front of him.","This true disciple did not even have time to react. That speed was too fast. A demonic claw pierced through his chest and ripped his heart out.","The true disciple could not react, and his eyes widened in dibelief. This demonic claw was too terrifying. It tore through his breastplate and his protective energy shield. Even with his cultivation, the true disciple could not withstand this attack.","Originally, his cultivation was about the same as Wang Yifan’s, or even a little stronger. Who knew that after Wang Yifan became a demon, he would be so terrifying?","The true disciple couldn’t block this attack.","Wang Yifan ripped out the true disciple’s heart and swallowed it in front of everyone. Blood flowed down his chin. This heart contained all the power of this true disciple. Now, it was absorbed by him and turned into power that he could use.","“Whoever interferes will end up like him. This has nothing to do with you. I only want Chu Yunfan’s life! ” Wang Yifan laughed sinisterly.","Now that he had turned into a demon, his bloodthirsty desire was released. It was as if he had turned from a human into a beast. He would not be lenient when killing people even when he was still human. However, he would not dig out a person’s heart and eat it. This was against humanity.","However, there was no obstruction for him to do such a thing now. One could imagine that he had long become a demon, not a human. His only rationality told him that he absolutely could not let others interfere. Otherwise, his desire for revenge would become a delusion.","“How dare you kill people in front of us!”","These true disciples were shocked and angry. Wang Yifan was simply too bold. At this moment, in their eyes, the arrogant Chu Yunfan from before paled in comparison to Wang Yifan. At the very least, Chu Yunfan was a human, while Wnag Yifan was a demon. They could not be mentioned in the same breath.","In particular, Senior Zhantai was burning with anger. Her beautiful eyes erupted with a terrifying light. She gathered all her mana. Even if Wang Yifan turned into a demon, she was fearless.","Ye Wuxie and the other true disciples of the other sects were also on guard. Who knew if Wang Yifan would go crazy again?","“Everyone, there’s no need to make a move. If I can kill him once, I can kill him a second time..”"]},{"number":1814,"title":"Chapter 1814: Stepping Into the Cosmos Stage, Chu Yunfan’s Might","paragraphs":["Chapter 1814: Stepping Into the Cosmos Stage, Chu Yunfan’s Might","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Just as everyone was about to attack together, Chu Yunfan spoke up.","Everyone looked at Chu Yunfan and didn’t understand why he said that. Everyone could see that Wang Yifan’s strength had increased greatly after he became a demon, and he had become more difficult to deal with. Now, Chu Yunfan actually wanted to fight one-on-one?","Many people didn’t know if Chu Yunfan was overconfident or if he really had the ability to do so.","‘A duel? Interesting!’ Ye Wuxie looked at Chu Yunfan with a smile in his eyes. If this Chu Yunfan really dared to do this, then it would be interesting. Even he felt that Wang Yifan’s demonic form was very troublesome. Now, it was time to see how good Chu Yunfan was.","Junior Chu, this is not the time to be stubborn. These demons deserve to be killed. There’s no need to be polite with them,” Senior Zhantai said as she frowned as if she didn’t quite agree with Chu Yunfan.","Facing these demons, they had to go all out to kill this demon. This was where righteousness lay. No one dared to say that this was wrong. The true disciple that Wang Yifan had just killed was at a fifth-level Cosmic, but he was instantly killed by Wang Yifan. One could imagine how shocking Wang Yifan’s strength had increased.","“Senior, don’t worry. It’s just a demon. Wang Yifan wasn’t my match before he became a demon, and he’s even less of a match for me now. He’s only a beast that knows how to kill after becoming a demon,” Chu Yunfan said, “How can such a beast be my opponent?”","“Go to hell, Chu Yunfan!”","Wang Yifan’s geng metal sword spat out tens of millions of sword lights, directly covering Chu Yunfan. He still had some rationality and knew that he couldn’t implicate others. If the other true disciples attacked together, not to mention not being able to escape, even his idea of killing Chu Yunfan to avenge himself would be in vain.","The terrifying sword lights were like a tornado, tearing the sky apart and turning into a torrent of sword light that drowned Chu Yunfan. Compared to before, the power of the sword lights spat out by the geng metal sword was now several times stronger.","The power of the sword was closely related to the user. If the user was strong, he could even kill emperors with it. However, if the user was not strong enough, it would be very ordinary. After Wang Yifan went crazy, his strength increased greatly, and the power of the sword also increased several times.","“Eight Astonishing Punches!”","Everyone heard Chu Yunfan’s roar coming from the sword light storm. Then, they saw the eight heavenly dragons appear in the air as if they had been summoned, protecting Chu Yunfan. At the same time, the dragons formed by the fist force kept attacking, crushing the sword light storm into pieces.","“How is this possible?! How can you withstand my attack?!” Wang Yifan roared, his face full of disbelief.","Chu Yunfan was simply too strong. After his strength had increased greatly, his casual attack had great power. He could easily defeat or even kill his former self.","Therefore, he was absolutely confident that he was definitely above Chu Yunfan in terms of strength. He should even be one level stronger than Chu","Yunfan.","The experts of the Flying Celestials were about to arrive. There was not much time left, so he could only take the risk. Who knew that his full-powered attack would be easily blocked by Chu Yunfan?","This made him feel depressed.","“Hmph!” Chu Yunfan snorted. “Do you think you’re the only one with a trump card? Do you think that this is all my strength?”","Chu Yunfan’s divine power boiled. If his divine power was originally maintained at the peak of the Abstract Interpretation Stage, making people think that he was only a peak Interpreter, then now that he released all his divine power, it surpassed the Abstract Interpretation Stage and reached the Cosmos Stage.","After reaching the Cosmos Stage, Chu Yunfan’s aura had increased by at least ten times. Senior Zhantai, Ye Wuxie and the others were all shocked, completely dumbfounded. It was too terrifying!","Chu Yunfan was still hiding his strength. They had thought that Chu Yunfan had done his best just now. Who would have thought that it was just the tip of the iceberg?","Chu Yunfan’s true trump card was that he had already entered the Cosmos Stage. Before this, they had known nothing about it.","“A true disciple... He has stepped into the true disciple level!”","Many elite disciples and inner disciples were completely dumbfounded. If Chu Yunfan’s combat strength was only comparable to a true disciple, then now that he had reached this level, he could be said to be a true disciple. Moreover, he was not a weakling among the true disciples. On the contrary, he was an expert among the true disciples.","Even an expert like Wang Yifan, who had painstakingly cultivated for many years and finally managed to squeeze into the ranks of the true disciples, had been trampled to death by him. If it wasn’t for the Demon Seed, Wang Yifan would have died long ago.","True disciples and those who were not were two completely different levels. True disciples were the higher-ups of the sect. Many elders who did not have power could not compare to the authority of true disciples. They even had to curry favor with the true disciples to survive.","Now, once Chu Yunfan became a true disciple, he would become the focus of the Flying Celestials’ training. His future prospects were limitless. Under such circumstances, many people thought of a possibility. The current Chu Yunfan was already so stunning, so what would happen to the future Chu Yunfan?","“As expected of a monster who has set countless records ever since he entered the Flying Celestials! ”","It was unknown which disciple shouted, but everyone nodded in unison. Clearly, they had the same feeling. They could muster up the courage to compete against geniuses, but what could they do against a terrifying monster? There was no way for them to compete.","Among these people, only Chu Hongcai was happy for Chu Yunfan. Just now, when Wang Yifan went berserk and his strength soared, he was worried to death. However, he knew that people like him were not qualified to participate in a battle of that level and did not dare to get close. Now that Chu Yunfan had revealed a new trump card, he finally felt at ease.","“Brother Fan is still Brother Fan after all. He can create legends wherever he goes!” Chu Hongcai said excitedly.."]},{"number":1815,"title":"Chapter 1815: Too Weak","paragraphs":["Chapter 1815: Too Weak","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan’s aura was soaring, not inferior to Wang Yifan’s. This was Chu Yunfan’s true trump card. He had truly entered the Cosmos Stage. He was at the same level as the other true disciples.","Chu Yunfan was even more terrifying because he was too powerful. He was perhaps the one to enter the Cosmos Stage in the shortest time in history!","“So what if you’re possessed? If I can kill you once, I can kill you a second time.” Chu Yunfan’s expression was cold. He crossed his arms and looked at Wang Yifan coldly.","Chu Yunfan’s gaze deeply pierced Wang Yifan’s heart. To Wang Yifan, this was simply outrageous, and he was instantly furious. The sword in his hand erupted with even greater sword lights.","It was even more terrifying than before. As time passed, his degree of demonic control became deeper and deeper, and his consciousness became weaker and weaker. He was swallowed by the demonic energy.","This was one of the side effects of planting the Demon Seed. If the person was a wise and courageous person, they could use the demonic energy for their own use. However, if their will was not firm enough, they would be swallowed by the demonic energy and become a peerless demon who only knew how to kill.","A long time ago, before the demonic path was born, countless people died under the Demon Seed and turned into demons who only knew how to kill. They could not even find their own consciousness.","In addition, Wang Yifan was certain that the Flying Celestials experts were on their way. Although he was getting stronger, time was not on his side. He had no choice.","With a loud shout, the storm formed by the sword turned into a tornado and swept toward Chu Yunfan. He did not choose to expand his attack range. His remaining rationality told him that he could not do this. Otherwise, even revenge would be a delusion.","Chu Yunfan slapped down with a backhand. It was the Flying Celestial Palm Strike. The strike hit the sword lights, making a series of metal clanging sounds. Chu Yunfan turned the sword lights into harmless golden lights that filled the sky and scattered. It could not pose any threat to him at all.","“Transcendent Flying Celestial!”","At this moment, Wang Yifan used the Transcendent Flying Celestial technqiue. In an instant, he became a demonic immortal between heaven and earth. The demonic energy stagnated and was about to turn into immortal energy. The entire world was swept by his sword and used by him.","This was the supreme sword technique of the Flying Celestials. Only true disciples and above were qualified to cultivate this ultimate technique.","“Is this your only trick? You’re too weak!”","Chu Yunfan roared and threw a punch. His body changed and eight dragons appeared around him. Then, he directly suppressed the demonic immortal. The eight dragons suppressed the demonic immortal who had used the Transcendent Flying Celestial and tore him apart.","“Impossible! How could you endure my strength?!”","Wang Yifan roared and became even angrier. As the demonic aura became deeper and deeper, his body grew a head taller and he looked burly.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan’s fist force didn’t slow down and smashed into Wang Yifan’s body.","Bam!","This punch turned Wang Yifan’s chest into a bloody mess. After becoming a demon, he had gained a demon body. His physical strength had increased by at least a few levels, but when facing Chu Yunfan, he still had no strength to fight back. He finally understood how strong Chu Yunfan’s body had become. It was not as simple as he had thought. It was a truly terrifying existence.","Spurt!","Wang Yifan spat out a mouthful of blood. His eyes flashed with shock. He didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to be so powerful. If Chu Yunfan had used such a method just now, he could have killed him with one punch. There was no need to go around in circles with him.","It was just that Chu Yunfan was too lazy to use his full strength before, because he could deal with him without using his full strength. Chu Yunfan had said that he hadn’t even used ten percent of his power. Now that he thought about it, it was definitely true.","Wang Yifan felt an intense pain in his chest. Fortunately, after becoming a demon, the strength of his body had increased a lot. Otherwise, Chu Yunfan would have punched through his chest and he would have died.","Even demons would die if their chests were pierced and their hearts and internal organs exploded. There was no possibility of survival. No matter how tenacious the vitality of demons was, they were still flesh and blood.","But even so, being hit by this punch still made him face the threat of death again, making him feel that death was approaching crazily once again. “You’re going to kill me? I’ll drag you down with me even if I die!”","Wang Yifan roared. He had a green face and fangs, looking extremely terrifying.","“You’re still alive.” Chu Yunfan was a little stunned.","He had not expected Wang Yifan to survive. It seemed that he was indeed tenacious enough. The vitality of demons was indeed tenacious. He couldn’t be killed with a single punch.","Of course, only Chu Yunfan would think so. The others was frightened by Chu Yunfan’s violent fighting strength. They were completely shocked.","Generally speaking, demons of the same level were stronger than humans of the same level. Other than physique cultivators, ordinary human experts could not compare to demon experts in terms of physical strength. However, Chu Yunfan had seriously injured Wang Yifan, who was at a higher level than him and had turned into a demon.","What kind of astonishing combat strength was this?!","“Ahhhh!” Wang Yifan continued to roar. As he roared, the demonic energy in his body surged even more. It was twice as terrifying as before.","Just like that, under everyone’s watchful eyes, he stepped into the sixth level of the Cosmos Stage.","Everyone’s expressions changed. Wang Yifan’s cultivation had increased by two levels in such a short period. If it was normal cultivation, those with less talent would need at least ten or twenty years to do this. If there were no special fortuitous encounters, they might not be able to make another breakthrough in their entire lives.","And now, Wang Yifan had completed all of this in a short period. No wonder so many people wanted to break through through by going berserk.","At this point, the demonic energy in Wang Yifan became even more shocking.","It devoured his rationality and charged forward.","Boom!","Wang Yifan tore open the sky, and an explosion sounded. At this time, he simply abandoned his sword and pounced like a wild beast.","This was even more terrifying than before. Before, he still retained some rationality and could be considered a human. Now, he was a monster without consciousness.."]},{"number":1816,"title":"Chapter 1816: Wang Yifan Finally Dies","paragraphs":["Chapter 1816: Wang Yifan Finally Dies","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","However, this demon was the most terrifying kind. It could be called a master of the world just by relying on its instinct and the terrifying sixth-level Cosmic cultivation.","Everyone’s expression changed drastically. The true disciples could still resist, but the elite disciples and inner disciples felt infected by the demonic energy and retreated.","“Attack! We can’t let him continue. Otherwise, the consequences will be dire!”","Senior Zhantai erupted. Her mana were extremely dense. Compared to Wang Yifan, who had already become a demon, she was not inferior. Her cultivation was one of the best among the true disciples.","She had also stepped into the sixth level of the Cosmos Stage.","Opposite her, Ye Wuxie’s expression was grave. He had not wanted to get involved. The ten great sects were cooperating on the surface, but in reality, they were constantly fighting in private. Now that such a thing had happened in the Flying Celestials, he just wanted to watch the show.","However, things had already reached this point. Wang Yifan’s obsession had surpassed his previous imagination. He couldn’t sit idly by. Otherwise, when the Imperial Court came looking for him, he wouldn’t be able to escape a scolding. After all, the true disciples present had official duties from the Imperial Court. It was impossible for them to turn a blind eye this time.","Ye Wuxie erupted with dense divine power to resist the demonic energy. It exploded like a sun, making him look like a sun god.","The strength of the two suppressed this demonic energy that filled the sky.","Even Chu Yunfan was slightly surprised. Senior Zhantai, Zhantai Xuan, was very famous among the true disciples. She was the number one female true disciple. In terms of fame, she was even more famous than Yi Yunyao.","Based on Chu Yunfan’s understanding, Yi Yunyao was probably not Zhantai Xuan’s match. Zhantai Xuan was extremely powerful and had probably reached the peak sixth-level Cosmos Stage. She was only half a step away from the seventh level.","Once one entered that level, the person would have stepped into the ranks of the strongest true disciples of the current era. Wang Yifan couldn’t compare to Zhantai Xuan in the slighest. No wonder many people said that Zhantai Xuan was giving Wang Yifan face by attending the tea party. They weren’t on the same level.","Ye Wuxie’s cultivation was not much worse than Zhantai Xuan’s. Both of them were of the same level, and they were only one step away from entering the seventh level of the Cosmos Stage.","It was no wonder that no matter how much Wang Yifan had turned into a demon, the two of them had been sitting on the fishing platform. Compared to the two of them, Wang Yifan was only slightly stronger. He wasn’t enough to pose a threat to the two of them.","It would be easy for them to take him down.","But now that Wang Yifan had gone one step further into becoming a demon and his strength had broken through to the sixth level of the Cosmos Stage, the two naturally couldn’t sit still anymore. They had to end this disaster ahead of time.","However, just as they were about to attack, Chu Yunfan attacked again. Countless divine powers condensed on his body, and a terrifying and violent aura surged out of his body, turning into golden hair that was released from every pore of his body.","In just a short time, Chu Yunfan had transformed into a human hou.","Chu Yunfan’s aura soared to another level after transforming into the hou. He had advanced to the sixth level of the Cosmos Stage.","These four people’s auras had reached the sixth level of the Cosmos Stage. They were like four peerless overlords, suppressing the entire scene. Even the true disciples who were present hastily retreated. They did not dare to approach. They were all true disciples, but it was clear that there was a huge difference in their cultivation levels. Facing these four existences that were like peerless overlords, they simply did not have the courage to be compared to them.","Seeing Chu Yunfan suddenly transform, Ye Wuxie and Zhantai Xuan were stunned. Chu Yunfan had one trump card after another. No matter what trump card Wang Yifan pulled out, when everyone thought that Chu Yunfan was dead, Chu Yunfan turned around and continued to surprise them.","They now understood why Chu Yunfan was so fearless. It was the confidence brought by absolute strength. If it wasn’t for the fact that Wang Yifan had been hit by the Demon Seed, the battle would have ended much earlier.","With Chu Yunfan’s strength, he was qualified to look down on Wang Yifan. The strength that Wang Yifan was so proud of was nothing in front of Chu Yunfan.","No one knew what Chu Yunfan had experienced in such a short time to be so powerful.","“There’s no need for you to interfere in this battle, seniors. If I can kill him one time, I can kill him a second time,” Chu Yunfan said coldly. Some people thought that this was his limit, but it was far from his limit.","Earlier had only be the strongest state of his conventional combat strength. They had not taken into account unconventional methods. If anyone thought that his previous attack could be used to evaluate his strength, they would be gravely mistaken.","Boom!","Wang Yifan’s huge demonic body then pounced over. He was on par with Chu","Yunfan, who had transformed into a human hou. He wanted to claw Chu Yunfan to death, but at this time, he discovered that there was a huge cauldron spinning above Chu Yunfan’s head. The light shadow formed by this cauldron protected Chu Yunfan.","Wang Yifan’s sudden attack wasn’t couldn’t break through the cauldron!","“Since you’ve made your move, it’s my turn.!”","Chu Yunfan shouted and threw a backhand attack. His fist was like a meteor, and the fist force turned into eight dragons that suppressed Wang Yifan.","Spurt!","Wang Yifan spat out a mouthful of blood. Even though he was possessed, he was no match for Chu Yunfan, who had transformed into a hou. He was sent flying with a punch and spat out a mouthful of blood. Immediately after, Chu Yunfan chased after Wang Yifan with a backhand and smashed the cauldron on Wang Yifan.","Wang Yifan fell to the ground, screaming as his powerful body trembled.","Chu Yunfan didn’t show any mercy and stomped on Wang Yifan ruthlessly.","Bam!","Chu Yunfan stomped on Wang Yifan and shattered him into pieces. Wang Yifam wanted to reform his body, but Chu Yunfan’s sword came down and shattered his head.","A deadly silence fell over the scene. Everyone was dumbfounded. Wang Yifan had died just like that.."]},{"number":1817,"title":"Chapter 1817 Wang Yifan’s Master","paragraphs":["1817 Wang Yifan’s Master","From the start to the end, Chu Yunfan had crushed Wang Yifan. Even after Wang Yifan became a demon and his strength increased dramatically, he was still no match for Chu Yunfan. He was crushed in minutes.","After his head was cut off, even though Wang Yifan’s demonic body was very tenacious, it was useless. If his head was gone, he was dead. The demonic energy that was gushing out of his body dissipated and no longer condensed.","The demon seed in his body also disappeared without a trace. The seed could save him once, but it could not save him a second time. Even if he was resurrected again, Chu Yunfan was absolutely confident that he could kill him. Compared to the previous situation, there had been a fundamental change.","Chu Yunfan returned to his human form. His breathing became a little hurried. Transforming into a hou was a huge burden for him. However, compared to the past, this burden was much smaller because his strength could not be mentioned in the same breath as before.","In just a moment, he recovered to his original state. Chu Yunfan now possessed two top-notch physiques—the Imperial Physique and the Thunderclap Physique. At the same time, he also had the bloodline of two super-ancient ferocious beasts, the bloodline of the hou and the bloodline of the Immemorial Dark Phoenix. When these effects were applied to Chu Yunfan’s body, it was truly terrifying.","Even if it was an expert whose cultivation level was far higher than his, it would only take a short period for him to transform into a hou. It would be enough to make him pant and consume a lot of energy, let alone imagine Chu Yunfan’s transformation. It could be said that he had only consumed a little energy.","This was very shocking.","Zhan Taixuan and Ye Wuxie noticed this. In their eyes, Chu Yunfan was no longer a junior. On the contrary, he could be on equal footing with them. Although his current level had not reached their level, his combat strength was not inferior to theirs. He was a true expert among the experts.","Although cultivation level was important, in the end, combat strength determined everything. Chu Yunfan’s powerful combat strength allowed him to fight for the qualifications to be on equal footing with these top geniuses.","Zhan Taixuan was moved. Seeing Chu Yunfan use all kinds of trump cards, and knowing that this new junior brother had only spent less than one-tenth of her cultivation time but was already on par with her, even someone as arrogant as she had to admire him. As experts, they could appreciate each other. Between the strong and the weak, it was impossible to not understand this common language.","“Thank you for protecting me earlier.” Chu Yunfan cupped his hands.","Although he didn’t need it, the two of them did want to help him. Chu Yunfan accepted this favor. He also needed to integrate into the circle of these geniuses.","“Junior Chu, you don’t have to be so polite. Before the two of us could attack, Wang Yifan died. This b*stard joined the demons. His death isn’t worth regretting,” Zhan Taixuan said with a smile.","As she spoke, she looked at Wang Yifan’s corpse with disgust. She had fought with the demons before and had seen them wreak havoc. Therefore, she hated them from the bottom of her heart.","“Not bad. There’s finally someone in the Flying Celestials that I like. Hua Xianyuan is too young and weak, so he’s not interesting. The rest are just people like Wang Yifan. Now, there’s finally someone that I like.” Ye Wuxie grinned, his expression wild and arrogant as if he had no regard for the other Flying Celestial true disciples.","Although everyone was not happy, they did not show any surprise. It was clear that they had heard Ye Wuxie’s words more than once or twice and naturally did not feel anything.","But toward Ye Wuxie’s strength, they were all in awe. Among their peers, it was hard to find a match for him. Even Zhantai Xuan, who was known as the number one female true disciple of the Flying Celestials, could not gain any advantage. Even though the Flying Celestials were dissatisfied with the powerful people, they still knew the severity of the situation.","Chu Yunfan glanced at Ye Wuxie and found that this person was very interesting. However, there was something about Ye Wuxie that he could not see through. There were deep secrets about him that no one knew.","After this brief exchange between the three of them, an incomparably powerful aura crushed over with the pressure of Mount Tai. Everyone saw a huge hand from the sky falling from the sky and grabbing Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan didn’t expect this to happen, but fortunately, he hadn’t relaxed after killing Wang Yifan. In the blink of an eye, he had launched his defenses. Above his head, the Mountain River Cauldron protected him.","An incomparably loud boom, like the sound of metal clashing, rang out. The huge hand landed on the cauldron, and a series of clashing sounds erupted.","He instinctively took a few steps back. He felt the muscles all over his body tearing apart crazily, and he spat out a mouthful of blood.","“Who is it?!” Chu Yunfan shouted.","“You killed my disciple!”","A loud shout sounded in the sky. Everyone’s expressions changed because they knew the identity of the person from this sentence. It was Wang Yifan’s master, one of the Flying Celestials’ grand elders, Jiang Wan’an.","When many people thought of this person, they felt a chill run down their back. This was a true big shot. In the Flying Celestials, the elders were divided into many levels. The highest level was naturally the supreme elders, followed by the ordinary supreme elders, then the core elders, and finally the fringe elders. The few elders who had attacked Chu Yunfan earlier were the lowest level of elders, but even so, they were all Cosmics.","Jiang Wan’an was different. He was a grand elder. Although he was only an ordinary grand elder, his cultivation had truly surpassed the Cosmos Stage and reached another level."]},{"number":1818,"title":"Chapter 1818 Old Man, Sooner or Later, You Will Die by My Hands","paragraphs":["1818 Old Man, Sooner or Later, You Will Die by My Hands","If the true disciples and elders were the backbone of the Flying Celestials, then the grand elders were the true high-end power of the Flying Celestials. Each of them had supreme prestige and could be said to be illustrious.","Many people recalled that Jiang Wan’an was not a good-tempered person. On the contrary, he was very powerful and had a violent temper. He did not care about ordinary people’s lives. And Chu Yunfan had killed his favorite disciple. One could imagine how furious Jiang Wan’an was.","The truth was similar to what many people thought. Jiang Wan’an arrived and immediately targeted Chu Yunfan, not giving Chu Yunfan any chance to explain.","Chu Yunfan’s gaze pierced through the void and saw an old man in white glaring at him. Unlike ordinary old men, this old man was tall and had the bearing of a dragon and tiger. Just by standing there alone, he seemed to have the power to shake the world.","In the past, he had a supreme reputation. Later on, when he grew old, he entered a state of seclusion cultivation. However, that did not mean that his strength was weak. In fact, he was still an incomparably terrifying figure.","Chu Yunfan could feel that this old man was a huge threat to him. The identity of this old man was not unfamiliar to him. Although he had no regard for Wang Yifan, of course, he investigated Wang Yifan.","He had investigated Wnag Yifan thoroughly, and he had a lot of information on Wang Yifan. No matter which file it was, there was a prominent mention of his master, Jiang Wan’an.","To Chu Yunfan, Wang Yifan wasn’t the real danger. Wang Yifan was no match for Chu Yunfan. The real problem was his master, Jiang Wan’an.","Jiang Wan’an appeared almost as soon as Chu Yunfan killed Wang Yifan.","“You want to kill me?” Chu Yunfan said coldly. He didn’t show any fear when facing such a grand elder.","“That’s right. You killed my disciple. I want you to pay with your life!” Jiang Wan’an grinned ferociously.","He was no different from Wang Yifan. He didn’t care about Chu Yunfan’s life at all. He had also heard about this one-year agreement, but he didn’t take it to heart.","Wang Yifan was a disciple that he had personally taught. Wang Yifan had been his trusted aide. He was very confident in Wang Yifan’s strength. And a new disciple wanted to challenge Wang Yifan? Wasn’t that courting death?","Even if those veteran elite disciples were to challenge Wang Yifan, they would still be defeated. He originally thought that Chu Yunfan was just using words to hold Wang Yifan back and buy himself some time. He didn’t have the slightest interest in caring about it.","Who would have thought that Wang Yifan would fall into such a situation? He fell too miserably and lost his life.","Just now, he hadn’t been able to kill Chu Yunfan with a single strike, which made him feel extremely frustrated. At the very least, Chu Yunfan wasn’t like what he had thought. He didn’t know what kind of method or magic artifact Chu Yunfan had used to kill Wang Yifan. It seemed that he indeed had his own strength.","But so what? If he wanted to kill someone, did he have to consider so many things?","“This is a life-and-death agreement between Wang Yifan and me. The entire sect is my witness. Once on the stage, life and death do not matter. These are the rules of the Flying Celestials. But now, you want to kill me openly. Do you really think that you can act lawlessly?” Chu Yunfan shouted, not afraid of Jiang Wan’an in the slightest.","“Don’t give me such a big reason. I will kill you!”","How could Jiang Wan’an not know that he was not in the right? However, it did not matter to him whether he was in the right or not. He had absolute strength, and that was enough. He would be criticized and blamed by some people later, but as long as Chu Yunfan was killed, who would speak up for a dead person?","“You don’t care what happened, and you don’t care that Wang Yifan has become a demon. You came to avenge your disciple.” Chu Yunfan sneered. He wasn’t surprised by Jiang Wan’an’s reaction. It was within his expectations.","“Hahahaha. What a sharp-tongued kid. I don’t care if Wang Yifan was possessed or not. I only know that you killed him. I want to avenge him. It’s only right to pay with your life.”","Jiang Wan’an was so angry that he laughed. He didn’t try to reason with Chu Yunfan because he knew that he was not in the right. He sensed that there were many powerful auras on the way. He did not have much time left.","‘One strike. I have to kill him now. Otherwise, I won’t get the chance!’","Jiang Wan’an’s eyes flickered with a terrifying light. He naturally understood that there was not much time and opportunity left for him. He had to kill Chu Yunfan in one strike.","At the thought of this, Jiang Wan’an gathered all the divine power in his body and turned it into a terrifying storm. At the same time, he grabbed at the sku, and a long sword appeared. This sword was completely black, although it was inferior to the geng metal sword.","However, Jiang Wan’an was more than ten times stronger than Wang Yifan. Such vigorous strength allowed him to attack in an instant. The black sword light in his hand was like a long black dragon. It instantly swept across the sky toward Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan’s expression was extremely grave. Jiang Wan’an’s attack did not give him any way out. Even a sixth or seventh-level Cosmic would die if they were to encounter such an attack. They might even be cut in half.","“Do you think only you have a trump card? Watch me!” Chu Yunfan let out a long roar, and the divine power in his body became solemn. A Sword Light Talisman appeared in his hand, and a shocking sword light was brewing within the talisman."]},{"number":1819,"title":"Chapter 1819 The Flying Celestial’s Sect Leader","paragraphs":["1819 The Flying Celestial’s Sect Leader","Countless spirit energy gathered over, turning into terrifying sword light fluctuations that swept out crazily. This was Chu Yunfan’s trump card, the Sword Light Talisman!","Every time, it was a matter of life and death for Chu Yunfan. Although he could only use it three times and it would be a pity to use it early, he did not regret it at all.","And now, Chu Yunfan was determined to use it one last time.","All of this took a long time to describe, but in fact, it happened in the blink of an eye. The sword light in Chu Yunfan’s hand surged and soared through the sky. Even Jiang Wan’an, who was originally full of confidence, felt a wave of fear.","“Sh*t!” Jiang Wan’an immediately knew that things were not good. He trusted his senses. This sword light that was condensing felt like a real threat.","However, it was too late. His sword light had already attacked and was about to touch Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan made his move. He opened his arms and grabbed the end of the sword energy, then slashed it down at Jiang Wan’an.","Swish!","Jiang Wan’an’s sword light was instantly washed away by this sword light, and it dissipated. Then, the sword immediately slashed down at Jiang Wan’an’s head.","Chu Yunfan’s eyes were calm, but there was a hint of madness in them. ‘Who the f*ck cares that you’re a grand elder? If you want to kill me, you have to check yourself!’","Even the world’s number one expert would not be able to make Chu Yunfan surrender without a fight.","Jiang Wan’an was stunned. He had never expected Chu Yunfan to dare to attack a grand elder like him. Even an ordinary true disciple would have their legs go weak when facing him and would not dare to attack. However, Chu Yunfan clearly didn’t play by the rules.","Swish!","The sword light swept down. It was originally going to split Jiang Wan’an in half from head to toe, but at that critical moment, it deviated slightly. However, his entire arm and shoulder were cut open by this earth-shattering sword light.","The sword light swept across and disappeared into the universe.","“Ah!” Jiang Wan’an screamed.","He didn’t expect that he would be injured by Chu Yunfan’s hands. At this moment, he could see that Chu Yunfan really dared to kill him. Killing a grand elder was a huge sin. Many people didn’t even dare to think about it, but Chu Yunfan did it without hesitation.","Jiang Wan’an’s eyes were red, and he covered his wound with one hand. He breathed laboriously. The wound that was slashed by the sword light was densely covered with sword light, which was constantly corroding his muscles and preventing his wound from healing.","“I’m going to kill you!” Jiang Wan’an gritted his teeth as he stared at Chu Yunfan.","All of this took a long time to describe, but in fact, it had only happened in a short time. Ye Wuxie and Zhan Taixuan, who were standing at the side, finally reacted.","“He actually has another trump card!”","‘What sword light is that?!’ Zhan Taixuan was also a little stunned as she watched the terrifying sword light disappear into the horizon.","She could feel that if that sword light landed on her body, she would definitely die. It was impossible for her to escape it. However, when she saw the Sword Light Talisman in Chu Yunfan’s hand that had already dissipated, she understood that this was probably a one-time use item. It would spent after use.","But even so, this was still very shocking.","Jiang Wan’an, who had been seriously injured, stood up and was about to attack again. Although he had lost one arm and was seriously injured, his strength was still above Chu Yunfan’s.","Chu Yunfan’s face revealed a somewhat regretful expression, but he did not have the slightest regret or fear. On the contrary, hair grew out of every pore of his body and covered his entire body. He once again transformed into a human hou.","Above his head, the Mountain River Cauldron spun, protecting him. In his hand, he held the spoils of war he had obtained from Wang Yifan, the geng metal sword.","Both offensive and defensive!","Chu Yunfan clearly had no intention of backing down. He raised his mana to the peak, ready to burn his life force to fight Jiang Wan’an. It was impossible for Jiang Wan’an to make Chu Yunfan surrender.","He had not used his full strength yet. If he burned his life force and burned enough of it, there was indeed a secret technique that could increase his strength again. He could even kill Jiang Wan’an.","Both sides were at daggers drawn, and it seemed that they were about to attack. Just then, a terrifying aura swept down from the sky.","“Stop!”","A loud shout was heard, and a figure swept down. Everyone saw that the terrifying divine power fluctuation on Jiang Wan’an’s body was suppressed. Chu Yunfan, who had transformed into a hou, also returned to his human form. He was suppressed by the person who had arrived.","At that moment, everyone saw who it was. It was a square-faced middle-aged man wearing a moon-white robe embroidered with ancient and profound array patterns. He carried an unimaginable might.","This middle-aged man had a handsome face. When he was young, he must have been a handsome man who was popular throughout the world.","“It’s the sect leader!”","Everyone immediately recognized the identity of the person who had just arrived. It was the sect leader of the Flying Celestials, Situ Xuan.","Many people blinked their eyes in disbelief. Only then did they realize that this person was indeed the sect leader of the Flying Celestials, Situ Xuan. This legendary figure was the number one expert of the Flying Celestials. He was one of the strongest experts in the world.","At this moment, everyone was relieved. No wonder this person could disintegrate the two people who were raising their divine power and aura with just his aura.","He suppressed the two of them with his strength.","Forget about Chu Yunfan, Jiang Wan’an was the grand elder—a top expert of the Flying Celestials.","“What do you two think you’re doing?” Situ Xuan looked at the two of them coldly and snorted."]},{"number":1820,"title":"Chapter 1820 Those Who Humiliate the Flying Celestials Deserve to Die","paragraphs":["1820 Those Who Humiliate the Flying Celestials Deserve to Die","Situ Xuan’s words made everyone freeze. This included the powerful figures that descended from afar. These figures were cloaked and did not appear. They either sensed the existence of the demonic energy or received the news and rushed over.","The impact would be unimaginable!","If they let the disciple who had gone berserk escape, the Flying Celestials would be reduced to a laughingstock, and their faces would be stomped into the ground. But now, the sect leader, who had not appeared in a long time, had appeared!","Sect Leader Situ Xuan has a high position in the sect. He spent half of his time in the imperial capital to deal with various matters, and the rest of his time was spent in seclusion. All matters in the sect were usually handled by the deputy sect leader and the elders. Not to mention the many elders and true disciples, even the supreme elders did not see Situ Xuan often.","Now, he had appeared!","Even Jiang Wan’an was shocked. He was usually arrogant and unscrupulous because Situ Xuan was not around. After he killed Chu Yunfan, even if Situ Xuan came to find him, he would not really be too ruthless because Chu Yunfan was just an elite disciple.","The difference in weight between an elite disciple and a grand elder was known by everyone. There was no doubt about it. However, Jiang Wan’an was caught red-handed. Although he was furious, he knew the severity of the situation. In front of the sect leader, he did not dare to be impudent.","“Greetings, Sect Leader!”","Everyone greeted in unison and bowed.","Situ Xuan glanced at Chu Yunfan and then looked at Jiang Wan’an. “Elder Jiang, you’re a grand elder. Why are you fighting with a disciple?”","Situ Xuan looked displeased. He didn’t know what happened and immediately encountered such a ridiculous situation the moment he returned to the sect. A grand elder was personally chasing after a disciple? This was a bad look.","“Sect Leader, this little b*stard killed my personal disciple. How can I not take revenge?” Jiang Wan’an’s eyes were red and his voice was hoarse. He had many disciples, but the only one who had truly become a talent was Wang Yifan. He had high hopes for Wang Yifan, but who knew that he would die at Chu Yunfan’s hands?","Situ Xuan looked toward Chu Yunfan, who calmly said, “Sect Leader, I have a one-year agreement with Wang Yifan. It was to be a battle to the death. Life and death do not matter. This is allowed by the sect’s rules. On top of that, Wang Yifan was a spy sent by the demons to our sect. That’s why I killed him.”","Chu Yunfan did not panic. All the divine power in his body retreated. It was not that he did not want to use his divine power, but under Situ Xuan’s pressure, he could not use any divine power. It was as if it was compressed into the depths of his soul.","He was secretly shocked. Situ Xuan’s strength far exceeded his initial expectations. Theoretically speaking, a grand elder and the sect leader were only one level apart, but Jiang Wan’an’s strength was like heaven and earth compared to Situ Xuan’s. They were not on the same level at all.","Chu Yunfan could fight back against Jiang Wan’an and even severely injure him, but against Situ Xuan, he could not even resist. Situ Xuan’s strength was at least an entire level higher than Jiang Wan’an’s. They were not on the same level at all.","This was one of the strongest people in the world—a top-notch figure whose name shook the world. With just a thought, Situ Xuan was able to suppress the two people who were about to erupt at any moment.","“This is slander! Yifan isn’t a spy of the demons!” When Jiang Wan’an heard Chu Yunfan’s words, he was instantly furious. He had watched Wang Yifan grow up and had high hopes for him. Others might not know if Wang Yifan was a spy for the demon, but how could he not know?","“Sir, this little b*stard is cunning! We can’t trust him!” Jiang Wan’an roared.","Situ Xuan frowned and looked at Chu Yunfan. “You say that Wang Yifan is a demon spy, but do you have evidence?”","Situ Xuan’s eyebrows shot up. Just the fact that a true disciple was killed and the grand elder was chasing after a disciple was already very shameful. Now, it even involved a true disciple becoming a demon. It was simply a big joke. If others knew about this, the Flying Celestials would be shamed to no end. Moreover, this had happened in front of everyone. It was simply a slap in the face in public!","This was different from the information he had received. He had received news that Wang Yifan had been killed and had rushed over as quickly as he could. He had no idea that Wang Yifan had gone berserk. However, the corpse was indeed the corpse of a demon, and Wang Yifan’s face could be identified. It really was his disciple.","Jiang Wan’an was at a loss. Was Wang Yifan really a demon spy? But that was impossible. With his cultivation, if Wang Yifan was really a demon spy, Wang Yifan wouldn’t be able to hide it from him. Therefore, there was only one conclusion, and that was that this was Chu Yunfan’s trick. Although he didn’t know how Chu Yunfan did it, in his opinion, it definitely had something to do with Chu Yunfan.","Thinking of this, his eyes turned red. Wang Yifan was dead, but he was still being dragged through the mud. Moreover, even if Wang Yifan was possessed, no one else had the right to tell him what to do.","“Sir, the corpse is over there. You may go ahead and check it at any time,” Chu Yunfan said.","He had a clear conscience in this matter, so he was naturally not afraid of others seeking the truth. He didn’t know where Wang Yifan had got the demon seed, and after becoming a demon, Wang Yifan couldn’t explain himself. He had died for nothing.","Situ Xuan glanced at the corpse on the ground and said, “Why would we continue to make fools of ourselves? I don’t care why Wang Yifan planted the demon seed, but since he did, he’s an enemy of my clan. If Chu Yunfan hadn’t killed him, I would have. He ruined the reputation of my sect. He deserved to die.”","Situ Xuan’s words concluded this matter."]},{"number":1821,"title":"Chapter 1821 Promotion to True Disciple","paragraphs":["1821 Promotion to True Disciple","Hearing Situ Xuan’s words, even though Jiang Wan’an was furious, he didn’t dare to do anything.","“You’re a grand elder, yet you’re chasing after a disciple without regard for your status or your dignity, Elder Jiang. This is an absolute disgrace!” Situ Xuan continued to berate, “Regardless of whether Wang Yifan is a demon or a demon spy, what you’re doing is inappropriate. Go and reflect on your mistakes. You’re not allowed to come out of seclusion for three years.”","“Yes, sir,” Jiang Wan’an said through gritted teeth.","Although he was extremely dissatisfied, he did not dare to disobey Situ Xuan’s words. Even though he was a grand elder, he was still far from being comparable to the sect leader who had all the power. Even if he was not satisfied, he could only acquiesce.","“As for you, you offended your superiors by killing a few elders and attacking a grand elder. You shouldn’t have done that. However, considering that you were trying to protect yourself, you’ll only be grounded for six months,” Situ Xuan said, “Will you accept this punishment?”","“I’m willing, sir,” Chu Yunfan answered.","He knew that although it seemed like Situ Xuan was going to give each of them fifty strokes, this was the best result he could get. After all, a true disciple had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands, and he had also injured a grand elder. If Situ Xuan did not show any reaction, the Flying Celestials would be in chaos in the future.","With Situ Xuan’s verdict, the incident of a Flying Celestials’ true disciple becoming a demon came to an end. However, the aftermath had only just begun to ferment and did not dissipate with the passage of time. On the contrary, this matter continued to grow and spread.","The whole thing was full of drama, completely beyond the imagination of ordinary people. Just Chu Yunfan, an elite disciple, challenging Wang Yifan, a true disciple, was already a huge matter, not to mention that Chu Yunfan had actually succeeded. Killing Wang Yifan in front of everyone was a miracle.","Since ancient times, Chu Yunfan was the only one who had challenged and killed a true disciple as an elite disciple. There was no doubt about the difference between elite disciples and true disciples. Everyone knew how big it was. Even if an elite disciple was lucky enough to enter the Cosmos Stage and be on equal footing with a true disciple, it was almost impossible to defeat a veteran true disciple, let alone kill them.","After that, Wang Yifan became a demon and his battle strength soared, shocking all the upper echelons of the Flying Celestials. They thought that Chu Yunfan would die at Wang Yifan’s hands before the upper echelons of the Flying Celestials could arrive.","In the end, Chu Yunfan used his trump card and his battle strength soared. Even after Wang Yifan became a demon, he was still killed by Chu Yunfan with a few punches and kicks. All this was already strange enough, but after that, it attracted the pursuit of Wang Yifan’s master, Jiang Wan’an. Not only was Chu Yunfan fine, but he also severely injured Jiang Wan’an.","According to the description from the people at the scene, if Jiang Wan’an had not dodged at the last moment, the consequences would have been unimaginable. He would have almost certainly died under Chu Yunfan’s attack.","The whole thing sounded bizarre and complicated, and many people were curious about Chu Yunfan. Was this elite disciple whom they had never heard of before actually so amazing? What was his background?","If Chu Yunfan had only let a few people know of his existence before, or if most people had ignored him even after hearing his name, then no one dared to ignore his existence now. He had entered the Flying Celestials for only a few years, yet he already possessed such strength. His future was simply limitless. It could be said that no one had heard of him for ten years, but he became famous in one day.","Overnight, Chu Yunfan became the topic of countless people’s discussion. This wave began to spread outside the sect with the passage of time. Especially after Ye Wuxie and the others left the Flying Celestials, Chu Yunfan’s name began to attract more attention.","However, just as everyone was enthusiastically discussing this matter, the higher-ups ‘decision was made. Everyone’s jaws dropped. The handling of Chu Yunfan and Wang Yifan’s life-and-death battle was like giving each of them fifty strokes of the cane. However, the series of rewards that followed surprised many people.","Chu Yunfan, who had killed several elders and a true disciple in a row and also severely injured a grand elder, was promoted to true disciple. The Startling Cloud Peak that belonged to Wang Yifan was also given to him. On top of that, to reward him for killing the demonized Wang Yifan and for his great contribution to the Imperial Court, Chu Yunfan was promoted to second-grade general. He was specially rewarded with two million middle-grade spirit stones and an Evolution Pill. The geng metal sword that originally belonged to Wang Yifan was also given to Chu Yunfan.","For a time, this caused a huge uproar. The punishment from this matter was so light that it could not be counted. However, the reward was extremely generous. The two million middle-grade spirit stones were secondary. The Evolution Pill was an extremely precious pill even for true disciples.","To make an Evolution Pill, many of the ingredients needed were extremely precious. Unless it was a colossus like the Flying Celestials or Grand Xia, it would be extremely difficult for ordinary people to gather all the necessary ingredients.","With these rewards, everyone understood one thing. Chu Yunfan had without a doubt become a favorite of the Flying Celestials’ higher-ups. At the very least, he became someone that a portion of the Flying Celestials’ higher-ups liked. It meant that there were a considerable number of higher-ups standing behind him.","No matter what, the Flying Celestials couldn’t really punish Chu Yunfan, who had a bright future, because of Wang Yifan who was thoroughly investigated and concluded to be a demon spy. There were many true disciples in the Flying Celestials, but only a few of them were truly worthy of great responsibilities and had a limitless future. They were even treated as the future of the sect and were nurtured with all their might.","Although there were only a few of them, these few people in each generation often became the core pillars of the Flying Celestials. Everyone only knew of Hua Xianyuan before, and now they knew Chu Yunfan’s name too."]},{"number":1822,"title":"Chapter 1822 Famous for a Time","paragraphs":["1822 Famous for a Time","No one could say anything wrong with this advancement. After all, Chu Yunfan had already stepped into the Cosmos Stage. He was qualified to become a true disciple.","In other words, Chu Yunfan became a big shot among the true disciples as soon as he joined their circle. He was qualified to establish another mountain and recruit followers.","Even Zhan Taixuan, who was known as the number one female true disciple of the Flying Celestials, had publicly stated that she was confident in Chu Yunfan. This was enough to make many people think about Chu Yunfan’s true strength. Without a doubt, as long as he didn’t die prematurely, it was only a matter of time before he became one of the best among the true disciples. He might even become a big shot among the big shots of the Flying Celestials in the future.","Other than Wang Yifan, who had turned into a demon, the unlucky elders of the Flying Celestials that were killed were no longer cared about. No one mentioned them. It was as if they had never existed. After all, they were just a few fringe elders.","The status of a true disciple was equal to that of a fringe elder of the Flying Celestials. In fact, a true disciple’s status was higher. Chu Yunfan, who was recognized as the core of the Flying Celestials’ younger generation, had an even more extraordinary status.","According to past management, the Flying Celestials’ higher-ups valued Chu Yunfan no less than a grand elder. In this aspect, the treatment afforded to him was almost the same as Hua Xianyuan’s.","After all, Hua Xianyuan had yet to step into the Cosmos Stage and become a true disciple. However, Chu Yunfan had truly stepped into the Cosmos Stage and become a true disciple. One only had potential in the future, but Chu Yunfan’s potential had already transformed into a part of his true strength.","Naturally, no one raised any objections to Chu Yunfan’s promotion. Even Chu Yunfan’s greatest enemy, Jiang Wan’an, was in a state of confinement and reflection. He could not speak out.","At the same time, Chu Yunfan’s powerful rise gave many people an opportunity. As the lid of this matter was blown open, many things about him in Baotai began to be understood. Before this, almost no one was willing to understand him. He was just an elite disciple, a commander of a small city garrison. What was there to pay attention to?","But now, Chu Yunfan had become a true disciple, and he had become an External General within the Imperial Court. Many true disciples who had served the Imperial Court for many years had not been promoted to a second-grade position.","It would be fine if Chu Yunfan was the only one who had improved. However, You Chuyun and the others who had left the Flying Celestials with Chu Yunfan had all also become much stronger. On top of that, they had all been promoted. Their improvement speed was many times faster than when they were unknown in the Flying Celestials.","This made many people’s eyes turn green with jealousy. After all, no one did not want to improve their strength, and no one did not want to be promoted and make a fortune. What did You Chuyun and the others have? They had relied on the fact that they had known Chu Yunfan for a long time and had joined him for a long time.","At first, they were just a group of inner disciples. Now, they had all become elite disciples. This made the other elite disciples very envious. With Chu Yunfan’s current fame, many elite disciples who were originally high and mighty came crawling to Startling Cloud Peak, wanting to see Chu Yunfan and hoping he’d take them in as his followers.","As the saying goes, rich people had distant relatives in the mountains, but poor people in the downtown area have no one to ask about them.","Before this, Chu Yunfan had been a potato in the eyes of countless people, but many people were afraid of Wang Yifan and did not dare to join Chu Yunfan. Now that they wanted to join him, it was not so easy. The screening threshold to becoming a follower was now very high. It was impossible for ordinary inner disciples to become Chu Yunfan’s followers like You Chuyun and the others had. Only those who were outstanding among the inner disciples and had extremely high talent were accepted.","This made many inner disciples beat their chests in frustration. There had been a great opportunity in front of them, but they didn’t cherish it. Now that they had lost it, it was too late for regret.","As for the elite disciples, it was the same. The ordinary elite disciples who wanted to become Chu Yunfan’s followers were not qualified. As Chu Yunfan was under house arrest, he did not show up to the recruitment, After You Chuyun received Chu Yunfan’s instructions, he returned to the Flying Celestials from Baotai to deal with the matter.","Those who were not determined, those who had ulterior motives, and those who just wanted to fish in troubled waters were all eliminated. Only those who sincerely wanted to become Chu Yunfan’s followers were accepted into and received Chu Yunfan’s guidance.","You Chuyun followed Chu Yunfan’s point of view—quality was more important than quantity. A true follower had to be useful during critical moments. Otherwise, no matter how many people there were, they would scatter when needed. What was the use of having them around?","After ten days of screening, 50 elite disciples and 100 inner disciples were selected to become Chu Yunfan’s followers. In addition to the fringe disciples who were doing odd jobs, the originally cold and quiet Startling Cloud Peak due to Wang Yifan’s death become lively again.","In just three days, everyone felt that they had gained a lot. Since there were not many people, Chu Yunfan could give one-on-one targeted guidance. His cultivation level was higher than these people’s, and his understanding of the great dao far exceeded their imagination. He was from a strategic position and could easily discover their problems and propose solutions.","When this news spread, everyone was in an uproar. Countless people pounded their feet and stomped their chests. It was a huge loss not to be chosen as Chu Yunfan’s follower."]},{"number":1823,"title":"Chapter 1823 Taking Over Startling Cloud Peak and Going Into Seclusion","paragraphs":["1823 Taking Over Startling Cloud Peak and Going Into Seclusion","After all, cultivation was not easy, and it was often not easy to improve. The higher one’s cultivation was, the more difficult it was for one to break through. Though many people achieved success in their cultivation, their cultivation experience was often only applicable to themselves and was difficult to teach to others.","This was a rare opportunity.","If Chu Yunfan had given these people pointers, but they had gained nothing in the end, then many people would have laughed at him for overestimating himself. Hosting a lecture on Dao was not something that everyone had the qualifications to do. If one’s own understanding of martial arts was not enough and they still hosted a lecture, then one would only become a laughing stock.","However, not only did Chu Yunfan host a lecture, but he also achieved remarkable results. One-third of his followers broke through, and the rest at least gained something. Even a powerful supreme elder could not do such a thing.","This made many people very curious. Although the things that Chu Yunfan talked about did not exceed the Cosmos Stage and were basically at the level of inner and elite disciples, the theoretical knowledge was too solid. Whether it was martial arts, divine arts, punch techniques, or kicking techniques, there was almost nothing that Chu Yunfan did not know. Moreover, his guidance was always on point. It was as if Chu Yunfan had a deep understanding of every aspect. There was nothing he didn’t know.","It was through this lecture that Chu Yunfan completely convinced these arrogant disciples. If they were originally here because of the benefits—because Chu Yunfan could bring them benefits that ordinary true disciples could not provide—they were now completely convinced by him.","This was the so-called like-minded.","After the lecture, Chu Yunfan sent them away. With You Chuyun as the leader, he led them to Baotai and began to establish the external army. This was Chu Yunfan’s army, and the Imperial Court had attached great importance to it. They preferred the second-line army like the Baotai garrison to be filled with new recruits, and these recruits were among the best of the best.","This was what the generals of the various armies liked most because many people were afraid that there would be many veterans in their armies. These recruits who had not been led astray were the favorite soldiers of the various generals, not to mention the outstanding ones among the recruits.","It was clear that Grand Xia had high hopes for Chu Yunfan. With You Chuyun and the other disciples of the Flying Celestials as the backbone, even if Chu Yun was not around, he could still build the army. The army wouldn’t be dragged down by Chu Yunfan’s absence.","At the same time, Chu Yunfan received the rewards from the Flying Celestials. Two million middle-grade spirit stones solved Chu Yunfan’s urgent need. He needed middle-grade spirit stones to be used in too many places.","Whether it was the maintenance of the mountain or the growth of the Brahma Tree, they could not be separated from the watering of middle-grade spirit stones. His own cultivation also required a large amount of spirit energy.","The geng metal sword greatly increased Chu Yunfan’s attack. The Divinity Slicer sword he had previously also gotten from Wang Yifan was too weak compared to the geng metal sword. The Divinity Slicer was actually cut in half. The geng metal sword was incomparably sharp. At this moment, it finally showed its incisiveness.","To Chu Yunfan, the most important thing now was naturally the Evolution Pill. It was the most precious thing. With this pill, he no longer needed to wait for the Brahma Fruit to ripen. He could make a breakthrough in his cultivation and undergo an earth-shattering change.","Although he was grounded as a punishment and was in seclusion to reflect on his mistakes, it wasn’t a real imprisonment. Therefore, his environment was very good. It was originally the Startling Cloud Peak that Wang Yifan had run for many years. Now, Chu Yunfan had been allowed to take over.","After some repairs, he could make use of it. After taking over Startling Cloud Peak, Chu Yunfan realized that the immortal peaks where these true disciples lived were not just simple residences.","These immortal peaks were often densely packed with all kinds of barriers. They were like fortresses. Not only did they have defensive barriers and arrays, but they also had offensive barriers and arrays. The full firepower of such immortal peaks was not inferior to the power of thousands of elite troops of Grand Xia.","There were countless immortal peaks like this in the Flying Celestials. One could imagine how shocking the Flying Celestials’ foundation was. Once it was completely unleashed, it would probably be earth-shattering.","Even so, the Flying Celestials were at the bottom of the Ten Great Sects. The top three sects—Destiny, the Virtuous Academy, and Great Change Faith—were even more unfathomable.","Grand Xia had a terrifying foundation that ordinary people could not imagine. Chu Yunfan could not help but think of the Federation. It was really different. If the Federation wanted to have such a foundation, who knew how much time it would take to have a chance?","As usual, after Chu Yunfan set up layers of barriers, he hid in the Mountain River Diagram. In the diagram, he sat cross-legged and floated high in the air, like one of the few gods in the world. He opened his mouth, and the Evolution Pill turned into a beam of divine light that entered his mouth. It instantly turned into a terrifying energy torrent that spread into his limbs and bones.","He hurriedly circulated the Emperor Method to guide the enormous medicinal power and began to attack the level two Cosmos Stage barrier. After all, he had just broken through not long ago. The barrier was extremely solid and could not be easily broken through.","However, Chu Yunfan wasn’t in a hurry. He was patient and kept trying to break through to a higher level."]},{"number":1824,"title":"Chapter 1824 Stepping Into the Second Level of the Cosmos Stage","paragraphs":["1824 Stepping Into the Second Level of the Cosmos Stage","A month passed by quickly.","After an unknown amount of time, Chu Yunfan suddenly opened his eyes, and his eyes burst with a bright light.","Boom!","Then, a series of crackling sounds burst out from his body, like the sound of frying beans. Chu Yunfan’s height suddenly increased by a large margin, and then slowly returned to normal. The surging divine power in his body soared into the sky, and his energy surged into the sky. After a long time, these phenomena finally disappeared.","Chu Yunfan exhaled. “I’ve finally broken through to the second level of the Cosmos Stage.”","After a whole month of crazy cultivation, he finally broke through. His combat strength underwent an earth-shaking change. His conventional combat strength was comparable to the sixth level of the Cosmos Stage, and he could even sweep through a sixth-level Cosmic.","His breakthrough was far more difficult than ordinary people. Therefore, once he broke through, his combat strength would soar and far surpass ordinary people. Once he transformed into a hou, his combat strength would increase by another level and he would enter the seventh level of the Cosmos Stage. If he met Li Qianyuan now, he would not be afraid.","After cultivating to this level, although his level was still inferior, in terms of combat strength, he had the ability to fight with the top figures of the younger generation. Even though Meng Tianren, Zi Buyu, and the others were stronger than him, he could protect himself.","After coming out of seclusion, Chu Yunfan called Chu Hongcai over. Compared to a month ago, Chu Hongcai’s situation was completely different now.","A month ago, Chu Hongcai was just an unknown inner disciple. After just a short month, his situation had changed drastically. Everyone knew that he was Chu Yunfan’s cousin. With Chu Yunfan’s current status, it could be said that he had risen to the top.","Everyone knew that the higher-ups of the Flying Celestials, including the sect leader, treated Chu Yunfan differently. As Chu Yunfan’s only relative, Chu Hongcai was now naturally valued by everyone.","With Chu Yunfan’s support, Chu Hongcai was put in charge of all kinds of affairs in Startling Cloud Peak. The cultivation resources that were originally lacking were now so abundant that they could not be used up. Just the congratulatory gifts sent by various forces to celebrate Chu Yunfan’s promotion to true disciple were a huge fortune.","It was not something that could be compared to back in the Chu clan. What military aristocratic family was not as glorious as a top-notch expert?","The inner disciples and elite disciples wanted to curry favor with Chu Hongcai. Even the legendary true disciples and elders who were originally high and mighty had to treat him as an equal.","The key to all of this was naturally Chu Yunfan. Without him, none of those big shots would even look at Chu Hongcai, let alone treat him as an equal. If Chu Yunfan was just an ordinary true disciple, it would be impossible for those true disciples and elders to look at Chu Hongcai in a new light.","If it was years ago, Chu Hongcai might have been surprised by his sudden wealth. However, after experiencing the destruction of the Chu clan, his thoughts changed drastically. He understood that these people were not trying to curry favor with him, but rather, they were using him to curry favor with Chu Yunfan.","Only when one was strong could one be truly strong.","In his heart, Chu Yunfan was his role model and idol. Chu Yunfan had never played any tricks and relied on his own strength to sweep away the enemies.","“You’ve been doing very well. You’ve managed all these things in an orderly manner. In the future, when we rebuild the Chu clan, you’ll be busy with these things.” Chu Yunfan looked at Chu Hongcai satisfactorily.","Chu Hongcai was, after all, a descendant of an aristocratic family. He was able to understand many management matters. During this period, he managed Startling Cloud Peak well. When Chu Yunfan was in seclusion, Chu Hongcai was the one who took care of everything.","“These are all minor affairs. In the end, in this world, strength is what speaks,” Chu Yunfan said.","In the past, he was just a small inner disciple and no one cared about him. Any random person could surpass him. But now, things were different. Everyone had to respect him, but all of this was not fought for by himself, but because of Chu Yunfan’s reputation. This was not a reflection of his own strength.","“Mm, it’s good that you have this understanding. I will try my best to guide your cultivation so that you can become an elite disciple as soon as possible,” Chu Yunfan said.","For others, this was a very difficult thing to do, but for Chu Yunfan, who had the resources and strength now, it was too easy.","“Also, what’s going on between you and Junior Liu?” Chu Yunfan grinned at Chu Hongcai.","Chu Hongcai’s face revealed a rare bashful expression. “Senior Liu and I have promised each other for life. However, I have yet to avenge our clan, and the revival of the Chu clan business is still far away. We don’t dare to delay our relationship though. We’ve already agreed that when my cultivation reaches a certain level and I become a true disciple, I’ll welcome her to my mountain with a palanquin!”","“That’s great. In that case, you must cultivate well. The Chu clan should have such ambition. Why stop at becoming a true disciple? The Chu clan will be relying on you to rebuild in the future. The matriarch and the others would be overjoyed if they knew,” Chu Yunfan said.","He had no interest in rebuilding the Chu clan, so these matters would inevitably fall on Chu Hongcai. With his help and advice, Chu Hongcai’s advancement to the true disciple level was just around the corner. This was not a difficult thing for him.","“Thank you, Brother Fan,” Chu Hongcai said."]},{"number":1825,"title":"Chapter 1825 A Shocking Change on the Prodigy List After Six Months","paragraphs":["1825 A Shocking Change on the Prodigy List After Six Months","In the blink of an eye, half a year had passed since Chu Yunfan killed Wang Yifan, severely injured grand elder Jiang Wan’an, and became a true disciple. During this half a year, Chu Yunfan lived in seclusion and did not come out. Not many people could see him.","Everyone was used to this. Among the true disciples, there was suddenly another big shot. Although Chu Yunfan had not popped up recently, the battle that day had established his position within the sect. Among the true disciples, he could be considered a mountain. Ordinary people could not afford to provoke such an existence. Half a year’s time was enough for the impact of that battle to slowly subside.","During this half a year, Chu Yunfan would occasionally communicate with You Chuyun to ask about the results of the construction of the external army. He did not care much for the outside world.","This period was a leisure time that he hadn’t had for a long time. Whether he was willing or not, he had to complete the six months of confinement. After all, even Jiang Wan’an, a grand elder, had to complete the three years of confinement obediently and couldn’t leave his quarters.","However, Chu Yunfan did not just sit idle for six months. Not only did he successfully break through to the second level of the Cosmos Stage, but he also pushed his cultivation to the peak. He was only one opportunity away from breaking through to the third level of the Cosmos Stage. Once he broke through, he would possess the capital to compete with those top-notch experts. He could even defeat them.","Apart from that, he was supervising You Chuyun’s construction of the external army. After all, this was his future base. Chu Yunfan had a large number of medicinal herbs that he did not need. He went to the Thousand Treasures Pavilion to exchange them for the medicinal herbs he needed. Within half a year, he had made many pills and distributed them to every soldier of the external army.","This was not surprising to those who had started Chu Yunfan earlier. They knew how Chu Yunfan did things. However, the new recruits were dumbfounded. In Grand Xia, there were countless generals who used the troops under their command to accumulate wealth. It was extremely rare for a general to use his own money to increase their strength.","It was clear that Grand Xia would not subsidize these pills. Otherwise, with so many troops in Grand Xia, the pills alone would drag down the finances of the empire. These medicinal pills would help them break through from the Golden Core Stage to the Abstract Stage.","Although this batch of new soldiers were all new recruits, they were the cream of the crop. They were all considered elites. After a few more battles, they would be the cream of the crop.","Their strength was strong, unlike the original Baotai garrison which was too weak. Just upgrading them to the Golden Core Stage required Chu Yunfan to expend a lot of effort.","With the help of these pills, coupled with the martial arts manuals and classics of various cultivation levels that the army had opened to them, the new recruits were shocked and excited.","In Grand Xia, most of these people were ordinary people. In fact, many of them were ordinary people who couldn’t even find the cultivation method of the Abstract Stage. They relied on their extraordinary talent to cultivate to this level. The reason why they chose to enlist in the army was that they hoped to obtain divine martial arts after they achieved various military merits.","In Grand Xia, these soldiers were allowed to take these innate techniques and pass them on to the next generation. After all, the number of sects that Grand Xia had destroyed was countless. It was unknown how many cultivation techniques there were. Even the people of Grand Xia themselves couldn’t tell.","Moreover, these divine abilities and martial arts techniques were ordinary techniques in the eyes of the higher-ups. Their grades were very low, and there was no need to restrict them.","However, although the conditions were very relaxed, they could obtain it as long as one made meritorious contributions. In fact, most recruits would die tragically in action not long after they entered a sect.","Humans had never stopped fighting internally, not to mention that there were many powerful races eyeing them covetously. As a result, battles in Grand Xia were very ordinary, and there were not many opportunities for them to obtain military merits.","Other than free internal energy techniques that could allow them to live longer and become martial artists, other resources were difficult to obtain. But now, Chu Yunfan was being so straightforward. It was not like what the other seniors had said, that he had to work hard for the general to obtain some military achievements from the general in the future and advance further. Now that Chu Yunfan had helped them reduce this step, who knew how many people would be saved?","With just these two points, Chu Yunfan had completely won over the garrison army. Even though they were fighting wars, it was clear that only by following a commander who knew how to empathize with the soldiers would they have a greater future.","In just half a year, the strength of the garrison army increased quickly, especially when tens of thousands of people had advanced to the Abstract Stage. It was a terrifying scene. If it were not for the array formation that Chu Yunfan had left behind to recover and block the aura, it would have caused a great uproar.","However, this also left Chu Yunfan quite poor. Other people used their troops to find ways to earn money and then secretly took the income, and Chu Yunfan’s behavior was unusual in this aspect. Not only did he not want the army to go out to earn money, but he even paid for their advancements himself. This undoubtedly caused a great sensation throughout the army.","It was not until a new prodigy list was released that it ignited the attention of the younger generation’s experts. On the list, first place was still Li Qianyuan, Marquis Huntian of Grand Xia."]},{"number":1826,"title":"Chapter 1826 Chu Yunfan Ranks 100th on the Prodigy List","paragraphs":["1826 Chu Yunfan Ranks 100th on the Prodigy List","The update of the prodigy list shocked the world. The world had been turned upside down and fortunes were seized. This was the true mantra passed down for ten thousand years.","Even the grand elders of the ten great sects were only at the Creation Stage.","After reaching the Creation Stage, one could be considered a grandmaster. What was a grandmaster? They were masters who could establish a sect. The sect leaders of first-rate sects were only at this level.","And there was no doubt that Li Qianyuan had really stepped into this rank.","The fact that another top expert had appeared in the world was not the most sensational news. What truly shocked the world was that he was the first expert in his generation to step into the Creation Stage.","It was controversial to say that Li Qianyuan was the number one master of the younger generation. After all, many people on the prodigy list below him had similar cultivation levels as him. However, with the update of the prodigy list this time, his title as the number one person of the younger generation began to live up to its name. At the very least, he had pulled ahead of everyone.","Even those who were dissatisfied with this had nothing to say. There was no doubt about the difference in cultivation levels. The difference between the Cosmos Stage and the Creation Stage was like heaven and earth. It was only a step away, but it was also a huge difference.","After the rankings were announced, not long after, eight of the top ten on the rankings were announced to be in seclusion. The impact of this update could be seen from this.","This list made almost every one of these geniuses feel a great sense of crisis. After all, even if they were a little worse than Li Qianyuan in the eyes of many people, they themselves had never thought so. In their hearts, they were on equal footing with Li Qianyuan. Now that he had quietly pulled past them, how could they not be anxious?","What many people knew was that this gap was not just a little bit, especially since Li Qianyuan was born in a family of generals and had a high status in Grand Xia. He was the first marquis of the younger generation, and he had access to a lot of cultivation resources.","Previously, he was stuck at the peak of the Cosmos Stage and had not broken through, so this advantage could not be shown. However, once he broke through the barrier and entered the Creation Stage, with his talent and the value and resources of Grand Xia, it was very normal for him to make a great breakthrough in a short time.","The cultivation method of geniuses was different from that of ordinary people. Ordinary people would grind hard and break through step by step. It was different for geniuses. For geniuses, there was no such thing as following the prescribed steps. Often, a fortuitous encounter could usher in a huge explosion in their cultivation. There were many people whose cultivation had suddenly risen in a short period.","It hadn’t been long since Li Qianyuan entered the Cosmos Stage, but he had reached the peak of the Cosmos Stage in a very short time. Therefore, these geniuses had an extremely strong sense of crisis. They had to catch up with Li Qianyuan’s progress and not fall behind forever.","The most shocking thing about the update of this list was, of course, that Li Qianyuan’s cultivation had broken through to the Creation Stage, and he was once again ahead of everyone. However, for many people, the name at the end of the list was undoubtedly a greater stimulation.","Ranked 100th on the prodigy list was Chu Yunfan of the Flying Celestials. He was born in the Violet Thunder Prefecture to the Chu clan of the Great Wei kingdom. His performance was originally mediocre, but after he obtained the inheritance of the Violet Thunder Sword Sect, he soared to the skies.","During the war to pacify the Violet Thunder Prefecture, he killed many of the younger geniuses of Grand Xia. After joining the Flying Celestial Sect, he became a core disciple in record time. He had killed Wang Yifan, who had turned into a demon, and severely injured Grand Elder Jiang Wan’an, shocking the entire sect.","Chu Yunfan’s strength was unfathomable, and he had many inheritances. He had many fortuitous encounters and performed dazzlingly on the human-demon battlefield. His talent level was extremely high.","The announcement of the last name on the prodigy list was the root cause of the uproar among many people. Compared to the others, Chu Yunfan was a name that no one knew.","As for the others, each of them had already displayed extremely powerful talent when they were young. They were invincible among their peers and had defeated countless powerful enemies. It was only natural for them to be on the prodigy list. It was just that their rankings were different.","Even the elites of the demon clan, the Hu clan, the Berserker Clan, and many other foreign races throughout the foreign lands had been famous for ten to twenty years. Everyone had long gotten used to their names.","However, the prodigy list was different. The prodigy list was a gathering place for the top experts of the younger generation. It was very difficult for any rising star to squeeze in.","Chu Yunfan had violated this rule and rushed to the last place on the prodigy list.","“Who is this Chu Yunfan? Could it be that the Mysteries Pavilion made a mistake?”","Many people’s first reaction was that the Mysteries Pavilion had placed the wrong person on the rankings. Although it was only the 100th place, these 100 people were all young geniuses of various races on the rankings. It involved countless living beings, and in the end, only these 100 people stood out.","It was extremely difficult to get on the rankings. These people were peerless figures of their generation. If they did not die prematurely in the future, they would definitely be one of the top figures who dominated this generation.","Everyone was talking about it. Though they had accepted Li Qianyuan’s entry into the Creation Stage, that was much easier than accepting an unknown person on the list.","In response to everyone’s discussion and some people’s censure, the Mysteries Pavilion did not bother to explain. They only replied that they had not made a mistake.","For a moment, everyone stopped fighting and pointed their spearheads at Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":1827,"title":"Chapter 1827 The Great Uproar Raised by the Prodigy List","paragraphs":["1827 The Great Uproar Raised by the Prodigy List","No one dared to doubt the Mysteries Pavilion’s rankings.","Otherwise, they wouldn’t have the ability to launch the prodigy list. There were even the sky list and earth list above the prodigy list. Those were the records of the super big shots who could truly influence the entire world. Each of those people possessed earth-shattering strength and status. Each of them was a figure that could shake the world with a stomp of their feet.","There generally wouldn’t be any changes to the names on the sky and earth lists. The names that changed were the ones on the prodigy list. These geniuses on the prodigy list could cause a huge change in their cultivation with any random fortuitous encounter, and their rankings would change greatly.","Of course, most of the information on the sky and earth lists was not made public. The Mysteries Pavilion deliberately avoided giving out information about these top experts as if they were afraid that these big shots would come looking for trouble. It was far from being as clear as when the prodigy list was compiled.","From this, it could be seen that Li Qianyuan, who had always been the number one in the world, was indeed not ordinary. However, he had accumulated his prestige for a long time. Even if everyone had doubts and dissatisfaction with him, they could not say anything. Strength was the absolute principle. After entering the Creation Stage, he pulled ahead of everyone by leaps and bounds.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. He had only appeared for less than two years, so he was like a rootless duckweed. Many people were naturally not convinced by him, especially since he was in the last place. To many people who were interested in being on the rankings and thought that they had the strength to be on the rankings, he was simply a thorn in their side.","This matter caused a huge commotion. Like a rolling tide, it pressed down on Chu Yunfan in the Flying Celestials. For a time, the challenge invitations flew like snowflakes. However, because Chu Yunfan was still grounded and could not see outsiders, these people could not make the trip.","However, as time passed, Chu Yunfan’s punishment ended, and many people rushed to the Flying Celestials. The higher-ups of the sect were not willing to pay any attention to these challenges. The sect leader, Situ Xuan, said that it was just a small scene and there was no need to make a fuss.","To the big shots at the top of the Flying Celestials, the fight for the prodigy list was just a small scene. Which of them had not experienced such a fight before? This was nothing.","“The prodigy list...”","Chu Yunfan had just finished his punishment when he received this prodigy list. A screen was projected on the jade slip. On the screen were the names of the hundreds of people on the ranking. On it were introductions to the people on the rankings—their strength, status, and even the battles they had fought to become famous. There was even some information about the source of their inheritances.","To ordinary people, this was confidential information. It should not even be announced in front of others, but it was all made clear on this prodigy list.","Chu Yunfan read the part about himself. Unlike the others, the part about him was basically what he had already exposed. There were deeper things about himself that he had not revealed.","He seemed to have revealed a lot of things, but no one knew his true trump card at the core. Even the legendary Mysteries Pavilion’s Rankings could not calculate it.","“It seems that the Mysteries Pavilion’s Rankings aren’t omniscient.”","Chu Yunfan was able to deduce many things from this ranking list. He was afraid that the Mysteries Pavilion’s Rankings, which was said to be omniscient and had nothing that could not be deduced, had many restrictions.","Because of the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, Chu Yunfan knew that such things were not rare since ancient times. Some people had special secret techniques, and some people had special magic artifacts that could divine these deductions.","For example, the Mountain River Diagram in Chu Yunfan’s hand was a magic artifact that the Alchemy Emperor carried with him. Naturally, it could make these kinds of deductions. Some experts with powerful cultivation bases could block such deductions with their huge providence. Even though the Mysteries Pavilion’s Rankings claimed that there was nothing that could not be found out, it was not really clear about everything.","Many of the judgments about Chu Yunfan on the Mysteries Pavilion’s Rankings came from the trump cards that he had already revealed. As for those that had not been revealed in front of others, no one knew.","The sky list and the earth list did not give any pointers to the top experts, and they did not change for many years. It was probably not only because the Mysteries Pavilion was afraid of the strength of those top experts. The bigger reason was that they could not deduce the true trump cards of these experts. If the Mysteries Pavilion’s Ranking was really as they claimed to know everything, the entire world would probably not tolerate them.","This was not good news for Chu Yunfan. This meant that after he had painstakingly caught up with Li Qianyuan, the latter had pulled ahead some more. This meant that Chu Yunfan’s expected time to end things with Li Qianyuan had to be postponed because he needed more time to cultivate.","“Brother Fan, I’m afraid we’re in big trouble. I heard that a lot of people aren’t happy that you’re on the prodigy list and that many of them are on their way here,” Chu Hongcai said unhappily.","Although Chu Yunfan was only ranked 100 on the prodigy list, it was great news for the Startling Cloud Peak. However, before they could be happy for long, they heard all kinds of rumors.","Startling Cloud Peak, which had finally calmed down for half a year, was once again in an uproar. It once again became the focus of the Flying Celestials. Although the number of people on the prodigy list seemed to be quite a lot, in reality, there were not many people among the various races and sects.","In the Flying Celestials, there were only two people who had entered the list. One of them was the chief disciple of the Flying Celestials, Yang Dengxian, who was ranked 20th. Other than that, only Chu Yunfan was on the list. One could imagine how much of a commotion he had caused in the sect."]},{"number":1828,"title":"Chapter 1828 Defeat Them Until They Have Nothing to Say","paragraphs":["1828 Defeat Them Until They Have Nothing to Say","A single prodigy list had allowed Chu Yunfan to reach the heavens in a single step and become well-known by everyone.","Chu Yunfan’s strength was not even mentioned in the prodigy list. The two battles that allowed him to enter the prodigy list were naturally not a secret under the investigation of people who were interested. Because of this, many people thought that Chu Yunfan didn’t live up to his name. Defeating the possessed Wang Yifan wasn’t a great achievement at all. Wang Yifan’s strength wasn’t much to them.","Even after becoming a demon, the increase in Wang Yifan’s strength seemed very limited to many people. There were many people who could defeat him. Not to mention the battle that severely injured Jiang Wan’an. Chu Yunfan had relied on a Sword Energy Talisman. Although such an item was rare, it was not completely non-existent. It could only be used a limited number of times and was not his true strength.","It was precisely because of this that he became the person with the greatest controversy on the prodigy list.","“It’s fine. To wear the crown, one must bear its weight. I’ll defeat them,” Chu Yunfan said as he smiled at Chu Hongcai. “Since some people think that I’m not worthy of the rankings, I’ll beat them up until they have nothing to say.”","Chu Yunfan did not think much of these doubts. There were some doubts about him, but he was curious about what mechanism the Mysteries Pavilion used to determine his strength. They could actually see his strength.","“But Brother Fan, these people are not ordinary people.”","Although Chu Hongcai had confidence in Chu Yunfan, he was still a little worried. After all, those who sent challenge letters were all outstanding disciples with extraordinary talent.","“It doesn’t matter. I hid my strength to deal with Li Qianyuan, but now that he has broken through to the Creation Stage, and everyone wants to see my strength, I’ll let them see it,” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","Chu Yunfan had not intended to expose his strength and wanted to catch Li Qianyuan off guard. However, plans couldn’t keep up with changes. Since that was the case, he didn’t have to hide anymore.","“Li Qianyuan!” Chu Hongcai gritted his teeth.","He learned later that although the Chu clan was destroyed by others, it was Li Qianyuan who ordered those people to kill Chu Yunfan. To lure Chu Yunfan out, those people killed the entire Chu clan. Therefore, his real enemy was none other than Li Qianyuan.","However, Chu Hongcai understood that with his strength, it was impossible for him to take revenge. Therefore, he placed all his hopes on Chu Yunfan.","“Don’t worry. Li Qianyuan will die in my hands sooner or later. Let him live a little longer.” Chu Yunfan patted Chu Hongcai’s shoulder and sighed. “How many people have sent me challenge letters? Let me see them.”","Chu Yunfan took the challenge letters from Chu Hongcai and read the first one.","Ye Yin of the Flying Celestials.","This name was famous in the Flying Celestials. His reputation in the Flying Celestials was even higher than Zhan Taixuan, who was ranked first among the female disciples.","Ye Yin was a terrifying figure who was second only to Yang Dengxian, the chief disciple. His cultivation base was unimaginably powerful. In the Flying Celestials, there were five great true disciples, and Ye Yin was ranked second. Even among the many elders, those who could stand shoulder-to-shoulder with him were rare.","Such a person was regarded as someone who could challenge Yang Dengxian. In the future, he would definitely become a member of the core group of supreme elders. It was even possible for him to be the vice sect leader or the sect leader.","In the power structure of the Flying Celestials, the sect leader was supreme. Other than the sect leader, there were a few vice sect leaders, followed by the core group of supreme elders, and then the ordinary grand elders.","Now, such a person took action because of the prodigy list.","Chu Yunfan accepted Ye Yin’s challenge and set it for three days later. This news spread throughout the Flying Celestials overnight. It even spread out of the sect at a shocking speed.","Because of the prodigy list, Chu Yunfan was undoubtedly one of the focal points during this period. His acceptance of Ye Yin’s challenge instantly ignited the emotions of the entire Flying Celestials.","Ye Yin, one of the five great true disciples, had challenged Chu Yunfan. Without a doubt, both sides were proud geniuses. Now, they were going to fight, and it was a battle that many people were watching.","“Chu Yunfan is finished. Although he’s on the prodigy list, this honor isn’t something he can keep.”","“He stole the honor that didn’t belong to him. Those who challenged him now, which one of them isn’t famous and powerful? Which one of them isn’t much stronger than him?”","“I’m afraid they’re about to reveal their true form now. I think the Mysteries Pavillion made a mistake.”","“That’s right. Although Chu Yunfan’s strength is extraordinary and his talent is very shocking, it’s different for him to be on the prodigy list. There are so many races and so many geniuses, but only 100 people can be on the ranking. He doesn’t have the qualifications.”","Everyone was discussing animatedly, and no one was optimistic about Chu Yunfan. Although his rise was fast, there was still a big gap between him and the veteran experts.","In the eyes of many people, even if there was a second person in the Flying Celestials who was qualified to be on the rankings, it would be Ye Yin, not Chu Yunfan.","***","In the mountain valley of the Flying Celestials that stretched for thousands of miles, there were thousands of mountains and thousands of valleys. Tall trees rose from the ground and soared into the sky. They were like heavenly pillars that densely covered the mountains.","On a mountain peak in the mountains, two figures stood with their hands behind their backs. Looking into the distance, it was a vast expanse. Both of them wore moon-white robes with golden edges. However, the patterns were complicated. One could tell at a glance that these were the clothes of the true disciples of the Flying Celestials.","One of them looked to be about twenty-seven or twenty-eight years old. His face was angular and his sharp eyebrows reached his temples. If there were any disciples of the Flying Celestials here, they would definitely recognize him at first glance. He was the chief disciple of the Flying Celestials—Yang Dengxian."]},{"number":1829,"title":"Chapter 1829 Chu Yunfan’s Shocking Influence","paragraphs":["1829 Chu Yunfan’s Shocking Influence","Next to Yang Dengxian was a young man in his late twenties. He was tall and strong, and he was as sharp as a sword that had been unsheathed.","This young man was none other than one of the core great true disciples of the Flying Celestials, Ye Yin.","“Challenge? It’s not a challenge,” Ye Yin cocked an eyebrows. “He’s just a junior.”","“But this junior is going to be above you.” Yang Dengxian smiled.","“Above me? I just want to let the Mysteries Pavilion know that they’ve made a mistake on the prodigy list.” Ye Yin sneered.","For an expert at his level, it was fine if he was not ranked on the prodigy list, but a junior had been picked over him. This was simply a great humiliation.","“I only have one target, and that is you.” Ye Yin looked at Yang Dengxian.","“You’re no match for me, so don’t waste your time. I don’t have that much time either. I’m going to go into seclusion. I won’t come out until I break my destiny.”","Yang Dengxian glanced at Ye Yin and didn’t take his words seriously. Although he was ranked 20th, everyone else on the prodigy list was not far from him except for Li Qianyuan. Even the top 10 might not dare to say that they could defeat him. He naturally had to catch up and not let others take the lead.","“You’re still as arrogant as ever.”","Although Ye Yin said this, he knew his limits. He had just entered the seventh level of the Cosmos Stage not long ago, while Yang Dengxian had been at this level for much longer. Though he was strong, the gap between them had not narrowed.","He was a little anxious. As Li Qianyuan stepped into the Creation Stage, it was like a raging tide was detonated. Many top talents of the younger generation began to enter the state of seclusion.","This was a huge test for them. After all, they had just established themselves in this field, while some had already begun to charge into another field, while others had already stepped into another field.","“It’s better for Chu Yunfan to be defeated by you than by someone else. At least the Flying Celestials’ reputation will be preserved. But I advise you not to take the chestnuts out of the fire for someone else,” Yang Dengxian advised.","Ye Yin raised an eyebrow and said, “It’s not your place to lecture me on this matter. I will beat him down. I’ll have a place on the prodigy list. Go into seclusion. When you come out, I will have caught up to you.” He turned into a streak of light and disappeared into the sky.","Yang Dengxian shook his head. In his opinion, Ye Yin’s situation was still too small. Ye Yin was in a hurry to prove that he was not inferior to him. Yang Dengxian knew all too well that the higher-ups of the sect were very optimistic about Chu Yunfan, especially the sect leader. Therefore, even if Chu Yunfan lost, he could only lose at the hands of his own people.","Yang Dengxian would not make a move. He did not have the time, nor the need. He was in the top 20 of the prodigy list, and Chu Yunfan was ranked at the bottom. It was a completely different matter.","Therefore, this task fell on Ye Yin’s head. However, he also knew that some people had used this opportunity to find Ye Yin. It wasn’t convenient for some people to take action, but Ye Yin could. These people were both from the sect and outside. The people Chu Yunfan had offended were all people who had been robbed openly. There was no secret offense that no one knew about.","This was the reason why he had come to Ye Yin on the eve of his secluded cultivation. He was trying to give Ye Yin a vague warning, but he didn’t know if Ye Yin understood.","He was different from Ye Yin. He was almost the next sect leader. His perspective on problems was naturally not the same as Ye Yin’s. As sect leader, one naturally had to be tolerant. There were so many factions in the Flying Celestials, could he suppress them all?","The Flying Celestials had flourished for so many years and had a mature selection system. There were specific standards for the sect leader. If he did not meet them, he might be ousted. He could not really do whatever he wanted.","Although this was a battle between the experts of the Flying Celestials, it involved two great experts. All the experts in the Flying Celestials gathered here. Not only were the true disciples very interested in this, many elders were very interested in this unprecedented battle too.","Although many people thought that Chu Yunfan was inferior to Ye Yin, Chu Yunfan easily defeated the demonized Wang Yifan and was recognized as the best among the true disciples of the Flying Celestials.","Such a big battle was not common.","Around the life and death arena at the peak of the mountains, many true disciples and elders gathered. This lineup was enough to compare to many first-rate sects and even scare them.","It was only at this time that they could truly understand Chu Yunfan’s influence. The reason why these people came was not only because of Ye Yin’s name, but also because of Chu Yunfan. After all, his influence had long been different from before after he had been promoted to a true disciple.","“Many true disciples have come. I recognize more than 20 of them. There are also some who don’t appear often, so I can’t recognize them. There are also many elders. This battle is indeed eye-catching.”","“Neither side is simple. On one side is the person ranked 100th on the prodigy list, and on the other side is an expert of our Flying Celestials who is second only to Eldest Senior.”","“That’s right. There’s going to be a fierce battle. Let’s see how long Chu Yunfan will last.”","Many inner disciples widened their eyes. The number of true disciples they had seen today was probably more than they had seen in their entire lives. After all, apart from those who could not return from the outside and those who could not come out from seclusion, most of the true disciples had arrived. It was rare to see so many true disciples at the same time.","In the crowd, Yi Yunyao was mixed among the true disciples. She was slightly stunned. No one knew Chu Yunfan’s background better than her. He definitely did not come from this world. Moreover, Chu Yunfan had not joined the Flying Celestials for long. Not only was he on equal footing with her, but he had even far surpassed her. She knew that if it were her, she would not have had such a challenge.","“Chu Yunfan’s here!” someone shouted loudly, and the crowd instantly boiled over."]},{"number":1830,"title":"Chapter 1830 Ironfeather Black Eagle","paragraphs":["1830 Ironfeather Black Eagle","Everyone saw a young man wearing a white robe walking up the mountainside. There was no paved pathway up to the life and death arena at the peak of the mountain range, but it was naturally not difficult for everyone. Everyone could fly, so it didn’t matter if there were stairs or not.","Step by step, Chu Yunfan walked onto the arena and looked around. Among these people, he saw many familiar figures, such as Yi Yunyao, Zhantai Xuan, and Hua Xianyuan.","In the past, he couldn’t see through Yi Yunyao’s cultivation level. Now, he could easily see through her. She had already stepped into the fifth level of the Cosmos Stage. No wonder even Wang Yifan suffered a loss at her hands. At this speed, it wouldn’t be difficult for her to cultivate to the seventh level of the Cosmos Stage in a short time.","After half a year, Zhantai Xuan was getting closer to the seventh level of teh Cosmos Stage. The barrier was like a thin layer of paper. Chu Yunfan could tell that it was only a matter of time before she reached the seventh level of the Cosmos Stage. It would take her another month at most.","Once one entered the seventh Cosmos Stage they would be the best among the true disciples. It was a very obvious dividing line among many true disciples if their cultivation did not reach the seventh level. Only by reaching that level could one have a chance of breaking through to the Creation Stage and become a top-notch expert.","Once Zhantai Xuan stepped into that level, she would receive the full help of the Flying Celestials. After all, a seventh-level Cosmic and a Creator were two completely different concepts.","What really surprised him was that Hua Xianyuan had entered the Cosmos Stage in just half a year. Although he was only at the first level, the aura of the Cosmos Stage on him was stable. He would not easily fall back to the Abstract Interpretation Stage.","However, he remembered that Hua Xianyuan had the Wind Spirit Physique, a constitution worthy of a king. For someone to be conferred the title of king, their talent had to be unquestionable. Reaching the Cosmos Stage was definitely not the end. On the contrary, for a king, this was just the beginning.","In addition, a large number of true disciples and elders had gathered. However, most of them were from the Flying Celestials. There were very few from the other sects. Because there was not enough time, many people could not make it in time.","Chu Yunfan did not know that as he observed the crowd, the crowd was also observing him. Hua Xianyuan, in particular, had a complicated expression on his face. His cultivation progress could not be said to be slow. Back then, he and Chu Yunfan had become elite disciples together. Two years later, Chu Yunfan had become a true disciple. Such cultivation speed was like riding a rocket. Normally, he would be the most dazzling peerless genius. In fact, he was even confident that he could compete with those geniuses on the prodigy list or even trample them under his feet.","But now, his brilliance was completely overshadowed by one person, and that was Chu Yunfan.","Since the inner disciple competition, hehua Xianyuan had regarded Chu Yunfan as his biggest competitor. In the future, he might be able to compete with the geniuses on the prodigy list, and Chu Yunfan was currently on the prodigy list. The difference between the two sides was clear at a glance. No matter how unwilling he was, he understood the gap between them.","However, he didn’t lose confidence. His king physique was almost at the peak, and he would definitely be a top figure in the future. Although he was depressed about falling behind for a while, it was not completely unacceptable.","“Is this Chu Yunfan? He actually came.”","“It seems that they came prepared. This will definitely be a big battle.”","“I heard that when he defeated Wang Yifan, Chu Yunfan didn’t use his full strength. No one knows where his true bottom line is. But facing Ye Yin, he’ll have to use his full strength. Otherwise, he’ll be quickly defeated.”","“Among the great true disciples, Ye Yin is second only to Eldest Senior. His cultivation is world-shaking. It’s said that he obtained an amazing inheritance when he was young. However, no one has ever seen his true appearance. Perhaps we’ll have a chance to see it this time.”","“I heard that the other followers of the great true disciples also wanted to challenge Chu Yunfan. Who knew that Ye Yin would make the first move.”","“After all, this is related to the ranking of the prodigy list, isn’t it? Even the last place is an honor.”","Not long after Chu Yunfan arrived, he saw a figure rushing over from the sky. He saw a huge bird hovering in the sky. It was completely black, like a giant eagle. Its wings were over a hundred meters long. It was definitely a ferocious beast.","“Ye Yin has arrived!”","“It is Ye Yin. That should be the legendary Ironfeather Black Eagle. Tsk tsk, this ferocious beast has the bloodline of an ancient ferocity. It’s almost impossible to subdue such a top-notch demonic bird.”","“That’s right. This kind of demonic bird is arrogant and aloof. It’s impossible for anyone to tame it. Unless it’s nurtured from the time it was an egg and grows up together, it’s possible for them to be telepathically connected.”","“I heard that the Ye clan’s leader went deep into the demon region and experienced life and death situations before he finally managed to steal an Ironfeather Black Eagle’s egg. In the end, the Ye clan’s experts who traveled with him suffered heavy casualties. All of them were killed by the Ironfeather Black Eagle tribe. Only the Ye clan’s leader managed to escape. The Ye clan had done their best to nurture a genius like Ye Yin.”","Many people had heard of the legend of Ye Yin and the Ironfeather Black Eagle, and the Ye clan had never sad anything against the story. And Ye Yin did not disappoint the Ye clan. He entered the Flying Celestials at a young age and rose quickly. Now, he was the second of the great true disciples of the Flying Celestials, second only to the chief disciple, Yang Dengxian.","Everyone could feel an oppressive force from this Ironfeather Black Eagle, as if they were facing a terrifying beast.","“The seventh Cosmos Stage,” Chu Yunfan mused.","His gaze fell on Ye Yin and the Ironfeather Black Eagle. Both the man and the beast were at the seventh level of the Cosmos Stage. Not only was Ye Yin’s cultivation base strong, but even the Ironfeather Black Eagle’s cultivation base was not the slightest bit inferior to his.","The Ironfeather Black Eagle tribe was one of the overlords of the sky in the vast demon region. They were extremely terrifying demon birds. Just this Ironfeather Black Eagle alone was much stronger than 99% of the experts present."]},{"number":1831,"title":"Chapter 1831 I Deserve It","paragraphs":["1831 I Deserve It","This was probably where Ye Yin’s greatest confidence lay. Just his demon pet was much more powerful than most true disciples.","Ye Yin stood with his hands behind his back. His expression was filled with great confidence. He didn’t care about Chu Yunfan at all. He could have easily defeated Chu Yunfan, but he had to issue a challenge with great fanfare. Why did he do it?","It was so he could defeat Chu Yunfan in front of everyone and prove to the world that it was definitely a mistake for him not to be on the prodigy list. It was fine if he wasn’t there, but there was Chu Yunfan. Wasn’t this a big mistake?","“Are you that confident?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“It’s not confidence, it’s strength,” Ye Yin said indifferently, “Even the Mysteries Pavillion makes mistakes. I will correct them.”","Chu Yunfan sneered. “You want to step on me to get to the top? Well, it just so happenes that I want to use you to establish my prestige. I deserve to be ranked on the prodigy list.”","Although Chu Yunfan didn’t like to be high-profile, he was confident in himself. If he didn’t have the momentum to defeat countless competitors, he wouldn’t have been able to reach this stage.","Ye Yin and Chu Yunfan were the same.","“Good one. You want to use me to establish yourself?” Ye Yin laughed.","Then, int he blink of an eye, he made his move. He took a step forward and stood on the Ironfeather Black Eagle as he grabbed out","Boom!","Everyone felt that the surrounding spirit energy being stirred up at an astonishing speed. The spirit energy that was originally invisible to the naked eye had now turned into streams of air that were visible to the naked eye. In the air, it was like a huge hand from the sky, suddenly grabbing toward Chu Yunfan.","It was the Flying Celestial Palm Strike!","Many of the true disciples and elders present recognized the martial art move that Ye Yin had performed. It was the Flying Celestial Palm Strike. Most of them had cultivated the same move, but the power they displayed was not even one-third of this move. Some people even felt that the Flying Celestial Palm Strike they had used was less than 1% of this attack.","The entire sky was shaking. Ye Yin was able to shake the heavens and earth in a casual manner and smashed down on Chu Yunfan’s head. The moment an expert made a move, he would know if there was one.","However, Chu Yunfan did not move. The terrifying hand slapped down, forming a terrifying airflow that blew his clothes. He conjured lightning that filled the sky. The lightning turned into an ancient long sword. He waved his fiercely, and in an instant, this sword cut down on the Flying Celestial Palm Strike.","Boom!","A shocking sword light soared into the sky like a huge pillar of air, blasting into the Flying Celestial Palm Strike.","It was the collision of two terrifying forces in the air. In an instant, it triggered the barrier of the arena that enveloped the two of them. This made many true disciples and elders with lower cultivation levels heave a sigh of relief. What a joke. Just the aftershock of this collision made them feel that they were invincible. If they were hit, they would surely die.","The power of one attack had actually reached such a terrifying level. It was simply terrifying to the extreme. Everyone was shocked.","“A few months ago, when Chu Yunfan killed Wang Yifan, he was still calm when faced with Wang Yifan’s strength after Wang Yifan became a demon. At that time, Wang Yifan couldn’t even force Chu Yunfan to use his true strength. But it seems that in these few months, Chu Yunfan has become even stronger. I saw that battle with my own eyes. If he had this strength back then, Wang Yifan would have died before he could become a demon,” a true disciple who had seen the battle a few months ago said with certainty.","“Ye Yin only attacked casually. The two sides are still in the probing stage. A casual attack from Ye Yin would probably severely injure an ordinary true disciple. The Ironfeather Black Eagle under his feet has yet to join the battle. Chu Yunfan is fighting two top true disciples alone. He has no chance of winning,” someone said.","Everyone nodded their heads. No one felt that there was anything wrong with the Ironfeather Black Eagle joining the battle. In this world, there were experts who specialized in taming beasts. Taming powerful monsters for their own use was also a method. No one felt that this was an unfair victory.","The reason why humans were different from beasts was that humans would use all kinds of methods to strengthen themselves. All kinds of tools and all kinds of worldly possessions were the same. On the other hand, beasts without intelligence could only rely on the strength of their bodies. There were huge limitations. Intelligence was the most powerful strength.","“Ye Yin, you don’t have any chance of winning at this level, so there’s no need to probe,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently. He could tell that Ye Yin was just testing the waters and had not really made a move.","Ye Yin smiled coldly.” I didn’t expect you to be able to withstand this attack. It doesn’t seem like you were lucky to defeat Wang Yifan and heavily injure Elder Jiang Wan’an. In that case, I’m going to make my move.” His eyes flashed with a sharp light.","Boom!","He attacked again. The Flying Celestial Palm Strike attacked again, but the power of this attack was more than ten times stronger than before. This was his true strength—the strength of a seventh-level Cosmic. Previously, he was only at the strength of an sixth-level Cosmic. He did not even use a fraction of his true strength.","The sky shook once again. Everyone seemed felt that there was a monster violently turning over in the sky, causing the airflow between heaven and earth to tremble violently. The power of this attack was so strong that everyone was scared until their faces turned ashen.","“Flying Immortal Great Palm! You’re going to lose Chu Yunfan!”"]},{"number":1832,"title":"Chapter 1832 Ye Yin Is Injured!","paragraphs":["1832 Ye Yin Is Injured!","This Flying Celestial Palm Strike was clearly different from before. This attack contained Ye Yin’s divine power, and it was truly like Mount Tai pressing down. This big hand was much smaller than before, less than half its size, but its power had increased by ten times.","“That’s right, the list must have been ranked wrongly.”","“The day the prodigy list will be rearranged is today.”","Many people clamored. These people were all Ye Yin’s supporters. Ye Yin had been operating in the Flying Celestials for many years and had a deep foundation. It was unknown how many supporters he had. Now that they saw Ye Yin’s true strength, they immediately clamored.","However, Chu Yunfan was fearless. Almost every pore on his body was spewing out lightning energy, which transformed into a sword. It was the power of lightning. This treasure sword transformed into seven incomparably huge lightning swords.","This was the Violet Thunder Swords’ legacy, the Seven Violet Thunder Swords, which only grandmaster-level experts could learn.","Boom!","The swords struck out at lightning speed and hit the Flying Celestial Palm Strike. The sword light tore through everything as if it was cutting through metal and stone. It cut the Flying Celestial Palm Strike in half.","Boom!","The Flying Celestial Palm Strike was cleaved into two halves. Countless spirit energy scattered down as if it had lost the restraint of some power. It started to rain spirit energy. There was too much spirit energy that it liquefied. This collision was ten times more terrifying than before. The strength of both sides’ attacks were incomparable to that of the past.","However, after this attack was blocked by Chu Yunfan, Ye Yin let out a long cry and kicked out. He flew up into the air and stomped down with one foot.","“Fire Spirit Stomp!”","Countless spirit energy gathered on Ye Yin’s leg. It was as if the wind was helping the fire to burn fiercely. It turned into a heavenly pillar and fell.","Although they were blocked by the arena barrier, many people could not help but retreat. They could feel a wave of heat coming at them. The terrifying power contained in it made them shudder. If not for the barrier, they would definitely run as far as they could.","“This is the true pinnacle of power. Although we are also Cosmics, I’m afraid we can’t withstand this attack,” an elder said in shock.","Boom!","This kick hit Chu Yunfan, turning the place where he was standing into a raging flame and a sea of fire. The entire arena shook violently. However, everyone saw a figure rush out from the sea of fire. That person seemed to be covered in lightning armor, completely enveloping him.","Everyone saw Chu Yunfan leap out. Under the protection of the lightning armor, the attack did not pose a threat to him. Even his clothes were not messed up.","“Chu Yunfan is still fine after such an attack!”","Many people saw this scene and were shocked. Even Zhantai Xuan, who had already stepped into this point and was about to break through, was shocked. Although she was just a little bit away from entering the seventh level of the Cosmos Stage, it was still not the case. If she were any of the two, she would have been defeated by now. Every move they made surpassed the limits of her level.","There was no need to mention sixth-level Cosmics. If an ordinary sixth-level Cosmic, it was almost certain death. One blow was enough to defeat them. But looking at Chu Yunfan’s appearance, he didn’t look like he was going to lose at all.","This aligned with the rumors. Chu Yunfan’s physical cultivation had reached an extremely terrifying level. He must be a physique cultivator. In addition, he had learned an extremely powerful lightning technique from god knows where, making him extremely troublesome.","Among the many divine abilities in the world, lightning techniques were the most difficult to deal with. Lightning users would have lightning in their attacks and they were as fast as lightning. When they defended, they were practically indestructible.","There were almost no weakness.","The thunder technique that Chu Yunfan had learned was all-rounded. There was no flaw at all. In other words, if he wanted to defeat Chu Yunfan, he hhad to rely on his strength. It was impossible to take any shortcuts.","What Ye Yin didn’t know was that the lightning armor that Chu Yunfan was using was extraordinary. It was an extremely powerful divine ability called the Thunder Emperor Armor. It was famous in ancient times. However, there were very few people who could cultivate it. They had to have a physique like the Thunderclap Physique that had a great affinity with lightning. Otherwise, it was impossible.","The power of the Thunder Emperor Armor was unquestionable. It was indestructible when defending and it could greatly increase attack power when attacking. When it moved, it was as fast as lightning. Whether it was speed, attack power, or defense, there was no flaw.","Back then, the Thunder Emperor had relied on the Thunder Emperor Armor to fight against three emperors for three days and three nights. There was no doubt about its power.","This was only the basic form of the Thunder Emperor Armor. However, the requirements to use it were very high as the Thunder Emperor Armor as it taxed one’s physical fitness. Chu Yunfan only had the ability to use the Thunder Emperor Armor after he had entered the Cosmos Stage.","This was the first time Chu Yunfan was using this technique.","Before this, even when Wang Yifan had become a demon, he wouldn’t have been a threat to Chu Yunfan. He didn’t even need to use the Thunder Emperor Armor. Now that he was using it, his aura soared to the limit.","“Come at me together with your bird, Ye Yin. Otherwise, you can’t do anything to me!” Chu Yunfan shouted.","As soon as he finished speaking and appeared behind Ye Yin. Ye Yin instantly slapped out with his palm.","Clang!","A huge explosion sounded like the sound of metal clashing. Blood spurted out.","Everyone could clearly see that there was a golden sword stabbed into Ye Yin’s palm. The sword had broken through his protective energy shield."]},{"number":1833,"title":"Chapter 1833 An Astonishing Increase in Battle","paragraphs":["1833 An Astonishing Increase in Battle","“The geng metal sword!”","The geng metal sword was extremely sharp and priceless, especially for experts who were proficient in martial arts. Such a divine weapon was much more convenient than any magic weapon. In Chu Yunfan’s hand, the power of the geng metal sword was at least ten times stronger. It wasn’t something Wang Yifan could compare to.","“You hurt me!” Ye Yin’s eyes flashed with anger.","He shook his hand and the wound that had been bleeding non-stop began to heal. However, this speed was different from what he had expected. The geng metal sword light was preventing his wound from healing.","“What a troublesome sword, but its not a big deal.”","Ye Yin’s expression was extremely cold. To him, being injured by Chu Yunfan was equivalent to a big slap in the face. It was beyond his expectations.","Boom!","A huge palm landed out of thin air, hitting the place where Chu Yunfan was standing. It blew up the air in that area. This scene was simply terrifying in the eyes of many people.","However, Chu Yunfan was not hit. In the next moment, he had already arrived behind Ye Yin. He was as fast as lightning. Ordinary people had no time to react. It was only when he revealed his figure that many people finally reacted.","However, the geng metal sword split into seven shadows of sword light. The seven sword lights surrounded Chu Yunfan, either attacking, defending, or patrolling. It was both offensive and defensive.","Whoosh, whoosh, whoosh!","One of the sword lights shot out and transformed into a rain of geng metal swords that filled the sky.","Ye Yin’s expression became colder and colder. The Ironfeather Black Eagle under his feet was connected to its master’s mind. In an instant, it had flown up at an extremely fast speed. Under the watchful eyes of the crowd, the Ironfeather Black Eagle shrunk to the size of three people. However, its speed had increased by a lot.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","In the sky, loud booms could be heard everywhere. Many people could not keep up with the speed of the two people’s exchange. They could only see huge explosions high up in the sky.","The battle between the two sides became more and more intense. In this arena that was not too big, it was like a stream of light.","“How is this possible? Chu Yunfan is actually so strong. Even when Ye Yin was using his full strength, he was still able to fight with him until now. It’s simply unbelievable.”","“It must be because of that lightning armor. It greatly enhanced Chu Yunfan’s attack, defense, and speed,” someone commented After all, this was not a difficult guess.","“That divine ability should consume a lot of energy. How has Chu Yunfan endured it until now?” someone said in disbelief.","The more powerful the divine power and martial arts, the more terrifying the consumption.","But looking at Chu Yunfan’s appearance, he did not look like he could not hold on and was about to be defeated. One could imagine that his divine power was really dense and terrifying.","“Didn’t Chu Yunfan just enter the Cosmos Stage? No matter how you look at it, the density of this divine power is no less than Ye Yin’s, and the recovery speed is even more shocking,” someone said as they thought of this key point.","Nobody could make sense of it.","At this moment, inside the arena, Ye Yin had realized the problem. Others could not keep up with the speed of the two people. It was not obvious, but he could see clearly that Chu Yunfan was not without consumption. Maintaining the Thunder Emperor Armor was exhausting for him. However, what was even more terrifying was his recovery speed. As soon as his front foot was exhausted, his back foot would already recover. It was almost endless.","Ye Yin thought that he had the upper hand in terms of strength and cultivation level. Logically speaking, he should be the one who was not afraid of a prolonged battle. Now, it seemed that Chu Yunfan was even less afraid of a prolonged battle than him.","Moreover, as Chu Yunfan attacked more and more, Ye Yin could even feel that Chu Yunfan’s comprehension of various martial arts combinations and the Thunder Emperor Armor was also increasing. He could easily feel this speed of improvement.","This was the most terrifying thing. This ability to steadily improve in battle was simply a monster. In the middle of the battle, everyone was on tenterhooks and didn’t dare to be distracted. Otherwise, they would die. Under such circumstances, it was a terrifying thing to analyze battle experience and turn it into their own use.","‘I have to end this quickly. I can’t let him continue to grow!’ Ye Yin immediately realized that he had become Chu Yunfan’s whetstone. A sharp light flashed in his eyes as he stared at Chu Yunfan.","In an instant, countless divine power surged throughout his body. These divine power condensed into a long dragon that soared into the sky. He grabbed at the air and then scattered it all over the sky. In an instant, countless talismans flew up.","Boom!","A series of terrifying explosions erupted, and the entire arena shook violently. The originally unbreakable barrier was shaking at an astonishing speed.","“Those are high-level explosive talismans of the Divine Talisman Sect!” someone exclaimed.","They all recognized it. This was clearly a technique of the Divine Talisman Sect, high-grade explosive talismans. Many of the talismans of the Divine Talisman Sect were sold outside. The sect needed sufficient resources to cultivate, but they usually only gave out low-grade talismans. High-level explosive talismans were very difficult to obtain.","A terrifying scene was caused by these explosive talismans. It almost blew up the entire arena. Every explosive talisman was priceless, and now they were all thrown out in one go.","What was a highballer? This was a highballer."]},{"number":1834,"title":"Chapter 1834 It’s Time to End This Boring Farce","paragraphs":["1834 It’s Time to End This Boring Farce","As a veteran true disciple, Ye Yin’s foundation was naturally not something that ordinary people could compare to. In addition, he had the support of the entire Ye clan behind him. He did not lack in financial resources, material resources, or manpower.","Otherwise, Chu Yunfan wouldn’t have chosen to join the Flying Celestials. With the inheritance in his mind, even if he was alone, he would be able to make a name for himself in the future and reach the peak. However, the time would be greatly delayed.","Everyone was dumbfounded. Every Explosive Talisman was equivalent to a strike of power from a top Cosmic. Ye Yin had thrown out hundreds of them in one go. Their value was at least more than a million middle-grade spirit stones.","Most people would use it as a trump card to turn the tables at a critical moment. However, when it came to Ye Yin, he threw it out casually. It would have been fine if they were in other places, but they were in an arena. Although the arena was as big as a football field, for two Cosmics, this distance was no different from facing each other.","These hundreds of explosive talismans exploded together, leaving no space for Chu Yunfan to dodge.","“Chu Yunfan has to take them head-on. Even if he doesn’t die, he will be seriously injured.”","Many people secretly guessed that this had nothing to do with speed. Being confined in a small space, Chu Yunfan’s speed was restricted.","Sure enough, after the endless smoke and dust from the explosion dispersed, everyone saw that the Thunder Emperor Armor on Chu Yunfan’s body, which had been so majestic just a moment ago, was damaged. It was extremely difficult for Chu Yunfan to withstand that terrifying attack head-on.","“Now!” Ye Yin roared, “I’ll take advantage of your weakness to take your life.”","It was at this moment that Ye Yin attacked with the Fire Spirit Stomp again. A huge foot stomped down on Chu Yunfan.","The Ironfeather Black Eagle beneath his feet seemed to have already communicated with him and began to flap its wings. Two tornadoes were born from under its wings and fused into the Fire Spirit Stomp. The wind helped the fire and the power of the Fire Spirit Stomp increased by several times.","A calm light flashed through Ye Yin’s eyes. With this attack, the situation was set. Chu Yunfan could not turn the tables. Even if a seventh-level Cosmic took it head-on, he would at least be severely injured or even die.","This was the best time for him to cooperate with the Ironfeather Black Eagle.","Boom!","This kick created a huge hole in the originally incomparably sturdy arena barrier, almost shattering the arena.","“Where’s Chu Yunfan? Is he dead?”","Many people gasped. In the crowd, Chu Hongcai, who had the most confidence in Chu Yunfan, was now anxious. That stomp was too terrifying. Almost no one present could withstand it. Ye Yin was definitely not an ordinary person.","In the crowd, Zhantai Xuan, Hua Xianyuan, and the others alsoopened their heavenly eyes, wanting to see what was going on. The intensity of this series of battles had already far exceeded their imaginations. If it were them, they would not be able to withstand it at all.","“Die!” someone shouted.","Everyone saw a figure covered in golden hair and emitting golden light standing on the almost shattered arena.","“As expected. You are indeed one of the great true disciples. If I don’t use my full strength, I can’t take you down.”","Chu Yunfan’s entire body was golden. Every strand of hair seemed to be engraved with ancient runes and was filled with a fierce aura. As one of the ten ancient ferocities, the hou erupted with a terrifying aura. This was Chu Yunfan’s strongest state. After transforming into a hou, his strength had increased by several times.","Just as Ye Yin had guessed, Chu Yunfan did not use his full strength from the beginning. Instead, he used Ye Yin as a whetstone.","With Chu Yunfan’s current strength, there were not many people who could withstand his full strength attack unscathed, especially among his peers. It was as rare as phoenix feathers and qilin horns.","This was an unprecedented opportunity. The more he fought, the faster Chu Yunfan comprehended. He quickly absorbed the Thunder Emperor Armor and many other martial arts and divine abilities.","Battle was the best catalyst. And this was also his limit. Coupled with the Thunder Emperor Armor, he could only barely withstand Ye Yin’s full strength attack. Chu Yunfan was a little dissatisfied that he couldn’t defeat Ye Yin. If anyone else heard this, they would have been scared to death.","Ye Yin was a top-notch expert of the seventh level of the Cosmos Stage, while Chu Yunfan was only at the second level of the Cosmos Stage. The difference in strength between them was like heaven and earth.","A second-level Cosmic had forced Ye Yin, a seveth-level Cosmic, to a draw. Such a battle record was shocking enough for anyone. It could be said that anyone could become famous with such a battle.","However, Chu Yunfan was still not satisfied. In his eyes, Ye Yin had never existed. Although Ye Yin thought highly of himself, to Chu Yunfan, Ye Yin had never been his goal.","Li Qianyuan was the only one worthy of his attention. And even on the road of cultivation, Li Qianyuan was just a test. His real goal was to reach the top, to reach the unprecedented realm, to live forever.","“Is this your trump card?” Ye Yin’s expression was ice-cold. In the intelligence report, it was mentioned that Chu Yunfan could transform into a hou. It was a secret technique and divine ability.","However, at that time, he didn’t care. This secret technique was at the same level as Wang Yifan’s demonization. He thought it wasn’t a threat to true experts. But now, he realized that everything was wrong, and the fierce aura emitted by Chu Yunfan made his heart palpitate. It was as if he had fallen into an ice cave. A cold feeling ran from the soles of his feet to his head.","“That’s right. It’s time to end this boring farce.”"]},{"number":1835,"title":"Chapter 1835 The End, Ye Yin’s Defeat","paragraphs":["1835 The End, Ye Yin’s Defeat","“What? You actually dare to say that this is a boring farce?!”","What had he become? A clown?","Thinking of this, a cold glint flashed across his eyes.","“Don’t think that you can do anything just because you can transform,” Ye Yin said coldly.","He jumped down from the back of the Ironfeather Black Eagle and lunged at Chu Yunfan. One of his feet was like a pillar that lifted up the sky. On the other side, the Ironfeather Black Eagle had only been cooperating with Ye Yin and had not really attacked. Now, it had finally sensed its master’s anger and attacked.","Its first move was an extremely brilliant martial art, the Eagle Claw Technique.","The Eagle Claw Technique was a martial art that was created by imitating these birds. The Ironfeather Black Eagle did not even need to learn it and could use it automatically.","Demonic power surged on the Ironfeather Black Eagle’s body, covering half of the sky as it grabbed at Chu Yunfan. Even seventh-level Cosmics wouldn’t dare to fight against these creatures so easily. They would certainly use defensive magic tools to defend themselves.","But at this time, Chu Yunfan’s actions were completely beyond everyone’s expectations. He didn’t choose to dodge the attack as everyone thought. Instead, he rushed forward.","The Ironfeather Black Eagle was the overlord of demonic birds, one of the kings of the sky. Its attack was extremely terrifying. However, Chu Yunfan’s hou was one of the Ten Ferocities.","“I’ll deal with you first!” Chu Yunfan roared and rose into the sky. He ignored Ye Yin and headed toward the Ironfeather Black Eagle as if he were possessed by an ancient beast.","Bam!","Ye Yin’s Fire Spirit Stomp landed on Chu Yunfan. Countless divine powers turned into lava and drowned out everything, but Chu Yunfan didn’t move an inch. This Fire Spirit Stomp couldn’t even break through his defense.","Chu Yunfan punched out eight heavenly dragons, clashing with the huge eagle claw.","Clang!","A sound that sounded like metal clashing rang out.","Immediately after, everyone was shocked to hear the Ironfeather Black Eagle let out a sorrowful cry. In the process of its collision with Chu Yunfan, its entire eagle claw was broken, and it was crippled by Chu Yunfan.","During this process, Chu Yunfan held his ground. He was not affected in the slightest.","What was ferocity? This was ferocity!","Many people felt like they were looking at a painting. In the distant immemorial era, on the land where countless ferocious beasts ran amok, a hou roared toward the sky and rampaged around. It killed countless terrifying ferocious beasts and became the top predator at the top of the food chain.","Chu Yunfan was not satisfied with just crippling one of the eagle’s claws. Instead, he took a step forward and chased after the eagle.","Before Ye Yin could react, Chu Yunfan had already closed in on the Ironfeather Black Eagle.","The bird was shocked. It immediately flapped its wings, trying to dodge Chu Yunfan’s attack. However, in terms of speed, Chu Yunfan was only faster than it. How could it escape from Chu Yunfan’s grasp?","“Break!” Chu Yunfan shouted and grabbed at the air.","The geng metal sword appeared in Chu Yunfan’s hand, and a sword light that was thousands of feet long appeared. The sword slashed down toward the Ironfeather Black Eagle.","Slice!","One of the Ironfeather Black Eagle’s wings was cut clean off. With a miserable cry, the huge bird fell to the ground, and blood splattered everywhere. The Ironfeather Black Eagle was considered fierce, but who would have thought that Chu Yunfan’s hou was even fiercer?","“D*mn it!” Ye Yin was furious.","The Ironfeather Black Eagle had grown up with him since he was young. In the eyes of outsiders, it was his demon pet, but to him, it was no different from his brother. They had fought side by side all these years and had never encountered such a miserable time.","“Don’t worry, it’s your turn now.” Chu Yunfan turned to look in Ye Yin’s direction.","After transforming into the hou, Chu Yunfan’s combat strength had broken through to the seventh level of the Cosmos Stage. With his invincible body, he was simply terrifying.","“How could this be? How long has it been? Ye Yin has already suffered such a crushing defeat!” someone shouted, and almost everyone nodded.","They couldn’t imagine how Chu Yunfan had done it. Originally, they were all optimistic about Ye Yin and not Chu Yunfan. Who would have thought that reality would give them a few harsh slaps?","Chu Yunfan had only just made a move, and everything had been completely reversed.","By now, everyone could see that Chu Yunfan had not used his full strength from the beginning. He was just playing with Ye Yin and used him to temper his strength and treated Ye Yin as a whetstone.","What kind of shocking breadth of mind was this? Even Yang Dengxian, the head disciple of the Flying Celestials, would not dare to treat Ye Yin as a target to temper himself.","Many then realized that with Chu Yunfan’s astonishing strength, the rankings of the Flying Celestials’ true disciples would probably be reshuffled. There would be another person added to the original five great disciples, and the person’s ranking would be extremely high, second only to Yang Dengxian.","However, these thoughts only went through their minds for a moment before they were immediately attracted by the battle in the arena again. As soon as Chu Yunfan finished speaking, he had already rushed over. A terrifying and fierce aura swept over like a tide, fiercely rolling in Ye Yin’s direction.","“Let’s end this. Eight Astonishing Fists!”","Chu Yunfan punched out. The force of his punch twisted and turned into the eight heavenly dragons, capable of suppressing all the powerful enemies.","At this moment, Ye Yin finally realized how terrifying Chu Yunfan was after transforming into a hou.","“How are you so strong?!” Ye Yin roared and tried to resist, but it was useless.","In the blink of an eye, Chu Yunfan’s punch broke through all his defenses and bombarded his body.","Bam!","The earth shook and the mountains shook.","Everyone looked at the scene before them in disbelief. Ye Yin had failed just like that?"]},{"number":1836,"title":"Chapter 1836 Far-Reaching Impact","paragraphs":["1836 Far-Reaching Impact","Everyone was dumbfounded as they looked at the arena barrier that had been blasted through. They knew the arena had been reinforced many times. Even if a true disciple attacked at full force, they would be unable to destroy the barrier.","Everyone saw Chu Yunfan fly forward and sent Ye Yin flying through the arena barrier. Although the arena was already broken before this, Chu Yunfan’s strength still shocked everyone.","“Senior Chu defeated Senior Ye so quickly? It’s a crushing defeat.”","“You’re right. No one would have expected this outcome.”","“Senior Chu crushed Senior Ye after revealing his true strength.”","Many people had unknowingly changed how they addressed Chu Yunfan, calling him “senior.” Chu Yunfan was much younger than them, but most regarded accomplished people as elders. Yang Dengxian was the chief disciple and everyone’s “Big Brother.” However, it did not mean he was the oldest, but the strongest among them.","After displaying his overwhelming strength, Chu Yunfan would no doubt take over Ye Yin’s position. His attacks resembled a storm that took their breaths away. Regardless if anyone admitted it, Ye Yin would have undoubtedly lost.","Everyone looked at Ye Yin, who had suffered a crushing defeat, and the Ironfeather Black Eagle with its severed wings. Then, they looked at the calm Chu Yunfan, who had returned to his human form and was wearing a calm expression.","They finally understood what Chu Yunfan had meant. He was not arrogant, as the situation was nothing to someone who possessed tremendous strength. It was just that no one knew his strength and was unwilling to admit it.","A few in the crowd looked grim. These were the remaining three of the Flying Celestials’ great true disciples. They had considered challenging Chu Yunfan when the prodigy list had just been announced. They had not expected Ye Yin to beat them to it. They were still indignant at that time, but they were relieved after seeing how Chu Yunfan defeated Ye Yin. It would have been over for the trio if they did not stop earlier. The one lying in a pool of blood would have been one of them instead of Ye Yin.","Even they had to admit there was a place for Chu Yunfan among the great true disciples of the Flying Celestials. In the future, it would no longer be the five great true disciples but the six great true disciples.","Chu Yunfan’s cultivation level was far from the other great true disciples. They were at the seventh level of the Cosmos Stage. To the lower-leveled disciples, their higher-ups possessed overwhelming strength. However, Chu Yunfan’s combat strength had surpassed even theirs. It was something that they had to admit.","His cultivation level was not worth mentioning because his combat strength had reached such a level. It was only a matter of time before he increased his level. By then, his strength would increase as well.","They knew they were no longer worthy of being Chu Yunfan’s opponent, even if they were unwilling to admit it. The only person among the Flying Celestials who could suppress him was probably the chief disciple, Yang Dengxian.","Suddenly, a ridiculous thought flashed through their minds. Based on Chu Yunfan’s growth speed, it would not be long before he overthrew Yang Dengxian.","Chu Yunfan had just joined the Flying Celestials. He was an ordinary inner disciple then. Although he had a one-year agreement with Wang Yifan, none took it seriously. Even Wang Yifan was nothing in their eyes.","However, the person they underestimated had created a shocking miracle in such a short period. In the future, he might surpass Yang Dengxian and become the chief disciple. It seemed nothing was impossible.","Soon after, they discarded this ridiculous from their minds. Even the talented Ye Yin, who had the Ye clan’s full support, was not a match for Yang Dengxian. They were the great true disciples, so they understood that although the five seemed to be on equal footing, Yang Dengxian was on another level. He was a powerful existence that could compete with the world.","That was the difference between a top student and a genius. A top student would have limits, while geniuses had none.","Chu Yunfan shook his head, saying, “Such a boring farce.”","If Ye Yin knew Chu Yunfan’s thoughts, the former would be depressed. He was the second of the great true disciples but was now just cannon fodder to Chu Yunfan. Ye Yin was a lamb to slaughter to establish Chu Yunfan’s might. It was unacceptable to the arrogant Ye Yin.","Chu Yunfan did not intend to kill Ye Yin. After all, the situation differed from what happened with Wang Yifan. Although Wang Yifan was a true disciple, he was insignificant in the overall situation. Moreover, he had become a demon.","Meanwhile, Ye Yin had a profound influence on the sect. Many elders and grand elders stood united around him. If Chu Yunfan killed Ye Yin, there would be much more trouble, and neither was it necessary."]},{"number":1837,"title":"Chapter 1837 Promotion to Sixth Great True Disciple","paragraphs":["1837 Promotion to Sixth Great True Disciple","Since he had achieved his goal, Chu Yunfan didn’t kill Ye Yin. Killing too many people from the same sect was not a long-term solution. There would definitely be many people who would criticize him. Even Sect Leader Situ Xuan, who was on his side, would probably be dissatisfied.","Suddenly, just as Chu Yunfan was about to leave, a beam of light swept down from the sky, and a figure appeared before him.","“It’s Eldest Senior! He’s here!”","Everyone recognized this person at a glance. Who else could it be other than Yang Dengxian, the chief disciple?","“Greetings, Eldest Senior!” Everyone bowed.","“No need to be so polite. Junior Chu, please come with me.” Yang Dengxian nodded.","After Yang Dengxian finished speaking, he disappeared from where he stood in a beam of light. Chu Yunfan also disappeared, chasing after the beam of light.","“Is this the end? It’s simply unbelievable. Senior Ye actually lost to Senior Chu!”","“And Senior Chu absolutely crushed Senior Ye! Is this the strength of those on the prodigy list?”","“I finally understand why Senior Brother Ye hasn’t been able to make it onto the prodigy list for so many years. It seems like they’re at the same cultivation level, but their combat strength is probably far apart. With Senior Chu’s strength, he’s only ranked in the top 100. Are the top 99 all monsters?”","Everyone instantly exploded into an uproar. More people were curious about why Yang Dengxian had suddenly appeared after the fight and looked for Chu Yunfan.","***","Chu Yunfan followed Yang Dengxian into a small pavilion on the top of a mountain. Yang Dengxian sat down on a jade stool while Chu Yunfan sat opposite him.","“Congratulations, Junior Chu.” Yang Dengxian glanced at Chu Yunfan and smiled a little.","“Congratulations?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“Firstly, congratulations on defeating Junior Ye. From now on, no one will dare to underestimate you. Secondly, congratulations on becoming one of the six great true disciples of the Flying Celestials,” Yang Dengxian said with a smile.","“Six great true disciples?” Chu Yunfan cocked an eyebrow.","“That’s right.” Yang Dengxian nodded. “From now on, the Flying Celestials will have six great true disciples instead of just five.”","Chu Yunfan naturally understood the benefits of becoming one of the great true disciples. Although they were all true disciples, there were different grades of true disciples. The core of the true disciples was naturally the great true disciples.","If nothing unexpected happened, these great true disciples would be the next sect leader, vice sect leader, and supreme elders. These true disciples would be nurtured in every way.","Being on equal footing with the others was not only in terms of strength but most importantly, in terms of status.","Of course, Chu Yunfan understood that this was what he had fought for after defeating Ye Yin. If he was defeated by Ye Yin, everything would naturally be over. He would be beaten back to his original state and would be regarded as a lucky person.","Though he had killed Wang Yifan and injured Jiang Wan’an, people would think that he was just lucky. At that time, even Situ Xuan, who had thought highly of him, would not care about him as much as he did now. Therefore, the battle with Ye Yin was one he could not afford to lose.","However, Ye Yin was different. Even if he lost and his reputation was damaged, he would still be one of the great true disciples and nothing would change for him. Of course, now that Chu Yunfan had won, there was no need to mention this. Smart people knew what was going on.","Chu Yunfan didn’t have any complaints about this. Such a system was beneficial to him. As long as he continued to show his value, the entire sect would support him with all their might. It was just like how they supported Yang Dengxian. Otherwise, even if Yang Dengxian was a genius, it would be impossible for him to become the twentieth place on the prodigy list.","Yang Dengxian looked at the calm Chu Yunfan, who did not look overjoyed about being promoted to great true disciple. He became a little emotional. At least he had done a good job in maintaining his Qi. When he had been promoted to great true disciple and was confirmed to be the next sect leader, he had been excited for a long time.","However, Chu Yunfan’s rise was too fast, so fast that no one could react in time. Before, he was just an ordinary inner disciple, but now he was qualified to be on equal footing with him. This was simply a miracle.","If Ynag Dengxian hadn’t seen it with his own eyes, he wouldn’t have believed that someone could rise so quickly. In fact, the information that he had received about Chu Yunfan and the Violet Thunder Sword Sect was something that he doubted.","After all, the Violet Thunder Swords once dominated a region and was not necessarily weaker than the current Flying Celestials. However, that was a matter of the past and the Violet Thunder Swords had long declined for god knows how many years. Yang Dengxian did not believe that the sect’s legacy had allowed Chu Yunfan to advance to this level.","“However Junior Chu, although you have defeated Junior Ye and won the recognition of everyone in the sect, there are still many who intend to defeat you to enter the prodigy list,” Yang Dengxian said, “Every time the prodigy list is announced, the last few people will often face endless challenges. It’s not rare for even the experts on the prodigy list to be kicked off their horses. Junior Chu, you appeared too suddenly. There are many people who are surely against you.”","The prodigy list was not completely accurate. After all, there were some people who could block deductions. There were even many who cultivated in the deep mountains and forests. They did not appear in the world, but once they appeared, they would amaze the world. Some people might have a fortuitous encounter and their strength would soar quickly, surpassing the prodigy list. This was also a common thing.","Chu Yunfan sneered. He knew how important the prodigy list was to the younger generation. There were countless geniuses in the world, and there were only a few hundred people on the rankings. Even if they were only at the bottom, it was enough for a sect to do its best to nurture them.","After all, Yang Dengxian was the only one of the Flying Celestials on the list, wasn’t he?"]},{"number":1838,"title":"Chapter 1838 The Support of the Sect","paragraphs":["1838 The Support of the Sect","Among these people, Chu Yunfan’s strength seemed to be the weakest.","Chu Yunfan had defeated Ye Yin with lightning speed, leaving some people with ulterior motives in the sect speechless and completely shocked. But to the experts outside the sect or even those outside the Central Plains, who felt that they could make it onto the prodigy list, he was still not a threat.","“Is this the intention of the higher-ups?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“It’s fine if the prodigy list is wrong, but since you can defeat Junior Ye, it means that the prodigy list isn’t wrong,” Yang Dengxian said.","“You know that I was previously the only one in the Flying Celestials on the list. Now that you’ve suddenly risen, the higher-ups want to ensure that you don’t lose. If you didn’t lose to Junior Ye, then you definitely can’t lose to anyone else. Do you understand what I mean?”","Chu Yunfan immediately understood what Yang Dengxian meant. To the higher-ups of the Flying Celestials, Ye Yin and Chu Yunfan were both disciples of the Flying Celestials. They were flesh on both hands, and Ye Yin’s status was even higher than Chu Yunfan’s. However, it was a different story when compared to the geniuses of other sects.","Obviously, Chu Yunfan was one of them. In that case, there was no doubt about who he would help. The status of the prodigy list was very important. Not only did many geniuses value the ranking of the prodigy list, but the various large sects also valued the prodigy list very much. This proved the strength of the juniors of the various large factions.","This was one of the battlefields where the various large factions fought openly and secretly.","However, the Flying Celestials were in a very awkward position. Although they were known for being full of geniuses and experts, Yang Dengxian was the only one who could make it onto the prodigy list. The other ten great sects all had at least two or more names on the list.","However, geniuses were not born out of thin air. They needed to be searched for and nurtured. They could not be rushed. This was also why Hua Xianyuan was so valued by the Flying Celestials.","Who would have thought that before Hua Xianyuan could rise, Chu Yunfan had already taken the lead?","“The sect leader also values your ranking very much,” Yang Dengxian said, “It’s precisely because of this that I came to find you personally. I should have been in seclusion already. Of course, the sect will also support you,” Yang Dengxian said.","“You will be given one Flying Celestial Fruit and you’re allowed to enter the sect’s library for ten days. You can read any book you want, and you’re allowed to cultivate in the Illusion Moon Cave for a month.”","Listening to Yang Dengxian’s conditions, even Chu Yunfan couldn’t help but be tempted. Chu Yunfan had eaten one Flying Celestial Fruit before, and it was very beneficial for increasing his cultivation. With the fruit, he should be able to advance further.","The library of the Flying Celestials was even more all-encompassing. It contained many martial arts manuals and notes written by many senior experts regarding cultivation. There were also many handwritten letters.","These were all good things that money could not buy. Martial arts manuals aside, under normal circumstances, no matter which martial arts one exchanged for, it would cost a large number of sect points.","As for those cultivation notes, they were all good things that could only be exchanged for by spending sect points. It could even be said that these were the true essence. In particular, the notes and annotations of many seniors were useful to the later generations, saving a lot of cultivation time. This was also a part of the Flying Celestials’s massive foundation.","There were also many records of what one had seen and heard, as well as many other ancient books. These were all secret manuals that were not to be spread to outsiders. All of these constituted the foundation of the Flying Celestials.","Ordinary people might not care much about these ancient books, but whether it was the education Chu Yunfan had received from the Federation or the memories of the Alchemy Sovereign, they all told him that in the process of cultivation, cultivators were constantly exploring the mysteries of heaven and earth. Every expert with a strong cultivation base was a knowledgeable person with an astonishing amount of knowledge. It was not an exaggeration to say that they were proficient in the arts and geography.","On the contrary, those who only knew how to cultivate and were single-minded to the end would often find it difficult to have high cultivation in the end, because such people often had shallow knowledge.","However, to maintain the spirit energy in it, ordinary people were not qualified to enter it to cultivate. Usually, only those who had made great contributions to the sect could use their points to exchange for the right to enter the place to cultivate.","In the Illusion Moon Cave, the spirit energy was extremely dense. At the same time, it would also produce all kinds of inner demons. These inner demons usually lurked and were usually invisible. They would only suddenly appear at the most critical moment of cultivation. By that time, it was often too late. These inner demons were the flaws of the mind. They could be induced in advance in the Illusionary Moon Cave. By eliminating one inner demon, one’s mental state would be more complete.","The Illusion Moon Cave was a holy land for cultivation that everyone yearned for.","The Flying Celestials were investing a lot in Chu Yunfan. His cultivation had advanced by leaps and bounds in recent years. Although his cultivation level was stable, his mental state had improved too quickly, which inevitably buried many seeds of disaster. Although he was usually supported by the godhead and would not waver in his state of mind, he could take this opportunity to cut off his inner demons. This way, his state of mind would not contain flaws and prevent him from reaching the peak.","“These are all the sect’s support for you,” Yang Dengxian said, “I only have one request—beat back all the challengers.”","“I understand.” Chu Yunfan nodded. “With the support of the sect, I have full confidence. It won’t be so easy for those people to step on me.”","Yang Dengxian saw that Chu Yunfan understood what he meant. He said, “In that case, I’m going to enter seclusion. I hope that after I come out, I will hear the news that you’ve gained a firm foothold on the prodigy list.”","After saying that, Yang Dengxian stood up and left. He turned into a streak of light and disappeared into the horizon."]},{"number":1839,"title":"Chapter 1839 Accept All the Challenges Together!","paragraphs":["1839 Accept All the Challenges Together!","“What? Chu Yunfan defeated Brother Ye?”","“Chu Yunfan has been promoted to the position of great true disciple?”","News of this spread throughout the Flying Celestials overnight. There were countless disciples in the sect, and only a small portion of them could rush over to watch the battle. Most of the Flying Celestials disciples were not aware of this, and they did not even care about it. They just treated it as ordinary news.","Many people thought that Ye Yin’s victory was only a matter of time, and Chu Yunfan had no chance of winning. However, the result was a slap to the faces of many people. In their eyes, Chu Yunfan, who had no chance of winning, was the one who won in the end.","And as time passed, the battle of that day was revealed through word of mouth. It wasn’t like what many people thought. Chu Yunfan had defeated Ye Yin through some underhanded methods. In fact, Chu Yunfan had crushed Ye Yin from the beginning to the end. Anyone could see that Chu Yunfan’s strength was far above Ye Yin’s.","At this moment, everyone finally acknowledged Chu Yunfan. To be able to be ranked on the prodigy list was naturally no small matter. Ye Yin was not ranked on the prodigy list, and that seemed to be a matter of course now.","Ye Yin was the second most powerful expert in the Flying Celestials, second only to Yang Dengxian. However, an expert of this level was no match for Chu Yunfan. One could imagine that the experts who could be ranked on the prodigy list were not simple characters. Even someone like Ye Yin was not a match for the prodigies on the prodigy list.","Immediately after, the Flying Celestials announced to the outside world that from now on, the Flying Celestials would go from five great true disciples to six great true disciples.","What was a great true disciple? They were the core of a sect’s true disciples. In every generation, there would not be more than ten great true disciples. This formed a wise contrast with the number of true disciples. These ten people were often the core of the next generation of leaders.","It had been many years since the last great true disciples had been in this situation. Initially, everyone was optimistic that the next person who could become a great true disciple would be none other than Hua Xianyuan. However, that was many years later. Who would have thought that Chu Yunfan would suddenly appear and surpass Hua Xianyuan in an instant, becoming the sixth great true disciple in an instant?","Although the great true disciples were ranked in the same order except for the chief disciple, there was no doubt that Chu Yunfan was a top-notch expert second only to Yang Dengxian.","Everyone could feel that the atmosphere in the sect had changed after this battle. Originally, many people would mock Chu Yunfan for overestimating his strength, but after this battle, all of them disappeared. It was as if they had disappeared without a trace overnight.","The direction of the wind suddenly changed. Everyone changed their tune, and the forces that were originally hostile to Chu Yunfan restrained themselves. Many people said that he had become the pride of the Flying Celestials overnight. After all, in a world of great competition, all the factions were constantly fighting openly and secretly, and the prodigy list was the most direct embodiment of the strength of the younger generation.","Even if one was only ranked 100th, it was still very impressive. The person was definitely the top genius in the world.","At this moment, all kinds of challenge letters flew in like snowflakes. Every letter was a serious challenge letter, and the names behind the challenge letters were all top geniuses who had once shaken the world.","Huang Xuanfei of the Huang clan of the Central Plains, Sad Arrow, the heir of the Sad Path Sect, Zhang Beidou of the Holy Puppet Sect, and Xia Yi of the Divine Maidens...","Each name was an outstanding person among the younger generation. They had been famous for many years. Although they were not on the prodigy list, they were not far off. In the eyes of many people, they had the strength to enter the prodigy list.","It was just that there were only 100 spots on the prodigy list, and many people who were not on the prodigy list might not be inferior to the experts on the prodigy list. This was publicly acknowledged by everyone.","In the past, any random person who appeared in the Flying Celestials would cause a commotion among the disciples. Even the great true disciples of the sect had to personally welcome them. Not to mention that so many big shots had come in one breath. Everyone felt dazzled and dizzy.","However, at this moment, Chu Yunfan announced that he would go into seclusion and not accept any challenges for the time being. It immediately caused a huge uproar. Everyone thought that Chu Yunfan was admitting defeat and did not dare to accept the challenge, that was why he put away all the challenge letters.","Everyone was boiling with excitement. Chu Yunfan’s intention was not to accept the challenges one by one but to accept them all in one go. He clearly did not think much of these geniuses.","“Chu Yunfan, I’d like to see how he’s going to deal with so many of us.”","“You’re so arrogant. It’s just three months. Even if I give you three years, nothing will change!”","“Hmph, a final struggle.”","The group of geniuses sneered and left. However, Chu Yunfan couldn’t hear these words at the moment. At this moment, he was standing before the Flying Celestial Library.","With a loud creaking sound, the two huge stone doors slowly opened, and a scholarly air rushed out. Different from the books recorded on the jade slips outside, the books in this library were all thread-bound books. Each book occupied a separate bookshelf, and the range of this bookshelf was like an independent kingdom. Above these bookshelves, there were barriers that were activated to isolate these books.","Chu Yunfan’s eyes lit up when he saw them. These books were not ordinary books. Each book had the imprint of the original author. Under the protection of the barrier, even with the passage of time, they would not be damaged. Different books could evolve into completely different essence, qi, and spirit, and even evolve into a world.","Chu Yunfan looked at the rows of martial arts manuals on the bookshelves. There were images of martial arts masters who were practicing different techniques."]},{"number":1840,"title":"Chapter 1840 The Library, Crazy Absorption","paragraphs":["1840 The Library, Crazy Absorption","This scene was an eye-opener for Chu Yunfan!","These images were practicing martial arts day and night. The person who imprinted these martial arts techniques must be a powerful martial arts expert.","These martial arts secret manuals were not cultivated like ordinary martial arts secret manuals. Instead, one could sink one’s divine will into them and comprehend them directly. This way, the comprehension speed was ten times or even dozens of times faster than ordinary martial arts secret manuals.","Only some extremely precious martial arts secret manuals would be preserved in this way, and in this library, there were all extremely precious secret manuals. Being able to meditate here for ten days was a rare fortuitous encounter. It was even more important than improving his cultivation. These were all improvements in Chu Yunfan’s martial arts knowledge. How far he could go in the future was closely related to this.","Since he only had ten days, Chu Yunfan didn’t hesitate to enter. However, he didn’t choose to check the martial arts manuals. For others, this was a rare opportunity to learn martial arts, but for Chu Yunfan, with the Alchemy Emperor’s memories and the Mighty Emperor Battle Book, he had no lack of powerful martial arts and divine powers.","What Chu Yunfan knew was probably more than the library. Therefore, he chose to only check out the book on the Flying Celestial Palm Strikes.","He quickly found the manual of the Flying Celestial Palm Strike and sent his spirit into it. Suddenly, he seemed to have entered another space. A figure that seemed to be able to support the heavens and the earth began to practice the Flying Celestial Palm Strike in front of him.","A huge hand that reached the sky suddenly slapped out. It contained the supreme laws of the Great Dao. Just this palm alone seemed to smash a huge hole in the world.","The giant hand had only landed for a short moment, but Chu Yunfan felt as if a century had passed. He suddenly gained a lot of enlightenment about the Flying Celestial Palm Strike.","“What a powerful spiritual imprint. I’ve only seen it once, and I’ve comprehended it to such an extent.”","Chu Yunfan felt that his understanding of the Flying Celestial Palm Strike was at least fifty to sixty percent, although this was related to the godhead and its extraordinary comprehension and analysis ability. the imprint of the Flying Celestial Palm Strike was no doubt powerful.","The strength of this Flying Celestials senior who had imprinted the Flying Celestial Palm Strike far exceeded Chu Yunfan’s current strength. Chu Yunfan could not be compared to him at all.","Very soon, another Flying Celestial Palm Strike was used. Chu Yunfan immediately held his breath and focused on comprehending.","A moment later, Chu Yunfan finally came out of this state of enlightenment.","“The Flying Celestial Palm Strike is indeed exquisite. It’s indeed the ultimate technique of the sect,” Chu Yunfan said to himself.","He had finally completely comprehended the Flying Celestial Palm Strike. It was almost as if he had copied it. His speed of comprehension was as fast as it could be. If people knew about his speed of comprehension, it would probably shake the Flying Celestials. However, it took Chu Yunfan 500,000 medium-grade spirit stones to finally succeed.","After he finished comprehending the Flying Celestial Palm Strike, Chu Yunfan immediately checked the cultivation notes of many senior experts. These senior experts’ notes were treasures that could not be bought with money. Those who could leave their own cultivation notes in this library were all experts above the Creation Stage. Their cultivation realm was even higher than Chu Yunfan’s.","If he wanted to break through the limits of the Cosmos Stage and reach the Creation Stage, the most important thing was his understanding of the Creation Stage. The more he comprehended about the Creation Stage, the more likely it was for his battle prowess to break through and complete a qualitative transformation. Otherwise, even if his cultivation level improved, it would be impossible for him to break through to the Creation Stage.","Unlike the Cosmos Stage, after breaking through to the Creation Stage, one’s combat strength would change tremendously. Under normal circumstances, one would not be able to break through to the Creation Stage. When that happened, no matter how many times Chu Yunfan broke through, his combat strength would not be able to break through.","The cultivation notes left behind by the senior experts were extremely precious to Chu Yunfan. These notes recorded many insights into the Creation Stage. To him, they were all extremely precious resources. His learning speed was very fast. With the help of the godhead, he could record many books with a glance. This was a speed that no one else could imagine.","“What is this Chu Yunfan doing? It’s impossible to remember it with just a glance,” an elder wondered in confusion.","However, this was only true for ordinary books. It was completely different for the books in this library. What these books recorded were not words, but the mental imprints left behind by experts. It was impossible to record this kind of spiritual imprint with just a glance. It required one to completely calm down and integrate one’s spirit energy into it before it was possible.","Putting it down after a glance was almost no different from not looking at it.","“Maybe he’s choosing,” another elder said.","The two of them were baffled. They had seen many geniuses who were allowed to enter to comprehend and cultivate, but none of them were like Chu Yunfan, who had to flip through almost all the books. Usually, they would know what kind of books they wanted from the start and read them accordingly.","However, they had nothing to say about Chu Yunfan’s choice. After all, this was his own choice, and Chu Yunfan only had ten days to comprehend here.","Chu Yunfan did not know what the two elders were thinking. To him, there were only ten days. Every minute and every second was precious. This was a rare opportunity. Through the godhead, he only needed to take a look and he could quickly copy and record everything.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even have the time to comprehend it. He could only keep flipping through and copying the various records in the notebook. There were millions of books in the library. Who knew how many books the Flying Celestials had collected? Even he had to choose which books to read.","After ten days, Chu Yunfan managed to finish reading all the notes."]},{"number":1841,"title":"Chapter 1841 Illusion Moon Cave, Inner Demon Appears","paragraphs":["1841 Illusion Moon Cave, Inner Demon Appears","For full ten days, Chu Yunfan was like a sponge, crazily absorbing knowledge. He just memorized them and did not fully comprehend it. However, just remembering so much knowledge would be of unimaginable help to Chu Yunfan.","This made it easier for him to infer other things from one instance. In addition, there were many Creaters’ comprehension of the Creation Stage recorded in these book. This was an extremely rare experience. This was a treasure that could not be bought with money.","With these seniors’ notes and painstaking experiences as the foundation, he truly had the foundation to increase his combat strength to another level. In just ten days, Chu Yunfan’s harvest was even more than his years of cultivation. This harvest would continue to ferment over time and become the cornerstone for him to advance to a higher level.","Ten days later, Chu Yunfan left the library.","“Chu Yunfan is pretty smart. He knows that time is limited. Compared to a certain martial art, those seniors’ handwritten notes are more important. A certain divine abilities can be exchanged for points outside, but these seniors’ handwritten notes are the essence of this library. Only those who are allowed to enter can see them.”","“That’s right. It’s a pity. Although he understands this principle, he’s reading too quickly. It’s as if he’s flipping through it casually. It’s such a pity that these ten days have been wasted.”","“I wonder what he’s up to. Is the sect leader really placing all his hopes on Chu Yunfan?”","The two elders guarding the library discussed animatedly as if they knew something.","At this time, Chu Yunfan left the library and went straight to the depths of the Illusion Moon Cave. This cave was located in a half-plane within the Flying Celestials. It could only be reached through a teleportation array.","The security outside the Illusionary Moon Cave was tight. Chu Yunfan sensed that when he arrived, several powerful divine wills swept down. After confirming that it was him, they turned their gazes away. These people were at least at the Creation Stage.","Chu Yunfan was speechless. There were indeed many experts in the Flying Celestials. However, this also proved the importance of the Illusionary Moon Cave.","Chu Yunfan then heard an old but deep voice say, “You have two months. Just come out on time after two months and don’t linger.”","“Understood,” he answered.","After stepping into the teleportation array, Chu Yunfan’s vision blurred and he appeared in another space. Spirit energy that had condensed into liquid was everywhere. It was extremely pure and did not need to be refined. It could be made into the energy that one needed.","This was very rare. Even the rich spirit energy in the Flying Celestials was impure to an expert like Chu Yunfan. He needed to refine it before he could use it. This was why spirit stones were considered hard currency. The spirit energy contained in spirit stones had long been sorted out time and time again, and its purity was many times purer than the spirit energy in the air.","However, the spirit energy in the Illusion Moon Cave was different. Not only was the spirit energy extremely dense, but its purity was also very high. It even surpassed middle-grade spirit stones and was equivalent to the purity of high-grade spirit stones. Chu Yunfan could absorb this energy directly.","He immediately found a place and began to absorb the spirit energy that filled the sky. Every time he took a breath, he could see countless spirit energy around him being absorbed into his stomach like two long dragons.","Chu Yunfan’s stomach bulged, and all the spirit energy he absorbed was concentrated in his stomach. A moment later, his stomach deflated, and he had absorbed all the spirit energy. At the same time, his aura became stronger.","“The purity is unbelievably high.” He sighed.","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan’s vision blurred, and the environment around him changed drastically. A room full of modern atmosphere appeared in front of him.","A crisp voice came from behind Chu Yunfan. A young girl sitting in an electronic wheelchair came from the room to Chu Yunfan. This girl was much smaller than her peers, but her face was filled with optimism and determination.","“Wash your hands and get ready to eat!”","Another woman’s voice came from the kitchen. A slender figure came out with a bowl of monster meat. Who else could it be but Chu Yunfan’s mother, Yang Yayun?","“I’m home!”","It was a middle-aged man’s voice. The door was pushed open, and a middle-aged man dressed like an office worker strode in. It was his father, Chu Wencheng.","“Did you behave yourself today?” Chu Wencheng touched Chu Qingxuan’s forehead with a face full of pity. Then, he looked at Chu Yunfan and asked, “What’s wrong?” How was class today? What did you learn?”","“Dad... Mom... Xuan Xuan... I miss you guys so much...”","Chu Yunfan felt himself tear up. Even when facing life and death situations, he had never shed a single tear. But now that he saw these familiar faces in front of him, he felt a lump in his throat.","“Silly child, what are you saying? If you miss us, just don’t leave,” Yang Yayun said with a smile as she put down the monster meat in her hand.","“I want to be with you guys too. I will go home to you guys sooner or later, but not right now. Please forgive me.”","Chu Yunfan put away the longing in his heart. He stretched out his hand toward the three, and a violent divine power surged out, shattering the scene before him. His parents and sister smiled, then turned into a ball of light and disappeared.","Chu Yunfan’s vision blurred again, and he returned to the Illusion Moon Cave. What he saw just now was just a scene brought on by his inner demon. He had not really returned to the Federation."]},{"number":1842,"title":"Chapter 1842 Multitasking, Crazy Comprehension","paragraphs":["1842 Multitasking, Crazy Comprehension","There was no doubt that this was the work of inner demons. His inner demons had discerned Chu Yunfan’s feelings and triggered the scene that he missed the most. However, Chu Yunfan’s heart was firm, so it was impossible for him to be affected by this illusion.","For any cultivator, inner demons were a huge problem. In the process of cultivation, they would often encounter all kinds of problems. When these problems accumulated, they would form inner demons.","There was a race of demons from beyond the heavens that were called inner demons. Once the inner demons were extremely serious, they could develop into true inner demons with consciousness. If one’s will was not strong enough, they would not be able to resist the inner demons and might be possessed by the inner demons. Such a thing was not uncommon in the past and present.","Once the inner demons were broken, one’s state of mind would be greatly consolidated. In the future, one’s cultivation would advance by leaps and bounds, and there would be great progress. Therefore, for cultivators, the inner demons were both a huge problem and a huge opportunity. It all depended on whether they could seize this opportunity.","Just as Chu Yunfan broke through one of the inner demons, he appeared in another environment. It was a vast expanse of yellow sand. Under the boundless starry sky, there were dilapidated prisons everywhere.","On the city wall, two figures leaned against each other. Their body temperature and fragrance surrounded their noses.","A warm and soft hand held Chu Yunfan’s palm. He then turned his head and smiled brightly. It was as if the world had frozen overnight, leaving only this smile.","This was an unforgettable scene.","“Yunfan, let’s just stay here like this for the rest of our lives.” Tang Siyu leaned her head on Chu Yunfan’s shoulder. They were so close that they could hear each other’s heartbeats.","Chu Yunfan came back to his senses. Wasn’t this scene the night he and Tang Siyu got engaged during the college entrance examination? The various dangers he had experienced back then had now turned into a beautiful picture.","In the distance, many ferocious figures were approaching. Those criminals who had made him feel like he was facing a great enemy before seemed like a joke now. Returning to his old place, his mentality was completely different.","Chu Yunfan patted Tang Siyu’s head and said, “I’m sorry. I can’t stay here forever. This place may contain some of my best memories, but don’t worry, I’ll find you again.”","“Okay, I’ll be waiting for you.” Tang Siyu smiled sweetly. Her eyes were filled with passion.","“Wait for me, Siyu.” Chu Yunfan hit Tang Siyu with his palm. She turned into a ball of light and disappeared before his eyes.","Chu Yunfan’s vision blurred, and he returned to the Illusion Moon Cave. This time, his expression was a little gloomy. However, he immediately threw these thoughts to the back of his mind because he knew that now was not the time for him to be dispirited. Tang Siyu was waiting for him to find her. He did not have much time to be dispirited.","Chu Yunfan was secretly speechless. The frequency of the environment here was too high. In just a short time, two scenes had appeared before him. Although he had easily seen through these illusions, these inner demons sure easily lured out the greatest desire in the depths of one’s heart. If it was an ordinary person, without a godhead to suppress their divine soul, they would probably be easily affected. Even if they were careful, they could still be affected. After all, these illusions were the scenes that they desired the most and the scenes that they feared the most.","It all came from within oneself. Once there was the slightest hesitation, more inner demons would take advantage of the situation and enter, resulting in energy deviations. Such a situation was not rare since ancient times.","As Chu Yunfan absorbed the spirit energy between heaven and earth, he felt that his power was increasing. At the same time, some images from his inner demons would appear in front of his eyes from time to time.","Blade mountains and sea of fire, the eighteen levels of hell, a life-and-death battle, and Chu Yunfan even saw the scene of his own tragic death. It could be said that all kinds of inner demons took turns to appear.","Chu Yunfan was shocked when he saw many of these scenes, because these scenes came from the deepest part of his soul. Some of them were his desires and some were his fears. Every single one of them shook his soul.","While dealing with his inner demons and absorbing the high-quality spirit energy in the Illusion Moon Cave, Chu Yunfan also diverted his attention to comprehend the things recorded in the notes from the library.","Chu Yunfan had a miniature version of the library in his mind. Although most of them were cultivation notes and experiences of Creators, it was still extremely shocking. The ten days in the library were too short, so he did not have much time to comprehend. Just that alone was very urgent.","At the same time, he had used up all the spirit stones in his Mountain River Diagram because using the godhead required a huge amount of energy. Now that the sky was filled with spirit energy that was of a higher quality than middle-grade spirit stones, he could take this opportunity to comprehend as well as sort out his inner demons.","After using the godhead, Chu Yunfan’s speed of absorbing the spirit energy was ten times faster. At the same time, countless books appeared in his mind and he began to analyze them. His understanding of the Great Dao and the Creation Stage improved at an astonishing speed. He even dared to say that his understanding of the Creation Stage had surpassed Li Qianyuan’s, who had already entered the Creation Stage.","At the same time, he dealt with all kinds of inner demons. If it was an ordinary person, they would have gone crazy long ago.","Chu Yunfan’s actions quickly attracted the attention of the grand elders guarding the Illusion Moon Cave. The elders were instantly stunned. Although this high-quality spirit energy was good, it contained a lot of energy. Even a Creator would have exploded and died if they absorbed crazily like Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":1843,"title":"Chapter 1843 Breakthrough, Third Cosmos Stage","paragraphs":["1843 Breakthrough, Third Cosmos Stage","The few elders looked at each other and understood each other. The moment Chu Yunfan showed the slightest sign of exhaustion, they would stop his crazy absorption of spirit energy.","These people were grand elders, so they naturally understood that in every generation, the geniuses who could squeeze into the prodigy list were the pillars of the Flying Celestials. These geniuses were the core disciples of the sect, and they must not encounter any problems here. Otherwise, the elders would be held accountable.","Although there were many grand elders in the sect who were hostile to Chu Yunfan because of Jiang Wan’an, most people did not feel much about it. On the contrary, they all wanted him to rise. grand elders had long since become one with the Flying Celestials, so the better the Flying Celestials were, the better they would be too.","“Let’s observe him for now. If anything goes wrong, we’ll interrupt him,” one of the grand elders said, and the others nodded.","Chu Yunfan didn’t know what these grand elders were thinking. He was already immersed in the process of crazily improving himself. To him, although it was not a direct increase in strength, it was an increase in his comprehension of the Great Dao.","He could at least unleash 10% more combat strength than before. Even though it was only 10%, the slightest difference could cause a fatal gap in a battle between peak experts, let alone such a huge difference. And this was not the limit. If Chu Yunfan’s cultivation level did not advance further, his combat strength could still exceed the limit and create a new record.","The grand elders looked at Chu Yunfan carefully, afraid that something would happen to him. But soon, they realized that although he absorbed spirit energy quickly, he digested it even faster. Although they didn’t know how Chu Yunfan did it, they heaved a sigh of relief. Now that the entire sect was focused on Chu Yunfan, they didn’t dare to let anything happen to him.","Two months passed in the blink of an eye.","“And your time is up. You are to leave now.”","Chu Yunfan got the hint and exited his seclusion.","“Two months sure go by quickly.” Chu Yunfan stretched, and his entire body made crackling sounds.","Two months was like a fleeting white horse to him. However, the things he comprehended in these two months were not things that ordinary people could imagine.","With such a foundation, Chu Yunfan was confident that he had combat strength of the Creation Stage as a Cosmic. This was because he had completely grasped the secrets of the Creation Stage.","After leaving the Illusion Moon Cave, Chu Yunfan brought out the Flying Celestial Fruit and ate it. In an instant, a terrifying energy surged out of the fruit and spread into his limbs and bones.","Chu Yunfan was not in a hurry. He slowly began to circulate the Emperor Method to absorb the energy from the fruit. He stepped on the light and headed in the direction of Startling Cloud Peak. As he sped past, the aura on his body surged, forming a rolling auspicious cloud above his head. It was a sign that terrifying divine power was surging.","Chu Yunfan’s aura grew inch by inch, breaking through the original limit. When he arrived at Startling Cloud Peak, his aura had completely changed. He had broken through to the third level of the Cosmos Stage.","A moment later, the surging aura above his head converged into his body, and he seemed to be no different from before. Only he knew that he had stepped into the third Cosmos Stage. His combat strength had increased by ten times, reaching the seventh Cosmos Stage. Moreover, he was one of the best among the seventh-level Cosmics.","If Chu Yunfan wanted to defeat Ye Yin now, he would not need to rely on his hou form. He would have the strength to defeat Ye Yin.","One could imagine how much he had improved in such a short time. To him, this was simple. It could be said that it was the easiest breakthrough he had ever made since he started cultivating.","Chu Yunfan finally understood why the ancient people’s cultivation speed increased so quickly after a night of enlightenment. There were even legends of them ascending during the day. This was because his comprehension was far above his current level. It was only a matter of time before his combat strength increased.","However, Chu Yunfan;s breakthrough was not over yet. After breaking through to the third Cosmos Stage, he felt that everything in front of him was flat. He no longer felt that his vision was blocked by mountains. If he was given a few more days, he could break through to the peak of the third Cosmos Stage. By then, he would not even be afraid of an expert at the peak of the Cosmos Stage. They would simply be no match for him.","Those who had issued challenges thought that Chu Yunfan was not worthy of being on the prodigy list. Little did they know that his combat strength had already undergone earth-shattering changes.","“Half a month. There’s still half a month left. By then, I’ll show them that they’re absolutely wrong.” Chu Yunfan stood with his hands behind his back, his gaze skyward. He didn’t care about those who had issued him challenge letters. His real target was still Li Qianyuan.","Chu Yunfan thought that with his current strength, he should be able to compete with Li Qianyuan. However, now that Li Qianyuan had broken through to the Creation Stage, his combat strength was far better than Chu Yunfan’s.","“After dealing with these challenges, I will focus on breaking through. I will then have the strength to compete with Li Qianyuan and even find a way to kill him.” Chu Yunfan’s eyes carried a cold glint.","He that if his thoughts were to be known, many people would be scared to death. Li Qianyuan was the number one person of the younger generation, and his cultivation was invincible. Ordinary people would not dare to go against him, let alone think of ways to kill him. This in itself was a crazy idea.","However, the battle between the two of them would break out sooner or later. It was only a matter of time."]},{"number":1844,"title":"Chapter 1844 The Battle Begins, All the Geniuses Gather","paragraphs":["1844 The Battle Begins, All the Geniuses Gather","Three months passed in the blink of an eye. For many cultivators, this was just a small period of seclusion. Those prodigies who had issued challenge letter rushed over come over.","Three months ago, Chu Yunfan had accepted all the challenges thrown his way. This matter caused quite a stir within Grand Xia, especially among the geniuses of the younger generation. They all wanted to meet this person who had just entered the prodigy list and caused such a huge commotion.","“Have you heard? There are quite a number of geniuses coming.”","“That’s right. Senior Chu has really offended them.”","“He accepted so many challenges and grouped them all together. He simply has no respect for them.”","In this battle for the top 100 on the prodigy list, Chu Yunfan of the Flying Celestials came to be a huge target. After he defeated Ye Yin, he was immediately promoted to great true disciple. In the eyes of ordinary disciples, he became second only to Yang Dengxian.","Strength was the foundation of everything, and Chu Yunfan had defeated Ye Yin, who was originally ranked second. In the eyes of many people, he naturally replaced Ye Yin as the second-ranked great true disciple.","Chu Yunfan’s battle today was not only related to his personal honor, but was also related to the Flying Celestials’ honor","There were at least a thousand Flying Celestial disciples present, and the weakest of them were elite disciples. There were also many true disciples and elders above them. These people formed one side, and on the other side stood a group of people who were far fewer than the Flying Celestial disciples.","There were only a few dozen people in total on the opposite side, but their auras soared to the sky. They faintly suppressed the Flying Celestial disciples who were in a group of more than a thousand people.","There were many more elite disciples, inner, and fringe disciples of the Flying Celestials around, but their strength was lower and they were not qualified to come any closer. Fortunately, even the weakest fringe disciple was at least in the Golden Core Stage. Their eyes were like torches, and even from a distance, they could see clearly.","There were thousands of people, and they looked extremely terrifying.","“There are so many masters here. Is the one with the bow the heir of the Sad Path Sect, Sorrow Arrow?” Someone pointed at a man who was dressed in a black and carried a bow on his back.","“Yeah, that’s Sorrow Arrow. It’s said he once shot an arrow thousands of miles away and killed a Cosmic demon. He became famous in that battle. Although Sad Path isn’t a super sect, they have many outstanding successors in every generation. Nearly half of the top experts in archery come from Sad Path. Sorrow Arrow is one of the best.”","In the knowledge of many people, the Sad Path was one of the few sect with an archery inheritance. Every generation of the sect would produce many powerful archery experts, and their names shook the world. On the prodigy list, there was the heir of the Sad Path, but there was only one person.","“The one with the puppet on his back should be Zhang Beidou from the Holy Puppets. It’s said that his Big Dipper Puppet Formation can contend with an army and easily kill Cosmics. He’s extremely talented.”","The disciples of the Flying Celestials quickly turned to look at Zhang Beidou. The Holy Puppet Sect was the same as the Flying Celestials. They were both one of the ten great sects. They were extremely powerful in Grand Xia.","This was especially true for the puppets created by this sect. They were a force that Grand Xia relied on greatly. It was said that there was always an incomparably powerful puppet army in Grand Xia. In terms of strength, they were even stronger than ordinary elites.","“And that’s the new divine maiden of the Divine Maiden House. Although she’s not on the prodigy list, she is the youngest among them. In terms of strength, she’s comparable to the old prodigies.”","Divine Maiden House was one of the top ten sects in Grand Xia. The most special thing about this sect was that they only accepted female disciples. The disciples of the Divine Maidens were all beautiful like flowers, and their talent and strength were extremely powerful. They were not inferior to male disciples in the slightest.","The disciples of the Divine Maidens had connections all over Grand Xia. There had always been a saying that it was better to provoke the Destiny Sect than the Divine Maidens.","“There’s also Huang Xuanfei from the Huang clan of the Central Prefecture. The Huang clan is the pillar of the Imperial Court. Huang Xuanfei joined the army since he was young and has made countless contributions to the Imperial Court.”","Huang Xuanfei, who was dressed in military armor, was the focus of everyone’s attention. Huang clan was known as the leader of many aristocratic families in the world and the leader of the generals in the Imperial Court. It was the only aristocratic family among the ten great powers of Grand Xia, and was known as the number one aristocratic family.","There were countless experts in the Huang clan, and there had been an endless stream of experts throughout the generations. There had been many experts who had joined the army, and there were countless students and old officials in the army. They were also inextricably linked to the Imperial Court. Throughout the generations, they had all married into the imperial family. They were no doubt the leader of the aristocratic families.","Among the outsiders, these four people were the leaders. Each of them had a huge reputation and had a powerful background.","In Grand Xia, the strongest power was naturally the Imperial Court, followed by the ten superpowers. After that, there were sects like the Sad Path. Although they were not as powerful as the top ten forces, they were sects with deep foundations. Each sect had countless experts and was a first-class force.","The first-class forces had the strength to influence matters within a country, but the top ten forces had the strength to influence the world. The influence of the first-class forces was limited to the provinces and counties.","The rest of the people were all from powerful backgrounds. They were at least from first-class forces and were world-famous geniuses. Their strength was at least among the best in the Cosmos Stage. Even if they had not reached the seventh evel, they were at least at the fifth or sixth Level.","Many of the Flying Celestials disciples had grave expressions on their faces. There was no doubt that these people would pose a huge threat to Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":1845,"title":"Chapter 1845 Chu Yunfan Appears","paragraphs":["1845 Chu Yunfan Appears","No matter how confident they were in Chu Yunfan, they couldn’t help but feel nervous.","This man was about 30 years old and was handsome and extraordinary. He possessed a tough aura and his expression was full of arrogance.","“Is that ‘Saber Wild’ Lin Dingtian from the Godly Sabers?”","The crowd looked at this black-clothed man in disbelief as if they could not believe it was really him.","“That’s right, it’s him. There’s no mistake. That black robe, the saber on his back, and that arrogant expression, it’s Lin Dingtian!”","“Senior Liu, is this Saber Wild very strong?”","In the crowd, Chu Hongcai asked Liu Wenjing, who was leaning against him, with a serious expression. But before Liu Wenjing could say anything, another figure appeared beside her—Zhantai Xuan.","Zhantai Xuan had an oppressive aura, but everyone present looked at her with a somewhat surprised expression. Everyone understood that if one could control it well, they could control their aura freely, which proved that their cultivation level was smooth. However, if one carried a powerful aura at all times, unless one was deliberately targeting an enemy, it meant that one’s cultivation level was not stable.","With Zhantai Xuan’s strength, it was impossible for her cultivation to be unstable unless she had just broken through to a new level, which was the seventh level of the Cosmos Stage.","The people around here were all close to Zhantai Xuan, so they were naturally happy to see her strength improve. This was especially true for those who had stepped into the seventh level of the Cosmos Stage. They were at the top of the current geniuses.","Zhantai Xuan naturally understood the meaning behind everyone’s gazes, but she smiled bitterly. She knew that although she was currently standing on the same level as those geniuses, she had only just entered this level. Those geniuses had already been in this level for many years and were preparing to break through to the Creation Stage. Some of them, like Li Qiankun, had already entered the Creation Stage. It was only temporary that their levels was about the same.","Although she had outstanding talent, cultivation resources, and many fortuitous encounters, those geniuses were all stronger than her. Just keeping up with the top 100 of the prodigy list, the number one group among them, was already exhausting. It was easier said than done to surpass them.","Zhantai Xuan quickly calmed herself before saying, “Saber Wild is indeed very strong. His ranking on the prodigy list is even higher than of Chu Yunfan’s. He’s ranked 95th on the prodigy list. Since he’s ranked like this, his combat strength is probably even higher than Chu Yunfan’s.”","Hearing Zhantai Xuan’s words, everyone’s expression turned solemn.","“I didn’t expect this battle to attract him.” Zhantai Xuan sneered. “Although I don’t know what the Godly Sabers are thinking, there must be someone behind this. The Flying Celestials wants to ensure that Chu Yunfan doesn’t lose his ranking on the prodigy list, but someone wants to embarrass our sect. Maybe they’re here for him. Even if Chu Yunfan defeats all those people before him, if he loses to Saber Wild in the end, the consequences will be unimaginable. The prestige he just established will be smashed into dust.”","When everyone heard this, they finally understood why so many true disciples and elders had solemn expressions on their faces. Saber Wild’s arrival was clearly hostile in nature. They were here for Chu Yunfan. Many people understood this, otherwise, the Godly Saber would not have appeared.","Chu Yunfan was very impressive to be 100th the prodigy list, right? Then they just sent a genius who was ranked higher than him.","Those who came did not come with good intentions, and those who had good intentions did not come.","“Why are you here?” Sorrow Arrow asked Saber Wild, his brows furrowed.","He had figured out Saber Wild’s motive, but this did not mean that he had a good relationship with him. Just the nickname “Saber Wild” was enough to know Lin Dingtian’s character. Almost no one present had a good relationship with him. It was just that due to his powerful strength that no one dared to flare up.","He sneered. “I heard that you were looked down upon by a junior. Tsk, tsk. Accepting all of your challenges in one go, how arrogant!”","“It’s just a monkey claiming to be king when there’s no tiger.” Sorrow Arrow fiddled with the bow, his eyes filled with disdain.","Although Sorrow Arrow had not entered the prodigy list, he did not feel that he was inferior to those prodigies on the prodigy list, especially to those who were ranked at the bottom. They were extremely close in strength and did not take them seriously.","But then, he glanced at Xia Yi, Huang Xuanfei, and Zhang Beidou. These three people seemed to be his allies at the moment, but once he defeated Chu Yunfan, they would become competitors.","Huang Xuanfei and the others immediately understood what Sorrow Arrow meant. At this time, Xia Yi said, “We shouldn’t fight among ourselves right now. Let’s wait until we defeat Chu Yunfan before we decide who’s better. How about that?”","“Sure!” Huang Xuanfei nodded. He didn’t want an internal conflict to break out before he fought Chu Yunfan.","“Then who will go first?” Zhang Beidou said.","“I will,” Sorrow Arrow said firmly as he stood up.","Of course, the other three didn’t want to let go of this opportunity. After all, whoever defeated Chu Yunfan first might be able to replace him on the prodigy list.","Saber Wild crossed his arms and looked at everything coldly as if he was watching a group of ants fighting. His arrogant attitude was obvious.","Suddenly, just as everyone was debating, they heard a clap of thunder. A figure stepped on lightning and rushed over. He was a young man in his twenties, wearing a moon-white robe with golden edges. He stood with his hands behind his back, his expression calm, like a god.","Chu Yunfan was here!"]},{"number":1846,"title":"Chapter 1846 Attack Together, I’m in a Hurry!","paragraphs":["1846 Attack Together, I’m in a Hurry!","Chu Yunfan finally appeared!","Back then, Chu Yunfan had accepted everyone’s challenge letter in one go, which had shocked everyone. Now, it was finally time to end it. In the eyes of many people, it was time to pull out a mule or a horse. Whether Chu Yunfan’s strength was as strong as he had shown, it was finally time to see.","“You’re finally here.” Sorrow Arrow’s eyes went wide. His eyes were like sharp swords, and they were aimed at Chu Yunfan.","“Yeah, I’m here,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently. Then, he swept his gaze across the crowd, and his gaze fell on Saber Wild. He was not familiar with Saber Wild. However, he soon found out about his identity.","During this period, although Chu Yunfan had been in seclusion, all kinds of information were sent to him continuously. Some were sent by his followers led by Chu Hongcai and You Chuyun. There were admirers throughout the sect who sent Chu Yunfan information. There were even higher-ups of the sect who sent over information about the people on the prodigy list.","Of course, Chu Yunfan accepted all the information with a smile. Although he was stunned for a moment, he quickly realized Saber Wild’s identity.","“‘Saber Wild’ Lin Dingtian,” Chu Yunfan said.","“Oh, you know who I am.” Lin Dingtian grinned, his face filled with malevolence as he stared at Chu Yunfan. “You’re more knowledgeable than I expected. I’m a little curious as to why the Msyterious Pavillion listed you on the prodigy list. You’re not even at the peak of the Cosmos Stage. The list must be wrong.”","Saber Wild showed absolute hostility toward Chu Yunfan from the start, and even a little contempt. He thought that he had completely seen through Chu Yunfan’s cultivation. Chu Yunfan was only at the beginning stage of the Cosmos Stage. How could he be qualified to be on the list?","As for Chu Yunfan defeating Ye Yin, although Saber Wild had heard about it, he did not believe it. After all, it was news from the Flying Celestials. Of course, the Flying Celestials would deliberately release false news to support their people. Although such behavior was despicable, it was not impossible. After all, everyone knew that only one person from the Flying Celestials was on the rankings previously. This was undoubtedly a slap in the face for the Flying Celestials, which was ranked among the top ten sects.","At this time, it was not strange to forcefully think of a way to promote another person.","“That’s right. I also think that the prodigy list must be wrong,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","“Even you think so. It seems that you still have some self-awareness.” Saber Wild laughed coldly, his gaze extremely wild.","“I feel that you have been ranked wrongly on the prodigy list. Who do you think you are? Do you think you’re worthy of being ranked above me?” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly.","“You... You b*stard... You sure are bold and arrogant!” Lin Dingtian was so angry that he laughed. “This is the first time I’ve met someone who’s more arrogant than me. Well done!","“However, your arrogance won’t save your life. Do you think that you’re safe just because you’re on the prodigy list? Do you know how many people are eliminated every year? Especially people like you who are just lucky!” Lin Dingtian calmed down quickly. “I dislike people who are more arrogant than me. If it was any other time, I would definitely chop off your head and use it as a urinal. However, the people who wish to challenge you today isn’t me, and you’re not worthy of me challenging you.”","Lin Dingtian crossed his arms and looked like he was watching a good show. Although he was angered by Chu Yunfan, he felt that Chu Yunfan was no match for him. After all, his ranking was above Chu Yunfan. Even if the Mysteries Pavilion had misjudged Chu Yunfan’s strength, he was still stronger than Chu Yunfan.","“Cut off my head and use it as a urinal?” Chu Yunfan’s eyes flashed with a cold light. “If this generation, you’re the only one on the rankings. However, I think the Godly Sabers will lose even this spot soon.”","Saber Wild looked at Chu Yunfan coldly. Of course, he understood what Chu Yunfan meant.","“Saber Wild, we’re the ones who want to challenge Chu Yunfan today, not you. Stand down or we’ll beat you up too!” Sorrow Arrow said.","Saber Wild wanted to attack, but when he saw that Xia Yi, Huang Xuanfei, Zhang Beidou, and the others were staring at him with unfriendly gazes, he realized that he had angered everyone. He was already on the list, so defeating Chu Yunfan was not an urgent matter. However, for the four people who were eager to prove themselves, defeating Chu Yunfan was the only way to get on the prodigy list.","The people on the prodigy list would only be defeated by the people on the prodigy list. This seemed to have become an unchanging law. Anyone who could break this law would often become a legend.","“It doesn’t matter,” Chu Yunfan said as he glanced at everyone. “Are you planning to attack together? I’m sorry, but I’m in a hurry, so I suggest you all attack together.”","Chu Yunfan’s words instantly made the conflict between Sorrow Arrow and the others disappear without a trace. Both sides threw their anger at Chu Yunfan.","Attack together? What did Chu Yunfan take them for?","If there was anyone whom they needed to fight together, it should be Li Qianyuan, who was the best among his peers.","Who was Chu Yunfan?","“Okay.”","“I’m not going to fight with you guys anymore.” Saber Wild sneered. “Whoever goes, chop off his head.”","“I’ll do it.” Sorrow Arrow stepped forward and attacked without further ado.","The bow on his back shot out at lightning speed. He pulled the bowstring to the limit and gathered his divine power into it, turning it into a terrifying arrow light.","The light emitted by this arrow was like the scorching sun. In an instant, it lit up the entire world and headed straight for Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":1847,"title":"Chapter 1847 Defeating Sorrow Arrow in One Strike","paragraphs":["1847 Defeating Sorrow Arrow in One Strike","This terrifying arrow light soared into the sky and headed straight for Chu Yunfan’s face. It was a killing move. Sorrow Arrow had no intention of staying behind. No matter how Chu Yunfan made it onto the prodigy list, he was not someone to be ignored.","The arrow soared through the sky and instantly arrived before Chu Yunfan.","Bam!","A terrifying scene appeared. Just as the arrow was about to hit Chu Yunfan, a blue electric energy shield appeared around him and blocked the arrow.","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!","The crowd saw that the arrow could not penetrate Chu Yunfan’s protective energy shield and shattered. Chu Yunfan’s defensive ability had reached a shocking level.","“What?”","Many people widened their eyes in disbelief. Chu Yunfan didn’t even make a move. He only relied on his protective energy shield to shatter all of Sorrow Arrow’s attacks. What kind of terrifying power was this?","“That’s it?” Chu Yunfan said as he grinned at Sorrow Arrow.","“That’s some bullsh*t energy shield. Watch this!”","Sorrow Arrow had been angered by Chu Yunfan’s words. Chu Yunfan was looking down on him completely. He pulled on his bow again, and an even more terrifying arrow light began to condense. Ghostly wails and howls rang out, and veryone felt their mood had suddenly dropped for some reason.","The arrow light grew stronger and stronger, almost like a dazzling sun, obscuring all light.","“It’s the Heartbreak Arrow of the Sad Path. It fuses the power of emotions into martial arts. The more compatible it is with the emotions of the Sad Path, the more terrifying the Heartbreak Arrow that can be unleashed,” Zhantai Xuan said with a serious expression.","Compared to before, Sorrow Arrow was much stronger. This attack affected everyone’s emotions. When Chu Hongcai, Liu Wenjing, and the others heard this, they finally understood why they suddenly felt so down. It was because of the influence of the Heartbreak Arrow.","Then, the arrow was released, and it swept toward Chu Yunfan like a terrifying light dragon.","“Just based on this technique, Sorrow Arrow should have the ability to enter the prodigy list.”","Zhang Beidou, Xia Yi, Huang Xuanfei, and the others were all shocked. Without a doubt, this attack from Sorrow Arrow showed them the power of the Heartbreak Arrow.","No wonder Sorrow Arrow wanted to fight for a ranking on the prodigy list. This kind of strength was indeed extraordinary. Even the geniuses on the prodigy list had to treat him seriously. Otherwise, they might die at his hands.","Suddenly, just as everyone thought that Chu Yunfan would not be able to deal with this attack, he casually grabbed the terrifying light dragon with a calm expression. It was as if a god in the sky had casually caught an ant that was causing trouble. Then, he easily crushed the light dragon, turning it into light spots that filled the sky and dissipated.","Whether it was the experts of the Flying Celestials or the experts of the other sects, all of them were dumbstruck by this scene. Even the Flying Celestial members who were very confident in Chu Yunfan did not expect him to withstand such a terrifying attack so easily.","“This... This...”","Many people felt a chill down their spine.","“What kind of strength is this? Isn’t Chu Yunfan just a lucky person? How can he be so strong?”","Many people understood that this was different from what they had imagined. It seemed that Chu Yunfan was not the lucky person they had thought. The strength he displayed was far from what they had imagined.","Unlike the others, Sorrow Arrow felt his hair stand on end. It was as if he was being targeted by a vicious beast. Instinctively, he attacked again and shot out nine terrifying arrow lights.","This was the profound meaning of the Heartbreak Arrow, the Nine Stars Alignment.","Nine terrifying arrows tore through the sky and enveloped Chu Yunfan.","This time, Chu Yunfan no longer passively defended. On the contrary, he began to attack as he shouted, “Flying Celestial Palm Strike!”","Countless spirit energy gathered around Chu Yunfan’s body, instantly condensing into a terrifying huge hand. The hand was like a cloud that hung down from the sky. When it descended, it began to spin like a millstone. The arrow lights of the Nine Stars Alignment was instantly obliterated.","Immediately after, the strike landed on Sorrow Arrow. In an instant, the situation changed. A series of violent explosions followed. Sorrow Arrow continuously shot out terrifying arrow lights in an attempt to destroy the Flying Celestial Palm Strike, but it was to no avail.","Bam!","The Flying Celestial Palm Strike landed on Sorrow Arrow, and everyone saw him spit out a mouthful of blood. He was instantly injured. He was sent flying backward like a kite with a broken string. It was a terrifying sight.","Bam!","Sorrow Arrow slammed into the ground. He struggled for a moment, and the sound of his bones breaking could be heard. He was heavily injured, and he could no longer move.","Heavily injured in one move!","Many people were dumbfounded. They had witnessed Sorrow Arrow’s strength. He had definitely entered the seventh level of the Cosmos Stage. Even if he was not on the prodigy list, he should be around the same level. Who would have thought that there would be such a big difference?","Those who had come to challenge him had extremely ugly expressions. No one had expected Chu Yunfan to be so strong. They had not even thought about this. To them, they should be stepping on him to get to the top. But now, the tables had turned.","They suddenly realized that Chu Yunfan was not a little white rabbit that they could easily pinch, but a terrifying t-rex."]},{"number":1848,"title":"Chapter 1848 Unable to Withstand a Single Blow (1)","paragraphs":["1848 Unable to Withstand a Single Blow (1)","This subversion of knowledge immediately made them feel at a loss. This was completely different from their previous understanding.","They didn’t know where they had heard this saying from or when it had started, but it seemed that this rumor started when the prodigy list had first appeared. But now, the facts proved that this rumor was completely wrong. Chu Yunfan was not as weak as everyone had thought.","Then the question was, if Chu Yunfan was not too weak, then why would there be such a rumor?","Many people thought of this and suddenly felt cold sweat dripping down their backs. It seemed that someone was behind this to spread such news, and their target was undoubtedly Chu Yunfan.","“He’s so strong. As expected of Senior Chu.”","“Wasn’t Sorrow Arrow very arrogant before? Didn’t he say that he would defeat Senior Chu to correct the Mysteries Pavillion’s list? And how did that go? He was defeated in one strike!”","“That’s right, but he was defeated in a single strike. He still dared to challenge Senior Chu in this state?”","A moment later, many of the Flying Celestial disciples burst into laughter. They no longer looked so worried as they looked at the challengers. They were originally worried that Chu Yunfan would fail, but now that they saw it, Chu Yunfan could not fail at all. At this moment, the atmosphere of worry was swept away, and their momentum soared.","On the other hand, Huang Xuanfei, Xia Yi, Hang Beidou, and the others had ugly expressions on their faces, and their eyes flickered with an inexplicable light. Even Wild Saber did not have his original arrogance. On the contrary, a solemn look flashed across his eyes.","Chu Yunfan was more powerful than they had imagined. This was very unexpected.","After Chu Yunfan defeated Sorrow Arrow with a single strike, he turned to Huang Xuanfei, Xia Yi, and Zhang Beidou. “Do you want to attack together or one by one?” He grinned, and in the next moment, his gaze fell on Huang Xuanfei.","Huang Xuanfei was shocked. This feeling made him recall the first time he went to the battlefield. He was targeted by a terrifying monster of the demons. On that battlefield, he had barely escaped death.","And now, the danger Chu Yunfan gave him was even more dangerous than that monster.","“Sh*t!”","Huang Xuanfei immediately knew that this was bad, but at this moment, Chu Yunfan’s gaze had already swept over. Everything was already in motion, and he had no choice but to follow through. He was the one who issued the challenge, so he could not afford to lose face, let alone let down the Huang clan of the Central Prefecture.","Chu Yunfan’s gaze swept over, giving him an extremely strong sense of oppression, making him feel like vomiting blood.","“I’m going to give it my all!”","Huang Xuanfei knew that he could not retreat without fighting. He could only fight to the death. Once he made such a decision, the courage that he had honed on the battlefield was instantly recovered. Facing Chu Yunfan, he calmed down. A halberd appeared in his hand—the Sky Halberd.","Boom!","Huang Xuanfei attacked. He realized that if he continued to be suppressed by Chu Yunfan like this, he would lose the courage to attack. This discovery forced him to make a move. Otherwise, he would lose his last chance of winning.","The halberd struck down, and a knight appeared in the sky. At first, the face of this knight couldn’t be seen clearly, but very quickly, it turned into Huang Xuanfei. His whole body was wrapped in armor, and his expression was cold. He look like a god of death.","“It’s here! It’s the ultimate technique of the Huang clan of the Central Prefecture, the Autumn Soldier of the Battlefield!” someone cried out in surprise.","The power of this attack caused many people to be incomparably amazed. The Autumn Soldiers of the Battlefield was a supreme technique. One horse could take on a thousand and break through ten thousand troops. It was not something that ordinary people could withstand. This attack would kill in one strike and break through the blockade of all powerful enemies with the force of a thunderbolt.","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan made his move. He didn’t make any movements, but simply clenched his five fingers into a fist and punched out. The fist force was like a long dragon whizzing out, instantly piercing through the knight who was rushing over.","Boom!","In an instant, the knight turned into a blood-red light spot in the sky, and the murderous atmosphere akin to a battlefield disappeared without a trace. All of them were blasted into nothingness by Chu Yunfan’s punch. They could not cause any damage to Chu Yunfan.","With just one punch, all the phenomena disappeared and suppressed all enemies.","“Damn it!” Huang Xuanfei immediately knew that things were not looking good for him.","However, Chu Yunfan’s punch did not lose its momentum. After breaking through Huang Xuanfei’s Autumn Soldiers of the Battlefield, it went straight for him.","“It won’t be that easy to defeat me!” Huang Xuanfei roared as he swung his halberd at the incoming fist, intending to destroy it.","Clang!","With a loud sound of metal clashing, everyone saw Chu Yunfan’s punch send Huang Xuanfei’s halberd flying into the air, turning into a stream of light and disappearing.","Chu Yunfan’s fist then landed on Huang Xuanfei’s chest.","Pow!","There was a loud explosion accompanied by the sound of bones breaking. Huang Xuanfei screamed and flew backward. He crashed into the ground and created a big hole. It was as if he had been hit by a comet.","Just like Sorrow Arrow, Huang Xuanfei was defeated by Chu Yunfan.","There was another deathly silence. Everyone held their breaths and were almost scared to death. Chu Yunfan’s combat strength shocked everyone. However, after Chu Yunfan’s defeat of Sorrow Arrow within seconds, this didn’t seem so hard to accept.","‘He was unable to withstand even a single blow!’ These words appeared in many people’s minds."]},{"number":1849,"title":"Chapter 1849 Unable to Withstand a Single Blow (2)","paragraphs":["1849 Unable to Withstand a Single Blow (2)","“So weak!”","No one knew that Huang Xuanfei, Sorrow Arrow, and the others, who were originally extremely powerful in their opinion, would turn out to be so vulnerable. Whether it was Huang Xuanfei or Sorrow Arrow, none of them were simple figures. They were also outstanding existences in their respective sects.","Although they were not on the prodigy list as there were only 100 people on the list, this did not mean that those who were not on the prodigy list were weak. Huang Xuanfei and Sorrow Arrow had fought against the elites on the prodigy list before. Although it was just small fights, they were not completely helpless.","It was precisely because of this that they had absolute confidence in challenging Chu Yunfan. He was only ranked 100th on the prodigy list. It was not like they had no chance of winning.","In the face of ordinary experts of the same level, they were able to suppress all enemies. Even those seventh level Cosmic veterans were defeated by them. This was a group of people whose brilliance was not inferior to the prodigies on the prodigy list.","But now, when facing Chu Yunfan, they were so vulnerable. Everyone understood that it was not because Sorrow Arrow and Huang Xuanfei were too weak. On the contrary, their attacks proved that they not. In fact, they were even stronger than many people imagined.","All of this could only be attributed to Chu Yunfan being too strong. His strength overshadowed their brilliance, making these geniuses appear as weak as ants.","‘Senior Chu’s isn’t any weaker than Senior Yang.’","Many people had such thoughts in their minds. In their opinion, even if Yang Dengxian personally took action, he wouldn’t be able to do better than this.","“So strong,” Zhantai Xuan said with a solemn expression.","Huang Xuanfei and Sorrow Arrow were extremely powerful. If it was her, even though they were all at the seventh level of the Cosmos Stage, she might not be able to last 50 moves against them.","They were all at the seventh level of the Cosmos Stage, but there was still a huge gap between them. The Sorrow Arrow and the others’ strength was infinitely close to the prodigy list. A newcomer like her could not compare to them.","However, these people were so vulnerable when facing Chu Yunfan. All of this could only mean that...","“Chu Yunfan got stronger... He’s even stronger than before!”","In the camp of the Flying Celestials, a person looked at Chu Yunfan with a complicated expression. Who else could it be but Hua Xianyuan?","He could keenly feel that Chu Yunfan’s strength had changed drastically compared to a few months ago. This change made him feel a little hopeless though his progress was not slow.","In just a few months, Hua Xianyuan had already reached the peak of the first Level of the Cosmos Stage. He would soon find a way to break through to the second level. However, Chu Yunfan’s speed was not one step at a time. It was more like one leap at a time.","The gap between them made Hua Xianyuan feel suffocated. He couldn’t even raise the mood to catch up. He had a feeling that since there was already Chu Yunfan, who was Hua Xianyuan? Everyone in Chu Yunfan’s batch was overshadowed by him.","Among the crowd, Chu Hongcai was unusually excited. He was unconditionally happy for Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan had a high position in his heart.","At this moment, the only challengers left were the Divine Maidens’ Xia Yi and the Holy Puppets’ Zhang Beidou.","The two of them became nervous. All of this took a long time to describe, but in fact, it had only happened in a moment. Within minutes, they saw two people they had regarded as strong enemies being defeated by Chu Yunfan. It was irrefutable that Chu Yunfan had defeated the two of them with absolute strength, leaving them speechless.","Many people had issued challenges. The weakest among them were at the fifth level of the Cosmos Stage, while the strongest were barely at the seventh level. Although they were considered extraordinary experts in the eyes of ordinary people, they knew what they were doing.","Chu Yunfan had accepted only Huang Xuanfei, Sorrow Arrow, Xia Yi, and Zhang Beidou. However, half of them had been defeated in just a few moments. This was undoubtedly a great psychological pressure for the remaining two.","“Go!”","The two of them looked at each other and understood what each other meant. They were going to join forces. This was the only way they could fight against Chu Yunfan.","Originally, they did not care about this. After all, they were here to challenge Chu Yunfan. In the end, they joined forces to deal with Chu Yunfan. What was this?","However, reality was about to give them a big slap. It made them understand that what they had thought before was simply a huge joke. With Chu Yunfan’s strength, it was not embarrassing for the two of them to join forces.","Zhang Beidou attacked first. A puppet appeared behind him. It was a lifelike young man. This young man’s entire body was covered in bursts of golden light as he rushed toward Chu Yunfan.","An invincible puppet!","This young man was like a human and possessed an extraordinary body. This was one of Zhang Beidou’s trump cards. He unleashed his trump card the moment he attacked.","At the same time, another hundred puppets appeared in the sky. They surrounded Chu Yunfan, and with the invincible young man as the leader, they attacked fiercely.","These puppets were all martial arts experts. The martial arts they displayed were not inferior to those of real humans. This was the power of the puppet path. If one accidentally provoked a puppet master, it could be equivalent to provoking dozens or hundreds of experts.","“Eight Astonishing Punches!”","However, Chu Yunfan was not afraid. He punched out, and his fist force transformed into eight heavenly dragons. The dragons rushed past him.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","With this punch, the hundreds of puppets that were equivalent to Cosmics exploded into pieces. Although they looked like humans, they were just mechanical puppets. And Chu Yunfan’s fist force did not slow down. He punched the leading puppet that was covered in golden light.","“It’s useless. My puppet has cultivated the Holy Invincibility Art. You can’t break through it!”","Zhang Beidou’s face revealed a confident expression. Even an expert at the peak of the seventh level of the Cosmos Stage could not break through his puppet.","However, as soon as he finished speaking, a cracking sound was heard, and the young man puppet shattered."]},{"number":1850,"title":"Chapter 1850 Unable to Withstand a Single Blow (3)","paragraphs":["1850 Unable to Withstand a Single Blow (3)","Zhang Beidou’s expression froze. He had just boasted that his puppet could never be broken by Chu Yunfan, but in the end, it was shattered by Chu Yunfan’s punch.","What was face-slapping? This was face-slapping!","His face instantly turned hot, but what followed was extreme fear. This puppet, which he had been carrying on his back, was different from his other puppets. It was the trump card of all his puppets. Even a seventh level Cosmic was not a match for his puppet.","This puppet could cultivate martial arts, possessed intelligence, and had the Holy Invincibility Art. His physical body was truly powerful to the extreme.","Zhang Beidou had once faced the siege of several seventh level Cosmics, but none of them had been able to break through his defense. His Golden Bell Iron Robe was one of his greatest trump cards.","Who knew that when facing Chu Yunfan, he would be so vulnerable. It was only a simple punch, but his puppet was shattered on the spot. This made him feel extremely embarrassed. The bold words he had just said were instantly thrown bnack into his face.","But at this moment, he didn’t have time to think too much, because Chu Yunfan’s fist was sweeping toward him. All his defenses and attacks were not worth mentioning in front of Chu Yunfan’s fist. He was no match for Chu Yunfan.","Bam!","Chu Yunfan’s punch landed on Zhang Beidou’s chest, and everyone saw dense cracks appearing on Zhang Beidou’s body. The cracks spread out from Chu Yunfan’s fist like a spider web. Everyone heard a series of cracking sounds, and Zhang Beidou shattered.","“Zhang Beidou is a puppet?”","Many people were shocked because they had never thought that Zhang Beidou was a puppet. However, they immediately realized that something was wrong. It wasn’t that Zhang Beidou was a puppet, but that he had placed himself inside a puppet.","Many people recalled that this was a divine ability of the Holy Puppets. They placed themselves inside puppets to prevent their fragile bodies from being attacked. Normally, this puppet was a life-bound puppet, and life-bound puppets were usually the strongest. Unless it was absolutely necessary, it would not easily appear.","Now, not only had Zhang Beidou’s other puppets been defeated by Chu Yunfan, but even his life-bound puppet had been unable to withstand Chu Yunfan’s attack and exploded. With just one punch, Zhang Beidou was severely injured and forced t retreat. He vomited blood and fainted.","The challengers were all shocked. Chu Yunfan was too strong. Zhang Beidou, who was one of the strongest among them, couldn’t even block a punch from Chu Yunfan. Although the Flying Celestials disciples felt that this was very exciting, it also made them terrified.","Now, only Xia Yi was left among the four challengers. Her pretty face was as cold as ice. Chu Yunfan had defeated three people in a row. To her, he was an unprecedented strong enemy. Even her confidence and pride was about to collapse in front of Chu Yunfan.","In just a moment, he had defeated three experts in a row, and he had not even attacked with his full strength. To be precise, he had attacked casually. Then, everyone was collectively defeated.","However, there was no time for Xia Yi to retreat. When Zhang Beidou attacked, she attacked as well. She had no other choice.","Xia Yi’s entire body emitted a faint immortal aura as if she was a fairy from heaven.","“That’s the Pure Heart Technique. It’s the cornerstone technique of the Divine Maidens. Ordinary disciples of the Divine Maidens are not allowed to learn it. Only after becoming a divine maiden of the sect will they be taught this technique. Now that I’m looking at it, it is indeed extraordinary,” Saber Wild said, seemingly still in the mood to speak, but his expression was much more solemn than before.","After performing the Pure Heart Technique, Xia Yi’s aura increased by a level. It was completely different from before. In an instant, a white palm pierced through the sky and slammed down on Chu Yunfan with a sky full of immortal energy.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at it. After severely injuring Zhang Beidou and knocking him unconscious, he allowed the white palm to land on him.","Clang!","There was a loud sound of metal clashing. Xia Yi realized that her attack had hit something akin to a piece of iron. It couldn’t penetrate Chu Yunfan’s defense.","‘How is his physique so strong?!’ Xia Yi thought.","She was shocked. She had seen others fight with a different level of power, but she didn’t have a deep understanding. It was terrifying. She finally understood how strong Chu Yunfan’s body was.","It was impossible to imagine how powerful someone’s physique could be without even making a move.","Instinctively, she retreated and didn’t dare to get close. However, it wasn’t so easy flee. In an instant, Chu Yunfan had already caught up with her and slapped her with a simple palm.","Bam!","Xia Yi was hit by the palm and felt the world spin. Intense pain filled her entire body and she spat out a mouthful of blood. She flew out like a kite with a broken string and landed on the ground. She instantly fainted, and it was unknown whether she was dead or alive.","At this point, all four challengers had been defeated by Chu Yunfan. Many people were completely dumbfounded. The challenge had ended, and this was completely different from what they had expected and thought at the beginning.","Before this, even the people in the Flying Celestials who had confidence in Chu Yunfan only thought that he could barely beat these people and maintain his ranking on the prodigy list.","To be able to do that was already very impressive. After all, Chu Yunfan had accepted everyone’s challenge in one breath. It was already shocking enough if he did not lose.","However, the reality was completely beyond everyone’s expectations. It was a situation that even the most imaginative person could not imagine.","Chu Yunfan easily defeated the four challengers. It was like an adult toying with a few children. The difference between the two sides was like the difference between heaven and earth. They were all defeated in one move. They did not even pose enough of a threat to he, and everyone saw how shocking his true strength was."]},{"number":1851,"title":"Chapter 1851 Battle of the Prodigy List","paragraphs":["1851 Battle of the Prodigy List","In other words, the four of them were defeated so badly that they couldn’t force Chu Yunfan to use his full strength. All of them were killed in one move, which made many people have terrifying guesses about Chu Yunfan’s strength.","Once the results of this battle spread, no one would doubt that Chu Yunfan’s rank on the prodigy list. It even caused many people to have doubts. Could this be the strength of all those on the prodigy list?","Chu Yunfan, who was ranked last on the prodigy list, had the strength to beat up the geniuses in the group after the prodigy list. If it was the top geniuses on the prodigy list who made a move, what kind of scene would it be?","When many of the younger generation elites thought of this result, they felt a sense of despair. It was not that they were not working hard enough. They toiled, cultivating day after day, never having a day of relaxation. However, many times, many things could not be made up for by hard work. Some people were not geniuses, but monsters.","For example, in the eyes of many people, Chu Yunfan was a monster. He swept away these ordinary prodigies like he was sweeping away ants. If he wasn’t a monster, then who was?","And such a monster was only ranked 100th. This made them feel that there were too many monsters in this world!","Just when everyone thought that the challenge was over, they saw Chu Yunfan’s gaze sweep over to Lin Dingtian.","“Didn’t you say you’d cut off my head? We’ll, let’s see if your saber is fast and wild enough to do so.”","Chu Yunfan’s words immediately caused a huge uproar among the crowd. He had actually challenged Lin Dingtian after defeating the four experts in a row.","‘The battle for the prodigy list!’","These words appeared in the minds of many people. Lin Dingtian was not someone Huang Xuanfei and the others could compare to. Huang Xuanfei and the others could not even enter the prodigy list, but Lin Dingtian was a genuine figure on the prodigy list, and his ranking was even higher than Chu Yunfan’s.","This made many people feel excited. Although Lin Dingtian was ranked above Chu Yunfan, he was only a few places higher than Chu Yunfan. There should be a similar difference.","There was no doubt that this would be a fierce battle!","They thought that Chu Yunfan would have to go through a fierce battle if he wanted to defeat Huang Xuanfei and the others. Who knew that Huang Xuanfei and the others couldn’t even withstand a few moves from Chu Yunfan? They were simply beaten up.","There had been no spectacular battle, but now, things were different. This was bound to be a huge battle.","The prodigies on the prodigy list would not easily fight because these people had high status and power. The rankings on the prodigy list not only represented their glory, but also the glory of their sect.","Therefore, they were not willing to make a move easily. Once they fought, there would definitely be a winner. It would be fine if they won, but once they lost, the consequences would be unimaginable.","Many people would never be able to see a prodigy battle in their entire lives!","“Hmm?” Lin Dingtian looked at Chu Yunfan coldly. “You actually have the guts to challenge me? How arrogant. Do you think I’m the same as them?”","Lin Dingtian suppressed his anger. In his opinion, Chu Yunfan simply did not know the immensity of heaven and earth. Although Chu Yunfan had defeated the other challengers, in his eyes, this was only natural. The people on the prodigy list should have such dominance, but now Chu Yunfan had actually turned his gaze to him. He was simply courting death.","However, Lin Dingtian did not intend to refuse, because he had come here with ill intentions. Chu Yunfan’s suggestion was exactly what he wanted.","“Since you want to know if my saber is fast, then let’s test it with your head.”","Chu Yunfan could clearly sense the killing intent in Lin Dingtian’s words. It was different from the others who only wanted to challenge Chu Yunfan and obtain a ranking on the prodigy list.","Lin Dingtian’s words were filled with killing intent. This made Chu Yunfan’s heart involuntarily surge with cold killing intent as well.","“You brought this upon yourself. Since you want to die, I’ll grant you your wish.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Lin Dingtian smirked. In an instant, an incomparably terrifying saber light soared into the sky and enveloped his entire person. In an instant, he entered the state of being one with the saber.","“Peak of the Cosmos Stage!” Zhantai Xuan’s eyes were wide open as if she didn’t want to miss a second. This was the strength of someone on the tail end of the prodigy list. She wanted to know just how big of a gap there was between her and the elites on the prodigy list.","Lin Dingtian’s sudden outburst attracted everyone’s attention, especially many of the Flying Celestials’ old elders. Their eyes were wide open. His strength had already reached the peak of the Cosmos Stage. With this strength, even if he was like Chu Yunfan, he could easily win against Huang Xuanfei and the others.","Even if it was them, it was impossible to be Lin Dingtian’s match.","Once such a genius entered a certain level, it was be difficult for them to meet a match within the same level. They could sweep away and suppress all powerful enemies.","“Chu Yunfan, do you think that you can defeat me just because you can defeat them? You’re gravely mistaken. Now, I’ll use the facts to tell you that whether you’re on the prodigy list or not is a completely different concept.” Lin Dingtian laughed.","The saber light on Lin Dingtian’s body grew thicker and thicker. He was nurturing this saber light, which grew stronger and stronger. It even forced many Cosmics present to retreat. Even though it wasn’t aimed at them, they could still feel the terrifying saber light hanging above their heads like a heavenly saber.","It could fall at any time, and once it fell, it would be the time for all things to perish.","Boom!","Lin Dingtian finally raised his saber light to the limit and attacked. A hint of pride flashed in his eyes. The reason he talked to Chu Yunfan just now was to buy time and let his saber light develop. After witnessing how Chu Yunfan had defeated Huang Xuanfei and the others so easily, no matter how confident and arrogant he was, he did not dare to take it lightly.","And now, he could finally rely on this saber light to kill a powerful enemy in one strike.","Boom!","The saber light slashed down and split the sky into two halves. The saber light that was thousands of feet high swept out and instantly reached Chu Yunfan’s face. The speed was terrifying and indescribable."]},{"number":1852,"title":"Chapter 1852 Lin Dingtian Dies","paragraphs":["Chapter 1852 Lin Dingtian Dies","Quick, quick, quick!","The terrifying saber light swept out, blowing Chu Yunfan’s clothes.","“Petty trick.” Chu Yunfan sneered. “The Godly Sabers are only so-so.”","In an instant, Chu Yunfan let out a long roar. He rose from the ground and faced the saber light. He didn’t use any divine power or martial arts and simply punched out.","The white fist hit the saber light that was coming down head-on.","“You’re courting death!”","Seeing Chu Yunfan’s actions, Lin Dingtian burst into laughter. He was not angry, but laughed instead. In his opinion, Chu Yunfan was simply courting death by doing this. Chu Yunfan had absolute confidence that he could receive his saber light with his bare hands. Even those geniuses ranked at the top of the prodigy list could not do this.","“Chu Yunfan is confused!”","Many disciples and elders in the Flying Celestials cried out. That saber light was too terrifying. It was enough to cut through mountains and shatter the sky. At this time, Chu Yunfan should have avoided the edge. But instead, he didn’t even seem to think of this and went up to fight.","Boom!","A terrifying explosion erupted, forming a mushroom cloud. Terrifying energy swept across. Everyone gathered their divine power into their eyes and saw that Chu Yunfan had caught the saber light with his bare hands. The saber light was as terrifying as the sun, but it could not go any further.","“A bare-handed artifact!” someone said this sentence in a daze, instantly shocking the entire scene.","“Invincible body... This is a real invincible body!” someone shouted.","The strength of Chu Yunfan’s physical body was beyond their imagination. It was not that no one’s body could compare to a hallowed weapon, but those people were all experts in the Creation Stage. Moreover, they had to be experts with high cultivation in the Creation Stage to have such ability. After all, the human body was made of flesh and blood, but magic artifacts could be refined without restraint to increase their power. These were two completely different things.","Many people’s pupils contracted slightly. What kind of special physique was this?!","When Chu Yunfan was able to compete with Hua Xianyuan and even defeat him, many people suspected that he also had a special physique. And it was definitely not an ordinary physique. This was because the body was like a vessel that determined a person’s upper limit.","No matter how talented a person was, if their physique was not good enough, their upper limit would be limited. It was like a water tank and a swimming pool. Even if a water tank was filled with water, it would not be able to compare to one-tenth of the water in a swimming pool.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t say anything about these things. Naturally, no one could get anything out of him, so they could only guess. Some people guessed that it was due to the enhancement of physique techniques, while others guessed that it was due to the innate affinity with the power of lightning. Lightning divine abilities were said to be invincible.","However, those were just guesses. Now, they had truly seen the other side. It was simply something they did not dare to imagine that they could fight against a hallowed saber light with their bare hands.","“What?!” Lin Dingtian’s eyes flashed with cold killing intent when he saw that Chu Yunfan had easily caught his attack. In addition, Chu Yunfan had said that the Godly Sabers was only so-so, which made him furious.","This saber light fell with hatred, and the degree of terror was even greater than before.","Chu Yunfan stretched out two fingers and caught the falling saber light.","Clang!","A metallic sound rang out.","“What?! He caught it with two fingers?!”","Everyone was shocked. When Chu Yunfan had taken Lin Dingtian’s blade with his fist earlier, it had already shocked everyone. Now, he had taken this terrifying attack with only two fingers. It even made everyone feel terrified!","Immediately after, Chu Yunfan turned his palm, and the shocking saber light shattered inch by inch. It was densely covered with all kinds of cracks, spreading out like a spider web.","Boom!","Accompanied by an incomparably loud explosion, everyone saw that the saber light turn into a light that filled the sky.","“Too weak and too slow.”","At this moment, Chu Yunfan’s aura was completely released, and he completely suppressed Lin Dingtian. This was Chu Yunfan’s true strength.","Chu Yunfan had already broken through to the third level of the Cosmos Stage. When that happened, his strength was already not inferior to Lin Dingtian’s. Later on, with the help of the Flying Celestial Fruit, Chu Yunfan reached the peak of the third Cosmos Stage. His strength had undergone an earth-shattering change. Compared to when he had just broken through, he was at least several times stronger. In other words, the current Chu Yunfan was at least several times stronger than Lin Dingtian.","To truly climb to the peak was something that Lin Dingtian could not imagine.","Right now, Chu Yunfan was confident that even if he fought with the top prodigies on the prodigy list, he would not be inferior. If he met Hu Qingxuan, Zi Buyu, and the others who had shocked him back then, Chu Yunfan would be able to fight with them or even win.","“Take this punch. If you survive, I’ll spare your life. Otherwise, you’ll die!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","In the blink of an eye, he attacked. His five fingers clenched into a fist, and in an instant, he attacked like lightning.","“Sh*t!” Lin Dingtian felt an astonishing killing intent. It even made him feel that his life was threatened.","Bam!","He felt his vision blur and realized that a fist had pierced through his body. He felt the vitality in his body rapidly flowing away.","Lin Dingtian was dead!"]},{"number":1853,"title":"Chapter 1853 What? The Godly Sabers?","paragraphs":["Chapter 1853 What? The Godly Sabers?","“What’s going on...”","Chu Yunfan was just too fast.","If the speed of Lin Dingtian’s blade light was already fast, then Chu Yunfan’s speed was at least twice as fast. It was so fast that no one could react in time, and neither could Lin Dingtian. Chu Yunfan’s punch tore through the sky, and Lin Dingtian’s chest was shattered on the spot.","Everyone saw that Lin Dingtian’s chest had already been smashed into smithereens by a single punch. The power of this punch to such an extent was simply inconceivable.","At this moment, even the slowest person had noticed that something was wrong. This was because it was completely different from their initial expectations. Almost everyone thought that Chu Yunfan was most likely not Lin Dingtian’s match. It was already quite good that they could come to a draw.","After all, Lin Dingtian was ranked above Chu Yunfan on the prodigy list. It was already shocking enough if Chu Yunfan was able to draw with Lin Dingtian.","However, the truth had given them a hard slap. They did not know that Lin Dingtian could not be evenly matched with Chu Yunfan. He was not Chu Yunfan’s match at all. From the beginning to the end, he was beaten up. From all aspects, everyone could see that Lin Dingtian was not Chu Yunfan’s match.","However, many people immediately reacted. Chu Yunfan had killed Lin Dingtian!","“He killed Lin Dingtian? The Godly Sabers will definitely not let this go!”","The outsiders’ expressions changed. They thought that Chu Yunfan wouldn’t dare to do anything to them. In fact, whether it was Sorrow Arrow, Xia Yi, Huang Xuanfei, or Zhang Beidou, they were all seriously injured, but they weren’t dead.","Only Lin Dingtian was killed by a punch!","After this series of events, of course, they would not decide whether Chu Yunfan did not have the ability to kill them or did not have the courage to kill them. On the contrary, Chu Yunfan had the strength and courage to do so. However, he had spared their lives. Only Lin Dingtian was killed.","Chu Yunfan wanted to kill him, so he killed him. It was that simple.","Many people suddenly thought that Lin Dingtian was completely different from the others because the others were here to challenge Chu Yunfan. However, Lin Dingtian was clearly different from the others. He came with ill intentions. This was probably the main reason why Chu Yunfan killed him. But even so, Chu Yunfan’s courage was still unbelievable.","Many people were shocked, especially when they recalled that Lin Dingtian was the top disciple of the Godly Sabers’ current generation and the only person in the Godly Sabers to enter the prodigy list. The Godly Sabers had placed great hopes on Lin Dingtian. It could even be said that he was being groomed as the next sect leader.","The Godly Sabers were different from the Flying Celestials. The Flying Celestials was one of the top ten sects, and the resources it possessed were unimaginable for the Godly Sabers. Although the Flying Celestials only had two people on the rankings, it was thought to be an accident and a decline.","The Godly Sabers had done their best to nurture Lin Dingtian who was on the prodigy list. Now that Chu Yunfan had killed him, the Godly Sabers were probably going to go crazy.","Many people looked at Chu Yunfan. They didn’t know if he didn’t care or if he hadn’t thought of this at all. This was especially true for Sorrow Arrow and the others, who were healing themselves at the side. Initially, they were still indignant, but after seeing how Chu Yunfan killed Lin Dingtian with a single punch, they had no more complaints. Chu Yunfan had the strength to kill them with one punch. As long as he had the will, everything would be simple.","At this moment, they felt lucky that they had not provoked Chu Yunfan. Otherwise, the consequences would be unimaginable and they would probably die. Chu Yunfan had killed the chief disciple of the Godly Sabers without even blinking. If he really wanted to kill them, it would be nothing.","At this time, many Flying Celestial disciples had thought of this. Some people began to worry about Chu Yunfan, but most people didn’t care.","“That’s right. Our sect isn’t some small clan that can be easily bullied!”","The Flying Celestial disciples were not afraid. Although the Flying Celestials were considered to be at the bottom of the top ten sects, it was still one of the top ten sects—a colossus that truly controlled the kingdom’s political power.","The Godly Sabers were not weak, but that was all. The Flying Celestial disciples naturally had a psychological advantage over the Godly Sabers. Moreover, everyone knew that this was a life-and-death battle. Since it was a life-and-death battle, it was very normal for deaths to occur.","Although many people didn’t like Chu Yunfan, because of the incident with Grand Elder Jiang Wan’an and Wang Yifan, many people were hostile toward Chu Yunfan. However, no matter what, it was still an internal conflict.","Chu Yunfan’s expression did not change after he killed Lin Dingtian with a single punch. Lin Dingtian had come with ill intentions. He had said that he wanted to kill him. With Chu Yunfan’s temper, he would not let him off.","Even if everyone in the Godly Sabers hated him to the core, he was not afraid. The current situation was completely different from before. When he displayed his strength to stabilize his ranking on the prodigy list, he defeated Lin Dingtian, who was ranked higher than him.","As long as the higher-ups of the Flying Celestials were not completely blind, they would definitely try their best to protect him. Even if the Godly Sabers came to attack aggressively, the sect would definitely fend them off.","Being on the prodigy list was just one of the benefits.","Most importantly, his status in the sect had undergone a tremendous change. He was almost on par with Yang Dengxian. The sect would pay attention to him as much as the Godly Sabers paid attention to Lin Dingtian. It was the same. Therefore, Chu Yunfan was not worried.","Lin Dingtian suddenly came uninvited with ill intentions, and Chu Yunfan didn’t believe that there was no one behind this. This mastermind hated him to the bone and had the ability to invite a prodigy on the prodigy list. Besides Li Qianyuan, Chu Yunfan could not think of anyone else.","As he paid more and more attention to Chu Yunfan, Li Qianyuan’s little tricks became more and more, and all kinds of methods were constantly strengthened."]},{"number":1854,"title":"Chapter 1854 Causing a Great Wave","paragraphs":["1854 Causing a Great Wave","To kill Chu Yunfan, Li Qianyuan had exhausted all his efforts. However, he probably did not expect that Chu Yunfan’s strength to have reached such a level. It had not been long since Chu Yunfan had just entered the prodigy list, yet he could easily kill Lin Dingtian.","The hundreds of people on the prodigy list could be said to be the best among the younger generation of experts. They were the top prodigies in everyone’s eyes.","There was not much difference in strength between those on the list. Li Qianyuan, who was originally at the top of the prodigy list, was at the peak of the Cosmos Stage. However, on the prodigy list, except for Chu Yunfan, who was a freak and an anomaly, the others were basically at the peak Cosmos Stage.","The difference between them was not big, and the prodigy list was not a ranking of cultivation levels. On the contrary, it was a ranking of combat strength. Although their cultivation levels were similar, there was a difference in their battle prowess.","Now, except for Li Qianyuan, who was the first to enter the Creation Stage, there was no obvious difference in the cultivation levels of the others. Even many of the top geniuses below the prodigy list had already entered the seventh level of the Cosmos Stage. There were even some at the peak. It was just that there were only 100 spaces on the prodigy list, so they had no chance to show their faces.","Within the prodigy list, other than the people at the top, the rankings of the prodigies at the bottom were constantly changing. Although there might not be much difference in cultivation levels, if someone obtained some fortuitous encounter or some divine ability inheritance, their combat strength would soar to another level.","And now, Chu Yunfan was like this. If it was said that he could barely be ranked on the prodigy list, then after a short time, his cultivation level and divine power had improved again, and his ranking on the prodigy list would have a world-shaking change.","This was where Chu Yunfan had an advantage over the others, because the others were stuck at the peak of a major level and could not break through easily. If one couldn’t break through, one’s increase in combat strength would be limited, and Chu Yunfan was constantly improving. Naturally, he could surpass everyone in a short time.","Li Qianyuan had the same advantage as Chu Yunfan. After breaking through to a new cultivation level, as long as he stabilized his cultivation level, he would have an amazing improvement in a short time.","Chu Yunfan had defeated many challengers and even killed Lin Dingtian, who was ranked 95th on the prodigy list. This news spread through the Flying Celestials immediately.","“Senior Chu won?”","“All those challengers were defeated?”","“More importantly, Saber Wild Lin Dingtian died at Senior Chu’s hands!”","“Saber Wild? The legendary Saber Wild?”","“After this battle, not only will Senior Chu maintain his ranking on the prodigy list, but his ranking will probably advance by many places. Even Saber Wild isn’t his match.”","Everyone in the Flying Celestials was discussing animatedly. Before this, almost no one had thought that Chu Yunfan would win. However, he had completed a great reversal of the situation and easily defeated a group of challengers. He had also killed Lin Dingtian with one blow.","Chu Yunfan was the epitome of a comeback, especially when he had only entered the Flying Celestials for two years. In a short time, he had already done something that ordinary people could not do in their lifetime. Therefore, he became the idol of the new disciples of the Flying Celestials. Many young disciples regarded him as their idol.","Initially, when Chu Yunfan first chose a follower, it was extremely difficult. He had the shortest end of the stick. But now, after he defeated many challengers and displayed a shocking combat strength that far exceeded his ranking, Chu Yunfan suddenly became a hot potato in the Flying Celestials.","Everyone could see that as the second disciple to enter the prodigy list, the higher-ups of the Flying Celestials would definitely do their best to nurture him. Chu Yunfan’s status would naturally rise. Becoming his follower would naturally allow them to keep up with this trend.","When Chu Yunfan first chose his followers, only a few inner and fringe disciples were willing to follow him. However, with his entry into the prodigy list, his status had stabilized. After taking a step forward, not to mention the inner and fringe disciples, there were countless elite disciples who wanted to join Startling Cloud Peak.","Even true disciples and elders wanted to follow Chu Yunfan and join Startling Cloud Peak and form an alliance between true disciples and elders. After all, even Wang Yifan had several Cosmic elders willing to follow him, not to mention the current Chu Yunfan. He could be said to be like the sun at noon, and his power was more than ten times that of Wang Yifan.","Even many true disciples with bright futures were willing to join Chu Yunfan and become his followers. After all, although they had a bright future ahead of them, there was still a huge gap between them and Chu Yunfan. At most, they would only break through to the Creation Stage and become members of the grand elder group in the future.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. In the future, if he wanted to, he would be qualified to compete with Yang Dengxian for the position of sect leader of the Flying Celestials. Even if he failed in the end, he would still get the position of the chief supreme elder.","No matter which one it was, it would definitely be someone who would influence Grand Xia in the future or even the entire world. At that time, they would be able to follow Chu Yunfan around the world, and the situation would not be comparable to their current one.","This was the reason why many experts throughout history had many followers. Even the Alchemy Emperor in Chu Yunfan’s memories had many followers. Even when the Alchemy Emperor was young and his strength was not too strong, there were experts who were shocked by his talent and volunteered to be his protectors.","After the Alchemy Emperor successfully reached enlightenment, these people naturally reaped many benefits. This was the logic that when one person gained enlightenment, their chickens and dogs would ascend too. As long as Chu Yunfan’s performance was outstanding enough and his future was bright enough, even these proud and arrogant true disciples wouldn’t mind being a chicken or dog.","Ye Yin, who was recuperating, also received the news and felt lucky. Of course, he didn’t believe that Chu Yunfan’s strength had changed drastically in the past three months. After all, cultivation in the Cosmos Stage was no joke. Therefore, he naturally understood that Chu Yunfan already had such strength, but he didn’t use his full strength back then.","After this incident, Ye Yin no longer had any thoughts of competing with Chu Yunfan.","“I didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to have such strength. I didn’t recognize Mount Tai back then. Forget it. From now on, I’m going into seclusion to cultivate.”","After making up his mind, the disheartened Ye Yin publicly announced that he was going into seclusion and would not ask about the matters of the sect.","And this was just one of the waves caused by Chu Yunfan’s battle"]},{"number":1855,"title":"Chapter 1855 30th on the Prodigy List","paragraphs":["1855 30th on the Prodigy List","The news of this battle spread throughout the Flying Celestials. Not long after, the entire Grand Xia Empire and even the entire world knew of this news. Chu Yunfan killing Lin Dingtian with a single punch made him even more famous.","There weren’t many fights between those on the prodigy list. Even if there were, they would usually stop after a brief taste. After all, being on the prodigy list already represented standing at the peak of the younger generation. In the future, these people might stand at the peak of the world.","How much hatred must there be to make these geniuses on the prodigy list so easily decide life and death? There was no need for that. Every prodigy on the prodigy list was not simple. If they did not have 100% confidence, the consequences would be unimaginable. They might even die. Just like Zi Buyu, even if Meng Tianren and the others fought for benefits, they did not really fight to the death.","In this atmosphere, Chu Yunfan’s actions were too abrupt. However, this made many people truly realize the terrifying strength of this new prodigy. To beat another prodigy who was also on the prodigy list to death, what kind of terrifying strength was this?","Moreover, it was said that Chu Yunfan was not injured at all. This meant that his strength far exceeded his current ranking. He could at least be ranked in the middle, not at the bottom of the ranking.","This was the first time Chu Yunfan had become known to the world as a true expert. He was different from the talented new stars from before. After all, he could easily kill a peak Cosmic on the prodigy list. He was definitely an expert. At this rate, good fortunes were in sight. At that time, he would be an expert who could truly influence the Central Plains.","Soon, the Mysteries Pavilion updated the prodigy list again, and Chu Yunfan’s ranking rose from the last place to the 30th place. When this ranking came out, it was absolutely shocking.","What was rocket speed? This was rocket speed!","Prior to this, although there were precedents of a large increase in rankings, those were basically people who had reached the age limit and were replaced. The people behind him were suddenly ranked up a lot. However, it was different now. Chu Yunfan had relied on his strength to rise up, which caused many people to be in an uproar.","Many people expressed their dissatisfaction. Although Chu Yunfan had the record of killing a prodigy like Lin Dingtian, he had suddenly risen to 30th place. One could imagine what kind of uproar it would cause.","The top 30 were basically the first group ranked at the top of the prodigy list. This move caused the dissatisfaction of many prodigies on the prodigy list. These people initially had no interest in Chu Yunfan’s ranking on the prodigy list, because to them, it was just a fight between those at the bottom of the rankings. Now, Chu Yunfan had actually risen to 30th place, which meant that many people’s rankings had been surpassed by him.","How could they accept the fact that a junior who was less than half their age and had shallow qualifications had climbed over their heads?","However, after complaining a few times, the prodigies fell silent. Just as everyone was discussing animatedly, news quickly spread. There was only one reason why these prodigies did not protest. That was that these prodigies had collectively entered seclusion.","Other than Chu Yunfan, who was a freak, the other people who could make it onto the prodigy list were basically masters at the peak of the Cosmos Stage. They were all above the boundary point of this level. Because of this, it was only a matter of time before they broke through to the Creation Stage. Therefore, they were not willing to waste their breath on this matter. Not to mention whether Chu Yunfan was easy to deal with, even if they delayed time and let others break through to the Creation Stage first, it would really be a burning fire.","Judging from the current situation of the prodigy list, the next step was to enter the Creation Stage collectively. It was obvious who was in the lead in this step. It was Li Qianyuan. No one wanted to fall behind others in this step.","As for Chu Yunfan?","According to another prodigy, “There’s an insurmountable gap between the Cosmos Stage and the Creation Stage. Even if Chu Yunfan’s combat strength is heaven-defying, it’s impossible for him to cross this gap. When we break through, he’ll just be a joke.”","When this prodigy’s words rang out, everyone immediately came to a realization. It was not that many prodigies were that magnanimous, but they understood that there was nothing more important than breaking through to the Creation Stage. Once they broke through to the Creation Stage, Chu Yunfan, who seemed to have soared to the top 30, would be just a joke.","The difference in combat strength between the Cosmos Stage and the Creation Stage was ten times or even dozens of times. If Chu Yunfan had been able to compete with them previously due to his various fortuitous encounters, then everything would return to square one after they entered the Creation Stage.","The divine dragon in the sky was still a divine dragon, and the ants on the ground were just ants. Even if they were to dominate for a moment, it would only be for a moment. The difference in the level of life was enough to flatten everything.","For a moment, a wave of people who looked down on Chu Yunfan started to stir up. Many people knew that the gap between the Cosmos Stage and the Creation Stage was like a chasm. It was like the difference between heaven and earth, and it was almost impossible to cross.","Although these prodigies were certain that they could break through to the Creation Stage, this stage was a chasm that 90% of the experts at the peak of the Cosmos Stage could not cross in their lifetime.","At this stage of cultivation, the difference in talent between each other was clear at a glance. Some geniuses could still soar all the way, while some people had already begun to slow down. It was as if they were shackled and could not take even half a step forward.","Therefore, there was a reason why everyone looked down on Chu Yunfan. If he wanted to match the Creation Stage in terms of combat strength, he would at least have to step into this cultivation level himself.","However, with Chu Yunfan’s current level, it was unknown how long it would take for him to enter the Creation Stage. At that time, who knew how high the prodigies on the prodigy list would be?","A gap of one step was a gap of many steps. The disadvantage of age was undoubtedly reflected. It was precisely because Chu Yunfan was not old enough that he could not compete with those older prodigies for the fortuitous encounters that he should have. His path of growth was destined to be more bumpy than others.","This wave quickly swept into the Flying Celestials and immediately poured a bucket of cold water on the enthusiasm of the sect to flatter Chu Yunfan.","Everyone immediately calmed down. Especially those who weren’t resolute, they decided to wait and see."]},{"number":1856,"title":"Chapter 1856 Changes in a Year, Everyone Entering the Creation Stage","paragraphs":["1856 Changes in a Year, Everyone Entering the Creation Stage","Chu Yunfan was naturally aware of this.","In fact, Chu Hongcai told Chu Yunfan about this news immediately. This wave had affected many neutral factions in the Flying Celestials. However, it was a different story for the Flying Celestials disciples.","After all, even if it was as they said, Chu Yunfan would be left behind by the others on the prodigy list in the short term, with his age and cultivation, his future was still limitless. Choosing to be Chu Yunfan’s follower was naturally an investment in the future, not in the short term. Therefore, after this trend started, although many people had some strange words, it did not have much of an impact on the overall situation.","Unless Chu Yunfan suddenly died, such strange words were not enough to shake his power. The higher-ups of the sect would not believe such nonsense. After all, they were investing in the future. As long as Chu Yunfan could grow, even if he was a little later than the current batch of geniuses, it was still of vital importance to the Flying Celestials.","These prodigies couldn’t improve endlessly. They had to reach the end, and that was when Chu Yunfan would show his strength.","However, that was just what everyone thought. Chu Yunfan had never thought about this. 10,000 years was too long, and he had to seize every minute. The others did not know how much effort Chu Yunfan had put in to break through to the Creation Stage. He had memorized all kinds of notes and books about the enlightenment of the Creation Stage. He knew more than many Creators.","If he wanted a breakthrough in his combat strength, he needed to put in a lot of effort. It was very difficult, but it was not impossible. Once he broke through, it would be a smooth road. He would be able to catch up with Li Qianyuan quickly and would no longer be bound by the cultivation level.","The following period of time was equally important to Chu Yunfan. Those prodigies on the prodigy list thought they were powerful and were unwilling to waste their breath on him. Chu Yunfan was also unwilling to waste his time on them.","As the two parties fell silent, Chu Yunfan leaped up. The matter of him being ranked 30th on the prodigy list was quickly forgotten by everyone. Although the name list changes on the prodigy list were famous for a while, in the end, it was only a confrontation between the younger generation. The prodigies that truly affected the world’s big figures did not change.","Time passed quickly in this atmosphere, and a year passed in the blink of an eye. The entire world underwent tremendous changes in this one year. The biggest change was undoubtedly the change in the prodigy list.","More than a year ago, the prodigy list announced that Li Qianyuan, the original number one on the prodigy list, had successfully entered the Creation Stage. In just over a year, more than half of the people on the prodigy list had entered the Creation Stage. Every once in a while, the prodigy list would change. The many prodigies who were originally of similar cultivation levels were separated.","After Li Qianyuan, many prodigies seemed to have been stimulated and broke through in a short time. As for the remaining people, although they had yet to break through, they were close. This was a situation that the upper echelons of the various large factions were willing to see. After all, the relationship between the various prodigies could not just be hostile to each other. It was a competition and mutual promotion.","In a sense, the existence of the prodigy list had stimulated the pride of these prodigies. No one was willing to fall behind others. And just half a year ago, Li Qianyuan, who was the first to enter the Creation Stage, had a change in his information. He was now in the second level of the Creation Stage.","After entering the first Creation Stage, Li Qianyuan took the lead in entering the second Creation Stage. This change stimulated many people to enter secluded cultivation overnight and crazily improve their strength.","As more than half of the experts on the prodigy list had already entered the Creation Stage, the remaining half, according to many people’s speculations, would be able to enter the Creation Stage in at least half a year or at most a year. At that time, the prodigy list would welcome an earth-shattering change.","Once these prodigies collectively stepped into the Creation Stage, they could only be said to be juniors who were highly valued. Many prodigies and geniuses now possessed the strength to influence the world. No matter how one looked at it, a Creator could not be treated as a junior. They would be great figures at the level of a sect leader in a second-rate sect.","To deal with this frequently changing situation, the Mysteries Pavilion took the opportunity to announce to the public that from now on, the rankings on the prodigy list would be updated in real-time instead of on a regular basis. As long as there was a change in the strength of the people on the list, it would immediately be displayed.","When this news came out, it caused a great uproar. This was the first time the Mysteries Pavilion had done this. In the past, they would release a new prodigy list every once in a while. Usually, there would not be any changes to the list for a long time. However, the situation had become confusing since Chu Yunfan entered the list a year ago.","After a period of accumulation, the prodigies entered a period of rapid eruption. Their strength changed with each passing day, and their strength improved every day.","“Due to the fact that the original mechanism of the prodigy list can no longer adapt to the increase in the strength of the current prodigies, we have especially changed the prodigy list to a real-time update mechanism.”","This was the only explanation the Mysteries Pavilion gave and they did not appear again after. However, the huge commotion it caused affected all the prodigies on the prodigy list, as well as those top-notch geniuses whose strength was already close to the prodigy list.","There were only 100 people recorded on the prodigy list, but there were many people who were just a little bit away from entering the prodigy list. The number might be ten times or even dozens of times that. These people were also paying attention to the real-time changes in the prodigy list.","Especially now that the list was updated in real-time, there was no need to wait for the next issue of the prodigy list to be released. This stimulated these prodigies to cultivate desperately. Those on the rankings wanted to keep their positions, while those who were not on the list wanted to be on the list.","Those at the bottom of the list wanted to overtake the geniuses at the top, while those at the top did not dare to slack off. Everyone cultivated day and night.","After these geniuses went into secluded cultivation, the situation in various places calmed down without the prodigies walking around. Over the past year, the world welcomed a rare period of peace. All kinds of open and secret struggles became much smaller, and none of them could shake the world."]},{"number":1857,"title":"Chapter 1857 Wherever the Flag Went, It Was Invincible","paragraphs":["1857 Wherever the Flag Went, It Was Invincible","The matters in the world were big and small, but in general, they were just matters between the top figures. However, those big shots who could really influence the situation of the world would not easily make a move. Once they made a move, it would definitely be a major event that would shake the world.","Therefore, the people who were the most in the limelight and the most active were none other than the young geniuses on the prodigy list. All kinds of things in the world that caused a sensation were more or less related to these geniuses. As time passed, the strength and influence of these geniuses continued to grow, and they gradually came to possess the ability to influence the world.","When these prodigies started secluded cultivation, the situation in the world suddenly became calm. As the rankings kept changing, many people suddenly realized that Chu Yunfan, who was famous a year ago, had fallen down to below 60th place.","From the original 35th place on the prodigy list, he had suddenly fallen to the 67th place. In front of him were all Creators. In other words, he was the number one person below the Creation Stage.","However, this title wasn’t a pleasant one, especially when Chu Yunfan had rushed into the top 30 and stepped on many prodigies. It had aroused the dissatisfaction of countless people. If Chu Yunfan could maintain his strength, it would be fine. Once Chu Yunfan showed the slightest fatigue, he immediately became the target of ridicule.","“It’s only been a year and he’s already fallen to 67th place. In another year, when the rest of the people have broken through to the Creation Stage, he’ll probably reach the end of the rankings. In another two years, when those geniuses behind have also broken through to the Creation Stage, he won’t even be able to stay on the prodigy list. In the end, he’s just a nouveau riche without any foundation.”","Almost everyone thought so. For a time, all kinds of strange theories spread. For a moment, Chu Yunfan had gained the recognition of the vast majority of people. After all, the Creation Stage was a natural moat in front of Chu Yunfan.","From the looks of it, he could cross this natural moat. The number of people who pursued him back then was now the number of people who mocked him. It was as if it was not enough to show how extraordinary they were.","Baotai, a border city, had undergone earth-shaking changes in just a few years after Chu Yunfan moved in. The city walls that had not been renovated for many years had been renovated, and the arrays and enchantments had been repaired and supplemented. In just a few years, Baotai had expanded to more than twice its original size.","The originally declining border town had now become a central city. The garrison troops that were stationed in this city had also been upgraded to an external army a year and a half ago. The presence of tens of thousands of soldiers greatly increased the sense of security in Baotai. In just over a year, many people had moved over from other places with their families. The city’s population exceeded a million, and it became a well-known economic and military town.","The ordinary citizens in Baotai did not know much about the changes on the prodigy list, nor did they know about the rumors. To them, they could clearly feel that ever since Chu Yunfan led the external army into the city, the entire city had improved.","The aristocratic families that were originally entrenched in Baotai relied on sucking the fat of the people to live a decadent and rich life. After Chu Yunfan uprooted these aristocratic families, the shackles on the ordinary people of Baotai were removed. Other than the taxes that had to be paid, there was no need to care about anything else, let alone all kinds of exorbitant taxes.","Baotai became more prosperous as the days went by.","Chu Yunfan had no interest in exploiting Baotai. Although he wanted to raise an army of tens of thousands of people, with his strict standards for the army, the resources consumed were countless. The income of Baotai alone was not enough to support such an army.","Fortunately, ever since he was promoted to Faraway General, the Imperial Court had changed its previous attitude of not caring about him. Not only did the Imperial Court allocate the best recruits, but it also allocated elites in all kinds of military affairs to Baotai.","Even so, it was still very difficult for Chu Yunfan to feed such an army. This was because he was ambitious and wanted to build a trump card army that far surpassed ordinary elites. Therefore, he was not stingy with all kinds of resources, especially with low-level cultivation resources. For the current Chu Yunfan, they were of no use at all, but for the external army, they were of great use.","In just a year, the entire army had undergone earth-shaking changes. Among the tens of thousands of troops, except for the members of the early Baotai garrison who had followed Chu Yunfan, who had long become Abstracts, the soldiers of Baotai had become Abstracts. The new recruits had also stepped into the Abstract Stage after more than a year of training.","With an Abstract army of over ten thousand people in his hands, it was hard to imagine how terrifying the army spirit could be. Chu Yunfan even dared to say that with this army, he could fight against a Creator without even fighting.","Within a year, the entire army had undergone earth-shattering changes. They were using the original guards of Baotai as a framework to expand. The ordinary guards of Baotai were promoted to low-level officers such as centurions.","In addition, Chu Yunfan’s reputation in the Flying Celestials had increased greatly. Countless people had attached themselves to him and became his followers. Among them, many elite disciples had been stuffed into the army by Chu Yunfan to become middle and high-level officers. These elite disciples were all experts at the Abstract Interpretation Stage and could be field officers. Now that they were all gathered together, such a configuration could simply be said to be super luxurious.","It was precisely because of the addition of these elite disciples that the entire army could undergo earth-shaking changes in just over a year. It truly possessed the standards of a strong army.","Chu Yunfan knew that a strong army couldn’t be raised in a greenhouse. When this army was established, they used the geographical advantage of being at the border to attack everywhere and pacify the place.","Originally, due to the lack of control over the border regions, Grand Xia was unable to control them well, causing all sorts of bandits to run amok. There were demons, the Hus, barbarians, and other foreign races that infiltrated the border regions.","In just over a year, they were all wiped out. They were either uprooted or fled thousands of miles away after hearing the name of the external army. Wherever the flag went, it was invincible."]},{"number":1858,"title":"Chapter 1858 Reporting to the Imperial City, Cultivation Advancement Is Near","paragraphs":["1858 Reporting to the Imperial City, Cultivation Advancement Is Near","In just over a year, the environment of Baotai had undergone earth-shaking changes. With a strong army like the external army guarding the city, the foreign tribes couldn’t infiltrate the border areas.","Chu Yunfan only had one attitude toward the forces that had infiltrated the city, and that was to uproot them. No matter who they were colluding with, if they were found out, they would be executed. Under the iron fist of lightning, even the local bandits were uprooted, let alone the forces of the foreign tribes that had infiltrated.","Originally, there were a large number of hu bandits living in the border areas. With the strength of the original Baotai garrison, it was naturally impossible to eliminate them. Once they left the city, they might be ambushed and completely wiped out.","Under such circumstances, these bandits were extremely arrogant. Now that the external army had risen, these bandits could only flee. After capturing all the bandits, Chu Yunfan beheaded them and built a warning to intimidate the bandits.","With a peaceful environment, Baotai naturally developed quickly. In just a year, it had developed by leaps and bounds and became the center of many nearby cities. After all, not all border towns had such conditions. This was no longer a frontline city, so it was naturally impossible for there to be elite troops stationed there.","Even when they were at the front line, it was impossible for them to defend against the attacks of all kinds of bandits. This was because the most elite troops were responsible for resisting the demon army and did not have the time to pacify the place. They could only defend the city from harassment. Some remote places would inevitably be harassed by these bandits. This was an old problem.","It wasn’t that Grand Xia didn’t want to resolve this, but Grand Xia was facing all-powerful enemies from all directions. Even with the strength of the empire, it was still a little difficult.","In addition, after Baotai became an inland city, the garrison troops were longer second-line local garrison troops. They could defend the city, but they were unable to go out to suppress the bandits. In addition, these bandits knew the severity of the situation and did not dare to attack the city. Otherwise, in a fit of anger, Grand Xia would be able to uproot these bandits in just a breath’s time.","Therefore, many cities turned a blind eye to these bandits. However, Chu Yunfan did not care about these unspoken rules. He basically killed everyone he caught without any mercy.","The entire area around Baotai became a forbidden zone. The people of Baotai could see the cavalry of the external army coming out of the city from time to time. Hundreds and thousands of them would take turns to exterminate the bandits. They would return triumphantly in a few days. The ordinary bandits were no match for the army. Even if there were some hidden experts among them, they were no match for the Flying Celestial disciples.","It was not until the actual extermination of the bandits that Chu Yunfan realized how chaotic the nearby area was. The supporters behind many bandits might be the disciples of some evil cult. However, they were basically no match for the Flying Celestial disciples. These were all the elite disciples of the sect.","In fact, Chu Yunfan had even encountered bandit leaders at the Cosmos Stage. Ordinary Flying Celestial disciples were not their match, and in the end, Chu Yunfan personally attacked and killed them in one blow.","After a few bandit leaders in the Cosmos Stage were killed, all the experts among the bandits fled. They all heard that a ruthless person had come.","On this day, Chu Yunfan was holding a document from the Grand Commandant’s Office in the commander’s office in Baotai. It was a promotion document promoting Chu Yunfan from Second Grade General to First Grade General.","The speed of his promotion was so fast that it would probably scare the eyes of many people. However, Chu Yunfan was not surprised. After more than a year, he was still the same as before. He looked like he was in his early twenties, and there was a hint of understanding and certainty in his expression.","In Chu Yunfan’s opinion, this was only a matter of course. In this year, he had personally killed more than ten Cosmics. They were all old bandits who had committed countless crimes and had accumulated a lot of blood debt. Therefore, Chu Yunfan didn’t show any mercy. These Cosmics were basically at the first, second, or third level of the Cosmos Stage. They were ranked at the bottom among the Cosmics.","However, even sixth or seventh-level Cosmics were no match for Chu Yunfan. They were all killed with one punch. There was no essential difference to him. Except for a few itinerant cultivators, the rest of the Cosmics were mostly disciples of the large sects in the outer realms. They had become bandits here for various reasons. They even supported many groups of bandits with the goal of plundering all kinds of resources to support their cultivation.","However, all of them had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands. In the past year, he had killed more than a dozen Cosmics. In addition to the ordinary bandits, there were more than 100,000 of them. It could be said that he was about to wipe out all the bandits near Baotai. Otherwise, those incomparably ferocious bandits would not have fled at the sight of the wind.","These were all real military achievements. Even if Li Qianyuan, a high-ranking official, wanted to suppress them, it was impossible. After all, the Grand Commandant’s Office was not an existence that Li Qianyuan could crush. It was a behemoth that specialized in managing senior officers above the general level.","After Chu Yunfan was promoted to First Grade General, he had to report to the Imperial City. This meant that he had stepped into the ranks of high-ranking military officers. Above that, he would be conferred the title of marquis.","However, this was the most difficult step. Grand Xia had millions of regular troops and tens of millions of second-line troops. Among them, there were many generals, but those who could successfully become marquises were still very few. Li Qianyuan was the only one in the younger generation.","However, since he had already reached this critical point, Chu Yunfan thought to himself that it was only a matter of time before he was granted the title of marquis. At that time, he would be able to sit on equal footing with Li Qianyuan and would not be afraid of Li Qianyuan’s schemes.","“It’s been a whole year. I’m getting moldy in Baotai. It’s time to go out,” Chu Yunfan said calmly.","To him, going to the Imperial City was not only to report on his work but also to take this opportunity to see if he could get news of Tang Siyu.","“However, there’s still a month before the debriefing. I’ll raise my cultivation to the fourth Cosmos Stage before I go to the Imperial City.”","Chu Yunfan’s eyes sparkled. No one else knew that his cultivation had reached the critical point of the third Cosmos Stage. He was only one step away from breaking through to the fourth level."]},{"number":1859,"title":"Chapter 1859 The Fourth Cosmos Stage, Strength Comparable to a Creater","paragraphs":["1859 The Fourth Cosmos Stage, Strength Comparable to a Creater","In this year, Chu Yunfan’s ranking on the prodigy list had dropped again and again. In the eyes of many, it would probably not be long before he fell off the prodigy list.","It seemed like an extraordinary feat to be able to conquer a cultivation level above one’s level with astonishing battle prowess. However, the drawbacks were finally about to show themselves. After all, Chu Yunfan’s cultivation level was lower than the others, and his battle prowess was one level higher. There was no doubt that it was difficult to compare with the others.","These rumors spread throughout the world, and even in the Baotai area, there were many such rumors. Naturally, they couldn’t hide it from Chu Yunfan’s eyes and ears, so the external army was very divided.","After such a long time, Chu Yunfan had completely subdued the entire external army and made them submit. After all, for such a long time, he had provided all kinds of cultivation resources, cultivation methods, manuals, and so on. It was enough to form a small sect. All of these were used on these ordinary soldiers, which was naturally enough to make them loyal.","To break through to the Void Stage in such a short period was an unreachable dream for ordinary soldiers. Moreover, this was only the beginning. To be able to follow such a prodigy on the prodigy list meant that their future was limitless. This was something that not only the disciples of the Flying Celestials could realize, but even the ordinary soldiers understood. Especially Chu Hongcai, You Chuyun, and the others were filled with righteous indignation.","However, Chu Yunfan did not comment. It was natural for his ranking on the prodigy list to drop. After all, everyone was improving themselves, but he was still standing still. But if everyone thought that he really had nothing to do, then they were really mistaken.","During this year, although his strength did not improve, he had been constantly comprehending the handwritten notes regarding the comprehension of the Creation Stage that he had seen in the Flying Celestial Library. He continued to comprehend and build a solid foundation for the final leap in his essence.","Now, it was finally time for him to try to break through to the fourth level of the Cosmos Stage. Once he broke through, his combat strength would also smoothly reach the Creation Stage. When one’s battle prowess crossed a major realm, there would also be an earth-shattering change.","Other than constantly studying the manual and increasing his comprehension of the Creation Stage, the most important thing was that Chu Yunfan was waiting for the Brahma Fruit to ripen.","The Brahma Fruit, which had been watered with the blood of many Cosmics, had finally grown to a stage that Chu Yunfan was satisfied with. It could help him reach the fourth level of the Cosmos Stage in one go.","Then, Chu Yunfan called You Chuyun over.","“I’ll be in seclusion for the next month. After that, I’ll head to the Imperial Capital to report on my work. You’ll be in charge of all the military affairs, big or small. Everyone will be under your command.”","“All right, Senior Chu.” You Chuyun nodded.","You Chuyun wasn’t unfamiliar with these things, and could even be said to be familiar with them. When Chu Yunfan was in seclusion, he was basically handling military affairs. In more than a year, his cultivation had reached the peak of the Abstract Interpretation Stage under Chu Yunfan’s special care. He was only one step away from becoming a true disciple of the Cosmos Stage.","However, he would need to spend some time to reach this step. Even so, this was far beyond his imagination. He had never thought that he would be able to enter the Cosmos Stage one day and become a true disciple. In the entire army, Chu Hongcai was the only other person who received such special treatment from Chu Yunfan. With Chu Yunfan’s guidance and the support of sufficient cultivation resources, it only took Chu Hongcai a little more than a year to smoothly enter the Void Stage. At this rate of cultivation, breaking through to the Cosmos Stage in a few years was just a matter of pushing the boat with the current. Such a speed of improvement made the entire army envious.","After giving instructions, Chu Yunfan entered the Mountain River Diagram and began his secluded cultivation. In the diagram, on the herb mountain, there was a bright red fruit growing on the Brahma Tree. It was the Brahma Fruit.","Chu Yunfan plucked the Brahma Fruit and immediately sat down cross-legged to eat it. Immediately, the Brahma Fruit turned into a terrifying energy torrent that rushed into every cell in his body.","The terrifying energy swept through everything, tearing his body apart. He felt as if every cell in his body was being torn apart. However, in the next moment, Chu Yunfan started to circulate the Emperor Method and continuously absorbed this energy torrent.","The energy contained in this Brahma Fruit far exceeded any of the ones he had consumed before. This was why Chu Yunfan had waited until now. He wanted to use this Brahma Fruit to break through to the fourth Cosmos Stage. As this energy was mobilized, it blocked in front of Chu Yunfan. Cracks finally appeared on the barrier of the fourth level of the Cosmos Stage.","Over the past year, Chu Yunfan had been constantly strengthening his foundation and had not tried to break through to the fourth level of the Cosmos Stage. This was because it was useless to just advance in cultivation level. One still needed to increase their combat strength by one level.","It didn’t take long for Chu Yunfan to open the barrier of the fourth Cosmos Stage.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan felt as if something in his mind had been broken through. He instantly felt the divine power in his body boiling. It was ten times, twenty times, or even thirty times more active than before. The crazy increase in divine power made him intoxicated. He even crazily absorbed the energy in the Brahma Fruit.","After breaking through the limit and reaching the fourth Cosmos Stage, Chu Yunfan felt that his journey was smooth. The original limit on his divine power disappeared without a trace. It doubled and tripled.","Chu Yunfan’s divine power continued to soar, and his strength increased crazily. It was like a flood breaking through a dam, crazily sweeping away all obstacles in front of him.","After a long time, Chu Yunfan finally exhaled and opened his eyes.","“I’ve finally broken through to the fourth Cosmos Stage.”","Chu Yunfan let out a breath and swept out like a long dragon.","He had just broken through to the fourth Cosmos Stage, but he could feel that his combat strength had increased by at least ten times. His cultivation had not broken through to the limit yet, so there was still room for further improvement.","This meant that the risk he had prepared to take had finally succeeded. He had completed this thrilling jump, and his battle prowess had successfully broken through to the Creation Stage. It would be meaningless for him to improve his cultivation and not break through the limits of the Cosmos Stage."]},{"number":1860,"title":"Chapter 1860 The Luck Dragon in Grand Xia’s Imperial Capital","paragraphs":["1860 The Luck Dragon in Grand Xia’s Imperial Capital","After breaking through, Chu Yunfan felt that his divine power was increasing crazily every second. Without any restrictions, he broke through like a galloping warhorse.","After breaking through to this level, Chu Yunfan finally understood how big the gap between the Creation Stage and the Cosmos Stage was. They were simply not on the same level.","This was especially true for those at the peak of the Cosmos Stage and the Creation Stage. Although there was only a thin line between them, the difference was at least ten times or even dozens of times.","When Jiang Wan’an wanted to kill him, victory was in his hands and he did not take him seriously at all. Even an ordinary Creator could easily kill an expert at the peak of the Cosmos Stage, not to mention that Jiang Wan’an was an outstanding one in the Creation Stage.","If he had known Chu Yunfan would sudden burst of Sword Light Talisman to severely injure him, he wouldn’t have been in such a sorry state. In the end, after Situ Xuan intervened, even Jiang Wan’an could only lower his head and admit his mistake.","It was no wonder that after Li Qianyuan broke through to the Creation Stage, almost all of those prodigies were completely stomping their feet because everyone knew that once Li Qianyuan broke through, he would far surpass them. If Li Qianyuan was only a little stronger than them before, he instantly left them in the dust behind after breaking through. It could even be said that the group of people added together was not Li Qianyuan’s opponent.","After Li Qianyuan entered the Creation Stage, another group of people entered the Creation Stage together. There was no gap in the prodigy list at first, but in an instant, there was a gap. There was a gap between the prodigies. The gap between the strongest and the weakest was clear at a glance.","But now, Chu Yunfan’s combat strength had broken through to the Creation Stage. It could be said that there had been an earth-shattering change. From then on, he definitely had the capital to compete with them.","His target was Li Qianyuan, who was currently ranked first. First-level Creators were not a match for Chu Yunfan, who had broken through rapidly. Even when facing Li Qianyuan, who had already reached the second Creation Stage, Chu Yunfan was not afraid. After transforming into a hou, he could fight Li Qianyuan.","However, no one in the outside world knew about it now. By breaking through in the Mountain River Diagram, this information was blocked from the divination of the Mysteries Pavilion. Unless Chu Yunfan made a move, no one would know.","Calculating the time, it was about time for Chu Yunfan to go to the Imperial Capital to report on his work. He came out of seclusion and went to a nearby large city. In such a large city, there were many teleportation arrays that could directly teleport a person to Grand Xia.","After all, Grand Xia was simply too vast. It was unknown how many tens of thousands of square kilometers it was. Without these teleportation arrays, if anything happened to Grand Xia, it would be impossible to resolve it.","With these teleportation arrays, no matter where the border was in trouble, they could immediately dispatch a large number of troops to suppress it. This was the reason why the empire of Grand Xia was as stable as Mount Tai.","Chu Yunfan was now the Imperial Court’s appointed general, so he could naturally use the Imperial Court’s special teleportation array, which was convenient and fast.","When Chu Yunfan opened his eyes again, he had already appeared in the Imperial Capital. Almost immediately, Chu Yunfan felt a dense aura hovering above the Imperial Capital. It was a sense of oppression.","This feeling was commonly known as luck.","Right now, Grand Xia was in a situation where the flames were burning and the people were loyal to it. Its luck could be said to be so dense that it could not be dissipated. The stronger the expert, the more they could feel the suppression of the luck.","Ordinary Creators would not be able to sense this kind of oppression as clearly as Chu Yunfan. Only Chu Yunfan, because of the godhead within him, had long reached the level where he could see mountains or water.","As far as his eyes could see, he could even feel a golden dragon coiling in the sky above the Imperial Capital, its cold gaze overlooking the entire world. The golden scales on its body flickered with a dazzling light under the sunlight. It was a Luck Dragon and was extremely powerful.","The Luck Dragon of a dynasty was closely related to the fate of the dynasty. If a dynasty entered the final stage, its Luck Dragon would also be listless and unable to intimidate the world. However, if a dynasty was at its peak, the power of the Luck Dragon was unimaginable.","Even the battle-seasoned Chu Yunfan could not help but suck in a breath of cold air when he saw it. This Luck Dragon enveloped the Imperial Capital of Grand Xia. No wonder those evil devils did not dare to be impudent.","All the demonic cultivators and heretics who came here would be affected by the Luck Dragon. Their strength would be suppressed by one level. Even those with weaker mental cultivation might be suppressed by several levels. An army of a million was nothing in front of the Luck Dragon.","Therefore, since ancient times, there had never been a record of the Imperial Capital of Grand Xia being attacked. No demonic cult would dare to have such thoughts unless the world was in chaos, the people were in dire straits, and the Luck Dragon was not supported by the people. Only then would the demonic cult have an opportunity to take advantage of it.","Since ancient times, no dynasty had ever been like this. However, Grand Xia had been working hard for generations, and the hearts of the people were loyal. Of course, it would not be easily shaken.","While Chu Yunfan was observing the Luck Dragon, he suddenly felt that the Luck Dragon seemed to have noticed his observation. It turned its head and looked at Chu Yunfan coldly.","Chu Yunfan was shocked. He felt an invisible pressure rising up and his body turned cold. However, after taking a look at Chu Yunfan, the Luck Dragon seemed to lose interest. It just turned its head and continued to look down on the world."]},{"number":1861,"title":"Chapter 1861 Princess Yun Yang","paragraphs":["1861 Princess Yun Yang","With just one glance, Chu Yunfan felt a chill run down his spine as if he had fallen into an ice cave. It was as if he was being stared at by an ancient vicious beast.","Although he was prepared, he realized how powerful and terrifying this Luck Dragon was after being looked at. Not to mention a Creator, even an expert who had surpassed the Creation Stage was probably not a match for this Luck Dragon.","Fortunately, Chu Yunfan already had an official position, and his body was tainted with the aura of Grand Xia, so he would not be targeted. If it were some evil cultivators, they would probably be killed by a glance.","After he was no longer targeted by the Luck Dragon and the Imperial Capital’s barrier, Chu Yunfan’s goosebumps finally disappeared. However, he soon realized that there were too many experts hiding in the Imperial Capital.","It was impossible for ordinary people to sense it, but Chu Yunfan was not an ordinary person. He could easily sense how many terrifying experts were hiding among them.","In fact, it was even stronger than what he had sensed in the Flying Celestials.","The Grand Xia Imperial Court was indeed the strongest power in the world. There were countless experts among them, and even the ten great sects had to submit to the Grand Xia Imperial Court and be used by them. Even the number one sect in the world, the Destiny Sect, was inferior to the Imperial Court of Grand Xia.","Chu Yunfan was wearing the Great General of the Faraway Army seal. Soon, the soldiers of the Grand Commandant’s Office led him through half of Grand Xia and arrived at the core area of Grand Xia, the Imperial Capital.","As the grand commandant was one of the three supreme dukes in the world, his office was in the Imperial Capital. However, the people who came and went were all soldiers from all over the world, and there was a somber atmosphere. Chu Yunfan could sense that there was an extremely terrifying expert hidden in the Grand Commandant’s Office. This person didn’t even hide their powerful aura to intimidate the small fries.","After Chu Yunfan revealed his identity, he was quickly led into the Grand Commandant’s Office and began his first debriefing. Contrary to Chu Yunfan’s expectations, it wasn’t too difficult. The two subordinates of the Grand Commandant’s Office simply asked him about some matters during his term of office and his views on the defense of Baotai and other areas. There were also questions about the experts that Chu Yunfan had encountered during the past year.","It was basically a routine inquiry, just a formality as the real investigation had begun a long time ago. According to the usual practice of the Grand Commandant’s Office, there was probably a thick stack of files about Chu Yunfan.","In particular, the two promotions of Chu Yunfan were definitely not just a matter of a single sentence from the grand commandant. It also involved the research of various materials and the assessment of loyalty to the Imperial Court.","All of this had been done long ago. After confirming that Chu Yunfan was fine, he was asked to come and report on his work. Therefore, all of this was just a formality.","After the debriefing, Chu Yunfan was informed that due to his recent performance and the repeated meritorious service of the army, the size of the army had been expanded from the original 10,000 to 50,000. His defense area had also expanded from Baotai and the area around the town to a defense area of 5,000 miles from Baotai, making his title of general truly worthy of its name.","Chu Yunfan did not get to meet the grand commandant. However, this was normal. The grand commandant held the power of the army. He was surely an extremely busy man. Chu Yunfan’s rank was not high enough for him to summon the grand commandant.","After leaving the Grand Commandant’s Office, Chu Yunfan went to the Flying Celestials’ outpost in the Imperial Capital. It was a manor with beautiful mountains and clear waters outside the Imperial Capital. Though it was outside the Imperial Capital, with the current business environment of the Imperial Capital, the value of this vast manor was immeasurable. The Flying Celestials’s foundation was evident.","As one of the six grand true disciples of the Flying Celestials, Chu Yunfan naturally had special treatment. He had a small courtyard in the manor to himself.","The Flying Celestial Garden was a common place for Flying Celestial disciples to stay after arriving in the Imperial Capital. Almost all the other large sects had similar residences in the Imperial Capital. This made it convenient for disciples to stay in the Imperial Capital.","In fact, this was not only in the Imperial Capital. A behemoth like the Flying Celestials had a station in almost every city so that the sect’s disciples could easily stay. It was just that the scale was different.","Chu Yunfan was not in a hurry to return to Baotai. He also wanted to take this opportunity to inquire about Tang Siyu’s whereabouts. As soon as he settled down, a disciple of the Flying Celestials came to report that someone had sent him an invitation.","“There will be a garden party tomorrow.” Chu Yunfan looked at the invitation card.","It was an invitation to attend a garden party. It was nothing much, but when he saw that the signature was by Princess Yun Yang, he asked the person in charge of the Flying Celestial Garden to find information about this princess. This was one of the main duties of the Flying Celestials’ outposts in various places.","Soon, all kinds of information about Princess Yun Yang was sent to Chu Yunfan, and he figured out the background of Princess Yun Yang. Currently, the Emperor of Grand Xia had many princes and princesses, and most of them were already adults. Therefore, the competition for the throne was especially intense.","However, unlike Great Wei, in Grand Xia, not only the princes would participate in the fight for the throne, but even the princesses were no exception. Since ancient times, there had been many ambitious princesses who participated in the fight for the throne.","The king of Grand Xia didn’t mind, and there were rumors that the position of the king of Grand Xia would be occupied by the capable. This had stimulated many princesses to participate in the fight for the throne.","Especially now that the emperor of Grand Xia had many children but did not appoint an official heir, it was obvious that he was encouraging these princes and princesses to show their abilities and choose the strongest one to inherit the throne.","Therefore, many princes and princesses joined the fight for the throne. Some joined the army, some entered politics, and cultivated their forces in all aspects. Among them, there were a few princes and princesses who had the loudest voices, including Princess Yun Yang.","Princess Yun Yang was the twelfth daughter of the current king. She had a noble status and her mother was an imperial consort. She had shown outstanding martial talent since she was young. Among the many princes and princesses, she was one of the best. After becoming an adult, she joined the fight for the throne. In Grand Xia, she also had a large number of followers and admirers."]},{"number":1862,"title":"Chapter 1862 Getting News About Tang Siyu","paragraphs":["1862 Getting News About Tang Siyu","A world of great strife!","This was a world of great conflict, and it was different from the dynasties of the Common Era. Grand Xia was surrounded by powerful foreign races, eyeing them covetously, ready to invade the Central Plains at any moment. It was because of this that every generation had to choose a powerful ruler. Once they chose a weak ruler, the Central Plains would face the danger of destruction.","Because of this, the competition for the throne of each generation was a stage for the princes and princesses to show off their abilities. This was especially true for these princes and princesses. Each of them enjoyed the best education and the most resources in the imperial family. The cultivation resources that ordinary people could only dream of but could not obtain were nothing to them.","This was passed down from generation to generation. Almost every generation of the imperial family would have many experts who would shock the world. These princes and princesses were all outstanding figures among their peers. In addition, many of their followers and allies were also outstanding figures. The fight for the throne often involved the top geniuses and elites in the world.","In Grand Xia, it was not popular to protect each other. They only followed one principle, and that was natural selection. The competition for resources had already been engraved into their bones. Those who were qualified to participate, they were all the best among their peers, and many of them were even the upper echelons of Grand Xia. The cultivation of such a person consumed a huge amount of resources. If they could not advance further, how could they obtain so many resources?","Whether it was the sect’s needs or their own needs, they had no choice but to join the fight for the throne and choose a prince or princess to assist him.","Every battle for the throne was extremely intense. This was why the rulers of Grand Xia were all heroes, and the important officials of the court were all dragons and phoenixes among men. Only one in a million could make Grand Xia prosper.","‘Princess Yun Yang? Interesting.’ Chu Yunfan smiled.","The internal affairs of Grand Xia did not object to the choice of the various officials. They even turned a blind eye to it. This was the same principle as the true Flying Celestial disciples would have a large number of followers around them. No matter who won or lost, they would have a large number of strong supporters. Only then would they be able to firmly grasp the power in their hands.","Chu Yunfan didn’t want to go at first, but there was a silver bracelet attached to the invitation letter. If it was an outsider, they would not have think much of this bracelet. But when Chu Yunfan saw it, he trembled.","Wasn’t this silver bracelet Tang Siyu’s communication bracelet?","This high-tech bracelet was not something that Grand Xia could produce.","‘Princess Yun Yang...’ Chu Yunfan thought.","He originally didn’t plan to attend this garden party, but now he had decided to attend this to find out more. He had only managed to gather news about Tang Siyu from Ye Qiushui, which was that Tang Siyu was favored by the eldest princess and had asked the king for the identity of Princess Gushe. Now, she was under the eldest princess’ tutelage and was cultivating in the secret realm of the imperial family.","That was why Chu Yunfan had wanted to come to the Imperial Capital—to inquire about Tang Siyu. Previously, he had not taken any action. It was not that he could not come to the Imperial Capital, but at that time, he was just an ordinary minor character. Even if he came to the Imperial Capital, it was impossible for him to obtain any news.","The eldest princess was the aunt of the current king. She chose to support the current king’s ascension, and she had made great contributions to this cause. Although she gradually retreated behind the scenes after the current king ascended the throne, her influence had not decreased in the slightest. In fact, it had even increased.","Before, Chu Yunfan was just an ordinary disciple of the Flying Celestials and didn’t even have the right to visit them. Therefore, no matter how anxious he was, he could only suppress his anxiety.","However, it was different now. He was already one of the six great true Flying Celestial disciples. His reputation was just below Yang Dengxian’s, and he was also a famous character on the prodigy list. This series of status buffs was enough for Chu Yunfan to have the qualifications and ability to inquire about Tang Siyu.","Now that Princess Yun Yang had sent this bracelet over, it was clear that she wanted to tell Chu Yunfan that she knew some things about Tang Siyu.","“Since you want to invite me so much, I’ll go and take a look.”","Three days passed in the blink of an eye.","Outside the Imperial Capital, satellite towns were scattered all around the Imperial Capital. In one of the towns, it was crowded early in the morning. Countless people came from all over the country to this town because today was the official start of Princess Yun Yang’s garden party.","“Princess Yun Yang’s annual garden party is about to begin. This is a major event in the Imperial Capital. Every year, it attracts countless young talents to participate. There are even experts on the prodigy list who come because of its fame.”","“That’s right. Now that Princess Yun Yang’s reputation is growing, the influence of the garden party is also growing. Originally, only some of Princess Yun Yang’s followers would participate. Now, as long as they have time, all the geniuses in the Imperial Capital and even the nearby provinces and counties will come to participate.”","“This is only natural. Princess Yun Yang is a popular candidate to become the future king. Her strength is unfathomable. Even the current king said that if Princess Yun Yang wasn’t a woman, she might’ve even surpassed the princes.”","In a restaurant in the town, many guests were discussing animatedly, and most of the content was about Princess Yun Yang’s garden party. After all, this was a rare event in this town. It was only because Princess Yun Yang’s manor was in this town. Otherwise, these people would not have been able to get such benefits.","“I wonder what Princess Yun Yang’s current strength is. It’s said that her strength is almost on par with the prodigies on the prodigy list. However, the Mysteries Pavilion is afraid of the imperial family and doesn’t rank the experts of the imperial family. This is why many people can’t guess.”","“Many experts have come this time, and they’re from the top ten sects. We might even get the chance to see Princess Yun Yang personally take action,” someone said confidently, but the others did not believe him.","Chu Yunfan leaned against a window and listened to these words.","Although Princess Yun Yang rarely made a move, she was probably not a kind person either. According to the news from the Flying Celestials, Princess Yun Yang had displayed astonishing martial talent when she was very young. However, after she grew up, her talent in this aspect gradually disappeared as if she had vanished."]},{"number":1863,"title":"Chapter 1863 Looking Down on Chu Yunfan?","paragraphs":["1863 Looking Down on Chu Yunfan?","However, this was only surface information. Princess Yun Yang had indeed stopped fighting in recent years. However, even the analysis of the information sent by the Flying Celestials did not quite believe that Princess Yun Yang would suddenly lose her talent and become ordinary.","Princess Yun Yang might be mediocre in terms of strength, but her reputation within the court was strong. This made her even more terrifying.","Chu Yunfan didn’t know if Princess Yun Yang wanted to hide her strength, but from the conversation of these people, it seemed that Princess Yun Yang’s plan to hide her strength had failed. It was impossible to hide fully. No one would believe that she had really become mediocre. However, based on Princess Yun Yang’s situation, perhaps she had wanted to create such a result to reflect her strength.","These people’s words made Chu Yunfan understand why there was no ranking of the imperial family’s experts in the prodigy list. This was very strange to him at first. Every sect and every faction had experts who entered the rankings, but the non one from the powerful imperial family had entered the prodigy list. This was strange. After all, in Chu Yunfan’s opinion, the number one sect among the ten great sects, the Destiny Sect, might not be as powerful as the imperial family.","The imperial family occupied the center of the Central Plains, and whether it was resources or foundations, they were the best. In addition, generations of kings had been top-notch experts, and their genes were passed down from generation to generation. It would be wrong to say that there were no top-notch experts.","It turned out that the Mysteries Pavilion and the imperial family had a tacit agreement not to place the members of the imperial family on the rankings.","‘Is that’s the case, the Mysteries Pavilion isn’t unscrupulous. There are still things that can make them hesitate,’ Chu Yunfan thought to himself.","The waters of this world ran deep.","“Every time there’s a garden party, there’ll be top geniuses from the top ten sects. This time is no exception. I heard that Huyan Zhuo of the Destiny Sect is here. He’s ranked 45th on the prodigy list. His strength has already reached the Creation Stage.”","When this person was mentioned, many people started to stir. The Destiny Sect was the number one sect in the world. In this year’s prodigy list, there were several people from the sect who had managed to enter. Among them, Huyan Zhuo was ranked last. However, even if he was ranked last in Destiny, in the eyes of outsiders, he was still a high and mighty genius.","“Besides Huyan Zhuo from Destiny, Zhang Feng from Great Change Faith is also here. I heard that his strength is on par with Huyan Zhuo’s. He’s ranked 50th on the list. Tsk, tsk. He’s really amazing!”","“That’s right. They will surely be the biggest attraction of this garden party.”","“Although everyone is from the top ten sects, there are strong and weak ones. For example, although the Flying Celestials is one of the top ten sects, it is true that other than Yang Dengxian, there hasn’t been another person who has managed to stand out.”","“That’s right. However, even if Yang Dengxian is the overlord of the Flying Celestials, there are countless young experts in our Imperial Capital. It’s impossible for him to be ranked at the top. Some people want to be on the prodigy list but can’t, while some people are unwilling to do so even if they have the chance. The gap between them is too great.”","“Any outstanding disciple of my sect, Great Change Faith, can easily defeat the Flying Celestials’ top disciples. There’s also the younger generation experts from the Holy Puppets, Medicinal Kings Valley, and the Divine Talisman Sect. It’s not difficult at all,” a young man in yellow said loudly. His expression was somewhat unscrupulous.","“Actually, I’ve always felt that there’s no need to list the top ten sects. Some sects have been at the bottom for so many years. It’s better to give up their positions to other sects.”","Hearing the arrogant words of this young man in yellow, many people in the restaurant had ugly expressions. From their attire, it could be judged that they were the disciples of the sects that had been named.","These people all regarded the sect’s honor as their lives. Now that this yellow-clothed youth actually dared to look down on them so much, everyone’s was naturally angered.","There were always conflicts between the top ten sects. If Destiny, Virtuous Academy, and Great Change Faith were the upper circle of the top ten sects, then the Flying Celestials, the Holy Puppets, Medicinal Kings Valley, and the Divine Talisman Sect were the lower circle of the top ten sects. This was especially true for the Flying Celestials.","The three sects—the Holy Puppets, Medicinal Kings Valley, and the Divine Talisman Sect—always had outstanding geniuses and shocked the world. But in terms of combat strength, these three sects were at the bottom. This was because the main direction of these three sects leaned toward support rather than direct combat. Although many people were unwilling to face the experts of these three sects, if they really fought, these three sects were indeed at the bottom.","However, the Flying Celestials was different. It didn’t have many restrictions, and besides the three bottom sects, they were the weakest sect. Even Yang Dengxian, the strongest in the Flying Celestials, was only ranked 20th on the prodigy list.","This was a very awkward situation.","The conflicts between the top ten sects were not small, and the conflicts between the upper circle and the lower circle were also not small. The disciples of the upper circle looked down on the disciples of the lower circle, and the disciples of the lower circle were equally indignant.","“That’s right. I heard that Chu Yunfan was ranked 30th before, but now he’s completely fallen. I estimate that in less than two years, he’ll completely fall out. In fact, many people’s strength has long surpassed his, but the ranking hasn’t changed,” the yellow-clothed youth said arrogantly.","“You’re talking nonsense. Do you think you’re qualified to talk about Senior Chu?” a young man spoke up.","“Who are you?” The yellow-robed youth glanced at the young man in the Flying Celestials’ standard moon-white robe.","“I’m Yangshuo of the Flying Celestials,” the young man said coldly.","“Yangshuo? Never heard of you. The Flying Celestials is only famous for Yang Dengxian and Chu Yunfan. I’ve heard of them. Why? Do you have any different opinions?” The youth in yellow sneered.","“Everything knows how to toot their horn. If you have the ability, let’s have a competition,” Yangshuo said.","“Why wouldn’t I dare? I, Lin Feng of Great Change Faith, will show you my skills.” The yellow-robed youth stood up. “This place is too small for me to properly show my skilled. Let’s go to the sky.” Lin Feng then instantly disappeared from where he was.","“A true disciple. He’s definitely a true disciple!”","Many people in the restaurant were excited. It was rare to see an expert of this level anytime and anywhere, especially a true disciple of the top ten sects."]},{"number":1864,"title":"Chapter 1864 Ye Yin Lowers His Head, Everyone Is Shocked","paragraphs":["1864 Ye Yin Lowers His Head, Everyone Is Shocked","“Hmph!” Yangshuo snorted coldly and disappeared from the spot he stood as well.","Everyone saw both parties appear in the sky through their divine wills.","“Flying Celestial Palm Strike!”","Yangshuo snorted coldly and took the lead to attack. He directly sent out a terrifying Flying Celestial Palm Strike.","“A fourth-level Cosmic!”","As soon as Yangshuo made his move, Chu Yunfan had already judged his strength. He had never seen Yangshuo before. There were too many true disciples in the Flying Celestials, and he couldn’t have met every one of them. Yangshuo’s strength was at most on par with Wang Yifan’s.","“Go to hell!” Opposite him, Lin Feng attacked and shouted, “Great Change Punch!”","Boom!","As this punch was thrown, the entire world shook violently. This punch instantly pierced through Yangshuo’s Flying Celestial Palm Strike and landed on his body.","Spurt!","Yangshuo spat out a mouthful of blood and flew backward like a kite with a broken string. With just one attack, Yangshuo was defeated!","“The Seventh Cosmos Stage!”","Everyone sucked in a breath of cold air. There was no lack of people present who had good eyesight. Naturally, they could see that Lin Feng’s cultivation had already reached the seventh level of the Cosmos Stage. Although he was far from being comparable to the prodigies on the prodigy list, he was definitely one of the best among the ordinary true disciples.","No wonder Yangshuo was instantly defeated.","“Trash. The Flying Celestials just doesn’t cut it,” Lin Feng said coldly. His gaze swept over the crowd, and many people lowered their heads.","Although many of the Flying Celestials disciples were still glaring at Lin Feng, none of them dared to challenge him. This year, Princess Yun Yang’s garden party had attracted a lot of powerhouses. There were mant powerful people from the Flying Celestials as well.","Even though Yangshuo was defeated by Lin Feng in just one move, his strength was not considered weak among the true Flying Celestial disciples. One could imagine that with Lin Feng’s strength, it was almost no difficulty for him to suppress the Flying Celestial disciples present.","Lin Feng descended and reentered the restaurant. Before this, everyone thought that he was arrogant, but now, many people present did not think so. They felt that unless it was a prodigy on the prodigy list who made a move, no one could firmly suppress him.","“Senior Lin, it’s been a few years since we last met. Your strength has improved.” A disciple of Great Change Faith came forward to greet Lin Feng.","Other experts who were on good terms with Lin Feng also stepped forward. Only the Flying Celestial disciples were indignant. As for the disciples of the Holy Puppets, the Divine Talisman Sect, and the Medicinal Kings Valley, although they weren’t happy, they were already used to it. They weren’t good at fighting, so they were already used to being at the bottom. The role of these three great sects was not in this.","“Of course, I’ve been traveling. I wouldn’t have come back until I reached the peak of the Cosmos Stage.” Lin Feng nodded proudly. “Defeating such a small character is not worth mentioning at all. Unless it’s a great true disciple, I’m not interested.”","Lin Feng was too lazy to say anything. Although they were all from one of the top ten sects, the difference between the three sects in the upper circle and the few sects in the lower circle was simply heaven and earth. Even though they were all true disciples, the true disciples of the three great sects in the upper circle were clearly stronger.","Without such strength, how could he dare to say such arrogant words.","“Lin Feng, you injured a disciple of the Flying Celestials, and you dare to boast shamelessly. You look down on the Flying Celestials. Today, I’ll defeat you.”","A calm voice came from outside the restaurant. Everyone looked toward the source of the voice and saw a man in a moon-white robe. He looked to be around 27 or 28 years old and was staying in front of Yangshuo.","“Ye Yin?” When Lin Feng saw this man, his expression finally became slightly solemn. He could look down on Yangshuo, but he couldn’t ignore Ye Yin.","Ye Yin was one of the great true Flying Celestial disciples. In terms of strength, unless they were a prodigy on the prodigy list, no one dared to take him lightly.","“Now you are a worthy opponent,” Ye Yin said, his expression arrogant as he looked at Lin Feng.","However, when Ye Yin’s gaze swept across the restaurant, he spotted Chu Yunfan leaning against the window with a leisurely expression.","Ye Yin’s pupils contracted slightly as he recalled the time he was defeated by Chu Yunfan. Although it was more than a year ago, it was still vivid in his mind.","“You’re here?” A bitter smile appeared on his face. “It’s unnecessary for me to stick out my neck then.”","Ye Yin had been defeated by Chu Yunfan a year ago. Now, his strength had also improved, but it was still insufficient to deal with Chu Yunfan a year ago, let alone the current Chu Yunfan.","Everyone’s eyes followed Ye Yin’s gaze and turned to Chu Yunfan. Many people were shocked because they couldn’t even tell when there was a person sitting by the window with a leisurely look. This was almost impossible for experts who had cultivated to their level. Within a certain range, everything was covered by their divine wills.","However, right now, within the range of their divine wills, there was actually a person sitting there so openly, and they actually couldn’t sense it at all before. As expected, after many people closed their eyes, they that there was no one at the table by the window. It was clearly an empty seat.","Of course, they didn’t think that they had misjudged him. There was only one possibility. This was an expert, a terrifying expert. He could conceal his aura and not let them detect him at all.","“I recognize him. I’ve seen his drawings before. Isn’t that Chu Yunfan?” someone suddenly exclaimed.","His words immediately blew up the entire restaurant. Everyone’s pupils instantly constricted. It was another prodigy on the prodigy list.","The most important thing was that they were just discussing Chu Yunfan, which had led to the battle between Lin Feng and Yangshuo. Now, the main character was right in front of them. Even though they were thick-skinned, they still felt a little embarrassed.","Only now did everyone understand why Ye Yin would treat this young man with such courtesy and be at a disadvantage. Many people remembered that there was once a report that Ye Yin had been defeated by Chu Yunfan. It had only been a year since then, but many people still remembered it.","Even Lin Feng and the others’ expressions changed instantly. No matter how disdainful they were toward Chu Yunfan in their words just now, he was still a true prodigy on the prodigy list. Chu Yunfan’s fame alone was enough to intimidate them."]},{"number":1865,"title":"Chapter 1865 An Easy Instant Kill","paragraphs":["1865 An Easy Instant Kill","Just the words “prodigy list” alone were enough to form a deterrent force.","Although many people felt that Chu Yunfan’s ranking on the prodigy list was the biggest exaggeration, no matter what, he was still on the list. No wonder even Ye Yin had to lower his head.","Chu Yunfan did not comment on Ye Yin’s words. With his strength, if he deliberately hid, these people would not have noticed him.","“It doesn’t matter. You can stand up to him. He’s just an insignificant person anyway.” Chu Yunfan waved. He didn’t want to get involved.","When Lin Feng heard this, his face instantly turned red. Chu Yunfan’s attitude was exactly the same as when he didn’t care about Yangshuo. At that time, he felt that there was no problem at all. However, he now realized that this was simply a blatant humiliation.","“Chu Yunfan, how dare you look down on me!” Lin Feng stared at Chu Yunfan angrily.","In his opinion, a mere fake actually dared to be so arrogant. Although it had only been a year, the situation of the entire prodigy list had undergone a world-shaking change.","“I’m sorry, I wasn’t targeting you,” Chu Yunfan said.","When the Great Change Faith disciples heard this, their faces lit up. So what if it was Chu Yunfan? He still had to know his own limits. The Flying Celestial disciples glared at Chu Yunfan. How could they show weakness at this time?","“I mean to say that all of Great Change Faith is trash.”","As soon as Chu Yunfan finished speaking, a commotion broke out. No one had expected him to have such a turn of events. Many people didn’t know whether to laugh or cry. When the Flying Celestial disciples reacted, they were already laughing their heads off.","Weren’t these Great Change Faith disciples looking down on the Flying Celestials? Now, Chu Yunfan was using his own methods to control them.","This was a slap to the Great Change Faith disciples, and their faces flushed red with anger.","“Chu Yunfan! How dare you insult my sect! No one in the world can save you now! Everyone, let’s attack together and make him pay!”","Lin Feng was burning with anger. With a command, several Great Change Faith disciples stood up and surrounded Chu Yunfan. Humiliating a sect was the biggest provocation in this world. It was like how Yangshuo knew he couldn’t beat Lin Feng but still wanted to attack. These people regarded their sect’s honor as their own life.","The Great Change Faith disciples knew that Chu Yunfan was on the prodigy list, but they couldn’t care less. Moreover, these people were all true disciples. They were the cream of the crop among the tens of thousands of Great Change Faith disciples, so they naturally had their pride.","“You’re courting death!”","The Great Change Faith disciples instantly erupted with their auras. One could imagine how terrifying they were. Many experts in the restaurant instinctively began to work together to form a barrier to prevent these true disciples from blowing the entire restaurant into pieces. Any one of these people could easily blast this town into pieces with their full strength.","“Great Change Punch!” Lin Feng attack. Compared to the time when he was dealing with Yangshuo, the fist force that erupted from this punch was more than twice as terrifying.","When he was dealing with Yangshuo, he didn’t use his full strength. Only now did he use his full strength. The terrifying strength of a seventh level Cosmic was instantly displayed. At the same time, the other Great Change Faith disciples also performed the Great Change Punch.","“It has appeared! The Great Change Punch!” someone exclaimed.","The status of the Great Change Punch in Great Change Faith was the same as the Flying Celestial Palm Strike of the Flying Celestials. They were the ultimate techniques of the sect, and usually, only true disciples and above would be taught them. This was a martial art that many true Great Change Faith disciples had to learn.","At this moment, these true Great Change Faith disciples all used the Great Change Punch at the same time, forming a formation. The fist force condensed together and turned into a terrifying fist print that smashed down on Chu Yunfan. Although the Great Change Faith disciples were furious, they still remembered that Chu Yunfan was a prodigy on the prodigy list. Naturally, they had to be careful.","“You lot are so noisy!”","Faced with the terrifying fist force that seemed to be able to blast a huge hole in the sky, Chu Yunfan only sneered and stretched out a finger.","Bam!","The terrifying attack was blocked by Chu Yunfan’s finger. He exerted a little force, and the huge fist that was like a millstone suddenly shattered, turning into spirit energy that filled the sky and dissipated.","Everyone was stunned. No one had expected Chu Yunfan to block this terrifying punch so easily. Even Lin Feng and the others were the same. The strength of everyone working together was something that even the geniuses on the prodigy list had to treat seriously. Who would have thought that Chu Yunfan would be able to disintegrate their attacks so easily?","Before they could react, Chu Yunfan waved the teacup in his hand. The tea in the teacup turned into water arrows and flew toward Great Change Faith disciples.","Spurt!","Spurt!","Spurt!","The Great Change Faith disciples spat out a mouthful of blood as if they had been hit hard. They flew out of the restaurant and landed on the ground.","Immediately, the entire place was filled with grief. The Great Change Faith disciples clutched their chests and screamed. Some people saw that their chests had caved in. Their sternum had actually been broken by the water arrow.","In an instant, the Great Change Faith disciples were severely injured, causing them to lose their basic combat strength. Thinking of this, many people sucked in a breath of cold air.","These disciples were all true disciples of the Cosmos Stage. Among them, Lin Feng was a terrifying existence at the seventh Cosmos Stage. Even if he wasn’t as good as the prodigies on the prodigy list, the difference wasn’t too great. Their bodies were as hard as metal, especially their bones. They were akin to divine weapons that could not be broken easily.","However, Chu Yunfan had only used tea turned into water arrows, and he was able to severely injure them. The difference between them was too great. It was simply impossible to calculate.","“So strong... Is this the strength of an expert on the prodigy list?” someone said in a daze.","The expected battle did not happen. A simple cup of tea had ended the battle."]},{"number":1866,"title":"Chapter 1866 Chu Yunfan, the One Taken Seriously","paragraphs":["1866 Chu Yunfan, the One Taken Seriously","There was no fierce battle. The barrier that everyone had formed to prevent the restaurant from being destroyed was useless. Chu Yunfan only needed a cup of tea to finish off Lin Feng and the others.","There was no doubt that the difference was huge. It could even be said that it was simply an instant kill.","At this moment, even those who didn’t understand the situation could see that Chu Yunfan’s strength was far above Lin Feng and the others. It could even be said that they were not on the same level.","“Is this the strength of a prodigy on the prodigy list? The difference is actually so great.”","Only now did many people finally realize that their previous estimation was probably wrong. Originally, they thought that even if Lin Feng and the others were not as good as the prodigies on the prodigy list, other than those prodigies who had already stepped into the Creation Stage, the gap should not be so great. Even if they were defeated, it should be after a bitter battle.","However, reality had given them a hard slap. There was no such thing as defeat after a bitter battle. A prodigy on the prodigy list had defeated them with just a cup of tea. The gap between them simply could not be calculated with reason.","What was even more terrifying was that the person who displayed such terrifying combat strength was actually Chu Yunfan, who they thought was a fake. Didn’t this mean that others could be even more terrifying?","The difference between being on the prodigy list and not was huge.","Many people stared at the scene in front of them with their mouths agape. They felt that their worldview had completely collapsed. The only person who didn’t find anything strange was Ye Yin. He still remembered how he was defeated by Chu Yunfan. He had been floored by Chu Yunfan in a few moves. At that time, Chu Yunfan had only just entered the prodigy list and was only ranked 100th. He was far from his current position.","Now that more than a year had passed, Chu Yunfan had become even more terrifying. Lin Feng’s strength was equal to Chu Yunfan’s from a year ago. However, when he faced Chu Yunfan, he couldn’t even block a cup of tea and was injured by a water arrow.","This was not just a defeat, it was a humiliation!","At this moment, Ye Yin was a little glad that he had not been defeated by Chu Yunfan in such a humiliating manner. Originally, because his strength had just improved, he had wanted to challenge Chu Yunfan to regain his lost reputation. But at this moment, that thought had completely disappeared.","In a year or so, Ye Yin’s progress was not small. Even he was confident that he was at least twice as strong as he was a year ago.","Li Qianyuan, who was on the prodigy list, had entered the Creation Stage. Not only did it stimulate the others on the prodigy list, but even Ye Yin, who was interested in the prodigy list, was also greatly stimulated. They realized that if this continued, they would only be pulled further and further away from those on the prodigy list. They would have to bury their heads in bitter cultivation for more than a year.","Under the cultivation of the Flying Celestials regardless of the cost, Ye Yin had made his combat strength double. However, when facing Chu Yunfan, he still seemed so small. He felt a huge gap.","A year had passed, but the gap between him and Chu Yunfan had not narrowed. Instead, it had widened.","After coming to this conclusion, Ye Yin smiled bitterly. He was even more shocked in his heart. Was Chu Yunfan some sort of a monster?","Chu Yunfan’s combat strength could still multiply without breaking through to the Creation Stage. It was as if there was no limit. He was simply like a monster.","It was like a top student and a study god. A top student scored 100 points because there were 100 points, while a study god scored 100 points because he could only score 100 points to gain. The results seemed to be the same, but in reality, they were worlds apart. Once the points were raised to 1,000 points or 10,000 points, the difference between them would be clear at a glance.","Everyone looked at Chu Yunfan. They finally understood why he didn’t intervene when he saw that scene. In his opinion, their fight was as boring as children playing house. He had no desire to intervene in the slightest. If Lin Feng and the others hadn’t attacked Chu Yunfan, he wouldn’t have attacked them. Thinking of this, everyone felt a little aggrieved. The strength they were proud of was not worth mentioning in front of Chu Yunfan.","On the other hand, the Flying Celestial disciples were delighted. They were completely powerless to deal with Lin Feng’s humiliation. In the end, they could only ask Ye Yin to step in. Who knew that Chu Yunfan was also in the Imperial Capital? And he had severely injured Lin Feng and the others with a single move, displaying shocking strength.","Suddenly, they felt that they had found the backbone of this garden party. It was not the original leader, Ye Yin, but Chu Yunfan, who had suddenly appeared.","The Flying Celestials disciples were stunned for a moment before they came forward to greet him.","“Greetings, Senior Chu!”","Chu Yunfan glanced around and found that these Flying Celestials disciples were all true disciples. There were no elite disciples or inner disciples. However, this made sense. With Princess Yun Yang’s reputation, those were invited to this garden party had to be at least true disciples or elite disciples of various sects. Even extremely famous geniuses would find it difficult to attract her attention. After all, these true disciples were all extremely famous geniuses in their early years—-people who made their peers feel despair.","“Sit.” Chu Yunfan made an inviting gesture.","These true disciples were excited, especially Yangshuo, who was grateful. Previously, he had suffered a crushing defeat at the hands of Lin Feng and could not even withstand a single attack. Who knew that the tables would turn and karma would come so quickly?","Lin Feng was easily taught a lesson by Chu Yunfan, and he was instantly grateful to Chu Yunfan.","At this moment, they did not look like the mighty true Flying Celestial disciples. On the contrary, they were no different from ordinary disciples.","“Senior Chu, are you here to attend the garden party?” one of the true disciples asked.","“Yes, I am. I was invited by Princess Yun Yang.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","“As expected. You are definitely qualified to be invited, Senior Chu. However, we’re different. We came here on our own,” another true disciple said.","At this time, Chu Yunfan learned from the others that although these people had come to attend the garden party, they did not have an invitation. In fact, only a few had gotten invitations. The rest came on their own. However, Princess Yun Yang did not refuse them.","Therefore, whether or not a person could get an invitation had inadvertently become a measure of whether or not they were a heavyweight.","Suddenly, just as everyone was talking, a loud shout came from outside the building.","“Chu Yunfan! Come out!”"]},{"number":1867,"title":"Chapter 1867 Just Another Person Who’s Here to Deliver His Head","paragraphs":["1867 Just Another Person Who’s Here to Deliver His Head","Everyone in the restaurant looked at Chu Yunfan.","“It’s Zhang Feng of Great Change Faith!”","Someone revealed this person’s identity. It was a true disciple of Great Change Faith, Zhang Feng, on the prodigy list?","Everyone trembled slightly. They were still shocked by Chu Yunfan’s strength, but Zhang Feng’s ranking on the prodigy list was above Chu Yunfan. Most importantly, Zhang Feng had truly entered the Creation Stage. Once he entered that level, it was enough to separate him from the Cosmics.","There were quite a number of Cosmics in the restaurant. Although they had not reached the Creation Stage, there were quite a number of masters in their various sect who were in the Creation Stage. Therefore, they were not unfamiliar with this. They naturally understood that once a person broke through to the Creation Stage, their combat strength would increase tenfold.","Against a Creator, it was meaningless to have more Cosmos Stage experts. Even the best Cosmics—the peak Cosmics—and even those on the prodigy list were all the same. If they had crossed it, they had crossed it. If they hadn’t crossed it, they hadn’t crossed it. The gap between them was simply incomparable.","However, no one was surprised by Zhang Feng’s arrival. It was just like how Lin Feng humiliated the Flying Celestials, causing Yangshuo, Ye Yin, and Chu Yunfan to appear one after another.","Chu Yunfan had beaten Lin Feng and the others up and even said that Great Change Faith was trash. It would be strange if Great Change Faith did not do anything.","At this moment, Ye Yin grew worried. Zhang Feng had clearly come with ill intentions. No matter how confident he was in Chu Yunfan, Zhang Feng’s ranking was above Chu Yunfan’s. He was an expert who had stepped into the Creation Stage. Such a person was definitely not someone that Chu Yunfan could deal with. After all, there was a limit to the number of people who could cross this level.","Even the other Flying Celestials disciples had solemn expressions. Clearly, their thoughts were not much different from Ye Yin’s.","“Senior Chu, why don’t we avoid him? I don’t think that Zhang Feng will dare to make a move here. After all, this is Princess Yun Yang’s territory,” a true disciple suggested.","It was not that he was timid, but Zhang Feng’s strength was far above everyone else’s. It could even be said that they were not Zhang Feng’s match even if they attacked together. The difference between the two was like heaven and earth.","“It’s fine. It’s just another person who’s here to deliver his head.” Chu Yunfan grinned and continued drinking his tea.","“Chu Yunfan!” Zhang Feng was getting impatient. “Since you want to be a coward and refuse to come out, don’t blame me for being rude!”","In the blink of an eye, Zhang Feng made his move. His large hand suddenly slapped out, condensing into a huge palm print formed by countless spirit energy. The light of a symbol flickered on the huge palm print. It was a symbol condensed from natural law. This was an extremely brilliant technique.","Everyone in the restaurant instantly felt a terrifying pressure falling from the sky and crushing down on them. The feeling made it difficult for them to even breathe. The blood that was originally flowing like a surging river in their bodies was almost forced to stop flowing.","It was simply terrifying to the extreme!","Everyone could see despair in each other’s eyes. This was the aura of a Creator.","Cultivators had gone against the universe and seized fortunes. When they reached the Creation Stage, their entire body would undergo a world-shaking transformation. This transformation was another leap in the level of life.","“Let’s go!” a Flying Celestial true disciple roared.","In an instant, all kinds of colorful divine power light emitted from their bodies in an attempt to resist this big hand. However, it was useless. Their resistance could not even slow down the big hand for a moment. They could only watch as the big hand slapped down. It seemed slow but was actually fast, as fast as lightning.","“I...am...one of those...who want to enter... the prodigy list... I will...not...surrender!” Ye Yin roared as he increased his divine power.","He used this attack as an opportunity to temper his will and cultivation. One could imagine that Ye Yin was definitely not an ordinary person to be able to sit firmly on the second seat of the great true disciples before Chu Yunfan appeared.","However, the more he resisted, the more powerful the counterattack was. In the blink of an eyes, he spat out a mouthful of blood and flew backward.","A look of disbelief flashed across his eyes. He knew that the Creation Stage was strong, but Zhang Feng’s strength clearly far exceeded many experts who had just entered the Creation Stage. Ye Yin attacked almost at the same time as everyone else, but he actually could not even block a single attack. And it was not just him. Everyone else who tried to resist also spat out a mouthful of blood.","Suddenly, at this moment of life and death, Chu Yunfan, who was still leisurely drinking tea, waved his hand. Immediately, a terrifying sword light condensed in his hand and shot out. The sword light, which was about the size of a palm, traversed the sky and smashed into the big hand through the window.","Stab!","The giant hand was like a balloon that had been punctured and instantly disappeared without a trace. Everyone felt the terrifying aura that was crushing down disappear without a trace as well, and they all heaved a sigh of relief.","That feeling was too terrifying. They didn’t want to encounter it again. It really made them feel the great terror of life and death.","At this moment, they finally realized that the reason they were saved was because of the seemingly calm Chu Yunfan. Initially, they did not think highly of him. They even thought that Chu Yunfan was no match for Zhang Feng.","However, reality had given them a hard slap in the face.","“No, he didn’t just counter the attack. Look! Zhang Feng is injured!”"]},{"number":1868,"title":"Chapter 1868 Sect Leader of the Demonic Sword Sect","paragraphs":["1868 Sect Leader of the Demonic Sword Sect","After someone cried out in surprise, everyone quickly spread out their divine wills. As expected, they saw that Zhang Feng’s palm had been cut open by the sword light, and it was dripping with blood.","Everyone discovered that the wound that had been cut open was healing very slowly. With the recovery ability of Creators, even if their intestines were cut open, it would only take them a few minutes to recover.","At this moment, everyone realized that Chu Yunfan’s casual attack was not as simple as they thought. Most importantly, they had discovered that he could injure a Creator.","They had just experienced how terrifying Zhang Feng was. The overwhelming pressure made everyone feel despair. Before the slap landed, just the aura of the attack had severely injured everyone. If it landed, the consequences would be unimaginable.","It was precisely because of this that Chu Yunfan, who could easily break through that terrifying attack and injure Zhang Feng, suddenly became mysterious in everyone’s hearts.","Chu Yunfan was so calm before. Though Zhang Feng had come to kill him, he did not care. He probably had some trump card that he had not shown yet.","Zhang Feng’s face was ashen as he looked at the blood that flowed out of his palm. After mobilizing his divine power to destroy the sword light contained in it, the wound on his hand recovered at an astonishing speed. He had never expected Chu Yunfan’s counterattack to turn his attack into nothing. What was even more unexpected was that he was injured by Chu Yunfan.","For someone as proud as Zhang Feng, this was a great humiliation.","He was no stranger to Chu Yunfan. More than a year ago, Chu Yunfan’s name suddenly jumped into the prodigy list, and he even rushed to the top 30, far above Zhang Feng himself. The uproar caused by the other prodigies when that happened far exceeded ordinary people’s imagination.","No one knew better than Zhang Feng that after entering the prodigy list, the price one had to pay to advance one rank was unimaginable, or even impossible. Those who could enter the list were talented and looked down on their peers. They had many fortuitous encounters and had received the full nurturing of their sect. Everyone on the prodigy list had the capital to look down on others, and they were only strong and not weak. Under such circumstances, their original reliance was not worth mentioning.","Chu Yunfan, who had rushed from the top 100 to the 30th place, was truly unique. This was exciting, and many people began to go into seclusion with all their strength. It was simply a humiliation to be surpassed by a junior whose cultivation was far inferior to theirs.","Later, as a large number of prodigies entered the Creation Stage one after another, Chu Yunfan’s ranking plummeted. It looked like it would not be long before he fell off the prodigy list.","In the eyes of the geniuses, this was a complete joke. They did not know what method Chu Yunfan had used to increase his combat strength and enter the prodigy list. He surpassed most of the prodigies in an instant. However, in the end, the gap still existed. As long as the prodigy charged forward, the gap would be widened in a short time.","Even Zhang Feng felt that Chu Yunfan was just a lucky person. A Cosmic was only a Cosmic after all. Even if they were both on the list, the difference was as big as heaven and earth.","This was the reason why he was so furious when he heard the report from Great Change Faith’s disciples. Who was Chu Yunfan? How dare he look down on Great Change Faith and injure its disciples. He was simply courting death.","Zhang Feng wanted to rope in these ordinary Great Change Faith true disciples. The competition for followers in Great Change Faith was even more intense than in the Flying Celestials.","This would be an excellent way for him to increase his reputation. Stepping on the shoulders of someone on the prodigy list to increase one’s reputation was the best.","Unfortunately, who knew that it would be a bad start? Chu Yunfan was more difficult to deal with than he thought.","“You only have some tricks up your sleeves. Yang Dengxian is more like it. Who do you think you are?” Zhang Feng laughed coldly. He then changed his mind. He no longer attacked casually like before. This time, his divine power was truly raised to the extreme.","In an instant, a terrifying pressure once again descended from the sky and covered the earth. It was several times stronger than before. Everyone in the restaurant immediately felt that it was difficult to breathe. It was as if someone was strangling their necks with a large hand. That feeling was really too uncomfortable.","Only Chu Yunfan wasn’t affected. He just sneered and opened his palm. A sword light condensed into a palm-sized small sword on his palm. The small sword spun violently, and the sword light contained in it became more and more shocking.","“You’re so noisy!”","Just as Chu Yunfan was about to attack, a crisp female voice rang out.","“Young masters, please stop!”","Along with this voice, a sharp aura swept over. The aura released by Zhang Feng disappeared without a trace under the sweep of this sharp aura.","Chu Yunfan and Zhang Feng turned their heads and saw a graceful figure in the air. It seemed slow but was actually fast. In just a moment, the figure arrived before Chu Yunfan.","It was a woman in her thirties. She had a pretty face and a graceful figure. However, what caught Chu Yunfan’s attention was that this woman was carrying a long sword on her back. She was dressed in a short martial arts outfit. She was like a sword that had left its sheath and had a sharp aura.","‘A Creator!’","Chu Yunfan and Zhang Feng instantly made a judgment. This woman was definitely a Creator. If not, she would not have been able to easily break through Zhang Feng’s aura.","“Who are you?” Zhang Feng asked. His face was ashen. If he hadn’t realized that this woman was very strong, almost on par with his, he would have gone crazy just because she dared to interfere and disperse his aura.","As a true disciple of one of the ten great sects, the Great Change Faith, Zhang Feng was extremely proud. He did not even put ordinary people in his eyes.","“I am Princess Yun Yang’s sword attendant, Tertius.” The woman nodded slightly.","When Zhang Feng heard this name, he frowned slightly. Suddenly, he thought of something and said, “No, your name isn’t Tertius. I’ve seen you before. Aren’t you the sect leader of the outer realms’ Demonic Sword Sect, Liu Qingying?”","Zhang Feng’s words caused an uproar."]},{"number":1869,"title":"Chapter 1869 Temporarily Stopping the War, the Undercurrent Surges","paragraphs":["1869 Temporarily Stopping the War, the Undercurrent Surges","Everyone had exploded in an uproar!","The people in the restaurant were all martial arts experts. Their knowledge was far beyond ordinary people’s imagination. They quickly recalled what kind of sect the Demonic Sword Sect was.","The Demonic Sword Sect was one of the three great sects of the demonic path in the outer realm. It was famous for its Demonic Sword Manual, even though it was only a third-rate sect among those in the demonic path.","However, even if it was a third-rate sect, its sect leader had to be an expert at the Creation Stage. Without the cultivation level of the Creation Stage, they did not have the qualifications to establish a sect in the outer realm. They would be swallowed up within minutes.","“I heard that the Demonic Sword Sect was wiped out overnight by a mysterious person. No one in the entire sect survived, and the Demonic Sword Manual was also taken away by someone. Isn’t it still unknown who did it?”","Some people recalled the information about the Demonic Sword Sect recorded in the intelligence report. Back then, the Demonic Sword Sect had been exterminated overnight. The entire sect was massacred, and all the books, resources, and wealth in the sect had been plundered.","At that time, it had been a sensation. No one knew why the Demonic Sword Sect was destroyed. They only knew that they had offended some big shot, which attracted the top experts to come and take revenge.","At that time, the whereabouts of the Demonic Sword Sect’s sect leader were also unknown. There were rumors that she had already died. However, not only did she not die, she had even become Princess Yun Yang’s sword attendant.","Many people gasped when they thought of this. Could it be that the person who had destroyed the Demonic Sword Sect was none other than Princess Yun Yang?","If that was the case, it would be too terrifying. This meant that Princess Yun Yang’s strength had far exceeded everyone’s imagination. Over the years, Princess Yun Yang had been known to have mediocre talent and had never made a move. However, in terms of reputation, she was not inferior to the other popular princes. Even a three-year-old child would not believe that there was no special reason for this.","However, this guess was still too frightening. No matter what, even a third-rate small sect in the outer realm had experts as common as the clouds. There should even be a few Creators within their ranks.","Given the strength of Grand Xia’s imperial family, it was naturally a piece of cake for them to destroy the Demonic Sword Sect. However, the imperial family of Grand Xia had never interfered in the fight for the throne between the princes and princesses.","In other words, it was very likely that Princess Yun Yang had silently destroyed the Demonic Sword Sect on her own. There was no other way to explain why the sect leader of the Demonic Sword Sect had become her sword attendant.","Creators were the few experts of the world. Every one of them was a figure at the level of a master. Such a figure was qualified to establish a sect.","This woman was certainly an arrogant character, but she willingly became someone else’s sword attendant and bore no status. Even her name had been erased. What kind of method had Princess Yun Yang use to achieve this?","Zhang Feng looked at Tertius, and his eyes were filled with shock and bewilderment. No wonder this woman could easily break through his aura. She was an old Creator. The reason he had recognized her was that when he was still serving in the army of Grand Xia, he had once led his troops to the outer realms. At that time, he had met Liu Qingying. However, at that time, he was not a match for her at all. Liu Qingying’s real opponent was a supreme elder of Great Change Faith.","Zhang Feng had only been there for a while. However, that was the first time he had seen a Creator attack with all his might. It was an unforgettable scene. However, he had not expected that the person who had been like a demon in his heart would become Princess Yun Yang’s sword attendant.","His evaluation of Princess Yun Yang instantly rose by several levels. These experts from the imperial family of Grand Xia might not be ranked on the prodigy list, but no matter how proud they were, they wouldn’t deny that there were indeed some people from the imperial family who were qualified to be ranked.","There had been countless experts in the imperial family throughout history, and they had emerged in an endless stream. It was not strange that some of them were qualified to enter the prodigy list.","After hearing everyone’s words, coupled with the information Chu Yunfan had read in “The World,” Chu Yunfan was certain that this woman before him was most likely the female sect leader of the Demonic Sword Sect, Liu Qingying.","Just like Zhang Feng, Chu Yunfan’s fear of Princess Yun Yang had increased by several levels. After all, to be able to order these grandmaster-level figures around like slaves was shocking.","“That lowly isn’t worth mentioning. It’s all in the past. I have since sincerely submitted to the Imperial Court. Since a long time ago, there has been no Demonic Sword sect leader, Liu Qingying. There is only Princess Yun Yang’s sword attendant, Tertius,” Tertius said with an indifferent expression.","It was as if what she was talking about was someone else’s matter and had nothing to do with her.","After saying this, Tertius said, “Young masters, please show Her Royal Highness some respect. Don’t fight inside the town or innocent people will be implicated. If you have any grudges to resolve, you can fight during the sparring session at the garden party. Is that agreeable?”","“Miss Tertius, I didn’t want to make a move, so I have no objections,” Chu Yunfan said as he cupped his hands. No matter what, he had to get news of Tang Siyu from Princess Yun Yang. He had to give her some face.","“Hmph, you’re lucky. I will show you mercy on account of Her Royal Highness. However, you won’t have such a good life later. If you’re afraid, you better scram!” Zhang Feng snorted.","No matter how dissatisfied he was, he had no choice but to stop for now. Otherwise, Tertius alone would be enough to make him kneel. She was the former leader of the Demonic Sword Sect. Although he was confident that he would surpass Tertius sooner or later and leave her behind, that was something for the future.","Hearing Zhang Feng’s despicable provocation, Chu Yunfan laughed. “Since you want to be beaten up so badly, how can I not fulfill your wish?” he said.","“Alright, in that case, let’s see how you die at the garden party later. Hmph!” Zhang Feng snorted coldly, then cupped his hands toward Tertius and said, “Farewell!”","With that, Zhang Feng’s figure turned into a stream of light and disappeared into the sky.","“Since the conflict has been resolved, I will take my leave first. Her Royal Highness has instructed me to convey that she hopes you will punctually attend the garden party that will begin in an hour, Young Master Chu,” Tertius said.","Chu Yunfan nodded. The garden party would only begin in an hour. Otherwise, everyone would not have had the time to quarrel. In the end, it almost turned into a big battle between Chu Yunfan and Zhang Feng.","That was a true battle between prodigies on the prodigy list. It was a rare scene.","After Tertius finished executing her orders, she also turned into a stream of light and disappeared into the horizon."]},{"number":1870,"title":"Chapter 1870 All the Heroes Arrive","paragraphs":["1870 All the Heroes Arrive","Chu Yunfan descended and returned to the restaurant.","After all, Zhang Feng had stepped into the Creation Stage. Once he crossed it, his battle prowess had increased tenfold. In many people’s eyes, being able to injure Zhang Feng was already the limit. It was an inconceivable thing.","However, what everyone could predict was that in the following garden party, a battle between the two sides was inevitable. Unless one of them found an excuse to leave, it could not be avoided. However, experts who could cultivate to such a level were more or less shameless. It was impossible for them to leave without a very good reason.","It didn’t take long for the news of Chu Yunfan and Zhang Feng’s upcoming battle to spread. Even in the Imperial City, such a battle on the level of the prodigy list was still rare. In a short while, many figures appeared in the sky around the small town. Many people rushed over from the Imperial City, wanting to witness this battle.","An hour passed very quickly. However, in this hour, there were experts that far exceeded the previous scale. There were at least twice as many as before. They were all experts at the level of true disciples from their sects. If one was not a true disciple, they would not even be qualified to participate in the garden party.","As the bell rang, Princess Yun Yang’s garden party finally began. Rays of light streaked across the sky, and the experts who were qualified to participate stepped on them.","Princess Yun Yang’s manor was not far from the small town. It occupied a vast area and had pleasant scenery. The mountains and rivers were far away, and it looked like a paradise.","The garden party was held in an open space in the middle of the manor. Everyone was in groups of three to five. They were divided into different groups according to different sects and different forces.","Grand Xia was led by the ten great sects, but there were far more than these ten powers. The situation was complicated, but they were all united under the banner of the Imperial Court.","When Chu Yunfan arrived, the true disciples of the Flying Celestials and some disciples from sects that were on good terms with the Flying Celestials had gathered. There were as many as thirty to forty people.","In this world, strength was respected. Chu Yunfan was the only one among them who was ranked on the prodigy list. This position was something that even Ye Yin could not replace, so Chu Yunfan naturally became the leader of everyone.","Even if they were not his followers, they had all gathered under his command. Not to mention that Ye Yin had completely given up on competing with Chu Yunfan. He had already realized that the gap between him and Chu Yunfan had not narrowed, but had instead increased.","Chu Yunfan’s ranking didn’t seem to have changed in the past year, but his improvement was even more shocking than his own. Unless Ye Yin stepped into the Creation Stage and his battle prowess underwent another earth-shattering change, it would be very difficult for him, who had already reached a limit, to contend with Chu Yunfan.","The other ten great sects had their own factions. However, among these people, there were two factions that were the largest.","One of them was Great Change Faith led by Zhang Feng and his allies.","Facing Zhang Feng from Great Change Faith was another group of people. They were led by a silver-haired youth. This youth had white hair and stood with his hands behind his back. A group of youths had gathered around him, and he was the leader among them.","The leader wes the Destiny Sect’s Huyan Zhuo.","The identity of this person was obvious. In this garden party, there were a total of three geniuses from the prodigy list. Although their rankings were not high, among all living beings in the world, those who could enter the prodigy list were already peerless figures among millions.","In addition, they had to take into account the alien experts who weren’t in the Central Plains. In truth, these two were already the cream of the crop among the younger generation of Grand Xia.","Although the top ten sects all had experts on the prodigy list, they were not here. Therefore, everyone was led by Chu Yunfan, Huyan Zhuo, or Zhang Feng.","This was the difference in the level of life. It was destined that ants could not be compared to the divine dragons in the sky. By the time Chu Yunfan crossed this line, their cultivation would have increased to an unknown level. The age disadvantage would continue until no one could improve anymore.","Suddenly, someone announced, “Princess Yun Yang has arrived!”","Everyone looked over and saw a woman in her twenties striding over from the depths of the manor. She had a graceful figure, exquisite facial features, and skin whiter than snow.","‘Princess Yun Yang!’ Chu Yunfan’s eyebrows went up slightly.","Princess Yun Yang was dressed in a gorgeous robe and looked graceful and noble. She had a noble aura that ordinary people did not have, and even had a hint of dragon aura. This could be hidden from others, but it couldn’t be hidden from Chu Yunfan. In his eyes, the fate above Princess Yun Yang’s head was like a golden dragon.","This surprised Chu Yunfan. It should be known that only the fate of a future king could manifest into a golden dragon. In the Common Era, once such a person was born, the other princes and princesses would not be able to compete with them.","However, it was different in Grand Xia. The kingdom’s national strength was a hundred times greater than that of the ancient world. Therefore, among the many princes and princesses, there were more than one or two who formed the Luck Dragon. However, these were all fake dragons. In the Dragon Inheritance War, only the fate of the last person who ascended the throne would transform into a true dragon.","They were be the so-called True Dragon Child of Heaven.","Although it was only a fake dragon, it was already very shocking. No wonder Princess Yun Yang was so powerful. She was able to contend with the other princes. This in itself showed that Princess Yun Yang was not an ordinary person.","When they saw Princess Yun Yang, everyone greeted her.","After returning the greeting, Princess Yun Yang came to the front of the crowd. She looked at them and said, “Everyone here is a world-famous hero. Today, you have the honor to attend my garden party. This manor is honored!”"]},{"number":1871,"title":"Chapter 1871 Who’s Here to Deliver Their Head?","paragraphs":["1871 Who’s Here to Deliver Their Head?","“I wanted to use this opportunity to meet the heroes of my kingdom.” Princess Yun Yang smiled sweetly.","Her smile was like a warm room in spring, and many young geniuses present could not help but stare at her. Many of them had a look of admiration in their eyes. Princess Yun Yang had many admirers within Grand Xia.","“I’m especially excited to meet General Chu. I’ve heard a lot about you, General. You’re the only one who can make it onto the prodigy list with a cultivation base below the peak of the Cosmos Stage. Now that I’ve seen you, I know your reputation is well deserved.” Princess Yun Yang looked at Chu Yunfan, her words full of praise.","Chu Yunfan felt two gazes falling on him like two sharp swords. He looked over. The owners of these two gazes were Zhang Feng and Huyan Zhuo from the Destiny Sect.","Chu Yunfan suddenly understood. Other than him, whether it was Zhang Feng or Huyan Zhuo, as experts on the prodigy list, they were extremely proud. In Grand Grand, they were characters that attracted everyone’s attention. Now, they were in attendance at Princess Yun Yang’s garden party. This meant that they had a certain degree of standing. At the very least, they had a certain degree of inclination.","The main reason for this was that both of them were in love with Princess Yun Yang. After all, Princess Yun Yang had yet to take up a husband. The imperial family of Grand Xia had always been open-minded in this aspect. The possibility of the king appointing a marriage for his heirs was very small. The princes and princesses were allowed to choose their own spouses.","After all, the imperial family of Grand Xia was so powerful that they no longer needed to rely on marriage to stabilize their rule. As long as the imperial family didn’t seek death, it was impossible for others to shake the rule of Grand Xia.","There was no doubt that among the many princesses, Princess Yun Yang was one of the best. She was one of the most popular and well-known princesses. Countless prodigies who claimed to be geniuses secretly listed Princess Yun Yang as their target and regarded each other as powerful competitors.","Princess Yun Yang’s praise for Chu Yunfan instantly made the two of them feel threatened. They even treated Chu Yunfan as a competitor. This time, not only Zhang Feng, but even Huyan Zhuo’s gaze toward Chu Yunfan became somewhat unfriendly.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t care. He looked straight at Princess Yun Yang and met her eyes. The reason why he was attending this party was simply to know Tang Siyu’s whereabouts. He only knew that Tang Siyu had been conferred the title of Princess Gushe, but he did not know her exact whereabouts. He needed to find out from Princess Yun Yang.","“You’re too polite, Your Royal Highness.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","After praising Chu Yunfan, Princess Yun Yang turned the topic to Zhang Feng and Huyan Zhuo. She even chatted and laughed with many people present, giving people a feeling of being bathed in the spring breeze as if she was everyone’s old friend. Chu Yunfan couldn’t help but sigh. No wonder Princess Yun Yang was able to create such a huge commotion. She was indeed not an ordinary woman to win a reputation that was on par with a few popular princes. The core of this garden party was undoubtedly Princess Yun Yang.","After the heated discussion came the core content of this garden party. Many geniuses began to give it a try. This was to be a sparring session, and they would verify what they had learned through battle. Although they were all the best of the younger generation in their respective factions and were all experts at the level of true disciples, their fame was often limited to their own sects. Only someone like Chu Yunfan who suddenly rushed onto the prodigy list would be able to become famous and well-known by everyone.","If other people wanted to become famous, they had to rely on such an opportunity to display their strength on similar occasions. Their fame would grow, and under such circumstances, the greater their fame, the more attention they would receive from the sects and the Imperial Court. Their future prospects would be limitless.","The current world was a world of great competition. Many geniuses were like thousands of sails competing to be the ones who jumped out of the reincarnation. They did not advocate the so-called dust to dust. Only by truly displaying one’s talent could one be able to obtain the sect’s vigorous nurturing. The path of cultivation could not be lacking in the support of various resources. How could one rely on one’s own bitter cultivation to compare to the sect’s full nurturing?","Princess Yun Yang held a garden party to rope in these young geniuses and choose the useful ones to become her followers, and these young geniuses wanted to take this opportunity to become famous. It was precisely because of this idea that Princess Yun Yang’s annual garden party became bigger and bigger, and her influence continued to increase.","However, when Princess Yun Yang announced the official start of the garden party’s sparring session, no one expected that the first person to jump out would be Zhang Feng.","“Chu Yunfan, do you dare to fight me now?” Zhang Feng looked at Chu Yunfan coldly.","This made many of the geniuses who were originally eager to try completely dumbfounded. They looked at Zhang Feng one after another, their eyes revealing only one message.","‘Are you crazy? How are we supposed to go out now?’","According to the usual, the first batch of people to go on stage would always be those with weaker cultivation. As a way to throw bricks to attract jade, they also understood in their hearts that when those true experts made a move, they would probably not have a chance.","Top experts like Zhang Feng usually sat on the fishing platform and would only appear after everyone had finished their matches. This was in line with their status and also gave everyone a chance to perform.","But now, Zhang Feng wanted to attack as soon as the sparring session started. He looked impatient. With Zhang Feng’s strength, who would be interested in watching them fight? They were not on the same level.","At this moment, these people looked at Zhang Feng bitterly. They were so depressed that they wanted to die. Many of them looked pensive. They all remembered the conflict between Chu Yunfan and Zhang Feng in the restaurant earlier. If Princess Yun Yang’s sword attendant, Tertius, had not suddenly appeared and interrupted them, they would have fought.","However, they had not expected Zhang Feng to jump out so impatiently. Clearly, he was not willing to wait any longer.","Everyone turned to look at Chu Yunfan. The real decision was in Chu Yunfan’s hands. At Princess Yun Yang’s garden party, if Chu Yunfan was unwilling, even Zhang Feng could not force him to make a move.","“Why wouldn’t I dare? Since you’re here to deliver your head, I’ll take it,” Chu Yunfan said coldly."]},{"number":1872,"title":"Chapter 1872 Crippled in One Punch","paragraphs":["1872 Crippled in One Punch","The battle of the prodigies!","Many people did not expect that the battle that was supposed to be the finale would suddenly be brought forward. These geniuses felt as if they were cursed. They had never seen someone break the rules like this.","Were these people crazy? Did they not care about their reputation?","With the battle between Chu Yunfan and Zhang Feng, no matter who won or lost, after experiencing such an exciting battle, no one would be in the mood to pay attention to the battle between ordinary people like them.","In the eyes of ordinary people, they were all geniuses who shook the region. To be able to become true disciples in various sects, of course, they weren’t simple. However, they were very clear that there was a huge gap between them and the big shots on the prodigy list.","However, they had nothing to say. Neither Zhang Feng nor Chu Yunfan were people they could afford to offend. Even Chu Yunfan, who had been criticized the most by many people behind their backs, had proven with absolute strength more than a year ago that ordinary cultivators at the peak of the Cosmos Stage were no match for him.","“Good!” Zhang Feng burst into laughter as he flew into the air.","In the air, there was an open barrier, which formed a small isolated space, which was specially used for those geniuses in the garden party.","After Zhang Feng flew up into the sky, the scouts and experts who were originally in the small town and could not participate in the garden party could finally see the battle. However, they were also a little surprised. They did not understand why Zhang Feng would fight in the first battle. Who would Zhang Feng’s opponent be? Chu Yunfan or Huyan Zhuo?","But soon, their doubts were answered. They saw Chu Yunfan walk up into the air. When he entered the barrier, Zhang Feng’s aura exploded. It was as if he was an immortal egg that was about to transform into a peerless ferocious creature.","The attack earlier had not been able to harm Chu Yunfan, and he was even injured by Chu Yunfan. This made Zhang Feng understand that Chu Yunfan’s strength was definitely extraordinary and could not be compared to ordinary people.","This time, Zhang Feng had truly risen to the peak. A terrifying aura enveloped the space. Although the people outside the barrier could not feel it, they could still feel the shock from what they could see, and it was terrifying.","Boom!","Zhang Feng stomped his foot, causing the entire sky to tremble. Fortunately, there was a barrier that blocked it. Otherwise, the entire world would have shattered.","“The Creation Stage! This is the power of a Creator!”","It was unknown which genius shouted, but it broke everyone’s thoughts. This was not the first time these geniuses had seen the power of the Creation Stage. However, it was the first time many of them had seen someone of the same generation as them who had stepped into the Creation Stage.","After all, there were only a few people in the same generation who had reached the Creation Stage. These people usually did not attack easily. Even if they did, very few people could force them to reveal their true strength. Strictly speaking, this was the first time they had seen such a scene.","Although they were only one step away from this power, only a small number of them were qualified to cross this rank. Even though they were geniuses and true disciples, the gap between them was obvious.","The people on the prodigy list were almost certain that they could enter the Creation Stage, but the other true disciples were not necessarily the same. Only a small number of them could enter the Creation Stage, and that was how the gap was widened.","Everyone could see that the surrounding spirit energy was gathering toward Zhang Feng at a speed visible to the naked eye, directly pouring into his fist.","“That’s so scary. Zhang Feng’s strength is indeed not something that a peak Cosmic can compare to.”","“This is Zhang Feng’s true strength. His being injured by Chu Yunfan earlier was probably just an accident.”","“The strength of a Creator is still superior to a Cosmic.”","However, they soon realized that something was wrong. They realized that Chu Yunfan was only looking at Zhang Feng coldly as if he did not mind Zhang Feng raising his strength to the peak.","Chu Yunfan just stood there coldly like a demon god. He also emitted a terrifying aura. Unlike Zhang Feng, who made a huge commotion, he just stood there quietly, but it was already very shocking.","“Chu Yunfan, you broke my attack and injured my hand earlier. If you think that’s my peak combat strength, then you’re gravely mistaken!” Zhang Feng burst into laughter and punched out. “Great Change Punch!”","This attack pierced the sky. A terrifying power spread out and the entire world shook violently. A terrifying fist force came crushing over. Even though they were separated by the barrier, many people still felt the pressure of Mount Tai pressing down on them.","The aura of the Creation Stage passed through the array, causing everyone to feel immense pressure. The Great Change Punch was unleashed to the extreme in Zhang Feng’s hands, truly reaching the level of perfection.","Countless people were dumbfounded. It was simply powerful to a terrifying extent.","With Zhang Feng’s cultivation level, when he reached the peak, he might even have a chance to become the sect leader of Great Change Faith, or at the very least, the first supreme elder.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan moved. His five fingers clenched into a fist, and a terrifying fist force leaked out. The terrifying fist force swept out. Energy gushed out like a pillar. He punched out, and the fist force pierced through the sky.","Quick! Quick! Quick!","Chu Yunfan’s punch was lightning fast, and it was aimed directly at the Great Change Punch.","Boom!","Everyone saw Chu Yunfan’s punch turn into a golden light and hit the Great Change Punch head-on. It tore the entire fist force of the Great Change Punch apart and then hit Zhang Feng’s fist.","Bam!","Zhang Feng’s fist hit the golden light. Immediately after, everyone heard him scream. His entire arm had collapsed and was broken by the golden light.","This brutal scene was witnessed by everyone, and they were scared to death. Immediately, the entire place fell into a dead silence. One could even hear everyone’s breathing. Everyone seemed to be frightened as they stared at the scene in front of them.","“H-How is this possible?” someone said in a daze."]},{"number":1873,"title":"Chapter 1873 I’ll Defeat You in One Move and Show You the Gap Between Us","paragraphs":["1873 I’ll Defeat You in One Move and Show You the Gap Between Us","Everyone was completely dumbfounded. This situation had completely exceeded their expectations. If the result was the other way around, they could still understand. After all, Zhang Feng had already stepped into the Creation Stage while Chu Yunfan was only in the Cosmos Stage. It was just different cultivation levels, and the difference in battle prowess was already like heaven and earth.","However, that was not the case. Chu Yunfan had crippled one of Zhang Feng’s arms with one punch. This scene completely exceeded everyone’s expectations and truly shocked everyone.","At this moment, everyone looked at Chu Yunfan’s expressionless and indifferent appearance. They felt that from the beginning, Chu Yunfan was not like what many people thought, pretending to be calm. He really had such strength. Even Huyan Zhuo, who hadn’t taken the power of this punch to heart at first, had a slight change in his expression.","“Young Master Huyan, who do you think will win between these two?” Princess Yun Yang asked.","Huyan Zhuo heard Princess Yun Yang’s words, but he didn’t immediately make a judgment. He said, “I can’t see through Chu Yunfan’s background. He must have had a good fortuitous encounter. However, the Cosmos Stage is only the Cosmos Stage. As long as he doesn’t reach the Creation Stage, he won’t be able to achieve anything. Zhang Feng’s strength is definitely not limited to this.”","Huyan Zhuo thought about it and decided to make such a judgment. After all, no matter how he looked at it, Zhang Feng should win. The probability of Chu Yunfan winning was too small. He had already crossed that line, so he knew the difference after crossing that line. It was like the difference between heaven and earth.","“Since you have so much confidence in Young Master Zhang, then I’ll bet on Chu Yunfan’s victory.”","Princess Yun Yang’s words made Huyan Zhuo’s eyes flash with a sharp light. He looked at Chu Yunfan with a sharp gaze. Chu Yunfan also felt Huyan Zhuo’s sharp gaze, but he only sneered.","Chu Yunfan continued to stare at Zhang Feng, and he clicked his tongue in wonder. Zhang Feng was indeed a prodigy who had stepped into the Creation Stage. If it was any other prodigy on the prodigy list who had not stepped into the Creation Stage, his punch would be enough to heavily injure them.","There was no need to use a second move. He could even kill them. But now, he had only crippled one of Zhang Feng’s arms. Chu Yunfan clicked his tongue in wonder.","If his thoughts were known, it would probably cause a huge uproar. After all, he was ranked in the middle of the prodigy list and had yet to enter the Creation Stage. Chu Yunfan had crippled Zhang Feng’s arm with a single punch, yet he was still so dissatisfied. Was he trying to ascend to the heavens?","“I told you, you’re just here to deliver your head,” Chu Yunfan said with a cold smile.","Zhang Feng’s gaze was extremely cold. He looked at Chu Yunfan. His arm made a series of violent crackling sounds, and his limp arm returned to normal. His breath was slightly unstable though. Not only did he fail to take down Chu Yunfan, but he was also injured by him. This was a great humiliation for him. A mere Cosmic had actually injured him, an expert at the Creation Stage. Wasn’t that a huge joke?","“Again, Great Change Punch!”","Around Zhang Feng, countless spirit energy came together and gathered on his arm. He punched out, and a huge figure vaguely formed behind him. This phantom was like a god of war, sweeping across the entire battlefield. It was invincible.","“This is the manifestation of the Great Change Punch. Only after cultivating this technique to the extreme can one have a certain chance of comprehending the manifestation.”","The Great Change Faith disciples immediately recognized the gigantic figure. It was the manifestation of the Great Change Punch. Only after comprehending this attack to the extreme and truly comprehending the concept of the founder could it be possible to evoke this phantom in reality.","This phantom was none other than the legendary Great Change Divine King, the founder of Great Change Faith. Back then, the Great Change Divine King had followed the founding ancestor of Grand Xia to conquer the world, pacifying the chaos in the four directions and establishing the foundation of Great Change Faith. He was said to be the founder of the sect.","In that era, he was a true peerless character, almost invincible. On the battlefield, he killed countless powerful enemies of the foreign races. His legends still circulate within Grand Xia to this day.","The deeper one’s understanding of the Great Change Punch, the more realistic the Great Change Divine King would be. Right now, Zhang Feng was only at the initial stage of the Great Change Divine King. Even so, at his age, he could be considered a rare genius.","He was a true genius!","There was no limit to the cultivation of the Great Change Punch. Or rather, no one had been able to cultivate to the level of the Great Change Divine King back then, and there was no limit to it. The more powerful a person was, the more terrifying the Great Change Punch they executed.","That terrifying figure suddenly pressed down on Chu Yunfan, almost killing him.","This was Zhang Feng’s true trump card. After evoking the Great Change Divine King, the power of the Great Change Punch he executed doubled. In a battle between experts, a slight difference was enough to make a huge difference, not to mention that it had doubled.","Zhang Feng’s face revealed a ferocious expression. This move was enough to severely injure him and defeat him instantly. Even Huyan Zhuo’s expression became grave. He wouldn’t have much of a chance against such an attack.","“Do you still think Chu Yunfan will still win, Princess?” Huyan Zhuo asked.","“I do. I believe Chu Yunfan will win,” Princess Yun Yang said calmly.","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan sneered at Zhang Feng, who had unleashed the Great Change Divine King phantom. He said without even looking, “I’ll defeat you in one move and show you the gap between us.”","Chu Yunfan made his move. He pounced forward like a ferocious tiger descending a mountain. He grabbed a lightning sword in his hand. The sword light swept across the sky and swept out over a thousand feet. Immediately after, it cut the Great Change Divine King phantom in half in midair.","Immediately after, the sword light tore through the fist force and landed on Zhang Feng.","Bam!","Zhang Feng was struck by the sword. The speed of the sword was too fast, so fast that he did not even have the chance to react before he was struck. He spat out a mouthful of blood and instantly fell to the ground like a kite with a broken string.","He was instantly defeated!"]},{"number":1874,"title":"Chapter 1874 Everyone’s Shock, Going On to Challenge Huyan Zhuo","paragraphs":["1874 Everyone’s Shock, Going On to Challenge Huyan Zhuo","The speed of this attack was so fast that many people did not even have time to react!","The power of Chu Yunfan’s attack was terrifying. Everyone couldn’t help but suck in a breath of cold air, and their pupils constricted slightly. Even Huyan Zhuo’s expression changed slightly when he saw this scene. He no longer had the calm and confident look he had before.","Originally, he thought nothing of Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan was just a person who had not even crossed the Creation Stage. Although they were all on the prodigy list, those at the top and bottom of the prodigy list were completely different from each other. Though Chu Yunfan was the first non-Creator to reach the top of the prodigy list, it was meaningless to a Creator like him.","Who would have thought that Chu Yunfan’s attack would directly injure Zhang Feng?","Even Huyan Zhuo could not underestimate the power of Zhang Feng’s attack.","However, Huyan Zhuo calmed down. “Zhang Feng was too careless. Chu Yunfan is weak. I don’t know how he did it, but Chu Yunfan won’t last long when fighting against a true Creator.”","Huyan Zhuo immediately made a judgment. Only this could explain why Zhang Feng was defeated by Chu Yunfan. Only this reason made sense. Thinking of this, he regained his confidence. After all, his strength was above Zhang Feng’s, so why did he have to be afraid of Chu Yunfan?","However, Chu Yunfan had defeated Zhang Feng cleanly earlier, which made Huyan Zhuo lose his composure for a moment. However, he was a prodigy who had experienced hundreds of battles, so he immediately recovered his wits.","If Chu Yunfan could defeat Zhang Feng so easily, didn’t that mean that Chu Yunfan could at least be compared to the top few monsters on the prodigy list?","When thinking of those people who were ranked at the top, they could only describe them as monsters!","Even though they were all on the prodigy list, compared to those people, Huyan Zhuo could only describe them as monsters. It wasn’t that there weren’t any experts in the Destiny Sect that he was in. Even he had yet to reach the top, and there were existences stronger than him. This feeling even made him feel suffocated as if he had really encountered a monster.","They were simply invincible. Compared to those monsters, Chu Yunfan was nothing.","Not to mention the fluctuations in Huyan Zhuo’s heart, the rest of the onlookers were completely shocked by Chu Yunfan. Many people even had a feeling that they had misunderstood Chu Yunfan’s strength.","The strength that Chu Yunfan had displayed earlier made everyone suspicious. How was this possible? This battle of prodigies was so simple. It was an existence that was practically on a different level.","Now that everyone thought about it, it seemed that from the beginning, Zhang Feng did not have any advantage in the process of fighting with Chu Yunfan. It was just that many people stubbornly believed that Zhang Feng was careless and let Chu Yunfan succeed.","They thought Zhang Feng had lost because of a moment of carelessness. At this moment, even if they wanted to find an excuse for Zhang Feng, they could not find it. Although their strength was not as good as Chu Yunfan and Zhang Feng, they still had their horizons. Naturally, they understood to a certain extent that luck was a joke.","Wouldn’t it be a joke if he could defeat someone stronger than him just by luck?","The difference between the Creation Stage and the Cosmos Stage could no longer be explained by luck alone. If there were still people who were lucky, wouldn’t that be pushing everyone’s intelligence to the ground?","“Is this Chu Yunfan’s true trump card?”","“A year ago, he had created a miracle. However, just as everyone thought that his halo had faded and he would only become an ordinary genius, he once again told everyone that a genius should not be humiliated.”","Everyone was discussing animatedly. Almost all of them were shocked by Chu Yunfan, but they soon heard Huyan Zhuo’s words. They couldn’t help but think about it carefully. They also felt that Huyan Zhuo’s words were very reasonable.","Princess Yun Yang looked at Chu Yunfan with a thoughtful look in her eyes. No one knew what she was thinking.","Spurt!","Zhang Feng spat out a mouthful of blood. He felt much better, but he still couldn’t gather his strength. His sternum was completely broken. He could barely take out a healing pill and swallow it. Only then did his injuries finally improve.","However, he knew that he had already failed. That attack had severely injured him. Now that he had finally escaped from the state of near death, it was impossible for him to fight Chu Yunfan.","A look of disbelief flashed through Zhang Feng’s eyes. He did not understand how Chu Yunfan could be so powerful.","Chu Yunfan placed his hands behind his back. His lightning sword spun around him, faintly emitting a terrifying aura. At this time, he had returned to his original appearance, devoid of the power that erupted from that attack. No one could tell if Chu Yunfan’s strength had suddenly erupted or if he possessed such strength and was just hiding it well because Zhang Feng had not been able to force Chu Yunfan to reveal his true strength.","To Zhang Feng, this was a great humiliation. He had not expected to lose to Chu Yunfan. Before this, no matter how strong Chu Yunfan’s strength was, he was only at the peak of the Cosmos Stage. It was just that the power of that attack had exceeded the peak of the Cosmos Stage. However, he had fallen into Chu Yunfan’s trap because he had not checked.","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan turned to look at Huyan Zhuo and said, “Huyan Zhuo, you’ve been unkind to me since the beginning. Since that’s the case, why don’t you come up as well and we can end this?”","Chu Yunfan’s words immediately caused another huge uproar, like a landslide and tsunami.","Chu Yunfan, who had just defeated Zhang Feng, was challenging Huyan Zhuo. Was he really that confident?","Many people even thought that the method he used to defeat Zhang Feng was not a temporary method. Could he still persist?","However, no one dared to talk about Chu Yunfan’s arrogance anymore. Chu Yunfan, who had easily defeated Zhang Feng, did indeed have the qualifications to do so.","“What an arrogant fellow!” Huyan Zhuo laughed coldly.","In the blink of an eye, his figure rose from the ground like a roc and arrived before Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":1875,"title":"Chapter 1875 Who Do You Think You Are?","paragraphs":["1875 Who Do You Think You Are?","Huyan Zhuo came to Chu Yunfan and stared at him coldly. “You only defeated Zhang Feng. Do you think you can fight me just too?”","“You’ll know if you have the ability to do so after you test it out.” Chu Yunfan looked at Huyan Zhuo.","Huyan Zhuo laughed coldly. His mana started to boil like waves of demonic flames. His mana started to burn, and an incomparable phenomenon appeared. He was like a golden sun god, and his body was burning with sun-like flames.","His gaze was cold and dark. He looked down on the world and controlled the sun, moon, and heaven. He was like a true god.","The strength that Huyan Zhuo had just displayed was even stronger than Zhang Feng’s. His ranking was much higher than Zhang Feng’s. Otherwise, he would not be ranked above Zhang Feng.","Chu Yunfan realized that if Zhang Feng had just stepped into the Creation Stage, then Huyan Zhuo was already close to the peak of the first level of the Creation Stage. In just a short year, his cultivation had made such great progress. It was shocking.","As expected of one of the few people who could be ranked at the peak in a place like the Destiny Sect. Huyan Zhuo’s future was simply limitless.","In comparison, Chu Yunfan seemed to be much calmer. All of his divine power was retracted in his body, and only the lightning sword was spinning around him.","However, after Chu Yunfan had defeated Zhang Feng with lightning speed, no one dared to underestimate Chu Yunfan.","On the ground, Zhang Feng looked at the two people flying in the sky with a complicated expression as he recuperated. He had originally thought that he would become the focus of attention at this garden party and might even be favored by Princess Yun Yang to become the prince consort.","At that time, he would truly be in high spirits. With Princess Yun Yang acting as the middleman, he could even get on the imperial family’s big ship and obtain resources that far exceeded his current level. At that time, it would not be impossible for him to become the chief disciple of Great Change Faith.","He could then surpass the monsters and become the true ruler of Great Change Faith. Who knew that the battle had just begun, right at the start of the garden party, he had already been eliminated? He had no chance to show his strength, let alone show off his might.","There was endless humiliation.","The two people above were both people he regarded as his biggest competitors. He could not wait for the two of them to suffer a loss. Especially toward Chu Yunfan, who had caused him to end up like this, Zhang Feng hated him so much that he gritted his teeth and could not contain his anger.","Just as he was letting his imagination run wild, everyone held their breaths and focused on the unprecedented battle that was about to erupt. The battle between prodigies had ended too mysteriously. Zhang Feng had not even had the chance to use his many divine abilities and skills before he was inexplicably defeated.","“Hah!”","Huyan Zhuo let out a long howl. He finally couldn’t hold it in any longer and attacked. However, his divine power was raised to the extreme. Endless divine power spread out and instantly turned into a majestic divine power that swept out into the air. Behind him, the shadow of an expert whose face could not be seen clearly formed. Everyone could even feel the aura of destiny on this expert. They felt as if boundless destiny had been bestowed upon them.","This was a true core principle of the Destiny Sect. Those who could join the Destiny Sect were all geniuses among geniuses. They were blessed by the heavens and were invincible.","Huyan Zhuo grabbed at Chu Yunfan with a big energy hand. It was an endless destiny aura that reached through the sky. This energy hand contained an incomparably dense divine power. It was equivalent to the terrifying power of dozens of experts at the peak of the Creation Stage.","In an instant, the hand enveloped Chu Yunfan, giving him a terrifying feeling that he could not escape or avoid. In fact, it was as if his destiny was in Huyan Zhuo’s hands.","“As expected of an expert from the Destiny Sect. It’s completely the battle rhythm of the Destiny Sect,” someone exclaimed.","Although not everyone had fought against Huyan Zhuo before, it didn’t mean that they hadn’t fought against other experts from the Destiny Sect.","“That’s right. This is the power of the Destiny Sect. It’s as if your destiny is in their hands. It’s as if you’ve entered his five fingers. No one can escape it,” someone said fearfully.","The Destiny Sect was the number one sect in the world. In terms of strength, they were naturally the best among the various sects. They were the upper circle of the upper circle.","There was even a saying that the disciples who walked out of the Destiny Sect could at least fight against two or even several disciples of the same level from the other ten great sects. If they weren’t disciples from the top ten sects, they wouldn’t pose any threat to the disciples of the Destiny Sect. In front of them, numbers were meaningless. No matter how many experts of the same level there were, it was impossible to defeat them. Whether it was a one-on-one or a group fight, they were almost invincible.","The experts of the Destiny Sect claimed to have mastered the fury of destiny.","Could humans fight against the heavens? Of course not!","Therefore, the other sects could not compete with the experts of the Destiny Sect.","“Chu Yunfan, I’ve already seen through your destiny. You’ll be defeated by me.” Huyan Zhuo’s expression was cold, his eyes flashing with killing intent. His voice was incomparably cold.","“What bullsh*t destiny? Cultivators like us go against the heavens when it comes to cultivation. Even the heavens can’t control my destiny, so who do you think you are?”","Chu Yunfan didn’t care about this kind of pressure. He just sneered. In an instant, every pore of his spewed sword light. Around his body, seven lightning swords formed. They were completely condensed from the power of lightning.","Every sword flashed with the light of lightning, sweeping away all enemies.","Whoosh!","The lightning swords swept out in an instant, sweeping across the sky and stabbing straight at the big hand.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan’s sword pierced through the big hand. In front of everyone, the terrifying big hand collapsed in the air and shattered before everyone.","In an instant, the terrifying hand that had been suppressing everyone a moment ago, almost making them feel as if their destiny was under its control, transformed into a terrifying shockwave that spread in all directions.","“This is the ultimate technique of the Violet Thunder Sword Sect? No wonder they were so arrogant, but what’s the use? Even those at the peak of the Violet Thunder Swords were defeated by my Destiny Sect!” Huyan Zhuo’s eyes flashed with a bright light as he shouted."]},{"number":1876,"title":"Chapter 1876 Defeating Huyan Zhuo","paragraphs":["1876 Defeating Huyan Zhuo","Huyan Zhuo revealed a shocking secret.","Later on, the sect was uprooted by the rebel forces of the Violet Thunder Sword Domain. In the end, the last descendant of the sect was captured in Grand Xia and the method to open the Violet Thunder Prefecture barrier was pried out of them.","It could be said to be extremely miserable.","However, no one knew exactly which faction the Violet Thunder Sword Sect had gone on an expedition against. Now, they had finally unraveled a mystery that had remained unsolved for many years in the Violet Thunder Sword Domain.","It turned out that the power that had defeated the Violet Thunder Swords was none other than the Destiny Sect that Huyan Zhuo was from. Even with the might of the Violet Thunder Swords back then, they were still forced to flee in a sorry state by the Destiny Sect, and their army was completely annihilated. One could imagine just how powerful the Destiny Sect was.","Almost everyone thought that Chu Yunfan, who came from the Violet Thunder Prefecture, had obtained the inheritance of the Violet Thunder Swords. After all, he had once displayed the ultimate technique of the Violet Thunder Swords, the Seven Violet Thunder Swords","This further confirmed many people’s guesses. Chu Yunfan definitely had a direct relationship with the Violet Thunder Swords. Even if he wasn’t the most direct successor, it was more or less the same.","If Chu Yunfan had shown himself back then, he would have been targeted by many people. However, the Violet Thunder Prefecture had already been breached and became the Violet Thunder Prefecture of Grand Xia. The inheritance of the Violet Thunder Swords had long been taken away by the Imperial Court of Grand Xia, so it was basically worthless.","Even if he had some of the Violet Thunder Swords’ heritage, it was nothing much. Which expert in the world did not have one or two declining heritage? This in itself was nothing.","As the successor of the Destiny Sect, Huyan Zhuo naturally had an absolute psychological advantage over Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan, who possessed the inheritance of the Violet Thunder Swords, might seem insufferably arrogant to others, but in Huyan Zhuo’s eyes, he was nothing but a defeated opponent.","“I’m not a descendant of the Violet Thunder Prefecture. Even if I am, so what!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","At this time, Huyan Zhuo couldn’t help but attack again. He wasn’t a kind person either. He opened his eyes and his aura suddenly expanded. A terrifying divine power suddenly erupted from his back. This divine power formed rings of light around his body. These rings of light were like light wheels that crushed down on Chu Yunfan.","“Destiny is mine!”","Huyan Zhuo let out a long howl as his entire body erupted. It was as if the entire world was under his control as if he was a true demon god.","The terrifying wind made Chu Yunfan’s clothes flutter.","“It’s your honor to be defeated by me!” Huyan Zhuo said coldly.","Suddenly, he made his move. A flag suddenly appeared in his hand. This flag was embroidered with a golden pattern. As soon as it was displayed, countless flames spewed out from it, setting the entire sky on fire.","“It’s the Inferno Flag. Huyan Zhuo brought out the Inferno Flag! He’s determined to win this battle. Chu Yunfan will lose!”","“That’s right. According to the rumors, this is the famous magic tool of an ancient sect called the Inferno Sect. Later, the Inferno Sect was destroyed by the Destiny Sect, and their inheritance was also annexed by the Destiny Sect. The Inferno Flag has become a magic tool that some of the top experts of the Destiny Sect must refine. Once the Inferno Flag is out, it can turn a radius of a thousand miles into a barren land.”","Seeing this flag, everyone became excited. The Inferno Flag was famous. Although it didn’t come from the Destiny Sect, after the Inferno Sect was destroyed, the Inferno Flag became the symbol of the Destiny Sect.","Even someone as arrogant as Zhang Feng had to admit that Huyan Zhuo’s strength was still above his after he had obtained the Inferno Flag. He had originally thought of Huyan Zhuo as a strong competitor. Now that he realized that his competitor was much stronger than him, his expression became serious.","The flame swept toward Chu Yunfan like a monstrous wave of fire. Huyan Zhuo’s face revealed a cold smile. Even a Creator could not resist this kind of flame. They could only choose to dodge.","In such a small space, there was not much room for Chu Yunfan to hide. It could be said that the flame enveloped Chu Yunfan all of a sudden, leaving him nowhere to hide.","However, he never expected that Chu Yunfan had no intention of dodging at all. Instead, Chu Yunfan raised his divine power to the limit and spat out a sword light. The sword light turned into a sky full of lightning and swept out.","Boom!","Endless lightning and flames collided, melting and devouring each other, forming a terrifying explosion.","To everyone’s surprise, even after using the Inferno Flag, Huyan Zhuo still couldn’t gain the upper hand.","Chu Yunfan’s body erupted with endless lightning power, sweeping through everything and breaking the flames that filled the sky.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan suddenly rose from the ground and rushed out like a tyrannosaurus. His hands tore apart the golden light that filled the sky and extinguished the fire in the air. Then, he pulled fiercely.","Everyone heard a huge explosion. The Inferno Flag was torn into two halves by Chu Yunfan.","Spurt!","Huyan Zhuo spat out a mouthful of blood. He was instantly injured and he flew backward as if he had been hit hard.","“Nine Netherworld Stomps!”","Chu Yunfan had no intention of showing mercy. He stomped on Huyan Zhuo.","Bam!","Huyan Zhuo fell from the sky and slammed into the ground, creating a huge crack.","Spurt!","Huyan Zhuo spat out a few mouthfuls of blood. He struggled to get up, but Chu Yunfan stomped on him again.","Boom!","The entire ground shook. In an instant, Huyan Zhuo was severely injured and fainted.","Huyan Zhuo was defeated, and the scene went dead silent."]},{"number":1877,"title":"Chapter 1877 Invincible Elegance, Comparable to Those Monsters","paragraphs":["1877 Invincible Elegance, Comparable to Those Monsters","Huyan Zhuo was defeated too quickly. It was so fast that no one could react.","Chu Yunfan’s speed had made another breakthrough after he had broken through. Even those in the Creation Stage couldn’t compare to Chu Yunfan’s speed, let alone those in the Cosmos Stage. They couldn’t see Chu Yunfan’s attack at all. They could only see his afterimages. The outcome of the battle had already been decided.","Such an astonishing speed shocked everyone!","“God, what speed...” someone muttered to himself.","It was unknown whether he was referring to Chu Yunfan’s speed or the speed at which Chu Yunfan defeated Huyan Zhuo. It was almost to the point that they did not have time to react before it was already over.","The entire place was deathly silent, so silent that one could hear a pin drop. The only sound left in the entire place was the sound of everyone inhaling a breath of cold air.","They were still in disbelief. What did they just see?","Huyan Zhuo, who was ranked at the top of the prodigy list, had been easily defeated by Chu Yunfan. It was completely different from what they had thought before. Originally, they had imagined that Chu Yunfan, who had yet to break through to the Creation Stage, was the weakest among the three. Who knew that Chu Yunfan was pretending?","After easily defeating Zhang Feng, he easily defeated Huyan Zhuo.","At this moment, the true disciples of the Flying Celestials remembered that Chu Yunfan’s expression was very calm from the beginning to the end as if he did not care about Zhang Feng and Huyan Zhuo. It was just that no one believed that Chu Yunfan had such strength before, so they were unwilling to believe it. However, they realized now how wrong and ridiculous their previous guess of Chu Yunfan was.","Chu Yunfan had such strength, so he was naturally very calm and didn’t have to worry about being attacked from both sides.","However, at this time, more people reacted. If Chu Yunfan had defeated the two of them after a bitter battle, then it could be said that their strength was on par. At most, Chu Yunfan’s strength was slightly stronger than theirs. However, the reality was that Chu Yunfan had easily defeated them. This meant that his strength far exceeded the two.","This reminded everyone of Chu Yunfan’s previous ranking in the top 30.","Although it was the top 30, considering that the prodigy list included the top geniuses of various races and factions, the top 30 was almost close to the top 10 of the younger generation of Grand Xia.","This wasn’t the top ten of any sect, but the top ten of the entire Grand Xia Empire. Standing at the peak of the billions of living beings, how powerful was that?","However, in the past year or so, Chu Yunfan’s ranking kept falling. This made many people wonder if Chu Yunfan was a fake. As many experts entered the Creation Stage one after another, it was predicted that Chu Yunfan would soon fall off the prodigy list.","But now, Chu Yunfan had used a vicious slap to tell everyone that he was still a force to be reckoned with.","“How is he so strong?!” Zhang Feng’s pupils constricted slightly as he couldn’t help but say.","If his defeat could be said to be due to Chu Yunfan catching him off guard, then after his defeat, Huyan Zhuo naturally could not underestimate Chu Yunfan. However, he still lost to Chu Yunfan. It was clear that Chu Yunfan was not just lucky to be able to defeat him. Chu Yunfan did have real strength. Even if he was prepared, he would not be able to defeat Chu Yunfan.","Even when the two of them attacked one after another, they could not test Chu Yunfan’s bottom line. Up until now, they could only see his terrifying power.","Zhang Feng could even feel that Chu Yunfan had not used his full strength when he attacked earlier. He had only used a portion of his strength, and they had already lost. If he attacked with his full strength, how terrifying would he be?","This made Zhang Feng think of the few monsters ranked at the top of the prodigy list. He had once seen two of them fight with his own eyes, and even now, he still felt his heart palpitate. They were all on the prodigy list, but the difference between them was too great.","Now, he could actually feel the aura of those monsters from Chu Yunfan’s body, and it was an invincible aura.","Among the younger generation, although Li Qianyuan was currently the leader, it was only a temporary ranking. No one had reached the peak, and no real war had broken out. The world’s number one would be born from these people. The world’s top masters of the future would be one of these people.","In a few years, a war most terrifying would erupt.","Zhang Feng shook his head. How was that possible? How could a fellow who had yet to enter the Creation Stage be like those terrifying monsters?","Moreover, to him, there was no difference at all. Whether Chu Yunfan used his full strength or not, it was just a punch. There was no difference.","Thinking of this, Zhang Feng became even more depressed. His pride had been shattered by Chu Yunfan’s punch. His perseverance in the past was not worth mentioning in front of this crushing defeat.","On the other side, Princess Yun Yang looked at Chu Yunfan with sparkling eyes as if she had discovered a peerless treasure. She probably didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to burst out with such light. He was on par with those monsters at the top of the prodigy list.","“As expected of her man. It’s not in vain that she’s been longing for him for so many years,” Princess Yun Yang muttered to herself.","However, her expression immediately changed and she revealed a beautiful smile. She said, “What an exciting battle. All three of you have displayed amazing skills, especially the External General. General Chu, you have displayed the supreme elegance of the younger generation of Grand Xia. The empire will only get better and better because of heroes like you. Men, take the two young masters to private quarters to rest. At the same time, give them a Nine Flower Jade Dew Pill to treat their injuries.”","Everyone was instantly in an uproar. Just a moment ago, there was a hint of pity in their eyes when they looked at Zhang Feng and Huyan Zhuo. Now, there was immediately a hint of envy.","“Two Nine Flower Jade Dew Pill have been brought forth. The princess is really generous. She spent a lot of effort to make the Nine Flower Jade Dew Pills by collecting nine types of divine flowers. Not only does it have miraculous effects on healing, but it can also greatly increase one’s cultivation.”","“That’s right. I’ve only heard of the Nine Flower Jade Dew Pill, but I’ve never seen it before. It seems that the two of them will have another breakthrough in their cultivation before long. I’m so jealous!”","“I’ve long heard of the Nine Flower Jade Dew Pill’s great name. It’s a famous healing pill.”"]},{"number":1878,"title":"Chapter 1878 Do You Remember Your Fiancee, Tang Siyu?","paragraphs":["1878 Do You Remember Your Fiancee, Tang Siyu?","Princess Yun Yang’s Nine Flower Jade Dew Pill instantly overshadowed Chu Yunfan’s limelight. This pill was an ancient formula. It was unknown how it had been passed down to the Grand Xia Imperial Court and was finally bestowed to Princess Yun Yang by the king.","Princess Yun Yang would only reward some geniuses and outstanding figures who were on good terms with her with these pills. It was one of her methods to win people’s hearts. This was something that everyone was aware of. In fact, everyone present was a hero, a figure that stood at the peak of all living beings. They naturally understood what Princess Yun Yang was thinking, but this was not annoying. After all, there was no such thing as a free lunch.","If one wanted to get something, they naturally had to pay a corresponding price.","Of course, everyone understood this principle. Moreover, it was impossible for them not to be tempted by the Nine Flower Jade Dew Pill. This was a legendary healing pill.","With the Nine Flower Jade Dew Pill, it was equivalent to having an extra life. It could save lives at critical moments and could also increase their cultivation. Therefore, even though those prodigies knew that this was Princess Yun Yang’s method to win over people’s hearts, they had no way of rejecting it.","As expected, Zhang Feng and Huyan Zhuo, who were originally indignant, looked much better now. They also knew of the Nine Flower Jade Dew Pill.","Suddenly, a figure appeared on the stage. Everyone looked and saw that it was none other than Princess Yun Yang’s sword attendant, Tertius. Everyone knew who she truly was. She was the former sect leader of the Demonic Sword Sect, so they did not dare to underestimate her.","They saw Tertius holding two white jade porcelain bottles. Inside the porcelain bottles were Nine Flower Jade Dew Pills.","“Thank you for the pill, Princess!”","Zhang Feng and Huyan Zhuo cupped their hands and thanked her. Without a care for anything else, they poured out the Nine Flower Jade Dew Pill. The entire venue was filled with the fragrance of flowers. It did not seem like ordinary pills.","After they took the Nine Flower Jade Dew Pill, their complexion immediately improved. The injuries on their bodies were alleviated at a speed that was visible to the naked eye. This was especially evident in Zhang Feng. His injuries quickly healed. Now that he had taken the Nine Flower Jade Dew Pill, his entire body had recovered to about 80% of his peak condition. He was basically fine now, and the rest would recover soon.","At this moment, he was no longer dissatisfied. On the contrary, he looked at Princess Yun Yang with even more admiration.","On the other side, Huyan Zhuo’s healing speed was slower than his, but he was able to stand up again very quickly. He glared at Chu Yunfan fiercely and finally came back to his senses. He had lost, and he had been defeated by Chu Yunfan, whom he had looked down on.","He felt that it was a great humiliation, but he only dared to look at it like this. He did not dare to move forward. What a joke. At this moment, even if he was stupid, he could see that Chu Yunfan’s strength was far above his.","Although Huyan Zhuo had stepped into the Creation Stage and his strength was no longer the same as before, the gap between him and Chu Yunfan had not narrowed. Instead, it had become wider and wider.","Chu Yunfan didn’t care about Huyan Zhuo’s gaze. He just sneered. In fact, for him, he only had one goal, and that was Li Qianyuan. Although Huyan Zhuo’s ranking was high, he didn’t even look at Huyan Zhuo.","However, he didn’t mind showing off his strength. Although it would attract more attention, it would also attract the attention of the Flying Celestials.","Although Chu Yunfan was already a core disciple, he was not valued as much as Yang Dengxian. The resources he could obtain were not on the same level as Yang Dengxian. He had to show stronger strength and stronger talent so that the Flying Celestials would pour resources into him. Then, he could catch up with Li Qianyuan at a faster speed.","“External General, I have something to say to you. Could we speak privately?” Princess Yun Yang said to Chu Yunfan.","“Of course, Your Royal Highness.”","Hearing there was going to be a conversation between Princess Yun Yang and Chu Yunfan, everyone’s interest was piqued. They didn’t know what was so private that they had to avoid everyone.","Chu Yunfan only sneered. These people were just defeated by him, yet they still dared to warn him. When Chu Yunfan’s gaze swept over, everyone immediately did not dare to look at him and turned their heads away.","Seeing this, Princess Yun Yang didn’t say anything. She just smiled and led the way. Her graceful figure quickly disappeared into the depths of the manor.","Chu Yunfan quickly followed her and arrived at a courtyard deep in the manor. Princess Yun Yang was sitting on a stone bench in the courtyard. In front of her was a tea set. Princess Yun Yang’s movements of brewing tea were like flowing water. It looked really beautiful.","“General Chu, please sit.” Princess Yun Yang gestured at another bench.","Chu Yunfan did not stand on ceremony and took the seat opposite her. “Why have you called me here, Princess?” he asked.","“Do you really not understand?” Princess Yun Yang said","“Well, in that case, let’s get straight to the point. Where did you get the personal terminal from, Princess?” Chu Yunfan asked. His eyes were like two sharp swords as he glared at Princess Yun Yang.","“So that bracelet is called a personal terminal,” Princess Yun Yang said indifferently, “From its function, it’s a very appropriate name.”","Princess Yun Yang glanced at Chu Yunfan and said, “I’ll get straight to the point. I invited you here today to help someone pass on a message. General Chu, do you still remember your fiancee, Tang Siyu?”","When Chu Yunfan heard this, he trembled slightly. With his state of mind, even if Mount Tai collapsed in front of him, his expression would not change. However, when he heard this name, he could not help but tremble.","He had spent far too much time searching for Tang Siyu. He had searched the entire Violet Thunder Prefecture, but he had never received any news of her. Now, everything was finally settled."]},{"number":1879,"title":"Chapter 1879 Choosing a Husband","paragraphs":["1879 Choosing a Husband","“Please tell me about Siyu, Princess,” Chu Yunfan said without hesitation.","“I didn’t expect you to be such a devoted person, General.” Princess Yun Yang smiled when she saw Chu Yunfan’s anxiety.","At this moment, Princess Yun Yang looked at Chu Yunfan, who no longer looked like the invincible figure who had killed everyone. He was just an ordinary man who missed his beloved.","“That’s right. I was asked by Siyu to meet you. Fortunately, you’re not a heartless person. Otherwise, I wouldn’t have tolerated you,” Princess Yun Yang said indifferently.","Her words were a bit cold as she spoke. There was actually a pressuring aura. However, this pressuring aura only lasted for an instant before it disappeared without a trace.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t doubt her. Someone who could make Tang Siyu personally come must be someone she trusted. Therefore, Chu Yunfan didn’t mind Princess Yun Yang’s attitude.","“I don’t know where Siyu is right now. I only know that she’s under the Elder Princess’ tutelage, but I don’t know the exact situation. Why can’t she come and see me?” Chu Yunfan asked.","He knew that only the eldest daughter of the current generation could take on the position of the Elder Princess. In Grand Xia, there were many people who participated in the fight for the throne. It was not considered taboo. One could imagine how much power the Elder Princess had in Grand Xia.","In the book, “The World,” he had read that among Grand Xia’s past Elder Princesses, there had been more than one Elder Princess who had the power to rule the country.","When the king became muddle-headed, the Elder Princess had helped him to become the king. This would become the benchmark for the later Elder Princesses.","“Because she has no choice.” Princess Yun Yang looked at Chu Yunfan with a burning gaze.","“Involuntary? Someone’s forcing her?” When Chu Yunfan heard this, his eyes flashed with a terrifying light. In an instant, a terrifying aura erupted from his body.","However, he immediately restrained his raging aura.","“May I ask what happened, Princess?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“You and Marquis Huntian are having a feud, but do you know who Marquis Huntian relies on in the court?” Princess Yun Yang glanced at Chu Yunfan.","“I don’t.” Chu Yunfan shook his head.","After all, he had only been in Grand Xia for a short time, so he didn’t know many things. There were no records in “The World.” In a sense, this was the so-called lack of foundation.","“Then I’ll get straight to the point. Marquis Huntian was an attendant in the Eastern Palace before he joined the army.”","Princess Yun Yang said a term that made Chu Yunfan’s eyelids twitch. Of course, he knew what it meant to be an attendant in the Eastern Palace.","The Eastern Palace belonged to the crown prince, and the attendants in the Eastern Palace were naturally under the crown prince. Every generation of kings would choose some of the most outstanding talents for the crown prince to study. These talents were either from the ten great sects or from the various aristocratic families in the court. Even the commoners were outstanding people. Each of them was the best among the best among their peers.","These people were often the backbone of the important officials after the crown prince ascended the throne. Therefore, most of the attendants were the most trusted people of the crown prince. In other words, Li Qianyuan was one of the crown prince’s subordinates.","Even if Chu Yunfan was ignorant, he knew what this meant. If it was only Li Qianyuan, it would not be a big deal. However, behind him stood the crown prince of the Eastern Palace, who was the future king. Among the many princes, the one with the greatest possibility of succession was the one with the most powerful supporters.","However, Chu Yunfan also understood a little. If there was no support from such a behemoth, how could Li Qianyuan be one step ahead of everyone to enter the Creation Stage and then enter the second Creation Stage first?","However, Chu Yunfan was only stunned for a moment. Even if it was the crown prince of the Eastern Palace, Chu Yunfan would never compromise on this issue.","“Is this related to the crown prince?” Chu Yunfan’s expression became colder and colder as if it could freeze.","“There is indeed some relationship. My aunt, the Elder Princess, has yet to express her stance, and many people want to obtain her support,” Princess Yun Yang said.","Chu Yunfan instantly understood the relationship between them. No wonder Li Qianyuan wanted to kill him, especially when there was no enmity between the two sides.","Now he understood everything. It must be because of Tang Siyu. At that time, Li Qianyuan probably thought that it was just to get rid of an insignificant person. He didn’t even need to go out himself or his followers. He just needed to spread the news, and there were many people willing to work for him.","The truth was similar to what he had thought. Many people had indeed received the news. Who was Marquis Huntian? He was the number one person among the younger generation of the current dynasty. It could be said that there was no one he could not kill.","Naturally, many people wanted to kill Chu Yunfan to please Li Qianyuan. However, they had underestimated Chu Yunfan’s tenacity. Those people had died in Chu Yunfan’s hands one after another. Even now, Chu Yunfan had grown from a small figure who was not worth mentioning at the beginning to an existence that was enough to arm-wrestle with Li Qianyuan.","A general of Grand Xia had tens of thousands of elites under his command. Although he could not be considered an important figure, he was definitely not as insignificant as he was at the beginning.","“Could it be that the Elder Princess has restricted Siyu’s movements?” When Chu Yunfan thought of this, his eyes were filled with killing intent.","Even if the other party was the Elder Princess, Chu Yunfan would never allow such a thing to happen.","“Auntie treats Siyu sincerely and treats her as her last disciple. Now, Siyu is in seclusion in the imperial family’s secret realm. Tsk, tsk. Even I have a hard time getting the chance to enter that place. If it wasn’t for Auntie’s insistence, Siyu wouldn’t have had the chance.” There was a hint of envy in Princess Yun Yang’s voice.","Knowing that Tang Siyu was fine, Chu Yunfan heaved a sigh of relief.","“However, Auntie wants to choose a husband for Siyu. This news has already been leaked. Once Siyu comes out of seclusion, she may have to choose a husband among the geniuses of the world,” Princess Yun Yang said, “Now you know why Li Qianyuan wants to target you. He wants this opportunity, especially for many people who are interested in the throne. This is an opportunity to build a relationship with my aunt.","“After all, Siyu quill be my aunt’s successor. Whoever marries her will naturally receive my aunt’s full support.”"]},{"number":1880,"title":"Chapter 1880 Half a Year Later, I Will Be the Victor, and Only I Can Be!","paragraphs":["1880 Half a Year Later, I Will Be the Victor, and Only I Can Be!","Chu Yunfan didn’t expect that the news he just received from Tang Siyu would be accompanied by such news. At this time, he already understood why Li Qianyuan had such a strong killing intent towards him.","If their goal was to choose a husband, then he, Tang Siyu’s fiancé, would undoubtedly become the biggest stumbling block.","Although in Li Qianyuan’s eyes, Chu Yunfan might not even be as good as an ant, and he did not even intend to do it himself, he only shouted and countless people came forward to fight for him.","Now that the Eldest Princess’s attitude was undecided, all the princes and princesses who wanted to become the Emperor wanted to gain the Eldest Princess’s support, so marrying Tang Siyu became a realistic and effective method. Especially after the Eldest Princess revealed her intention to choose a husband, it was likely that all those who wanted to become the Emperor would start to stir.","“What right does she have to do that?” Chu Yunfan said angrily.","“Because she’s strong enough. You’re not from my Grand Xia Empire, so you might not know much about the Eldest Princess ‘aunt. She might even be the number one expert of my Grand Xia Imperial Family!” Princess Yunyang said indifferently. ” Although he has been living in seclusion in the Southern Sea for the past few years, he was a top-notch expert of the Great Xia Imperial Family in his early years. He even had the chance to rule the world!”","“If it wasn’t like this, do you think that an ordinary princess would make the Crown Prince so nervous?” Princess Yunyang looked at Chu Yunfan and said. “You don’t have a choice. You won’t know in the future, but with your current strength, you’re definitely not a match for the Eldest Princess ‘aunt. I advise you to think about it carefully!”","“Moreover, it’s best that you don’t have such thoughts. The Eldest Princess ‘aunt is the number one expert in the royal family. Her cultivation is unfathomable, perhaps even stronger than my Imperial Father. Do you know how many people want to become her disciple but are unable to do so?” Princess Yunyang said. ” If it wasn’t for Siyu’s unique physique, which is even stronger than an emperor’s physique, aunt wouldn’t have treated her differently. This is an unprecedented opportunity for her. With aunt’s nurturing, she might even be able to become a top expert in the future. If it’s for her own good, don’t even think about it!”","Chu Yunfan clenched his fists and felt extremely humiliated. The Great Xia Dynasty was really a world where the strong preyed on the weak.","He seemed to see a peerless beauty looking down at the world with a cold and emotionless gaze. Even though she knew that Tang Siyu had a fiancé, she did not care at all. Presumably, in the Eldest Princess’s heart, he was not worthy of her disciple.","Therefore, she did not consider herself at all. Even Li Qianyuan did not like him at all at the beginning.","At that time, the only thing that was worth treating Chu Yunfan differently was his identity as Tang Siyu’s fiancé. Without this identity, he was probably less than an ant in the hearts of those so-called high and mighty figures.","It had been a long time since he felt this way. However, after a while, he finally said,” So, you mean that I want to participate in the selection of a husband?”","” That’s right. This is the best way and the only way. Don’t even think about taking her away from my aunt. That’s impossible!” Princess Yunyang said firmly.","Chu Yunfan realized that Princess Yunyang had an inexplicable sense of admiration when she mentioned the Eldest Princess.","“This son-in-law selection should be something that only the elites of Grand Xia, or even the entire world, can participate in. Originally, I didn’t think that you would even have the qualifications to participate. It’s not something that you would have a chance to do just because you’re on the Prodigy Rankings. In truth, your ranking on the Prodigy Rankings isn’t high either, and your chances of winning in the end aren’t high either!” Princess Yunyang said. “If you couldn’t defeat Zhang Feng and Huyan Zhuo today, I wouldn’t have told you this news. Otherwise, it would be a waste of time for you to go. You’d just be sending yourself to death. But now that you’ve obtained my approval, you have the right to know this news. You also have the possibility to walk to the end!”","” Thank you, Princess Yunyang, for informing me of this news. However, what I want to know is what benefits Your Highness will get from this matter!” Chu Yunfan said after letting out a long sigh.","Hearing Princess Yunyang say that he was not qualified at all, Chu Yunfan’s expression was not happy. His tone was also not polite. Even a clay man had some anger, let alone him.","Princess Yunyang did not mind Chu Yunfan’s change in attitude. She only smiled and said,” As long as you win the final victory, it will be the greatest benefit for me!”","Chu Yunfan frowned and immediately understood what Princess Yunyang meant. For her, who was interested in competing for the throne, all the princes were her competitors, whether it was the Crown Prince or the other princes.","Whether it was the Crown Prince or the other princes, they would not let go of this once-in-a-lifetime opportunity.","If one of them succeeded, it would be the worst news for Princess Yunyang.","Therefore, for Princess Yunyang, the biggest benefit of Chu Yunfan being the final winner was that the other princes and princesses ‘plans had all failed.","Moreover, she seemed to have a good relationship with Tang Siyu. This was her biggest advantage!","“Although you might not be happy to say this, this is indeed the best outcome for us, isn’t it?” Princess Yunyang said,” Right now, our relationship isn’t that close. It’s not scary to be used by others. What’s scary is that you don’t even have any value. If you want us to look at you in a different light, show us your strength and let everyone know that Siyu’s fiancée is not to be trifled with!”","Chu Yunfan took a deep breath and calmed the anger in his heart. Indeed, this was only the first time he had met Princess Yunyang. What right did he have to ask Princess Yunyang to be honest with him or even help him at all costs?","Just the information that Princess Yunyang had revealed to him was already worth thousands of gold.","” I hope that the final winner is you. Otherwise, I’m afraid that something that no one wants to see will happen in the end!” Princess Yunyang said.","“The final victor will definitely be me!” Chu Yunfan said firmly. “It can only be me!”","“I want to know, how much time is left before the selection of a husband begins?” Chu Yunfan asked.","” Half a year, you only have half a year. If you can’t defeat Li Qianyuan in half a year, then everything will be over!” Princess Yunyang said to Chu Yunfan.","She also wanted to see if Chu Yunfan, who had created countless miracles along the way, could create an even greater miracle in half a year.","” Half a year later, I know!” Chu Yunfan stood up and said,” Thank you for your hospitality today, Your Highness. However, I’m afraid I don’t have much time to waste here. I’ll take my leave first!”","Chu Yunfan turned around and left."]},{"number":1881,"title":"Chapter 1881 The Shocking Change of the Far-pacifying Army","paragraphs":["1881 The Shocking Change of the Far-pacifying Army","“Wait!”","Chu Yunfan turned to look at Princess Yunyang and saw a white porcelain bottle fly into his hand.","” Here’s a bottle of ten Nine Flower Dew Pills. Siyu asked me to bring them to you!” Princess Yunyang said.","Chu Yunfan took the bottle. The Nine Flower Dew Pill that Princess Yunyang had given to Zhang Feng and Huyan Zhuo had already made many people jealous. One could imagine how precious the Nine Flower Dew Pill was.","It was almost equivalent to a life.","But now, he had casually given Chu Yunfan a bottle of ten Nine Flower Dew Pills. It could not be said that it was not a big deal.","Chu Yunfan accepted the Nine Flower Dew Pill. Since it was Tang Siyu’s kind intention, he naturally wouldn’t waste it.","Others might not know about the Nine Flower Dew Pill, but he knew it the best. The inventor of the Nine Flower Dew Pill was none other than the Alchemy Sovereign. Moreover, it was also the pill formula that the Alchemy Sovereign developed in his early years.","Later on, after the Alchemy Sovereign died, this pill formula was passed down to the Imperial Family. It wasn’t that he didn’t know the pill formula, but the medicinal ingredients needed to refine the Nine Flower Dew Pill were really too precious.","It was only because Princess Yunyang had the backing of the imperial family that she could refine the Nine Flower Dew Pill in large quantities.","“Thank you, Your Highness!”","Chu Yunfan cupped his hands and said.","Princess Yunyang looked at Chu Yunfan and smiled.” You still have some manners. I hope you can win in half a year. Don’t disappoint Siyu, and don’t disappoint me!”","Chu Yunfan nodded, then he took a step forward and soared into the sky like a great roc spreading its wings.","Princess Yunyang stood up and watched Chu Yunfan’s figure disappear into the horizon.","Beside her, a figure appeared. It was Princess Yunyang’s sword maid, A’san. A’san stood behind Princess Yunyang with a submissive expression, not daring to cross over.","” No one would have thought that Siyu’s fiancé was actually a Hidden Dragon. Interesting!” Princess Yunyang smiled and said.","“Your Highness, should we entrust the matter of choosing a husband to him?” Ah San suddenly asked.","“Do we have a better choice now?” Princess Yunyang stretched lazily with a beautiful smile on her face. ” Moreover, this is also Siyu’s wish. As long as Siyu is still here, Chu Yunfan will have to fight with all his might. I am very optimistic about him. After half a year, maybe even Li Qianyuan will suffer a big loss at his hands!”","“Let’s go and meet the other heroes!” Princess Yunyang left gracefully.","He had already passed the interrogation of the Ministry of War. Now, through the teleportation array in the imperial capital, Chu Yunfan was teleported back to Baotai City in an instant.","“What’s wrong?” Chu Yunfan frowned slightly, feeling a little strange.","Did something happen in the army?","Given the location of Bao Tai City, unless the Monster Race, Hu Race, and Barbarian Race invaded on a large scale and the front line of the Demon-Subduing City collapsed, the war would not reach Bao Tai City.","“General You Chuyun and Commandant Chu Hongcai have been surrounded!” the officer said anxiously.","“Why are we surrounded? Where is he? Who is he?” Chu Yunfan immediately asked.","You Chuyun was his right-hand man, and also an important means to control the Faraway Army. Chu Hong was his family, and both of them were very important. Chu Yunfan could not help but feel nervous.","” Commandant Chu was supposed to lead his troops to attack a mountain stronghold five hundred miles away according to the usual schedule three days ago. Who knew that he would be surrounded the moment he went there? General You rushed to the rescue as soon as he received the news. Who knew that he would also be surrounded? Now, the other party has sent a letter, indicating that they want you to go there!” The officer couldn’t help but panic.” General, this is clearly a trap!”","Chu Yunfan narrowed his eyes, his gaze extremely cold. Even this officer could tell that this was a trap, so how could Chu Yunfan not see it?","This was probably a conspiracy against Chu Yunfan from the very beginning.","After Chu Hongcai was promoted to an elite disciple, he was pulled into the Faraway Army by Chu Yunfan. As the saying went, it was easy to be an official with a good person in the court. In addition, Chu Hongcai was indeed not weak, so he was quickly promoted to a commandant.","According to the rules set by Chu Yunfan before he left, the commandants and lieutenants in the army had to lead their troops to the battlefield according to different schedules to wipe out all the ghosts and monsters within a thousand miles.","Be it the barbarians, Hu tribes, mountain bandits, or all kinds of demons and ghosts, they were all within the scope of attack.","The reason why Bao Tai City had been able to undergo such drastic changes in such a short period of time and become the central city of the nearby area was because of such a thunderous method.","The other party must have known about the relationship between Chu Hongcai and Chu Yunfan, so they had specially chosen this opportunity to attack Chu Hongcai.","His goal was obvious, to lure Chu Yunfan out!","Although Chu Hongcai’s strength was not weak, he had only cultivated for a short period of time, and he had only received guidance from Chu Yunfan for a short period of time. At most, he was just an ordinary elite disciple.","Although his improvement was already very fast, there was no doubt that there were many people in the world who were better than him.","It would be too easy to target him!","Chu Yunfan knew this, but he also knew that any expert had to go through hardships. A greenhouse could not nurture a top-notch expert.","Of course, Chu Yunfan could let Chu Hongcai stay in the safest place and not go to the front line to take risks. However, if that happened, Chu Hongcai would be crippled and would never grow into a top expert.","Therefore, even though he knew that he might be targeted by others, Chu Yunfan did not change his mind.","You Chuyun naturally knew the relationship between Chu Yunfan and Chu Hongcai. When he heard that Chu Hongcai was surrounded and in danger, how could he remain calm?","He immediately led his troops forward, and this time, he also fell into a trap.","In the army, the only soul was naturally Chu Yunfan. He was the spiritual pillar of the entire army, but the one who usually controlled the army was You Chuyun.","Now that You Chuyun was also surrounded, the army was without a leader. It was a mess. Fortunately, Chu Yunfan returned at the most critical moment."]},{"number":1882,"title":"Chapter 1882 A Trap for Chu Yunfan","paragraphs":["1882 A Trap for Chu Yunfan","Chu Yunfan immediately realized that this was a trap—one meant to lure him out. This was the reason why You Chuyun and Chu Hongcai were merely captured and hadn’t been annihilated yet.","Once the news reached Zhenyao, as long as the city sent out a little bit of power, no matter how many invaders there were, they would all die. Therefore, these invaders had always been quick to fight, trying to wipe out their opponents in the shortest time possible.","However, the opponents this time were completely different. They surrounded their target and did not retreat even after a few days. They were waiting for Chu Yunfan’s return.","Chu Yunfan had no choice but to step into this trap.","If this ambush had happened in Baotai, with the layers of enchantments in the city, even if several Creators attacked at the same time, they would not have been able to do anything to Chu Yunfan. After all, Baotai was once a border city. The enchantments and arrays in the city were very impressive. Back then, it was facing the human-demon battlefield. Because of this, the other party knew that ordinary methods could not do anything to Chu Yunfan, so they had to rely on this method to force Chu Yunfan out.","“Didn’t you send a distress message to Zhenyao and the Ministry of War?” Chu Yunfan frowned slightly.","Although You Chuyun was his right-hand man, there should have been a large number of Flying Celestial disciples in the army at this time. There was even no lack of outstanding elites among the powerful elite disciples.","These people were the elites of the elites in the Flying Celestials. Now, they couldn’t even make such a simple decision. That was too disappointing.","“The other commandants have sent messengers to the Ministry of War and Zhenyao to request for help. They’ve even sent people to the nearby big cities for help. However, all the news has been like a stone sinking into the ocean. Until now, we have not received any reply.” The officer reported, “The commandants have come to the conclusion that someone is sniping us, so the messengers we sent out couldn’t send the news out normally.”","When Chu Yunfan heard this, even someone as calm as him couldn’t help but gasp.","This was terrifying. Baotai was a big place. Messengers sent out from here could go out in all directions. The messengers were all martial arts experts. It could be said that it was very easy for them to leave quietly.","But now, all the news had been intercepted. Even the messenger who was heading to the Imperial Capital’s Ministry of War through the teleportation array had been intercepted.","Otherwise, Chu Yunfan, who was in the Imperial City at that time, would have received the news. He could feel that a shocking net was falling toward him, wanting to catch a big fish like him.","“What an elaborate setup.” Chu Yunfan gasped.","To be able to completely isolate the news from Baotai, one must have a huge force. That person could cover the sky with one hand. Chu Yunfan even suspected that there were people in Grand Xia who were colluding with these people.","Otherwise, the messenger to the Imperial Capital’s Ministry of War would not have been like a stone sinking into the ocean. Zhenyao was pretty nearby, but they had not received a word of this attack. It was unimaginable how much manpower and resources were needed to keep this under wraps. And Chu Yunfan was the target of this inescapable net.","Chu Yunfan didn’t know whether he should cry or laugh. He was actually valued so much that the enemy needed to set up such a method to deal with him. However, he understood that the other party had tied his hands. He had no choice but to go. Even though he knew that it was a trap, he still had to go. He couldn’t just watch Chu Hongcai and You Chuyun be killed.","“Hehe, such an elaborate scheme. I wonder how many demons and monsters are behind this.” Chu Yunfan smiled coldly.","“General Chu, you can’t go. You are certainly strong enough to break out of the encirclement, and you can send out word. You can attract get Zhenyao’s army to come and destroy these clowns,” the officer said when he saw that Chu Yunfan wanted to go.","Chu Yunfan was like a military god to this army. The first batch of people who followed Chu Yunfan had now obtained great benefits. He had led them from one victory to another, so they absolutely did not want to see anything happen to him.","Chu Yunfan shook his head. He could imagine the consequences if he broke out of the encirclement and spread the news. You Chuyun and Chu Hongcai were like two ants in the enemy’s hands.","“But this is clearly a trap. There will be a large number of experts lying in ambush there!” The officer was anxious. “Why don’t you let us set off with all our troops instead while you get reinforcements, sir?”","“It’s no use. The enemy must have more than one or two top-notch masters. Even if the external army goes go, it’ll be useless.” Chu Yunfan shook his head.","The external army was a rare elite in the army. Dealing with ordinary experts was as easy as chopping melons and vegetables. However, it was impossible for the other party not to have thought of this. Whether it was Chu Hongcai or You Chuyun, they were easily defeated and surrounded. One could imagine that the other party must have an extremely powerful expert holding the fort. After all, this was the territory of Grand Xia. It was impossible for them to lead an army to infiltrate this place. That would be courting death. Only a large number of top experts could sneak in batches.","“But it would be too dangerous!” the officer warned.","“Don’t worry, they may be powerful, but I’m not to be trifled with either.” Chu Yunfan looked into the distance with an extremely cold gaze. “No matter who they are, I will wipe them out.”","Chu Yunfan then calmed himself and instructed, “Contact the Thousand Treasures Pavilion. I want to buy some medicinal herbs. The quicker the better.”","He still had a trump card, which was originally used to deal with Li Qianyuan. Once it was revealed, it would be earth-shattering.","“No matter who you are, I will make sure you die a horrible death!”"]},{"number":1883,"title":"Chapter 1883 A Pill Worth 100 Million Middle-Grade Spirit Stones","paragraphs":["1883 A Pill Worth 100 Million Middle-Grade Spirit Stones","Chu Yunfan had prepared many cards to deal with Li Qianyuan, but this sudden situation forced Chu Yunfan to use his cards in advance.","Even if the Elder Princess wanted to choose a husband for Tang Siyu, it was not a problem for Chu Yunfan. It was because of the hidden trump cards he had. No matter who it was, he had absolute confidence that he would be able to kill them. However, there was now a trap aim at him, and his only choice was to reveal his cards in advance.","The news of Chu Yunfan’s return quickly spread through the army, and the originally panicked soldiers calmed down. There was no doubt that Chu Yunfan was the soul of the army. Although he rarely took care of specific affairs, he was irreplaceable. He was the number one expert in the entire external army.","Without Chu Yunfan, the external army was just an ordinary elite force.","As Chu Yunfan returned, the external army returned to normal. He summoned the officers above the rank of lieutenant for a meeting. After comforting these officers, he let them return to their posts. Everything went on as usual as if nothing had happened. They did not even enter combat readiness because Chu Yunfan knew that with the strength of the other party, the external army would not be of much use.","The Thousand Treasures Pavilion moved quickly too. Soon, the person in charge of the nearby Thousand Treasures Pavilion, Wan Sanqian, came to meet him.","“Greetings, General Chu.” Wan Sanqian sighed.","He had never expected such a situation to happen. Although he had high hopes for Chu Yunfan, he had only bet that Chu Yunfan could become a true disciple of the Flying Celestials and become a big shot within the sect in the future.","But that was all he had predicted. Who would have thought that Chu Yunfan would become a true disciple of the Flying Celestials with lightning speed? He even entered the prodigy list with shocking momentum and became a prodigy that attracted the attention of the world.","Although some people criticized Chu Yunfan’s ranking for falling, that was only a small number of people. There were countless young geniuses in the world, but only a few hundred could make it onto the prodigy list. The value of this list could be imagined.","Wan Sanqian had no doubt that Chu Yunfan had become the focus of the Flying Celestials and even the entire Grand Xia empire. He would surely become one of the most powerful figures in Grand Xia in the future.","Chu Yunfan had achieved all this in a short time. How could Wan Sanqian not feel incomparably shocked? Originally, he could still disregard Chu Yunfan, who was only a lieutenant of the Baotai’s garrison at that time. But now, Chu Yunfan was someone he had to look up to.","The difference was so huge that even with his mental fortitude, Wan Sanqian found it hard to accept. Fortunately, he quickly adjusted himself.","“Why have you called me here, General Chu? Is there anything you need our cooperation with?” Wan Sanqian asked.","“Yes, I have a list here. I don’t care what method you use to find the ingredients on the list. The sooner the better. I want these ingredients in the camp within four hours,” Chu Yunfan said.","“Four hours?” Wan Sanqian was a little taken aback. He didn’t know why Chu Yunfan was in such a hurry to gather so many ingredients in four hours.","He glanced at the list and found that many of the items listed were precious ingredients. If it was an ordinary person, it would probably take forever to collect them.","“Will this be a problem for Thousand Treasures Pavilion?” Chu Yunfan said, “I know that the Thousand Treasures Pavilion is spread all over the Central Plains, so you should have an extremely large inventory. Even if some ingredients are hard to find, it shouldn’t be a problem for you.”","This was the reason Chu Yunfan chose to look for the Thousand Treasures Pavilion. Only they had the ability to help him collect all the ingredients in such a short time.","“It’s not a problem, General. However, the price will be higher then usual as some of the ingredients are already reserved by others. Now that they’ll be transferred to you, we have to compensate for the delay.”","Wan Sanqian thought for a moment and gritted his teeth. This was a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to face such a top genius with a boundless future. Although he didn’t know why Chu Yunfan was in such a hurry, it was definitely something extremely urgent. He understood the saying that adding flowers to the brocade was better than sending charcoal in the snow. Chu Yunfan would owe him a favor in the future.","“I’ll pay you as much as you want,” Chu Yunfan said like a typical rich and overbearing person.","He was not bluffing though. In the past year, as the external army continued to encircle and annihilate the various forces within a radius of a thousand miles of Baotai, they won successive battles. Chu Yunfan had even taken down many true disciples, and the wealth they had accumulated over the years had also fallen into his hands.","A man would not be rich without a windfall, and a horse would not be fat without a night of grass. In just over a year, after deducting the wealth that he had handed over to the Ministry of War and put into the external army as development funds, Chu Yunfan had accumulated a wealth of more than 100 million middle-grade spirit stones.","A portion of this wealth had been used up by his cultivation, but right now he still had at least 80 million middle-grade spirit stones. With enough middle-grade spirit stones to support him, the rich Chu Yunfan did not even consider the price.","“By my estimate, the starting cost for these should be about 20 million middle-grade spirit stones. Adding on the 50% premium, the total will be 30 million middle-grade spirit stones,” Wan Sanqian said.","After looking at the list of hebs, Wan Sanqian quickly determined the price. He was extremely shocked. Of course, he could tell that these ingredients were used for alchemy. The key was that the ingredients alone were worth 20 million middle-grade spirit stones. According to the usual price of ingredients sold by alchemists, the finished product would cost at least 100 million middle-grade spirit stones.","Even he had trouble imaginaning what a pill worth 100 million medium-grade spirit stones would be like. Moreover, he was a little curious. Chu Yunfan had only bought one set of ingredients and did not prepare a second set. Was he that confident that he would succeed on the first try?","But Wan Sanqian didn’t mention this out loud. After all, this was Chu Yunfan’s secret.","“Sure,” Chu Yunfan said without hesitation, “Thirty million middle-grade spirit stones, and I want to see the ingredients delivered within four hours.”"]},{"number":1884,"title":"Chapter 1884 It’s Unknown Who Will Catch Who","paragraphs":["1884 It’s Unknown Who Will Catch Who","Under the stimulation of the middle-grade spirit stones, the Thousand Treasures Pavilion quickly sprung into action. In less than four hours, all kinds of ingredients had been gathered in the camp of the external army.","Therefore, although the Thousand Treasures Pavilion had increased the fee by 50%, Chu Yunfan still had to owe them a favor. He understood that the reason why the Thousand Treasures Pavilion would help him find those ingredients at such a favorable price was because they saw his potential.","This was understandable, and it was also the reason why Chu Yunfan had to show off his talent. This was a world of great competition, after all. If one wanted to become the most outstanding person, it was impossible to cultivate in seclusion only. Such a person would not be valued at all, and the acquisition of various resources would be many times slower than others.","In a situation where their aptitudes were similar, the development of both sides was simply worlds apart. Not to mention that the Thousand Treasures Pavilion would spend a lot of effort to find all kinds of ingredients for him.","When the ingredients were delivered, Chu Yunfan immediately took out 30 million medium-grade spirit stones and handed them over to Wan Sanqian in a spatial bag. Wan Sanqian didn’t even count the stone and put it way. Chu Yunfan wouldn’t possibly lie about such things, or he would damage his entire reputation.","“General Chu, we’ve gathered all the ingredients you wanted. We’ve been really busy, and fortunately, we didn’t fail you.” Wan Sanqian smiled.","“I owe the Thousand Treasures Pavilion a huge favor for this. I will repay it in the future,” Chu Yunfan said.","“General Chu, do you not need our help?” Wan Sanqian asked, “There are some small things that the Thousand Treasures Pavilion can do with our ability, such as transmitting information.”","“What do you know?” Chu Yunfan’s eyes suddenly flashed with a sharp light.","Wan Sanqian’s face revealed an awkward expression as he said, “Please forgive us for making the decision without permission. As far as we know, there seem to be many people nearby who are hostile toward you. You can’t send any news, right? If you need it, we can help you send out word on your behalf.”","Wan Sanqian cursed in his heart. Chu Yunfan had asked for these ingredients in a hurry. It was obvious that something had happened. Wan Sanqian then arranged for someone to investigate the matter, and once he looked into it, he was shocked.","There were many experts hidden around Baotai. Even the Thousand Treasures Pavilion experts that Wan Sanqian sent out were almost killed. He wasn’t even sure of what the higher-ups had found. He was only the pavilion master of a branch office, and his authority was limited to the area around Baotai.","The higher-ups had sent someone to warn him that he could help Chu Yunfan collect ingredients, but he should refrain from helping any further. Otherwise, the consequences would be unpredictable.","However, Wang Sanqian couldn’t keep quiet and insisted on helping Chu Yunfan. Although he didn’t know what kind of trouble Chu Yunfan had gotten into, he was very optimistic about Chu Yunfan’s future.","Of course, it was impossible for him to go against the mastermind for Chu Yunfan, but if he were to use his own channels to spread the news, it would be a very simple matter.","Chu Yunfan glanced at Wan Sanqian and said, “Thank you for your kindness, Brother Wan, but there’s no need for that for the time being.”","Chu Yunfan didn’t know if this was Wan Sanqian’s own decision or the Thousand Treasures Pavilion’s instructions, Chu Yunfan still accepted Wan Sanqian’s intentions.","When Wan Sanqian heard Chu Yunfan call him “Brother Wan,” he naturally understood that Chu Yunfan had accepted his intentions. The relationship between the two of them had clearly improved.","He didn’t know whether Chu Yunfan was holding out or if he was really prepared. However, this matter was not something he could continue to interfere in, so he could only take his leave.","“In that case, I’ll be off now. Take care, General Chu.”","However, the Thousand Treasures Pavilion naturally could not rashly get involved in this accident for him. This was the reason he rejected Wan Sanqian’s good intentions.","Those people had set up an inescapable net to deal with Chu Yunfan and kill him, but how could Chu Yunfan not want to catch them all in one fell swoop?","This was a great opportunity for Chu Yunfan. After all, even if they were scared off, they would still come looking for him again and again. One could not guard against thieves forever.","No matter who jumped out, whether it was Li Qianyuan, the crown prince, or someone else, Chu Yunfan wanted to take advantage of this once-in-a-lifetime opportunity to catch them all. This would be a battle to solve a major problem, and his greatest trump card was the Six-Stripe Gold Pill, which was the simplified version of the Nine-Stripe Gold Pill.","Back then, Chu Yunfan had relied on the One-Stripe Gold Pill and the Three-Stripe Gold Pill to increase his strength and defeat his enemies. However, he had never made the Six-Stripe Gold Pill after the Three-Stripe Gold Pill because it was too difficult for him at that time. Though the pill formula developed by the Alchemy Emperor was a simplified version of the Nine-Stripe Gold Pill, it was still out of Chu Yunfan’s reach at that time.","Not only was his alchemy ability inferior, but the countless resources required were not something he could afford at that time. Now that he had the ability to make it, and he did not lack resources and wealth, it was a good time to refine the Six-Stripe Gold Pill.","However, the original purpose of refining the Six-Stripe Gold Pill was to deal with Li Qianyuan. After killing Li Qianyuan in one fell swoop, the Elder Princess would surely have nothing to say.","But now, Chu Yunfan was forced to use it in advance.","“But even if I don’t have the Six-Stripe Gold Pill, half a year’s time is enough for me to surpass Li Qianyuan. At that time, I can kill him with my own strength!” Chu Yunfan’s eyes flashed with a sharp light.","He wasn’t in a hurry to rush over. Since the other party’s goal was to lure him into taking the bait, they naturally wouldn’t easily make a move on Chu Hongcai and You Chuyun. This gave him enough time to prepare a trump card that was enough to overturn everything.","Chu Yunfan announced that he was going to enter seclusion. Then, he entered the Mountain River Diagram and immediately began making pills."]},{"number":1885,"title":"Chapter 1885 The Mastermind Appears, the Demons Annd the Demon God Sect","paragraphs":["1885 The Mastermind Appears, the Demons Annd the Demon God Sect","A group of people stood on top of a mountain peak outside a huge barrier, looking at the remnants of the external army. The originally mighty army of over a thousand soldiers was now left with over three hundred soldiers hiding in the valley, struggling to survive. Outside the huge barrier were many figures lying in ambush as if they were waiting for something.","Among this group of people, a middle-aged man wearing a blood-red robe with a villainous expression looked at the remaining soldiers in the valley with a deep gaze akin to an eagle’s.","“Chu Yunfan has returned?” The middle-aged man in a blood-red robe listened to his subordinate’s report and frowned slightly. “But he didn’t come out?”","“No, he didn’t, sir,” a subordinate answered in a low voice.","“Keep a close eye on the external army garrison. Send someone to keep a close eye on the surrounding garrisons as well. If Chu Yunfan doesn’t come out, or if he contacts other armies, then immediately destroy the rest of these people in the valley.”","“Yes, sir.” The subordinate left to carry out the man’s instructions.","The middle-aged man in a blood-red robe had an extremely cold expression, like ice in an ice cave. In his eyes, the remaining soldiers in the valley were a bunch of pigs. If it wasn’t for the fact that they were trying to lure Chu Yunfan out, they would have been killed long ago.","Inside the valley, the remnants of the external army surrounded Chu Hongcai and You Chuyun. Everyone looked dispirited. For more than a year, the external army had swept through the areas near Baotai and wiped out many demons and monsters. They were very happy about that.","There was no power that could resist their takeover. Even if there was, it would instantly collapse under Chu Yunfan’s personal attack. In the past year, the external army had been in high spirits.","Who would have thought that after being ambushed, the entire army would immediately be defeated? If the other party was willing, they could even wipe them out in minutes.","After being trapped for so long, even if they were stupid, they could tell that the other party had other intentions. In other words, they were not here for them.","They were just bait!","They were not the target of the attack because there was no need for them to do so. They remembered that the middle-aged man on the mountain peak had beaten them up so badly that they could not fight back. Even though the external army had exerted its army spirit, it was useless against such a top-notch expert.","The man had crushed their entire army single-handedly.","It was not difficult for them to guess that these people were targeting the pillar of their army and the only person with value to be targeted—the great general of the external army, Chu Yunfan.","Chu Hongcai was especially aware of this. Although he was only swept by the aftershock, he was still seriously injured. He struggled to suppress the injuries on his body. He could not expel the remaining divine power in his body even if he continued to heal. The people outside didn’t care about his healing. In other words, they just cared that he lived, even if it was barely.","Chu Hongcai was very clear about this, but his gaze was determined. Even if he was at the end of his rope, he did not have the slightest thought of giving up. This was what Chu Yunfan had always taught him. As a strong person, he should have such a strong heart. Otherwise, his future was bound to be limited.","However, he was also aware that he had become Chu Yunfan’s weakness. He blamed himself. Only he knew that under his determined gaze, he had already made a decision. If anything went wrong, he would rather commit suicide than fall into the hands of these people. Otherwise, he would only become a tool to deal with Chu Yunfan.","Chu Hongcai’s gaze swept across the half-hidden figures throughout the valley. Those figures were not all humanoid. There were some that were like giant beasts, revealing the identities of these people.","Suddenly, the remaining soldiers of the external army heard a commotion from afar. They looked over and saw a figure walking toward them. It was their pillar of support and the great general of the external army, Chu Yunfan.","Instantly, everyone’s spirits were shaken!","“It’s the Great General!”","“The Great General is here. We’re saved!”","“There’s hope for us!”","At this moment, everyone was excited. They finally saw the hope of survival.","“Watch out, everyone! Be on full alert!” You Chuyun shouted, and everyone immediately came back to their senses.","Chu Yunfan’s appearance might not be a good thing for them. If the other party thought that since Chu Yunfan had appeared and there was no value for them to continue existing, it was possible for the enemy to annihilate them now.","Fortunately, the most tragic situation did not happen. The other party seemed to be only interested in Chu Yunfan and did not think of destroying them. At the same time, they understood that the other party had ignored them and did not care about their lives. In any case, any one of them could destroy them all. There was no need to care about the opinions of ants.","“Chu Yunfan’s finally here. Interesting. Let’s end this quickly. After all, this isn’t the Demon Region,” the middle-aged man in the blood-red robe ordered.","The arrogant and unruly figures that had been lying dormant revealed themselves. In the blink of an eye, the entire world changed color, and countless ferocious auras appeared in the sky. They formed a large array in the air with lightning speed, surrounding Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan looked at the dozens of figures that suddenly surrounded him. Their combined demonic aura was monstrous, and the fierce aura was enough to scare any timid person to death.","Among these people, there were some who looked like humans, and there were also some peerless monsters. Their bodies were as huge as small mountains, and they were terrifying existences.","“Demons. You’re part of the Demon God Sect.”","Chu Yunfan finally understood who had set up this ambush. He originally thought that it was Li Qianyuan. He didn’t know whether Li Qianyuan had colluded with the Demon God Sect and the demons.","The demons and the Demon God Sect.","As a colossus that could be compared to Grand Xia, the strength of the demons was naturally unquestionable. There were countless experts among the demons.","As for the Demon God Sect, it was a faction that the demons had specially nurtured to disrupt Grand Xia. This sect had once caused a bloodbath in Grand Xia, and it could be said that there were as many experts as the clouds and their influence spread throughout the Central Plains.","The Demon God Sect was extremely troublesome to deal with."]},{"number":1886,"title":"Chapter 1886 Dozens of Experts on Par With Prodigies? They All Perished!","paragraphs":["1886 Dozens of Experts on Par With Prodigies? They All Perished!","Chu Yunfan finally understood why the Demon God Sect had set up a trap to deal with him. In fact, the Demon God Sect was a tool left behind by the demons to stir up trouble in the Central Plains. In addition to gathering information, they also had the mission of dealing with the top geniuses of Grand Xia.","Countless geniuses had died at the hands of the Demon God Sect since ancient times. Many of these geniuses had king-level physiques. In the future, they would be able to grow to the emperor level.","However, they had died quietly at the hands of the Demon God Sect. This was why many geniuses often had many protectors around them. It was to prevent a faction like the Demon God Sect from suddenly attacking them. However, even with protectors following them, many young geniuses still died. The Demon God Sect was riddled with blood debts.","And now, their eyes were fixed on Chu Yunfan.","If they failed this time, there would naturally be a next time unless the Demon God Sect could be uprooted. This was something that the Imperial Court of Grand Xia had always wanted to do. However, it was a pity that the Demon God Sect was elusive. Even if some of their branches were wiped out, it would not affect the overall situation.","The true headquarters of the Demon God Sect was not in Grand Xia. Therefore, the Demon God Sect had always been an extremely arrogant existence over the years. It was not that Grand Xia had not organized experts to raid the Demon God Sect’s headquarters. However, even if they succeeded, they only managed to take out the sect’s human slaves. The sect would then quickly rebuild.","Unless the entire demon race could be destroyed, it would be possible to completely destroy the Demon God Sect. Otherwise, it would be meaningless.","Almost all those on the prodigy list were targeted by the Demon God Sect. It was just that they had never set up such a huge situation to target them. After this battle, regardless of whether they won or lost, it would definitely cause a backlash from Grand Xia. After all, the Demon God Sect had killed the geniuses of Grand Xia many times, and Grand Xia had also organized experts to kill the geniuses of the demons, the Hus, and the barbarians many times. They would not give in to each other.","Each of these figures surrounding Chu Yunfan was at least a seventh-level Cosmic, and more than half of them were at the peak of the Cosmos Stage. It was clear that the Demon God Sect had done some research before taking action. Naturally, they knew that Chu Yunfan had easily defeated other prodigies at the peak of the Cosmos Stage.","These dozens of figures were no weaker than the prodigies Chu Yunfan had previously defeated. In fact, their cultivation was even deeper. With such a lineup, if it was Chu Yunfan from before, he would have to pay the price of blood just to kill his way out.","“Attack!”","A mountain-like beast roared and jumped up. It instantly pounced toward Chu Yunfan. The bloody jaws that opened brought a gust of wind, which turned into a strong wind and blew toward Chu Yunfan.","The peak of the Cosmos Stage!","A bloodthirsty look flashed through the giant beast’s eyes. It wanted to swallow Chu Yunfan—the human genius—in one bite. This was an unprecedented opportunity.","“You’re so noisy.”","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at the beast. He just put his arms out in front of him and a bolt of lightning spread out from his hands.","Stab!","The sound of flesh being torn apart could be heard. Everyone saw the huge ferocious beast being torn apart, and blood sprayed out like rain.","This ferocious beast at the peak of the Cosmos Stage was dead!","Before anyone could react, the beast that many people thought could fight Chu Yunfan had been torn to pieces. Before the body landed on the ground, Chu Yunfan transformed into a huge hand and sucked him into the Mountain River Diagram.","“Not a bad lineup, but you’ve underestimated me. It seems like you haven’t received the latest information yet,” Chu Yunfan said as he grinned coldly.","The other party had organized such a lineup, but it did not mean that the Demon God Sect did not have stronger experts. They just assumed that if dozens of experts who could fight equally with Chu Yunfan attacked together, it would be difficult for Chu Yunfan to escape even if he had wings. This was clearly based on the information on the prodigy list half a year ago.","If it was half a year ago, Chu Yunfan would not have been so relaxed. No one knew that with the Mountain River Diagram blocking the Mysteries Pavillion’s probing, even the Mysteries Pavilion could not calculate Chu Yunfan’s strength. Only after Chu Yunfan revealed himself would he be noticed by the Mysteries Pavillion. Therefore, from the beginning, this siege was destined to fail.","“Sh*t!”","The experts of the demons and the Demon God Sect who had rushed over realized that things were not looking good for them. Chu Yunfan’s strength had clearly exceeded their judgment. However, it was too late. Chu Yunfan had already made his move.","Lightning flashed, and Chu Yunfan’s figure flickered in the lightning. Everyone saw blood dripping down like rain.","Stab!","Stab!","Stab!","These awe-inspiring and terrifying existences who even dared to fight with the prodigies on the prodigy list were killed by Chu Yunfan as if he were stepping on ants.","Chu Yunfan’s hand flashed with a thunderbolt that looked like a long saber. With a casual slash, a fierce beast was cut in half or a Demon God Sect expert was cut in half at the waist.","The speed was too fast, so fast that no one could react at all. A casual slash formed a terrifying blade that was hundreds of meters long. Those ferocious beasts did not have time to react and were cut into pieces.","There were some extremely fast experts among the enemy ranks. They turned into a ray of light and wanted to escape, but they could not outmatch Chu Yunfan’s speed.","Chu Yunfan walked leisurely in the endless lightning like a true god of lightning. In the blink of an eye, he had already killed dozens of terrifying experts who had surrounded him. Whether it was the experts of the Demon God Sect who cultivated evil techniques or the demon beasts that gave countless human experts a headache, they could not even withstand a single move from Chu Yunfan.","All their defensive barriers and magic tools were torn apart the moment they came into contact with Chu Yunfan’s saber light. Their physical bodies could not withstand it at all. With just one slash, their souls and brains were crushed.","What was scary? This was scary!","What was a massacre? This was a massacre!","In a leisurely stroll, Chu Yunfan seemed to be slow but was actually fast. In just a few breaths, he had already killed all these experts.","Chu Yunfan grabbed their corpses and threw them into the Mountain River Diagram, watering the Brahma Tree with their blood.","Chu Yunfan, who had done all this, did not even miss a breath, nor did his heartbeat quicken even a little. This was just a warm-up for him."]},{"number":1887,"title":"Chapter 1887 As Powerful as a Godfiend","paragraphs":["1887 As Powerful as a Godfiend","Chu Yunfan only took a few breaths to wipe out these people. The difference in strength between the two sides was completely reflected.","You Chuyun knew this best. Although he was not a Cosmic true disciple, he was only half a step away. It would not be long before he could step into this level. However, he had a feeling that even if he entered the Cosmos Stage, he would not be a match for any of these people.","At the level of these experts, numbers were meaningless. Even if there were a hundred of them, they would be instantly killed, let alone the external army.","There was simply no possibility of survival.","However, such terrifying experts were killed by Chu Yunfan in just moments. To You Chuyun, this was equivalent to completely subverting his worldview. It was equivalent to the collapse and reconstruction of his worldview.","Only Chu Hongcai looked calm. To him, Chu Yunfan had created many miracles before, so another one or two more was not a big deal. Naturally, he had expected all of this. As long as it was Chu Yunfan, there was nothing he couldn’t do.","Even the experts of the Demon God Sect did not expect Chu Yunfan to be so terrifying. He had easily killed all the experts they had arranged. They had already taken Chu Yunfan’s strength into consideration. Even if Chu Yunfan had wings, it should have been difficult for him to escape.","However, this lineup, which seemed to be enough to make Chu Yunfan unable to escape even if he had wings, was not Chu Yunfan’s match at all. In just a few moves, they were all killed by Chu Yunfan. This was completely inconsistent with their initial judgment.","They had never thought that such a lineup would actually lose. What was even more terrifying was that such a lineup could not even stop Chu Yunfan for a moment. In just a casual stroll, he had already killed everyone.","Such a lineup would not fail even if they attacked thousands of troops. They could disperse an army of 100,000, but they were so vulnerable before Chu Yunfan.","Were they too weak, or was Chu Yunfan too strong?","Chu Yunfan, who was walking among the lightning, was like a god of lightning. He was the messenger of lightning, spreading the light of lightning to every corner of the world.","“Is that all? It’s really not enough to kill,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently. He looked into the depths of the void. Those people hidden in the depths of the void were observing him intently.","To deal with him, the Demon God Sect spent a lot of effort and found many experts. Of course, it was not just this lineup.","“Tsk, tsk. I didn’t expect you to be able to break this lineup.”","Suddenly, a burst of arrogant laughter was heard. Then, the void trembled. A young man in a blood-red robe slowly walked out and stood before Chu Yunfan.","The young man had a handsome face with a hint of evilness. His body flickered with a dense demonic energy, but he was a genuine human. His eyes did not look like human eyes though, but like the eyes of a cat demon.","Chu Yunfan looked at the young man indifferently. He immediately made the judgment that this young man was from the Blood God Sect.","This person was not a demon, but he had such a strong demonic aura that he almost did not look human. Although he had a human form, in Chu Yunfan’s perception, he was like a terrifying beast wearing human skin, filled with bloodlust and the desire to kill.","This young man’s strength was extremely terrifying. Just the demonic energy that seeped out had surpassed the experts that Chu Yunfan had defeated. He was clearly a terrifying existence that had already entered the Creation Stage.","“Lowly human?” Chu Yunfan frowned slightly. He knew that all the experts from the Demon God Sect must have been brainwashed. Even those great experts had to be brainwashed again and again every once in a while. No matter how powerful a person was, they would only become a lapdog.","“That’s right. Who do you think you are? You’re just lucky enough to be on the prodigy list. When we all break through to the Creation Stage, what are you?” The young man sneered as a hint of arrogance flashed through his eyes.","“And who are you?” Chu Yunfan was finally interested in the young man before him. “Junior master of the Demon God Sect, Ning Yaosheng!”","Chu Yunfan finally remembered who the person in front of him was. There was also a record of him in “The World.”","Ning Yaosheng was the top expert of the younger generation of the Demon God Sect. He was also the successor of the Demon God Sect and its future leader. His strength was unfathomable, and he was ranked 30th on the prodigy list.","It was recorded on the prodigy list that Ning Yaosheng was extremely powerful, and at the same time, he was extremely loyal to the Demon God Sect and the demons. He had organized many attempts to hunt down the geniuses of Grand Xia and had even killed a king-level physique expert of the same generation.","His strength was indescribably terrifying!","“You know my name. For this reason, I will leave your corpse intact and make your death less painful!” Ning Yaosheng laughed sinisterly.","“You’re just a lapdog of the demons. Even your leader doesn’t dare to come out. How dare a dog like you bark at me. You must be tired of living.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Chu Yunfan’s gaze swept across the sky. The experts hidden in it were different from those he had killed earlier. These people were genuine experts in the Creation Stage.","In order to kill him, the Demon God Sect had racked their brains."]},{"number":1888,"title":"Chapter 1888 Another Prodigy? He Dies in One Strike!","paragraphs":["1888 Another Prodigy? He Dies in One Strike!","Of course, this lineup was not used to deal with him, because the Demon God Sect thought that the previous lineup was more than enough to kill Chu Yunfan. The reason why he had arranged for so many Creators was to target the possible protector behind Chu Yunfan.","Ordinary true disciples would not be able to enjoy such luxurious treatment, but Chu Yunfan was one of the only two prodigies in the Flying Celestials to reach the top of the prodigy list. His future was limitless. Therefore, in the eyes of the Demon God Sect, it was very likely that the Flying Celestials had sent a protector to secretly follow Chu Yunfan to protect him.","After all, although the protector was powerful, he didn’t have much potential. He would be like this for the rest of his life, but Chu Yunfan was like the rising sun. It could be said that his future was limitless.","But who knew that they didn’t see Chu Yunfan’s protector, so these experts hid in the air and only looked at Chu Yunfan coldly, preventing other experts from interfering. In their eyes, Chu Yunfan was a dead man. The only difference was how he died.","After killing so many experts of the Demon God Sect and the demons, Chu Yunfan naturally would not have a good ending. They had to make him pay a sufficient price.","“What’s wrong? Aren’t they going to make a move?” Chu Yunfan chuckled.","“Do we need them to do anything to deal with you?” Ning Yaosheng sneered. “Tell me, how would you like to die?”","“I asked them to attack out of good intentions.” Chu Yunfan sneered. “Your words aren’t enough for me to beat you up.”","“Ridiculous. Who do you think you are? You’re not worthy of being mentioned in the same breath as me.”","Ning Yaosheng sneered and reached out with his hand toward Chu Yunfan. The demonic energy between his fingers boiled. In an instant, the demonic energy condensed into a bloody claw and grabbed at Chu Yunfan.","This claw was like a bloody claw that could destroy the world. The entire sky shook violently. Even the entire army felt the sun, moon, and stars shake violently and rotate with it.","“Demon God Blood Claw!” Ning Yaosheng shouted and used the ultimate technique of the Demon God Sect.","With this claw, the person who was grabbed would be instantly sucked dry of their essence. It was a demonic technique.","However, the power of this technique was shocking. Previously, when those people surrounded Chu Yunfan, they couldn’t exert such an imposing manner even if they joined forces. Ning Yaosheng’s casual attack could casually unleash such an attack. One could imagine how terrifying he was.","Peak of the first Creation Stage!","This kind of strength was even stronger than Zhang Feng and Huyan Zhuo, who had been defeated by Chu Yunfan. Ning Yaosheng’s ranking on the prodigy list was higher than the two of them.","“You’re nothing!”","Chu Yunfan shouted as well. His energy surged, forming a terrifying pillar of energy that rolled up into the sky. It instantly dispersed the aura of the demon god’s blood claw. Then, he suddenly clenched his five fingers into a fist and punched out.","Bam!","A terrifying power collided in midair, and the power of the Creation Stage spread out.","Ning Yaosheng’s Demon God Blood Claw was shattered, unable to pose any threat to Chu Yunfan.","“What? How is that possible?” Ning Yaosheng had a look of disbelief on his face.","Even if the seventh-level Cosmics and the peak Cosmics from earlier had joined forces, they would be no match for him. But now, he had been defeated by Chu Yunfan.","At this moment, he finally understood why Chu Yunfan could turn a blind eye to the lineup.","“Too weak. Even the junior leader of the Demon God Sect is only at this level. I’m afraid your orthodoxy will be lost.”","Chu Yunfan let out a long roar and rose from the ground. He rushed out like a skyrocketing cannon. His speed was fast, almost to the extreme!","In an instant, he rushed in front of Ning Yaosheng.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan’s aura boiled. He was like a ferocious dragon as he threw a punch. He did not use any special martial arts techniques or divine abilities. Just by relying on his extremely powerful energy, he collapsed the air. In an instant, he arrived before Ning Yaosheng.","“Sh*t!”","At this moment, Ning Yaosheng finally reacted. His expression was one of fear. When Chu Yunfan broke through his attack, he was only a little shocked, but now Chu Yunfan had erupted with such terrifying power. This was the source of his fear.","This power surpassed the information they had about Chu Yunfan, who they had thought was only at the peak of the Cosmic Stage. It was obvious that Chu Yunfan had already stepped into the Creation Stage, and he was several times stronger.","This terrifying aura made it difficult for people to even breathe. However, it was already too late.","In an instant, Ning Yaosheng roared out a Demon God Curse. This was an offensive divine ability, but he used it for defense. In the chaos, this was his only way.","However, the next scene made him despair, because the move he had placed his hopes on was shattered by Chu Yunfan’s punch. The Demon God Curse could not stop Chu Yunfan in the slightest.","What was the meaning of “One force can defeat ten skills?” What was the meaning of “A heavy sword without a sharp edge but with great skills?” At this moment, Ning Yaosheng truly felt the feeling of being defeated by someone with even more powerful strength.","It was not that he had not encountered such experts in the past, but those were all old seniors who posed a huge threat to him in his cultivation. This was the first time he had encountered such a thing among his peers.","However, things would not change according to his thoughts. Chu Yunfan punched out, shattering everything. Like a meteor piercing through the sky, the punch smashed into Ning Yaosheng’s body.","Spurt!","Ning Yaosheng coughed up a mouthful of blood, and the sound of his ribs breaking could be heard. Chu Yunfan’s punch had shattered his ribs and pierced through his chest.","“You...” Ning Yaosheng’s eyes widened in disbelief. Chu Yunfan’s attack was so powerful.","Chu Yunfan’s punch had actually pierced through his defense. In front of Chu Yunfan, he was like a child, unable to withstand a single blow.","“Too weak.” Chu Yunfan formed a finger sword and beheaded Ning Yaosheng.","The prodigy on the prodigy list, Ning Yaosheng, was dead!"]},{"number":1889,"title":"Chapter 1889 The Demon God Sect’s Leader, Ning Rentu!","paragraphs":["1889 The Demon God Sect’s Leader, Ning Rentu!","All of this happened at an extremely terrifying speed!","This time, even the Demon God Sect experts who were fully focused on guarding against the possibility of experts interfering were completely dumbfounded.","In the blink of an eye, Chu Yunfan had already beaten Ning Yaosheng to death. He didn’t give Ning Yaosheng the slightest chance to retaliate.","If Ning Yaosheng’s chest was pierced, he would have long been transformed into a half-human, half-demon physique and had a chance to survive. But Chu Yunfan had chopped off his head.","The junior leader of the Demon God Sect, the future sect leader, had died just like that.","He died almost without knowing how he died!","In the next moment, all the Demon God Sect experts were furious. Although the Demon God Sect was not united and was divided into cliques, they were like other factions. They valued their future successors.","It was not easy for the Demon God Sect to nurture a prodigy who could enter the prodigy list. They had killed countless living beings and cultivated the demon god technique. In the end, they used countless resources to allow Ning Yaosheng to enter the prodigy list, and his ranking was very high.","Now that Ning Yaosheng had died just like that, who knew how many years of hard work had been wasted? Most importantly, the Demon God Sect would suffer a gap in talent.","To any force, a shortage of talent was an extremely terrifying thing. Everyone was furious.","Suddenly, a terrifying aura enveloped Chu Yunfan, wanting to tear him into pieces. Many terrifying auras that far surpassed Ning Yaosheng’s locked onto him. Although their status was not as important as Ning Yaosheng, that was because Ning Yaosheng represented the future of the Demon God Sect. In reality, any of these experts of the Demon God Sect were far stronger than Ning Yaosheng.","Ning Yaosheng had only just entered the Creation Stage, and these Demon God Sect experts had entered the Creation Stage for who knew how long. Any one of their strength was not something Ning Yaosheng could compare to. Even Chu Yunfan’s monstrous aura was suppressed.","These experts surrounded Chu Yunfan, their gazes extremely cold. This was an aura that could only be possessed after killing countless creatures. These Demon God Sect experts hated humans very much. Their blood debts were piled up like mountains of corpses and seas of blood.","“Chu Yunfan, I didn’t expect you to be able to do this. The lord repeatedly warned me not to let you escape. I thought that the arrangements I made were foolproof, but I misjudged you.”","From the void, a middle-aged man in a blood-red robe with an ashen face appeared.","He had been tricked by Chu Yunfan. At this moment, he felt a burning pain on his face as if he had been slapped by Chu Yunfan. He had set up an inescapable net to deal with Chu Yunfan. Who would have thought that before Chu Yunfan died, the dozens of top-notch Cosmics he had arranged would die? He even lost the future Demon God sect leader.","Such a loss could be said to be a serious injury. Even he had not expected things to turn out this way.","The middle-aged man would not bat an eye if those dozens of Cosmics died. What truly made his heart ache was that the disciple he had carefully nurtured had died just like that. Who knew how many years it would take to nurture another future leader? Before that, there would be a shortage of talent.","He would also have to face the blame of the higher-ups. Thinking of this, he felt incomparably shocked and angry. His eyes were filled with killing intent as he stared at Chu Yunfan.","“I’ll kill you! Everyone related to you will die and be buried with you!”","In Chu Yunfan’s perception, this person wasn’t a human. It was just a monster wearing human skin. Usually, all its power was condensed in the human skin, but once it was shocked and angry, it would release that power.","However, the power in his body was at least dozens of times or even a hundred times stronger than Ning Yaosheng’s. The two of them could not be mentioned in the same breath.","“You’re the Demon God Sect’s leader, Ning Rentu, right?” Chu Yunfan said as he observed the middle-aged man.","“That’s right. At least you have some knowledge.”","Ning Rentu’s expression was extremely ferocious. He didn’t intervene before because he thought that with Ning Yaosheng’s strength, it would be easy for him to deal with Chu Yunfan. Who knew that Ning Yaosheng would suffer a huge loss at Chu Yunfan’s hands, and this huge loss would cost Ning Yaosheng his life?","Ning Rentu finally couldn’t hold it in anymore and was going to make a move.","Chu Yunfan looked at Ning Rentu. He was one of the most terrifying experts he had ever faced. Although Ning Rentu’s strength might not be comparable to Situ Xuan’s, Situ Xuan was on his side at that time, so he did not really feel Situ Xuan’s intimidation.","But now, he could truly feel Ning Rentu’s terrifying pressure that was like an avalanche. It far surpassed the pressure that Ning Yaosheng had exerted on him. It was completely different.","“I didn’t expect that you would personally come out to kill me. Should I feel honored?” Chu Yunfan grinned.","The Demon God Sect leader was comparable to the Flying Celestials leader, Situ Xuan. Even if his strength was not as good as Situ Xuan’s, he was on the same level.","Such an expert actually personally led a large group of experts to ambush Chu Yunfan. It could not be said that this was a big deal.","“Don’t feel honored. You’ll die by my hands very soon. I was wondering why that lord valued you so much and wanted you dead. But now it seems that he is the one who is truly far-sighted. As long as you’re alive, you’ll pose a huge threat to the monster race.”","Ning Rentu’s expression was extremely ugly, and his killing intent became even stronger. At this moment, he understood why the lord had to attack Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":1890,"title":"Chapter 1890 Slaughtering Creators Like Slaughtering Chickens","paragraphs":["1890 Slaughtering Creators Like Slaughtering Chickens","To Ning Rentu, even if Chu Yunfan was not a threat to the monsters now, as long as he continued to grow, he would definitely pose a huge threat to the monsters in the future. In his eyes, this alone was a capital crime for Chu Yunfan.","There was no need to kill mediocre people, but those who were too outstanding must be killed!","“Hurry up!” Ning Rentu said coldly as he crossed his arms.","At that moment, 30 Creators with terrifying auras flew down from the sky and rushed toward Chu Yunfan. These experts were extremely fast, and at the same time, their cooperation was also extremely tacit. The most terrifying attack came from the beginning, like a flood, drowning Chu Yunfan.","At that moment, Chu Yunfan took out a pill and put it into his mouth.","Kaboom!","An explosion rang out, and the faces of the people of the external army in the valley turned pale. The explosive airwaves rose into the air, turning into mushroom clouds that bombarded the sky and the earth, causing the ground to tremble violently.","Before anyone could react, all of this had already happened. These Creators were used to deal with the possible protector behind Chu Yunfan. Needless to say, most of them were Creators.","To kill Chu Yunfan, the Demon God Sect had dispatched at least half of their experts just to kill him. Such a lineup could be considered unprecedented.","“Roar!”","With a loud roar, a beast the size of a small mountain rushed out from the mushroom cloud. Its claws, which were like huge millstones, slammed down as if it was afraid that Chu Yunfan would not die completely and wanted to crush him into pieces.","Clang!","The huge beast’s claws pierced through the mushroom cloud and slammed into something like metal. The sound of metal clashing erupted, and a terrifying shockwave was emitted.","The shockwave dispersed the mushroom cloud. At this time, everyone finally saw the situation in the middle of the mushroom cloud. Chu Yunfan, who was originally thought to have died under this terrifying attack, was not dead. On the contrary, he was not seriously injured.","Above his head, the Mountain River Cauldron spun and blocked all the attacks.","“What cauldron is that?” At this moment, Ning Rentu was stunned.","Even a Creator would not be able to escape death from that attack. However, Chu Yunfan was able to take it, which was a miracle in itself. There was no doubt that the cauldron was a defensive treasure that could defend against such an attack. However, even so, it shouldn’t be.","Even if Chu Yunfan had a defensive true treasure, if he wanted to unleash the power of the defensive true treasure, the requirements for the user were very high.","Suddenly, he noticed that Chu Yunfan’s body was emitting more and more divine power. This divine power was released wantonly, and it had reached a level that was visible to the naked eye.","The divine power that was visible to the naked eye was incomparably dense. It transformed into a suit of armor around his body and protected him.","“How is that possible?”","Ning Rentu realized that Chu Yunfan’s power was soaring at an astonishing speed. Chu Yunfan’s combat strength increased crazily, reaching a shocking level. All of this seemed very strange and unbelievable.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan’s mana surged to a whole new realm, and his combat strength rushed to the second level of the Creation Stage. And this happened in a short time.","The third Creation Stage!","The fourth Creation Stage!","In just a moment, Chu Yunfan’s combat strength had charged into the fourth level of the Creation Stage. At this moment, Chu Yunfan revealed a pained expression. His physical body was extremely strong, but it did not mean that such a violent increase in strength did not burden his body.","After consuming the Six-Stripe Gold Pill, Chu Yunfan’s strength increased exponentially. He quickly surpassed the fourth level of the Creation Stage and rushed straight into the fifth level.","The mountain-like Creation beast that had slapped down with its huge beast claw suddenly realized that something was wrong. The aura on Chu Yunfan’s body erupted as if an ancient ferocious beast had awakened.","That aura almost overturned the sky, making the bear feel incomparably terrified.","Boom!","The enormous claw was instantly sent flying by a terrifying force.","A terrifying sword light shot into the sky and pierced through this huge ferocious beast. The power of lightning spread out from the sword light, causing the ferocious beast to fall from the sky.","Boom!","The huge corpse stirred up a dust wave that was over a thousand feet high. It died a tragic death and stopped moving.","“One!”","Chu Yunfan’s expression was a little ferocious. A huge pain raged through his body. The terrifying energy tore apart every cell in his body, making him feel great pain. Even the slightest movement caused him immense pain. If it were an ordinary person, they would have collapsed long ago.","The Six-Stripe Gold Pill was extremely powerful, but at the same time, the side effects were extremely shocking. The damage to his body was extremely shocking. It could be said that his body was being torn apart crazily at every moment. Then, it forcefully reassembled, and the cycle would repeat again.","It was as if Chu Yunfan had been forced into a desperate situation.","The terrifying power surged through his body. In the blink of an eye, he had broken through to the sixth level of the Creation Stage. His entire body was covered in blood, and he felt as if this punch could blast through the entire sky.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan disappeared into the air, leaving only the power of lightning in the sky. When he reappeared, he was standing before another ferocious beast.","“Nine Netherworld Stomps!” Chu Yunfan gritted his teeth and stomped down. The entire sky trembled as if a huge hole had been stomped out.","Boom!","The ferocious beast was stomped on, and it slammed into the ground, causing a 300-meter-tall wave of dust to rise.","Everyone saw that Chu Yunfan’s foot had pierced through the beast’s body, and the beast’s blood sprayed out like a pillar. It was a crushing slaughter. A terrifying power instantly erupted, killing these terrifying Creation beasts as if they were stepping on ants.","This scene looked familiar to the external army. They had witnessed this same scene over and over again. The enemy had come in an aggressive manner, but they had been easily defeated."]},{"number":1891,"title":"Chapter 1891 Crazy Upgrade, as Powerful as a Godfiend","paragraphs":["1891 Crazy Upgrade, as Powerful as a Godfiend","Chu Yunfan killed them all easily.","What kind of terrifying killing power was this?","Seeing Chu Yunfan’s violent appearance was something that many of the experts of the external army had never seen before. They had never seen Chu Yunfan like this. He was almost forced into a dead end.","Of course, they understood that Chu Yunfan looked very powerful in this state, but in fact, he was completely forced into a dead end. If not for that, Chu Yufan would not have used such a move. Although their strength could not be compared to anyone present, they still knew the basics.","Such a move was very harmful to the body and could not be used often. Even using it once might cost a huge price.","Many people in the army couldn’t help but shed tears. There had never been a noble who was willing to take such a risk for them. Although they were elite soldiers, they were knew that to Grand Xia, they were no different from cannon fodder. Although elite soldiers were hard to come by, how could they be compared to Chu Yunfan, who had a bright future?","If it was possible, it was not surprising that Grand Xia was willing to exchange 100,000 people for Chu Yunfan’s life.","When these soldiers were surrounded, they all fell into despair. This was an obvious trap, and the other party did not even bother to hide it. It was impossible for Chu Yunfan not to know. Under such circumstances, it was normal for Chu Yunfan not to appear. If it were them, they probably wouldn’t.","Among these people, other than Chu Hongcai who believed that Chu Yunfan would appear, no one else had such confidence. But now, not only did Chu Yunfan appear, but he also went into the tiger’s den for them. Chu Yunfan even used a move that was clearly burning his lifespan.","Such kindness made these tough guys, who never shed tears easily, shed tears one after another.","“We can’t let the enemy use us as a bargaining chip to threaten the great general. If things don’t work out, I’ll commit suicide. I must not become a burden to the great general!” a lieutenant suddenly said.","“That’s right. In front of these monsters, we’re as weak as ants. However, we can do anything. We can’t choose how we live, but at the very least, we can choose to die.”","“That’s right. If things don’t work out, we can only die to repay the great general’s kindness.”","His words immediately resonated with many soldiers. It could be said that from now on, no one was important than Chu Yunfan in their hearts. Even if Chu Yunfan wanted them to rebel, they would follow in his footsteps without frowning.","A wise man would die for his confidant, not to mention Chu Yunfan was willing to take the risk for them.","Compared to Chu Yunfan, they felt that they were just weeds on the roadside. Now, Chu Yunfan had used his body to exchange for their lives. It was worth it to be able to follow such a general for the rest of their lives.","While the external army was still in shock, Chu Yunfan had completely exploded and started a terrifying massacre.","Quick!","Quick!","Quick!","Under the enhancement of lightning power, Chu Yunfan’s speed was extremely fast. Everyone could not even see his afterimage.","Stab!","A Demon God Sect expert suddenly let out a miserable scream. A giant hand full of lightning had penetrated his chest without him realizing it, crushing his internal organs. The electric current spread out and strangled his brain. His corpse then disappeared into the Mountain River Diagram.","“Kill him! We can’t let him continue!”","Chu Yunfan’s continuous killing finally aroused the anger of these experts. In an instant, all the attacks of these experts fell on the entire area.","“No matter how fast he is, he can’t dodge all of us!” a ferocious beast shouted.","The entire sky was smashed into powder by their attacks, and a mushroom cloud was formed.","However, just as he finished speaking, a sword light suddenly descended from the sky. A terrifying lightning sword that was hundreds of feet long descended from the sky and instantly pierced through him, splitting his body into two halves.","There was disbelief in the beast’s eyes. One had to know that he was a terrifying sixth-level Creator. He even dared to arm-wrestle and fight against human experts at the seventh Creation Stage.","Who knew that he couldn’t even withstand a single move from Chu Yunfan’s sword?","Sure enough, he saw a figure appear in front of him. It was a figure covered in blood. It was impossible to tell how much of it belonged to Chu Yunfan and how much belonged to the demon beasts and the Demon God Sect experts.","Chu Yunfan’s entire body was soaked in blood, and there were even cracks on the surface of his body. These were caused by the power of the Six-Stripe Gold Pill wreaking havoc in his body.","Every cell in Chu Yunfan’s body was torn apart and reassembled over and over. If he hadn’t cultivated the two supreme physiques—the Thunderclap Physique and the Imperial Physique—at the same time, he would have exploded and died.","Chu Yunfan was desperately controlling his injuries. As he attacked, he desperately healed his injuries. Even so, he was on the verge of exploding.","That terrifying power almost tore his entire body apart. However, at this moment, his eyes looked extremely cold. It was true indifference and calmness. The godhead suppressed all his negative emotions, allowing him to enter an absolutely calm state. Otherwise, the intense pain alone would have been enough to make him faint.","This had nothing to do with how strong his willpower was because the injuries that erupted in his body happened in every cell. It was not the kind of injury in the ordinary sense. If it was even more serious, it might even hurt Chu Yunfan’s soul. The Nine-Stripe Gold Pill had such an ability.","During this process, Chu Yunfan could feel himself becoming stronger and stronger with every tear and every reassembly. After this forceful breakthrough, his future breakthrough path would also become much simpler.","It was as if his body had been forcibly expanded from a water tank to a pool, although the process was very painful and dangerous. If he was not careful, he would be doomed.","But similarly, once it was completed, it would be an earth-shattering change."]},{"number":1892,"title":"Chapter 1892 Sweeping Across, Saving People","paragraphs":["1892 Sweeping Across, Saving People","Boom!","A single force defeated ten!","The divine ability that Chu Yunfan had unleashed far exceeded his combat strength. However, his cultivation level was far from this, so his combat strength was far lower than his current divine ability.","By relying on his extremely dense mana, Chu Yunfan’s punch was enough to blast a sixth-level Creator of the Demon God Sect into pieces. This fighting style was extremely brutal.","Chu Yunfan’s muscles cracked as he threw out a punch. The terrifying divine ability wreaked havoc in his body like a double-edged sword, hurting others and himself.","Boom!","The aura on Chu Yunfan’s body erupted once again, and he charged into the seventh level of the Creation Stage. His eyes were bloodshot, and the blood vessels in his entire body bulged. His muscles were about to be torn apart.","“No!”","Chu Yunfan realized that if this continued, the uncontrollable divine ability would tear him apart. Under normal circumstances, after taking the Six-Stripe Gold Pill, he should be in seclusion to digest this power. However, he was now using the power of the Six-Stripe Gold Pill to defeat strong enemies. It was a huge burden on his body.","Chu Yunfan stretched out his hand and took out a Nine Flower Jade Dew Pill. He stuffed it into his mouth. The Nine Flower Jade Dew Pill immediately turned into a clear stream and flowed into Chu Yunfan’s body. His injuries then recovered at an astonishing speed. Although he would still be torn apart by the violent divine ability, his speed of recovery was finally comparable to the speed of the divine ability.","“Aaarrrgghh! Die!”","An incomparably huge flying ferocious beast pounced down. This beast had reached the seventh Creation Stage and was the true king of birds. Its entire body was covered in golden feathers. They were like sharp swords that shot out a rain of swords that filled the sky. Each feather could easily injure or even kill a Creator.","This beast was truly ferocious to the extreme. Among the demons, he was a demon king of a generation and had a famous reputation. His claws could easily tear a mountain apart like tofu.","Countless feathers flew toward Chu Yunfan.","“Flying Celestial Palm Strike!”","Chu Yunfan’s hand reached out and transformed into a huge hand that met the golden sword rain that filled the sky. In an instant, the sword rain was crushed into powder. Immediately after, a purple thunder sword light appeared in Chu Yunfan’s hand and shot out.","Stab!","The golden bird was pierced through and its head exploded. Its huge body fell, but before it touched the ground, it had already fallen into Chu Yunfan’s hand and was instantly absorbed into the Mountain River Diagram.","Finally, Ning Rentu’s expression changed. It was fine before, but now, a dignified seventh Creation Stage demon king had been pierced through by Chu Yunfan’s sword and died tragically.","Chu Yunfan’s current combat strength was more than ten times stronger than before. It was simply a exponential increase.","Ning Rentu knew that this couldn’t continue. At this stage, it could be said that these demon kings couldn’t control Chu Yunfan anymore.","Boom!","A monstrous hand swept across the sky and grabbed Chu Yunfan. It was like a blood-red demonic claw, and a terrifying power spread through the sky.","Chu Yunfan immediately felt an unprecedented terrifying pressure pressing down on him. His current battle prowess had already reached the seventh level of the Creation Stage, and it was soaring all the way to the peak of the seventh level of the Creation Stage.","However, this massive power was nothing in front of Ning Rentu’s terrifying powers. It was as if his power had already surpassed this limit and reached another terrifying level.","That was a terrifying strength that was ranked among the top in the entire world!","“This is the time!” Chu Yunfan’s eyes flickered. Hfigure flashed and he dodged the big hand that came from all directions.","Chu Yunfan tore through the overwhelming aura and reappeared in front of the valley.","“Great Genera!”","The External Army was overjoyed.","“Hmm?” Ning Rentu finally realized what Chu Yunfan was planning.","If he had been here, Chu Yunfan would not have been able to break through his line of defense and rescue the people in the valley. But now, because he was going to attack Chu Yunfan, the line of defense was suddenly loosened, which gave Chu Yunfan an opportunity.","“Don’t even think about it!” Ning Rentu roared.","A blood-red palm struck down from the sky. It was about a thousand meters wide and enveloped the entire valley, blocking all of Chu Yunfan’s escape routes. He didn’t give Chu Yunfan the slightest chance to escape.","Chu Yunfan could feel how terrifying the pressure was.","“Here goes nothing!” Chu Yunfan roared.","The divine ability in Chu Yunfan’s body rushed into the sky. It was extremely terrifying, and he erupted with all his strength. He supported the sky with his hands, forming a posture of lifting the sky. At the same time, the Mountain River Cauldron above his head spun and flew into the sky.","Clang!","The blood-colored palm slammed down fiercely, smashing onto the Mountain River Cauldron.","Spurt!","Chu Yunfan spat out a mouthful of blood. His body was about to explode. This attack had broken the balance in his body. The Mountain River Cauldron was buzzing as a terrifying sound wave raged out. Chu Yunfan forcibly held on, and extended a large hand of energy and grabbed the entire External Army.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan stomped his foot and turned into a bolt of lightning to escape.","“Trying to escape?”","Another terrifying blood-red palm slammed down.","Bam!","This attack hit the Mountain River Cauldron, almost sending the cauldron flying."]},{"number":1893,"title":"Chapter 1893 The Demon God Sect Leader Who Was Like a Loser","paragraphs":["1893 The Demon God Sect Leader Who Was Like a Loser","Chu Yunfan’s current strength was terrifying but Ning Rentu was even more so. The latter’s strength had exceeded this limit, and Chu Yunfan couldn’t be compared to him at all.","“Hurry up and leave!” Chu Yunfan waved, and the External Army turned into rays of light and disappeared into the horizon.","Chu Yunfan let out a sigh of relief.","“Chase after them. We can’t let them escape!” Ning Rentu roared.","The demon kings and Demon God Sect experts who had pounced over immediately chased after the External Army.","At this time, the enemy was somewhat frightened by Chu Yunfan. He had casually injured and even killed them. This killing efficiency was a little shocking. Although they could all see that Chu Yunfan must have overdrawn something in this state and couldn’t last long, he had caused such terrifying damage to them in that short time. If Chu Yunfan continued to be like this, they might not be a match for him and might be killed by him in a moment.","Before they could do anything, the fastest bird covered in green scales flew to Chu Yunfan’s left and was pierced by a sword light.","Stab!","The bird was pierced through in mid-air. Before its huge body could fall, Chu Yunfan absorbed it into the Mountain River Diagram.","“If you want to capture my men, you’ll have to do it over my dead body,” Chu Yunfan said.","His face was ashen as he endured the pain in his body. The blood vessels in his body were about to burst, and cracks appeared on his muscles as if they would explode at the next moment.","“Then I’ll kill you and step over your corpse!” Ning Rentu kicked down. Instantly, the world spun. This kick seemed to tear the world apart.","Bam!","This kick landed on the Mountain River Cauldron above Chu Yunfan’s head, and a sound like the sound of metal clashing erupted, and the cauldron trembled violently.","“Break!” Chu Yunfan roared.","At this moment, the medicinal strength of the Six-Stripe Gold Pill, which had been extremely powerful, was beginning to fade. The medicinal strength of the Six-Stripe Gold Pill had raised Chu Yunfan’s cultivation to the peak of the Creation Stage. However, that was the limit. Moreover, it was not enough to deal with Ning Rentu. Ning Rentu’s strength exceeded this limit.","After the continuous outburst earlier, the medicinal strength of the Six-Stripe Gold Pill was slowly fading and Chu Yunfan’s strength was heading downhill. It could not be compared to just now. But at this moment, Chu Yunfan chanted a strange language. Under the influence of this strange language, the blood in Chu Yunfan’s body began to burn.","Boom!","The energy and blood in Chu Yunfan’s body burned crazily. In that instant, his strength rose again. His divine ability, which had been on the decline, began to boil again. He rushed to the peak of the Creation Stage and even broke through that limit.","“Aaaarrrggghhh!”","Chu Yunfan started to risk his life by burning his lifespan. This was his last trump card. Because he had fused with a part of the Immemorial Dark Poenix’s divine soul, his lifespan was many times longer than that of ordinary people. This was one of the fundamental reasons why he could use such a life-burning move as his trump card.","But for Chu Yunfan, this was a feasible method.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan’s combat strength rushed into an unknown realm, completely surpassing the Creation Stage. However, he felt that he was about to reach his limit. He had burned at least 50 years of his lifespan and condensed it all to unleash this attack.","“Eight Astonishing Punches!” Chu Yunfan shouted and clenched his fist. A blood-red power wrapped around his arm and he punched out.","Boom!","The entire sky collapsed. This punch created mushroom clouds wherever it passed. The terrifying power destroyed everything and covered everything.","Bam!","Puff!","Boom!","At this moment, the demon kings and Demon God Sect experts who could not dodge in time were thrown away by the aftershock of this punch and were heavily injured. A few of them did not even have time to escape and were shattered on the spot.","They were all sent flying, and their eyes flashed with disbelief. What kind of power was this? They hadn’t expected Chu Yunfan to be able to bring about such a terrifying power.","At this moment, they finally understood why Chu Yunfan dared to come alone. Although his strength was not bad, in their eyes, he was simply an ant. He had not even stepped into the Creation Stage, so what was he?","However, who knew that Chu Yunfan would be able to unleash such a terrifying attack after being forced to the extreme?","With just one punch, they were greviously injured. There were also a few who did not manage to escape in time and died on the spot. Such an attack could be said to shake the heavens and earth, and it did not stop.","It smashed into Ning Rentu.","Boom!","This punch landed right before Ning Rentu. Layers of barriers had appeared in front of Ning Rentu at some point. There were actually hundreds of layers, protecting him within.","However, it was useless. In front of this extreme punch, the barrier layers were like paper. In an instant, they were torn apart.","Kaboom!","The punch finally landed on Ning Rentu’s body. An inner armor shimmering with blood-red light appeared on his body, but it was only able to block the punch for a moment before it was pierced through.","Boom!","This punch did not lose its momentum and pierced a large hole through Ning Rentu’s chest.","“Aaaaaggghhh!”","At this moment, how could he dare to stay? He fled into the distance."]},{"number":1894,"title":"Chapter 1894 All of Them Were Killed","paragraphs":["1894 All of Them Were Killed","Swish!","Swish!","Ning Rentu escaped, and Chu Yunfan did not have the strength to pursue him.","The wounds on Chu Yunfan’s body then opened up and exploded. Blood soaked his entire body as if he had just been fished out of a blood pool.","That punch had exhausted all of his strength. It was the result of burning 50 years of his lifespan. If he hadn’t fused with a portion of the Immemorial Dark Phoenix’s soul fragment and the essence of his life had undergone a transformation, these 50 years of lifespan would be enough for him to find it difficult to catch up to the top prodigies in the latter half of his life.","“Huff, huff, huff!” Chu Yunfan panted heavily as if he was going to explode in the next moment.","“Kill him! He’s at his weakest right now! Kill him!” a demon ape king covered in long white hair roared angrily. His fierce eyes flashed with a terrifying light. He finally saw an opportunity to capture Chu Yunfan.","How rare was this?","Before they came, no one had expected that their lineup would be foolproof. Even if Chu Yunfan had eight or ten protectors behind him, it would be difficult for them to win. Who knew that in the end, they would not be used to deal with the protectors behind Chu Yunfan, but to deal with Chu Yunfan himself. What made them even more embarrassed was that Chu Yunfan alone had almost beaten them into retreat.","Earlier, they had thought of fleeing. One had to know that all of them were notorious and had an illustrious reputation. They had actually been beaten to such a state by a small rising star of the human race. Even though they knew that Chu Yunfan had used a secret technique, it was still a huge humiliation.","However, they all understood that Chu Yunfan was now an arrow at the end of its flight. After that terrifying attack that severely injured Ning Rentu, Chu Yunfan no longer had the same might as before. The aura on his body was rapidly decreasing. There was no comparison at all.","It was like a severely injured beast that was on the verge of death.","“Die!”","The demon ape king let out a roar, and a stick appeared in his hand. In an instant, it expanded into a long staff.","In the next moment, the staff swelled, and it was as big as a mountain. It smashed down on Chu Yunfan from the sky.","The demon ape king’s eyes flashed with a terrifying ferocity. He wanted to kill Chu Yunfan with a single strike of his staff, and it weighed more than 1,000 catties.","Clang!","The sound of metal clashing erupted from this strike. It did not kill Chu Yunfan like many people had expected.","Bam!","A wave of violent waves rose, and everyone noticed that this terrifying attack had done nothing to Chu Yunfan. His hand appeared to be able to support the sky and blocked the staff.","Chu Yunfan gently spat out a mouthful of blood. This attack had shaken his injuries and caused him to spit out a mouthful of blood. However, his complexion was much better than before.","Chu Yunfan reached into the Mountain River Diagram, took out two Nine Flower Jade Dew Pills, and swallowed them. Immediately, the two pills turned into rolling clear streams that spread through his limbs and bones. The cells that had been torn apart by the violent power slowly recovered under the nourishment of this power.","Chu Yunfan’s injuries stabilized, unlike before when he looked like he could self-destruct at any time.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan took a step forward, and his figure shot out like a thunderbolt. In the next moment, he was standing before the demon ape king. The thunder power in his hand condensed into a sword, and the sword light turned into a hundred feet long, slashing out in the air.","Slash!","The demon ape king’s head was cut off and sent flying. Fresh blood spurted out.","The demon ape king’s eyes were filled with disbelief. He was an expert at the peak of the Creation Stage and was infamous among the demons. He had once killed many famous experts of Grand Xia.","But now, he had died at the hands of a rising star!","He was beheaded by Chu Yunfan with a single strike!","‘I can’t accept this!’ In the demon ape king’s mind, there was complete unwillingness.","Chu Yunfan clearly looked like an arrow at the end of its flight. However, he had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands at this time.","After killing the demon ape king, Chu Yunfan felt the injuries in his body worsen. He gritted his teeth. With a flash, he turned into an electric dragon and swept out, rushing at the remaining demons and Demon God Sect experts.","Chu Yunfan had already killed a few of them, and with the addition of his earlier punch, there were now less than 20 of them left. The remaining people were all heavily injured too. Although Chu Yunfan wasn’t at his peak, how could they be any better? Their combat strength was not even half of what it was before.","Chu Yunfan charged into the crowd of experts—like a tiger entering a flock of sheep—and began a crazy massacre.","Smash!","One of the Demon God Sect experts had his head smashed in by Chu Yunfan, who had taken over the demon ape king’s staff.","The expert could not defend at all. His head shattered and his head became a messed or red and white.","Then, the staff in Chu Yunfan’s hand swelled up like a mountain. He was like an ancient demon god. He held the mountain in his hand and swept it out. In the air, he hit a few huge ferocious beasts. These ferocious beasts were swept and their bodies exploded.","“Kill him or we’ll all die!”","The remaining experts had gone crazy. The blood in their bodies boiled, and all kinds of attacks fell on Chu Yunfan. However, at this moment, the Mountain River Cauldron flew out of Chu Yunfan’s body and spun around, protecting him. These people could not do anything to Chu Yunfan. When their attacks landed on the cauldron, the attacks disappeared. At most, Chu Yunfan was slightly shaken.","After all, they weren’t Ning Rentu. Ning Rentu had the ability to severely injure Chu Yunfan despite the Mountain River Cauldron, but they didn’t have that kind of strength. With such an absolute defense, Chu Yunfan attacked defensively.","The demon ape king’s staff was unleashed to the extreme in Chu Yunfan’s hands. With a casual sweep, an upper stage Creator died.","In just a moment, all the enemies were killed."]},{"number":1895,"title":"Chapter 1895 Surpassing Li Qianyuan for the First Time","paragraphs":["1895 Surpassing Li Qianyuan for the First Time","At this moment, Chu Yunfan finally could not hold on any longer. The aura on his body kept falling, starting from the peak of the Creation Stage.","Seventh Creation Stage!","Sixth Creation Stage!","Fifth Creation Stage!","Fourth Creation Stage!","Third Creation Stage!","His cultivation dropped all the way back to the Cosmos Stage.","“Huff, huff, huff!”","Chu Yunfan panted heavily, and the mana in his body calmed down. His body was covered in wounds from the battle. To be precise, most of them were not inflicted on him by others, but by his own strength. His body could not withstand the injuries.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan could feel that every cell in his body was riddled with injuries. He could even feel that all the muscles in his body had shattered. Every inch of his muscles had been torn apart, and there was not a single bit that was good.","If his body was a precise instrument, it was basically on the verge of being scrapped. If it wasn’t for the power of the Imperial Physique and the Thunderclap Physique, he wouldn’t have lasted until now.","He would have collapsed halfway, not to mention that he had severely injured Ning Rentu with a punch, causing the latter to flee like a stray dog.","In fact, Ning Rentu knew that Chu Yunfan’s attack might be the only one he could use, but he didn’t dare to take the risk. If Chu Yunfan had other methods that he hadn’t used, he would probably die here.","Ning Rentu didn’t dare to bet on this one in ten thousand chance. After all, from the beginning when Chu Yunfan appeared, he could be said to have surprised him repeatedly.","He thought that it could be easily resolved, but in the end, they were all wiped out. This was probably the most tragic operation he had ever planned since he became the Demon God Sect’s leader.","This was the amount of damage the headquarters would suffer from a surprise attack by the experts of Grand Xia. The experts that Chu Yunfan had killed this time were enough to make him a marquis.","Back then, Li Qianyuan had fought on the battlefield for many years and killed countless experts. Even the total number of experts he killed was not as many as Chu Yunfan’s.","In particular, Chu Yunfan had killed many high-stage Creators and even peak Creators. Each of these experts had posed a huge threat to Grand Xia, and had even caused immense damage. Now, Chu Yunfan had killed all of them. There were 30 Creators and dozens of Cosmics.","In addition, Chu Yunfan had severely injured the leader of the Demon God Sect, Ning Rentu. This time, Chu Yunfan could be conferred the title of marquis and be on equal footing with Li Qianyuan. It would then be impossible for Li Qianyuan to control him from the top.","After all, every single expert who was conferred the title of marquis had made great contributions to Grand Xia. At the same time, they were extremely powerful and influential. Such people were highly valued by the Grand Commandant’s Office.","At that time, Chu Yunfan and Li Qianyuan’s status would be equal, and he would not be afraid of Li Qianyuan finding trouble behind his back.","However, the loss was also incalculable. After all, the trump card that was originally used to deal with Li Qianyuan was now used in advance. It was because of the Six-Stripe Gold Pill that Chu Yunfan did not care about Li Qianyuan and the others’ small tricks. He was able to sweep away all the strong enemies with absolute strength.","Chu Yunfan had suffered heavy injuries that had even reached into his foundation. Fortunately, he still had seven Nine Flower Jade Dew Pills left, which should be enough for him to recover.","Chu Yunfan took all the corpses of these experts and watered their blood on the Brahma Tree. Before long, the Brahma Tree would bear more Brahma Fruit. At that time, not only would Chu Yunfan’s strength not decline, but it would also advance by leaps and bounds. These fruits were all watered with the blood of many high-stage Creators. The Brahma Fruits that bore this naturally had extraordinary effects.","Half a year is enough for my cultivation to advance by leaps and bounds. However, if I want to ensure that nothing goes wrong, I have to think of a way to break through to the Creation Stage,’ Chu Yunfan sat down cross-legged to rest while thinking to himself.","For others, whether they could win the husband selection and marry Tang Siyu was nothing more than a success or failure in fighting for the Elder Princess’ support. Although that was important, it was not to the point where they could not afford to lose.","But for Chu Yunfan, this was not the case. He could not afford to lose this competition. If he could break through to the Creation Stage in the next six months, then all the powerful enemies would be nothing to him.","Although he was still some distance away from the Creation Stage, although he was severely injured after using the Six-Stripe Gold Pill, as long as he recovered, it was only a matter of time before he broke through to the fifth level of the Cosmos Stage. At that time, even Li Qianyuan, who had entered the second Creation Stage, would not be his opponent.","At that time, it would be completely uncertain who would kill who.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even want to wait until the husband selection half a year later. If he could find an opportunity, he didn’t mind killing Li Qianyuan in advance. With a strong foundation, he would be this tough!","This was the first time that Chu Yunfan’s strength and Li Qianyuan’s strength had undergone a completely reversed. When he first fought with Li Qianyuan, he was just an unexpected ant to Li Qianyuan. But now, he could compete with Li Qianyuan and completely surpass Li Qianyuan in terms of combat strength.","Chu Yunfan couldn’t even count how many twists and turns had happened in the process. Fortunately, he had finally reached this step. He was no longer an insignificant figure.","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan felt his heart palpitate. He looked up and saw that the sky had been torn apart by some terrifying force. Then, a palm that looked like an ordinary person’s slapped down.","This palm didn’t look big, and it didn’t even have any power. It simply fell down, heading straight for Chu Yunfan’s head.","However, at that moment, Chu Yunfan felt all the hair on his body stand on end. This feeling made him feel as if he had fallen into an ice cave and was on the verge of death. It made him feel that it was difficult to even move his body.","It was as if an invisible net had fallen down, making it impossible for him to escape.","This feeling of being on the verge of death was very familiar. It instantly reminded him of the sudden attack of the big hand on the human-demon battlefield."]},{"number":1896,"title":"Chapter 1896 Chu Yunfan Is Dead?","paragraphs":["1896 Chu Yunfan Is Dead?","The terrifying attack descended from the sky. With just one palm, it seemed like it could make the entire battlefield sink. It was as if it was an attack from a god that had descended from the sky.","He immediately judged that this big hand was coming for him. Otherwise, it would not be such a coincidence to meet it head-on. He then thought of an even more terrifying possibility, which was that the owner of this big hand had a very high status in the entire demon race.","The last time this person had failed to kill him on the human-demon battlefield, so he arranged for the Demon God Sect to ambush him. Who knew that the Demon God Sect couldn’t kill Chu Yunfan, so this person just attacked directly.","Instantly, Chu Yunfan felt a chill run down his spine. If that was really the case, then it meant that a supreme and terrifying existence had been staring at him. They were even willing to go through the human-demon battlefield and the restrictions of Zhenyao City to attack him.","Chu Yunfan looked at the huge hand falling from the sky. It wasn’t very fast, but for Chu Yunfan, there was no way to escape. He couldn’t break through the suppression.","‘Damn it, damn it!’ Chu Yunfan gritted his teeth. He wanted to move, but what followed was intense pain and the bones in his body creaking as if he had suffered a huge pressure.","He couldn’t gather the strength in his body.","If Chu Yunfan was at his peak, he could still break through with all his strength. However, at this point, he could no longer move.","With his strength level, even an expert at the peak of the Creation Stage could not cause such a terrifying suppression on him. The only possibility was that The attacker was a terrifying expert who had surpassed the Creation Stage. He was even more terrifying than Ning Rentu.","“I have to go all out or I won’t have another chance!” Chu Yunfan roared.","He started reciting an ancient spell. This was an ancient secret technique. In an instant, the blood in his body burned again as if he had been reborn, breaking through the invisible restriction in an instant.","However, Chu Yunfan knew that this was far from enough. If he wanted to escape from this attack, just burning another ten years of his lifespan was not enough.","“Ahhhh! Break!” Chu Yunfan roared again.","He used the ancient secret technique of burning his life. In an instant, he burned hundreds of years of his life. At that moment, he seemed to have returned to the beginning, to his peak state, where he could sweep away all powerful enemies.","“Hmm?” someone spoke from the endless void. It seemed that Chu Yunfan was still able to erupt with such combat strength at this stage, and he was somewhat puzzled.","But then, the killing intent on the big hand became more and more intense.","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan made a hand seal and shouted, “Blood Escape!”","Chu Yunfan’s body was burning with red energy and blood, and he seemed to have aged all of a sudden. His figure began to gradually disappear. The red energy tore open the cage set up by the hand and was about to disappear.","“Trying to get away?”","The giant hand slammed down, but at the same time, Chu Yunfan disappeared from where he was.","Accompanied by this huge roar was a shocking sword light that flew across the sky.","In the sky, the first person was stabbed and could not escape. Blood sprayed out, but the person revealed a strange smile before disintegrating in the air.","Not long after, a second person arrived on the scene. When he saw the chaotic battlefield, his expression was incomparably furious. This was none other than the number one person in Grand Xia’s military, the Grand Commandant of Grand Xia.","The Grand Commandant frowned, his face filled with anger. He had been too careless and allowed these demons and Demon God Sect experts enter and kill so many citizens without realizing it. It was simply the most ridiculous thing.","The Grand Commandant had been guarding Zhenyao City all year round and was always paying attention to the direction of the demon base. He was doing this to prevent experts of such a level from making a move. He knew how terrifying the destructive power of an expert of such a level would be once they attacked.","However, who knew that his old rival would still sneak in under his nose and even kill Chu Yunfan, whom he thought highly of. To the Grand Commandant, this was simply a great humiliation. It was equivalent to someone slapping his face.","Chu Yunfan, a great true disciple of the Flying Celestials, had been killed without a sound. The Flying Celestials would surely come bearing down on him. Although he was the Grand Commandant, he had not reached the point where he could cover the sky with one hand and ignore others. Not to mention that he had thought highly of Chu Yunfan and even promoted him. Otherwise, Chu Yunfan’s promotion would not have come so quickly.","What kind of person was the Grand Commandant? With just a glance at the battlefield that did not even have a corpse, he could already deduce the entire battle. It was as if he had witnessed everything with his own eyes.","In front of his eyes, it was as if the image of Chu Yunfan fighting with these masters appeared. His face revealed a surprised expression. He did not know how Chu Yunfan did it. Although these battles had caused serious damage to the scene and razed the entire valley to the ground, there was no doubt that it was not a prolonged battle. Otherwise, with his reaction speed, he would’ve reacted this place before it ended.","All of the opponents were killed in one strike. From the bloodstains left on the scene, it was unknown how many Creators had been killed.","‘Chu Yunfan has actually reached this stage?’ the Grand Commandant thought his and felt gratified.","He had not misjudged Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan’s potential was extraordinary, comparable to Li Qianyuan, maybe even better. However, he was heartbroken that such a peerless genius had been killed.","He had not expected his old rival’s killing intent toward Chu Yunfan to reach such a level and that the latter would not rest until Chu Yunfan was dead.","One could only be a thief for a thousand days, but there was no reason to guard against thieves for a thousand days. The Grand Commandant had been careless, and Chu Yunfan had been killed.","The losses were immeasurable."]},{"number":1897,"title":"Chapter 1897 A Great Wave","paragraphs":["1897 A Great Wave","During this process, Chu Yunfan had killed many Cosmics and even high-stage Creators. However, in the Grand Commandant eyes, these people added together were not as important as Chu Yunfan.","What the Grand Commandant cared about was the future of the country and the inheritance of the human race. The structure and vision were extraordinary, and he did not care about the gains and losses of a single city or a land.","“You will regret it. You killed a genius of my clan, so you will repay it with the life of a genius from your clan!”","The Grand Commandant’s expression was extremely cold. He looked into the depths of the void and seemed to see a pair of cold eyes. It was his old rival.","The person he had killed earlier was just a clone. His true body had not entered this place. After all, this was the domain of Grand Xia. Once he came here, he might be left behind and never be able to return.","Powerful figures like him wouldn’t easily take risks. Once they died, it would be a major event that would shake the inheritance of their race. However, it was precisely because of this that he was truly furious. For a big shot at his level, ordinary things were not enough to make him moved.","If the Grand Commandant’s old rival hadn’t made a move, the Grand Commandant wouldn’t have been so angry. After all, both sides had scruples and had their bottom line. Experts at their level wouldn’t easily attack those geniuses. Otherwise, if both sides attacked together, they could kill all the geniuses of the two races, and both sides would suffer.","But now, this person had attacked before, and now he was even crossing the border to chase after Chu Yunfan. This had broken the Grand Commandant’s bottom line, although he did not understand what kind of talent Chu Yunfan had displayed to make his old rival disregard the rules and come to fight.","But no matter what, he would never allow this to happen again!","“You’ve made a grave mistake and have angered me. You demons will pay the price for this,” the Grand Commandant said coldly as his figure slowly disappeared from the sky.","A piece of news quickly spread among the younger generation of experts in the world. At Princess Yun yang’s garden party, Chu Yunfan had unexpectedly made a comeback and defeated Zhang Feng and Huyan Zhuo, who were ranked before him.","When this news spread, it shocked everyone. It was not as simple as Chu Yunfan defeating an expert ranked higher than him. Zhang Feng and Huyan Zhuo had already stepped into the Creation Stage, their defeat caused many of the previous rumors to fall apart.","Before this, many people did not think highly of Chu Yunfan. They all believed that as the prodigies on the prodigy list entered the Creation Stage one after another, Chu Yunfan’s advantage would no longer exist. He was able to dominate the Cosmos Stage but would not be able to defeat the prodigies who had already entered the Creation Stage.","After all, the strongest Cosmic was at least ten times weaker than the weakest Creator. They were existences on completely different levels. Moreover, this gap would only widen further as the prodigies broke through the barrier of the major level and their cultivation improved rapidly.","However, in this battle a year later, Chu Yunfan had ruthlessly slapped the faces of those who had not believed him before. Even if the others had stepped into the Creation Stage, so what? He would still slap their faces and beat them up. It was not difficult in the slightest.","During the battle, Chu Yunfan easily defeated Zhang Feng and Huyan Zhuo. Everyone couldn’t help but raise their evaluation of Chu Yunfan. Back then, his ranking on the prodigy list had once been as high as the top 30. Now, it seemed that it was not wrong.","Chu Yunfan’s glory did not lose its luster even after so many prodigies entered the Creation Stage one after another. On the contrary, he released an unprecedented brilliance, approaching those prodigies who were ranked at the top.","However, before everyone could recover from this shocking news, another piece of news was sent out.","Chu Yunfan had fallen!","The news had just spread, and everyone was in complete disbelief. After all, it had just been reported that Chu Yunfan had defeated everyone at Princess Yun Yang’s garden party and suppressed everyone.","However, as time passed, this news did not subside. On the contrary, it became more and more intense. More and more news was revealed as time passed.","When this news was revealed, everyone believed it. If it was a force in Grand Xia, they probably wouldn’t dare to act casually. After all, Chu Yunfan had the entire Flying Celestials behind him. Even if some people in the Flying Celestials looked down on Chu Yunfan, they were all united on this issue.","The Flying Celestials’ attention on Chu Yunfan was constantly rising. He was no less important than Yang Dengxian, but now that he had been killed, it would be strange if the Flying Celestials wasn’t furious.","Even the top ten sects didn’t dare to bear the wrath of the Flying Celestials. After all, they could target the outstanding disciples of the Flying Celestials, and vice versa, the Flying Celestials could target their outstanding disciples. If they attacked each other recklessly, they would die together.","However, if it was the Demon God Sect that attacked, then everything would be different. From the beginning of its establishment, the Demon God Sect had come to deal with the humans. Every year, many talented geniuses would be kidnapped. After years of brainwashing, they would become members of the Demon God Sect.","Now, other than a small number of traitors who had joined the demons, most of the others had come this way.","The Demon God Sect had attacked the outstanding geniuses of the human race more than once over the years. There was even a record of killing the number one genius on the prodigy list. Under such circumstances, it seemed that it was not strange to kill Chu Yunfan.","Grand Xia had suffered heavy losses more than once, and they had almost destroyed the Demon God Sect a few times. However, as long as the demons was not destroyed and the Demon God Sect’s framework did not collapse, it would recover sooner or later. It was just a matter of time.","Even though the Demon God Sect was the target of the entire world, there was nothing they could do. They could only carry out a clean-up operation against the Demon God Sect every once in a while.","As time passed, more and more details of the battle were revealed, especially when the remnants of the External Army returned to the camp, which confirmed that there was indeed such a trap.","The Demon God Sect used the name of the remnant of the External Army to force Chu Yunfan to go to the meeting alone. In the end, he fell into the Demon God Sect’s trap and died at the hands of the Demon God Sect."]},{"number":1898,"title":"Chapter 1898 The Demon God Sect Is Heavily Injured, and the Aftershocks Are Shocking","paragraphs":["1898 The Demon God Sect Is Heavily Injured, and the Aftershocks Are Shocking","When this news spread, it caused an endless storm, especially when many things that happened that day were spread.","The moment this news came out, everyone fell silent. After all, this matter involved the Demon God Sect and the demons behind the Demon God Sect. It could be said that it had always been a taboo within Grand Xia. Having something to do with the Demon God Sect and the demons undoubtedly crossed the line.","Grand Xia would never tolerate this. If it was only the Demon God Sect that made a move, it would not have shocked the entire Imperial Court. However, there was a traitor behind it.","A storm brew.","Sure enough, in just three days, the Grand Commandant’s Office of Grand Xia personally issued an order to uproot all the families suspected of colluding with the Demon God Sect. More than a dozen small aristocratic families and sects were found to be related to the Demon God Sect and were uprooted.","The main members of these sects and families would be beheaded. The rest would be sent to the toughest mines. Their descendants would never be used within ten generations.","For a time, a bloody storm was set off. There were even rumors that this matter involved the Marquis Huntian, Li Qianyuan. After all, with Chu Yunfan’s death, the grudge between him and Li Qianyuan was also revealed. Many people suspected that Li Qianyuan had something to do with the Demon God Sect being able to block the news of Baotai so smoothly.","However, they couldn’t find any evidence against Li Qianyuan, and there was a force that secretly quelled the matter, which made many people who disliked Li Qianyuan very disappointed. However, this cast a shadow over Li Qianyuan’s reputation.","And this was just the beginning. Following that, the Grand Commandant’s Office of Grand Xia sent out orders. Scouts were sent out everywhere, and a large number of garrisons were mobilized to raid the Demon God Sect’s encampments in various places.","In a short time, dozens of Demon God Sect’s branches were destroyed and uprooted. However, most of the branches had long been empty as if they had already expected Grand Xia’s revenge. Even so, the destruction of dozens of Demon God Sect branches was a heavy blow to the Demon God Sect.","The local powers that were related to the Demon God Sect were all investigated. The Demon God Sect’s power in Grand Xia regressed by decades overnight.","All of Grand Xia watched the actions of the Grand Commandant’s Office in silence. No one knew what was the reason for the Grand Commandant’s Office to be so furious. To be precise, it was the number one person in the military, the Grand Commandant, who was furious.","After all, it was just a prodigy on the prodigy list who had died. Logically speaking, it shouldn’t be like this.","Very soon, more news came. Only then did everyone know that this matter was related to a top figure of the demons. That figure had disregarded his dignity and identity to personally attack Chu Yunfan, angering the Grand Commandant.","Everyone was curious about what Chu Yunfan had done to make such a big shot disregard his dignity and tacit understanding to personally attack. But no matter what, it was meaningless. After all, Chu Yunfan had already fallen.","This series of events dazzled everyone. From the fall of Chu Yunfan on the prodigy list, the rage of the Grand Commandant’s Office, the shock of the Imperial Court of Grand Xia, and the heavy losses suffered by the Demon God Sect. Many sects and clans in Grand Xia were uprooted, implicating at least hundreds of thousands of people. It could be said to be an unprecedented catastrophe.","And the person who caused all this was Chu Yunfan.","“He’s really dead?” Many of those in the Flying Celestials found this unbelievable.","Chu Yunfan had made a name for himself in the Flying Celestials a long time ago. He was so powerful that he even defeated Ye Yin, who was ranked second and was only below Yang Dengxian, who was ranked first.","The next generation that the Flying Celestials had nurtured was eliminated by the Demon God Sect just like that, and everyone could feel that the atmosphere in the sect had stagnated. At Chu Yunfan’s level, he could influence the entire sect. He had many fans within the sect. At first, they didn’t believe it, but the series of events that happened later showed that it should be true. Otherwise, the Grand Commandant’s Office wouldn’t be so angry.","At this moment, within the Imperial Capital of Grand Xia, Li Qianyuan was sitting on the main seat in his residence. He looked at a middle-aged man who looked like a scholar with a happy expression.","The scholar looked gentle and refined, and his eyes flickered with the divine light of wisdom.","“His Royal Highness sent me to tell you that there are some things that are best left untouched, Your Grace. His Royal Highness personally helped you erase your traces, but there won’t be a next time,” the middle-aged scholar said, “Although they couldn’t find evidence, the Grand Commandant doesn’t need evidence. As long as there’s suspicion and a reasonable reason, it’s enough.”","Li Qianyuan’s expression changed at the mention of the Grand Commandant. Even as a marquis, he had to lower his head in front of the Grand Commandant. Not to mention him, even the crown prince had to lower his head. The Grand Commandant was truly the number one person in the military. If the crown prince wanted to take the throne, he needed the Grand Commandant’s support.","The Grand Commandant was clearly very unhappy about this incident. If the crown prince hadn’t stepped in to erase all traces and suppress the undercurrent, he would have been implicated. Thinking of this, Li Qianyuan couldn’t help but break out in a cold sweat.","“Moreover, His Royal Highness will surely ascend the throne in the future, and you will be a minister of the court. Once such a thing is discovered, it will destroy your future. The prince hopes that you will be careful, Your Grace,” the scholar warned."]},{"number":1899,"title":"Chapter 1899 Escaping and Healing","paragraphs":["1899 Escaping and Healing","Li Qianyuan’s expression turned cold. He could tell that his biggest backer, the crown prince, was very dissatisfied with him. After all, if nothing unexpected happened, the crown prince would become the future king and represent Grand Xia.","Colluding with the Demon God Sect and the Demon Race was undoubtedly taboo, but Li Qianyuan didn’t regret it. After all, he had gotten rid of a threat. Although it was had been risky, it was worth it.","He didn’t know when it started, but Chu Yunfan had risen from an insignificant small fry to a mortal enemy in his heart, especially when he heard that Chu Yunfan had defeated Zhang Feng and Huyan Zhuo. Although he was still very confident in his strength, if Chu Yunfan continued to grow, Chu Yunfan would pose a huge threat to him.","Li Qianyuan didn’t know when he started to worry. Although this worry didn’t seem to be much at the moment, it had indeed become a problem. That was why he had tacitly agreed to this matter.","For this incident, he had paid a huge price. Many of the families and sects that had been implicated had relied on him for a long time. Now, he had sacrificed all of them. This caused quite a stir among the followers. After all, in the face of such a situation where they could be sacrificed at any time, not many people could accept it calmly.","After all, an entire clan was sacrificed this time. Individual sacrifices could be for the clan and the sect. However, if the whole clan or sect was uprooted, then individual sacrifices would be meaningless. After all, the reason why his followers followed him was simply to pursue a great future.","However, Li Qianyuan still felt that it was all worth it. After all, as long as Chu Yunfan died, he would have one less worry in his heart. He would not have to worry about Chu Yunfan’s counterattack in the future.","“Sir, please go back and report to His Royal Highness that I’m not only doing this for myself but also for His Royal Highness’ great cause,” Li Qianyuan said, “The Elder Princess is about to choose a husband for Tang Siyu. Whoever can marry Tang Siyu will have the highest chance of obtaining the Elder Princess’ support. Chu Yunfan was said to be Tang Siyu’s fiance. Although his strength isn’t worth mentioning, his existence was full of variables.","“We have to obtain the Elder Princess’ support. There must be no accidents,” Li Qianyuan said firmly.","He had a clear conscience on this issue. The reason why he and Chu Yunfan became enemies was because of the matter of choosing a husband. In the end, it was for the crown prince’s cause.","“Understood. I will convey your message to His Royal Highness, Your Grace. If there is nothing else, I will take my leave first,” the scholar said.","“I won’t be seeing you off.”","*","Just as the news of Chu Yunfan’s death caused an uproar in Grand Xia and became ever more intense, in the distant Eastern Sea, above a huge island, a bloody light flashed, and then a figure appeared on the island.","There stood a man covered in blood, his muscles cracked. It was as if there was a huge amount of energy suppressed in his body that was about to explode.","Spurt!","The man spat out a mouthful of blood and collapsed. Like a comet crashing into the ground, a wave of dust that was hundreds of feet high was raised.","Upon closer inspection, who else could it be but Chu Yunfan?","‘I escaped!’ Chu Yunfan’s mind was blank. The only thought in his mind was that he had managed to get away.","Right now, he could feel intense pain even when he breathed. It was as if thousands of long knives were slashing at his body. He felt intense pain all over his body with just a slight movement of his fingers. He did not know how many bones in his body had been shattered. The damage to his body after consuming the Six-Stripe Gold Pill was already very shocking. In addition, he had burned his life force to unleash his strongest attack possible.","His body was already on the verge of collapse, and then he had suffered a terrifying attack from the mysterious person, almost causing his entire body to collapse right then and there.","If he had not burned hundreds of years of his lifespan at the most critical moment and used a forbidden escape technique, the Blood Escape, he would have died there.","This time, Chu Yunfan had gained a lot. After a series of battles and consuming the Six Stripe Gold Pill, the meridians in his body had once again expanded by a large margin. At the same time, he had a deeper understanding of the Creation Stage. It would be much easier for him to break through to the Creation Stage in the future.","However, he had paid a huge price. After that huge battle, not only had he used up many trump cards, but he had also spent more than 200 years of his lifespan. It was fortunate that he possessed part of the characteristics of the Immemorial Dark Phoenix and had a long lifespan. Otherwise, his life would be equivalent to entering middle age and all his potential would be exhausted. For now, he could still afford to consume it.","Chu Yunfan endured the intense pain and took out the remaining Nine Flower Jade Dew Pills from the Mountain River Diagram and swallowed them. He could feel that his entire body was collapsing, starting from the cellular level. That attack that had been aimed at him was too terrifying, almost cutting off his life force. If it wasn’t for his special and powerful physiques, that attack would have been enough to take his life.","But even so, Chu Yunfan was on the verge of breaking down. He circulated the Emperor Method, crazily absorbing the medicinal strength of the Nine Flower Jade Dew Pills, and circulating his energy to quickly heal his injuries.","Under the dual attacks, his body which was about to collapse stabilized and did not worsen further. However, it was not that easy to get better. That attack had greatly hurt his foundation. However, with the Nine Flower Jade Dew Pills, the wounds on Chu Yunfan’s body improved. Soon, he could sit up cross-legged.","Chu Yunfan smiled bitterly. It was true that man made plans and God laughs. He had calculated everything, and the truth was just as he had expected. Although the other party had endless trump cards, he destroyed them all in the end. Only the Demon God Sect leader had managed to escape. The only thing he didn’t expect was that such a big shot would be so desperate to get rid of him.","“No matter who you are, I will remember this attack. One day, all of you will die!” A cold light flashed through Chu Yunfan’s eyes. This time, the enemy had used Chu Hongcai and the others to force Chu Yunfan to come. They had completely touched Chu Yunfan’s bottom line.","He had to kill that person!"]},{"number":1900,"title":"Chapter 1900 Peak of the Fifth Cosmos Realm, Deep in the Eastern Sea","paragraphs":["1900 Peak of the Fifth Cosmos Realm, Deep in the Eastern Sea","A month passed in the blink of an eye. In the mountain range on the island, a cave was dug out by someone, and a barrier was set up at the entrance of the cave. There was no one inside the barrier as if it was an empty cave.","Inside the Mountain River Diagram, Chu Yunfan slowly opened his eyes. He had spent an entire month recuperating. He had consumed all the remaining Nine Flower Jade Dew Pills. The huge medicinal strength finally pulled him back from the danger of collapse.","The feeling of dying at any moment made Chu Yunfan tremble with fear. This was the closest he had ever been to death. If he had not risked his life and burned hundreds of years of his lifespan, he would have died on the spot.","But now, he had finally recovered. Every Nine Flower Jade Dew Pill was very precious and could be called a healing medicine. Now, after taking all of them, Chu Yunfan barely escaped death. One could imagine how serious his injuries were. This also included the tyrannical recovery ability brought about by his own tyrannical physique.","Compared to a month ago, Chu Yunfan only looked older by one or two years. It was hard to tell. One could imagine that his lifespan was indeed incomparably long.","As his injuries recovered, his strength naturally broke through to the fifth Cosmos Stage. Moreover, he had reached the peak of the fifth Cosmos Stage. He was only half a step away from entering the sixth level.","After all, whether it was the Six-Stripe Gold Pill or the Nine Flower Jade Dew Pills, they were both pills that could increase one’s strength. After Chu Yunfan fully recovered, he would naturally break through to the sixth Cosmos Stage.","If his injuries were not so severe that he had consumed too much medicinal power, it would not have been a problem for him to break through to the sixth Cosmos Stage.","After recovering to his peak, he felt that the strength of his whole body was unprecedentedly strong. If Li Qianyuan was standing in front of him now, Chu Yunfan could have killed him without a doubt.","Standing in this domain, he was the strongest. Even a third-level Creator could not do anything to him.","Chu Yunfan was determined to win the husband selection which would take place in five months. Whether it was the prodigies on the prodigy list or the so-called hidden geniuses that were not recorded on the prodigy list, he was not afraid of them.","They were simply no match for him!","In the remaining time, those geniuses would definitely not stagnate in their cultivation and would definitely have a further breakthrough. However, Chu Yunfan’s improvement would only be greater.","He turned his head and looked at the distant herb mountain. On the Brahma Tree, a few Brahma Fruits were flickering with a beautiful and alluring light. Beneath the tree was a pile of corpses that were still emitting a powerful aura. They could not be digested.","The Cosmic and Creators that Chu Yunfan had killed were all outstanding figures in their respective realms. The amount of blood essence in their bodies was unimaginably huge. Even with the Brahma Tree’s great absorption abilities, it was difficult for it to absorb all this power in such a short time. Unless Chu Yunfan could get a large pile of spirit stones, it was impossible for the tree to digest all the blood in a short time. Only then would the Brahma Tree be able to ripen.","At that time, with the support of the Brahma Fruit, it would not be difficult for Chu Yunfan’s cultivation to break through again. He might even enter the Creation Stage within half a year. At that time, whether it was his strength or status, they would be completely different than what they were now.","In Grand Xia, those who had stepped into the Creation Stage were considered to be at the level of an ancestor. They were different from those at the Cosmos Stage, who could only barely step into the ranks of experts. Their significance was completely different.","“It’s time to come out of seclusion!”","Chu Yunfan’s figure flashed, and he left the Mountain River Diagram. He appeared inside the cave and casually removed the various barriers at the entrance. The bright sunlight fell on his body, making him feel as if he had been reborn. It had been too long since he had seen the sun. In addition, he had just walked through the gates of hell. It almost made him feel as if he had gotten a second lease on life.","Chu Yunfan flew up into the sky. This was the first time he had the time to observe the island he was on. He spread out his divine will and immediately saw the entire island.","This island was at least a thousand kilometers in radius and could be considered a super-large island. On the island, there were mountains, forests, and strange rocks. It was a complete picture of nature that had not been developed.","The towering trees in the forest were all over a thousand feet tall, covering the sky. In the depths of the forest, the roars of unknown beasts echoed throughout the entire island.","In the distance, there was a sea wave that shook the sky. The monstrous waves were extremely shocking. They were like a tsunami that swept over. If it was in the Federation, such a huge wave would have formed a super-large tsunami. However, it was quite common here.","From this, Chu Yunfan could tell that he was probably far away from the Central Plains. After all, the waves near the Central Plains were relatively stable, and there would not be such shocking waves. Every time the waves hit the island, a rumbling sound would be heard as if the entire island was about to be washed away.","“Rumor has it that there are three seas around the Central Plains. The Northern Sea is frozen all year round, and the cold winds there are piercingly cold, like a world of ice and snow. This doesn’t seem to be the Northern Sea. But the Southern Sea is extremely hot, and heat waves roll about, so that’s not it either. There’s only one possibility. This is the depths of the Eastern Sea.”","Chu Yunfan recalled the records of the world in “The World.” Around the Central Plains, there were a total of three enormous seas that surrounded the Central Plains: the Northern Sea, the Eastern Sea, and the Southern Sea.","According to Chu Yunfan’s judgment, he was at the boundary of the Eastern Sea. The Blood Escape technique he had used allowed one to travel ten thousand miles in one breath. After burning hundreds of years of his lifespan, the technique’s power had increased by an unknown amount. Even Chu Yunfan himself did not know where he had escaped to.","In addition, he had been busy recovering his strength for the past month and had no time to think about these things. It was only now that he had a judgment of his location.","If he had been near the sea, it would have been easy for him to return to the Central Plains, but now it seemed that he had reached the depths of the Eastern Sea. It would naturally not be easy for him to return to the Central Plains.","This was a world completely different from the Central Plains. If the Central Plains was where all the powers were concentrated under a few powerful clans, then the Eastern Sea was the world of itinerant cultivators. Many itinerant cultivators who could no longer survive in the Central Plains fled into the Eastern Sea to avoid the attacks of Grand Xia."]}]);
